    about = "Coldridge Valley, Dun Morogh quests, Ironforge professions and Hall of Thanes preparation. Ends in Ironforge at 11.",
    steps = "S\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tStand still for 0.5 seconds before Auto Shot.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Coldridge Valley and class introductions.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t179\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill nearby level-1 wolves and collect eight pieces of meat for {q179}.\nC\t\t179\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t179\t\nA\t\t233\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t3115\t\nS\tDwarf Warrior\t\t\nA\t\t3106\t\nS\tGnome Warrior\t\t\nA\t\t3112\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nA\t\t98581\t\nS\tDwarf Rogue\t\t\nA\t\t3109\t\nS\tGnome Rogue\t\t\nA\t\t3113\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nA\t\t3110\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nA\t\t98574\t\nS\tDwarf Paladin\t\t\nA\t\t3107\t\nS\tGnome Mage\t\t\nA\t\t3114\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nA\t\t3108\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t170\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 2 on nearby level 1-2 enemies before continuing.\nX\t\t\t2\t\t\t\nS\tDwarf Warrior\t\t\nT\t\t3106\t\nS\tGnome Warrior\t\t\nT\t\t3112\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.83\t67.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Thran Khorman, learn Battle Shout I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nT\t\t98581\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.79\t66.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Teo Hammerstorm, learn Rockbiter Weapon I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Rogue\t\t\nT\t\t3109\t\nS\tGnome Rogue\t\t\nT\t\t3113\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.37\t67.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Solm Hargrin, learn Stealth I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nT\t\t3110\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nT\t\t98574\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.6\t66.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Branstock Khalder, learn Power Word: Fortitude I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Paladin\t\t\nT\t\t3107\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.83\t68.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bromos Grummner, learn Devotion Aura.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Mage\t\t\nT\t\t3114\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.71\t66.37\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Marryk Nurribit, learn Arcane Intellect I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t3108\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t29.18\t67.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Track Beasts from Thorgas Grimson.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t3115\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1599\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alamar, learn Immolate (2).\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Rockjaw Troggs and six Burly Rockjaw Troggs, levels 1-2, for {q170}.\nC\t\t170\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t233\t\nA\t\t234\t\nA\t\t183\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve Small Crag Boars, level 3, for {q183}.\nC\t\t183\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t183\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q234}. Choose a free Herbalism, Mining or Skinning book; use it when eligible to learn your chosen profession.\nT\t\t234\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t182\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fourteen level 3-4 Troll Whelps outside the cave for {q182}.\nC\t\t182\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t182\t\nA\t\t218\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Balir on the way to Anvilmar, then turn in {q170}.\nT\t\t170\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 4 on nearby level 3-4 enemies before entering the deeper cave.\nX\t\t\t4\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.83\t67.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Thran Khorman, learn Charge I and Rend I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.79\t66.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Teo Hammerstorm, learn Earth Shock I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nA\t\t94373\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.65\t66.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Alamar and train Corruption and Curse of Weakness (4).\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t29.18\t67.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Thorgas Grimson, learn Aspect of the Monkey and Serpent Sting I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.71\t66.37\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Marryk Nurribit, learn Frostbolt I and Conjure Water I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.83\t68.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bromos Grummner, learn Judgement and Blessing of Might I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.6\t66.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Branstock Khalder, learn Lesser Heal II and Shadow Word: Pain I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.37\t67.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Solm Hargrin, learn Pick Pocket and Backstab I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3361\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t26.33\t79.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path into the Frostmane cave.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Feather Charms from level 3-4 Frostmane Novices for {q1599}. Clear around Grik’nir first.\nC\t\t1599\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill level-5 Grik’nir and loot the journal for {q218}.\nC\t\t218\t\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Iceclaw Bear Pendants from level 3-4 Frostmane Troll Whelps and Novices in the cave for {q94373}.\nC\t\t94373\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t22.78\t80.0\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t26.33\t79.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Felix's belongings from the southern camps while leaving for {q3361}.\nC\t\t3361\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t218\t\nA\t\t282\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3364\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to your initial Anvilmar binding if ready; otherwise run directly back along the valley path.\nH\t\tHearth to Anvilmar\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q3364} to Durnan in Anvilmar within five minutes, then accept {q3365}.\nT\t\t3364\t\nA\t\t3365\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1599\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.8\t66.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain available spells. Buy Blood Pact I from Wren; summon the Imp, use the grimoire and check autocast.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3361\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nT\t\t94373\t\nA\t\t94374\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t26.4\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the snowy uphill trail north of Anvilmar to the Spirit Stone.\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nI\t\tDrink the Earth Sapta at the stone, then turn in {q94374} to the Minor Manifestation of Earth.\nU\t\t6635\t\nT\t\t94374\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nA\t\t94375\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Teo Hammerstorm, then turn in {q94375}. Receive your Earth Totem and learn Stoneskin Totem I; keep the totem in your bags.\nT\t\t94375\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 on nearby level-4 enemies before the next quest pickups.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q97277} from Grund.\nA\t\t97277\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the uphill trail west of Anvilmar past the crates to the ridge camp. Kill the level-6 prowler and collect the log for {q97277}.\nC\t\t97277\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nA\t\t5626\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t97277\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3365\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t282\t\nA\t\t420\t\nA\t\t96628\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2160\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Kharanos and Steelgrill: collect work before travelling back south.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the pass to Kharanos and turn in {q96628} to deliver the campfire message, then accept {q96608}.\nT\t\t96628\t\nA\t\t96608\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t/sit by Eric's campfire until Boosted Rest appears for {q96608}.\nC\t\t96608\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96608\t\nA\t\t96629\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q420} to Senir Whitebeard, then accept {q98322}.\nT\t\t420\t\nA\t\t98322\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t98321\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t400\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2160\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nT\t\t5626\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t99158\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.67\t52.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Gremlock Pilsnor in the back room of the Kharanos inn.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96629\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.38\t52.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind in Kharanos for the Ironforge return; sell junk. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Kharanos\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.18\t52.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Thamner Pol inside the Kharanos inn.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.19\t52.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Kreg Bilmn; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.19\t52.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Kreg Bilmn for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 before training and the supply quest.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.36\t52.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Granis Swiftaxe, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.58\t51.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ingrid Dunwald, learn Earthbind Totem and Healing Wave II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.33\t53.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gimrizz Shadowcog, learn Life Tap and Shadow Bolt II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t45.81\t53.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Grif Wildheart, learn Arcane Shot I and Hunter's Mark I. Restock ammunition.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.5\t52.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Magis Sparkmantle, learn Fireball II, Fire Blast I, Conjure Food I and Comprehend Scroll. Use Comprehend Scroll on untranslated scrolls you find.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.6\t52.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Azar Stronghammer, learn Holy Strike I, Holy Light II, Divine Protection I and Seal of the Crusader I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.56\t52.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hogral Bakkan, learn Gouge I and Sinister Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.34\t52.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Maxan Anvol, learn Power Word: Shield I and Smite II. Use your shield for solo pulls; once you have a wand, finish weakened enemies with it.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t317\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect four boar meat and two bear fur from level 5-7 Crag Boars and Young Black Bears. Boar meat drops slowly.\nK\t\t769\t1\t\t\nK\t\t6952\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t313\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t400\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5541\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98322\t\nA\t\t98319\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLoot the Ammo Crate beside Gretchen for {q5541} before heading south.\nC\t\t5541\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5541\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Misty Pine: gather wood while completing the wildlife supply quest.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99158\t\nA\t\t99159\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fourteen Mostly Dry Firewood between Kharanos and Misty Pine for {q99159}.\nC\t\t99159\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99159\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q317} before heading west.\nT\t\t317\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 before the western quests; finish on isolated level 6-7 wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t318\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Western circuit: use Den rewards before the level-9 Hold exploration.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.38\t52.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock supplies before heading west.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t287\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t318\t\nA\t\t319\t\nA\t\t315\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t98326\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHunt around Brewnall and toward Shimmer Ridge: six Ice Claw Bears, eight Elder Crag Boars and eight Snow Leopards, all level 7-8, for {q319}.\nC\t\t319\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t319\t\nA\t\t320\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kharanos if ready; otherwise take the road from Brewnall.\nH\t\tHearth to Kharanos\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t320\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 before training for the western caves.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.36\t52.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Granis Swiftaxe, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.58\t51.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ingrid Dunwald, learn Earth Shock II, Lightning Bolt II, Lightning Shield I, Rockbiter Weapon II and Stoneclaw Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.33\t53.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Bane of Agony and Fear (8) at Gimrizz. Buy and use Imp Firebolt II from Dannie Fizzwizzle nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t45.81\t53.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Grif Wildheart, learn Concussive Shot, Parry and Raptor Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.5\t52.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Magis Sparkmantle, learn Polymorph I, Frostbolt II and Arcane Missiles I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.6\t52.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Azar Stronghammer, learn Hammer of Justice I, Purify and Parry.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.56\t52.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hogral Bakkan, learn Evasion and Eviscerate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.34\t52.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Maxan Anvol, learn Renew I and Fade I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Ironforge by the northern road and main entrance if you need profession training, weapon skills or equipment; otherwise skip the Ironforge service steps and continue to the Grizzled Den. Train your chosen primary professions: all nine are available. Alchemy, Enchanting, Leatherworking, Tailoring, Herbalism and Skinning have no trainers in Kharanos. Blacksmithing is available in Kharanos; Engineering and Mining at Steelgrill's Depot; all three are also taught in Ironforge. Train any chosen Mining, Herbalism or Skinning not already learned from your starter quest book or a trainer. Fishing follows at Iceflow Lake on the later Shimmer Ridge-Brewnall return.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, one- and two-handed Maces, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes or one- and two-handed Maces.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Axes, one-handed Maces, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, two-handed Maces or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Maces.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers, Crossbows or Thrown.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Crossbows or Thrown.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman/Mage/Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a useful leveling weapon you can equip; keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready. Keep a ranged weapon and ammunition, or a thrown weapon, for pulling. Reserve money for class training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage/Priest/Warlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable early wand, such as a Lesser Magic Wand, at the Auction House. Equip it; stand still for 0.5 seconds before shooting.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAfter the Ironforge services, hearth to Kharanos if ready; otherwise take the road south.\nH\t\tHearth to Kharanos\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t42.5\t54.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Grizzled Den by its southern mouth. Collect eight shipments and eight manes for {q313} and {q98321}; pull level-8 shamans/elders singly.\nC\t\t313\t\t\nC\t\t98321\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Cornelius in the right-hand icy room for {q98319}.\nC\t\t98319\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Frosthowl (9) in the western Den room and loot the Sack of Fish for {q98326}. Clear his guards first.\nC\t\t98326\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t42.5\t54.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Kharanos from the Den if ready; otherwise retrace the tunnels to the southern entrance, clearing respawns, then take the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Kharanos\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.38\t52.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock food and drinks at Innkeeper Belm.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98319\t\nA\t\t98323\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98323\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98321\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t45.16\t51.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tSell junk and repair at Boran Ironclink.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t313\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t41.43\t43.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead west to Shimmer Ridge by the outside paths.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t41.43\t43.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Shimmerweed from baskets and level 8-9 Seers on southern Shimmer Ridge for {q315}. Avoid level-10 Hideskinners while 8.\nC\t\t315\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t35.48\t40.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the outside paths down to Iceflow Lake and learn Apprentice Fishing from Paxton Ganter before returning to Brewnall Village.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98326\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t31.53\t44.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Gretta Ganter; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q315}, then accept {q413}; keep it for South Gate Outpost on the Loch Modan transition.\nT\t\t315\t\nA\t\t413\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 on isolated level 8-9 wildlife before exploring Frostmane Hold.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Frostmane Hold. Kill five level 8-9 Headhunters and complete the exploration objective for {q287}; pull level-10 guards singly.\nC\t\t287\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kharanos from the Hold if ready; otherwise leave by the entrance and follow the road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Kharanos\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t287\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t291\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t96408\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Eastern circuit: actual enemies are lower than the Farsen quest levels.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the outside path to Farsen’s ridge camp.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96408\t\nA\t\t96392\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tChoose Farsen’s farsight dialogue for {q96392}.\nC\t\t96392\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96392\t\nA\t\t96390\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAvoid the level-11 elites Vagash and Old Icebeard.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t433\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t432\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six level 8-9 Skullthumpers on the quarry floor and ten level 9-10 Bonesnappers inside the mine for {q432} and {q433}.\nC\t\t432\t\t\nC\t\t433\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave the mine by its entrance and return to the quarry camp, then turn in {q432}.\nT\t\t432\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t433\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf an Empty Powder Keg dropped, use it to accept {q95213}; otherwise skip this quest and its follow-up.\nA\t\t95213\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t95213\t\nA\t\t95214\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t70.79\t53.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect sixteen powder from level 9-10 Rockjaw Ambushers on the surface above the mine for {q95214}. Avoid level 11-12 Backbreakers.\nC\t\t95214\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t70.79\t53.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 on individual level 9-10 Rockjaw Ambushers on the surface before fighting the spies.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t77.38\t62.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the surface path east to Ironband’s Compound, hunting Ambushers along the way. Kill ten level 9-11 Dark Iron Spies for {q96390}.\nC\t\t96390\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf a Dark Iron Map drops, use it to accept {q96391}; do not farm the starter.\nA\t\t96391\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish collecting the sixteen powder from the surface Ambushers for {q95214} before returning to the quarry camp.\nC\t\t95214\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95214} to Thesten before visiting Farsen.\nT\t\t95214\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96390\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96391\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q96393} after completing Underground Map; keep it for Hall of Thanes.\nA\t\t96393\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHall of Thanes follows at 13–14 in Loch Modan.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kharanos if ready, then take the road to Ironforge. Otherwise follow the road northwest from the ranch.\nH\t\tHearth to Kharanos\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.36\t52.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you hearth to Kharanos, accept {q1679} from Granis Swiftaxe; otherwise skip.\nA\t\t1679\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.5\t52.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you hearth to Kharanos, accept {q1879} from Magis Sparkmantle; otherwise skip.\nA\t\t1879\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t47.56\t52.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you hearth to Kharanos, accept {q2218} from Hogral Bakkan; otherwise skip.\nA\t\t2218\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nA\t\t6064\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on a Large Crag Boar for {q6064}, then return to Grif.\nC\t\t6064\t\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t6064\t\nA\t\t6084\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on a Snow Leopard for {q6084}, then return to Grif.\nC\t\t6084\t\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t6084\t\nA\t\t6085\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an Ice Claw Bear for {q6085}, then return to Grif.\nC\t\t6085\t\t\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t6085\t\nA\t\t6086\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Ironforge: level-10 training and the required class unlock.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road into Ironforge through its main entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t291\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Bloodrage and Rend II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.77\t90.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1679} if carrying it.\nT\t\t1679\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nA\t\t1678\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Ironforge by its main gate, follow the road through Kharanos toward Frostmane Hold, then climb the foothill path just south of the Hold to Vejrek's hut. Defeat level-11 Vejrek and take his head for {q1678}.\nC\t\t1678\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to Muren Stormpike in Ironforge, then turn in {q1678}. Learn Defensive Stance, Taunt and Sunder Armor I.\nT\t\t1678\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Flame Shock I, Flametongue Weapon I and Strength of Earth Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Shaman\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q94449}; keep it for the Loch Modan journey.\nA\t\t94449\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1879} if carrying it.\nT\t\t1879\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Frost Nova I, Conjure Water II and Frost Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2218} if carrying it.\nT\t\t2218\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Dual Wield, Sap I, Slice and Dice I and Sprint I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable weapon upgrade and an off-hand dagger at the Auction House; equip both weapons after learning Dual Wield.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Lay on Hands, Blessing of Protection I, Devotion Aura II, Seal of Righteousness II, Seal of Fury I and Righteous Fury.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Resurrection I, Mind Blast I, Lesser Heal III and Shadow Word: Pain II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q94817}, then turn in {q94817} and learn Confounding Flash from High Priestess Mims.\nA\t\t94817\t\nT\t\t94817\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nA\t\t5639\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind and visit the Cathedral of Light.\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5639} and learn Desperate Prayer from High Priestess Laurena.\nT\t\t5639\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves or Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTake the tram back to Ironforge before continuing.\nS\tDwarf Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6086} and learn Beast Training, Call Pet, Dismiss Pet, Feed Pet and Revive Pet from Belia Thundergranite.\nT\t\t6086\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.86\t85.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Belia Thundergranite, learn Growl II, Great Stamina I, Natural Armor I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Aspect of the Hawk, Serpent Sting II and Track Humanoids.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1715\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.35\t5.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain level-10 spells: Drain Soul first, then Create Healthstone, Demon Skin II and Immolate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind for the Voidwalker quest.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1715\t\nA\t\t1688\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.95\t72.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Stormwind’s gryphon flight point.\nP\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Staves.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road through Goldshire to Brackwell Pumpkin Patch.\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect a Soul Shard with Drain Soul for your Voidwalker summon.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tKill Surena (9) and loot her choker for {q1688}. Clear her nearby level 8-10 guards.\nC\t\t1688\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gakin with Surena's Choker.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1688\t\nA\t\t1689\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gakin’s summoning circle, use the Bloodstone Choker and subdue the Voidwalker for {q1689}.\nU\t\t6928\t\nC\t\t1689\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1689\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tSummon the Voidwalker and enable Torment for solo combat.\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kharanos if ready; otherwise take the tram to Ironforge and follow the road south.\nH\t\tHearth to Kharanos\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t34.2\t41.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to the northern snowfields and tame a Starving Winter Wolf as your permanent pet. Feed it meat and use Bite II until learned for Beast Training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tOpen Beast Training and teach Growl II and the available stamina and armor ranks. Enable Bite and Growl for solo work.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 on level 9-10 wildlife in eastern Dun Morogh. Hearth to Kharanos if ready; otherwise take the road.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\tDwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 12 for Redemption. Complete remaining Dun Morogh quests, such as Operation Recombobulation from Razzle Sprysprocket in Kharanos or Never Saddle on Quality from Rudra 