t\t91772\t\nA\t\t62\t\nA\t\t91775\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t47\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t60\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2158\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 before the farm circuit; finish on nearby wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Farley for field and city returns; repair. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Goldshire\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t44.37\t65.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Tomas in the inn's kitchen.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96626\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.96\t65.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Brog Hamfist; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.96\t65.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Brog Hamfist for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.28\t65.72\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5623} to Priestess Josetta if carrying it.\nT\t\t5623\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.39\t65.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Michelle Belle upstairs.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t47.61\t62.32\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Fishing from Lee Brown by Crystal Lake.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t99143\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t99127\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Fishing Traps along Crystal Lake's western shore and collect seven Half-Eaten Fish for {q99127}.\nC\t\t99127\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99127\t\nA\t\t99128\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern farm road to the Stonefields, then continue east to the Maclures.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t85\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t85\t\nA\t\t86\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t106\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Chunks of Boar Meat from Stonetusk Boars on the farm slopes for {q86}.\nC\t\t86\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t106\t\nA\t\t111\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t86\t\nA\t\t84\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t111\t\nA\t\t107\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t84\t\nA\t\t87\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire if ready; otherwise follow the farm road north.\nH\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t107\t\nA\t\t112\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 before training and the murloc camps; finish on level 5-6 boars if needed.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.09\t65.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Lyria Du Lac, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.87\t65.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Keryn Sylvius upstairs in the inn, learn Gouge I and Sinister Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.25\t66.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zaldimar Wefhellt upstairs in the inn, learn Fireball II, Fire Blast I, Conjure Food I and Comprehend Scroll. Use Comprehend Scroll on untranslated scrolls you find.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.28\t65.72\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Priestess Josetta upstairs in the inn, learn Power Word: Shield I and Smite II. Use your shield for solo pulls; once you have a wand, finish weakened enemies with it.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.1\t66.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brother Wilhelm, learn Holy Strike I, Holy Light II, Divine Protection I and Seal of the Crusader I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.18\t66.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Josephine Carson, learn Arcane Shot I and Hunter's Mark I. Restock ammunition.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t44.39\t66.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Maximillian Crowe in the inn's cellar, learn Life Tap and Shadow Bolt II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.82\t67.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Tharynn Bouden; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOn Crystal Lake's southern shore, kill seven Murlocs and four Streamrunners, collect six Shiny Junk from Junk Piles and four Crystal Kelp Fronds from the murlocs for {q99128}, {q99143}, and {q112}. Pull onto cleared ground.\nC\t\t99128\t\t\nC\t\t99143\t\t\nC\t\t112\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99143\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99128\t\nA\t\t99129\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t112\t\nA\t\t114\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99129\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t114\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 before Fargodeep Mine; finish on isolated level 6-7 kobolds outside the mine if needed.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t39.0\t82.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Fargodeep Mine through its lower western entrance for Goldtooth and Nimsy; keep pulls within cleared passages.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnels until the mine exploration completes for {q62}.\nC\t\t62\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Gold Dust, eight Large Candles and six Lost Books from the mine's kobolds for {q47}, {q60}, and {q91775}.\nC\t\t47\t\t\nC\t\t60\t\t\nC\t\t91775\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the cleared passages to Goldtooth and take Bernice's Necklace for {q87}.\nC\t\t87\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIn the large chamber, take the eastern passage and climb the stairs north to Nimsy. Defeat him and his summoned elemental, collect 'Fun with Elementals' for {q91775}, then leave through the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t91775\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t87\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire if ready; otherwise return along the farm road.\nH\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t47\t\nA\t\t40\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t62\t\nT\t\t91775\t\nT\t\t40\t\nA\t\t76\t\nA\t\t91777\t\nA\t\t35\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q60}, then accept {q61} for the level-8 city visit.\nT\t\t60\t\nA\t\t61\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 before training and the eastern circuit; finish on level 7-8 wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.09\t65.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Lyria Du Lac, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.87\t65.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Keryn Sylvius upstairs in the inn, learn Evasion and Eviscerate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.25\t66.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zaldimar Wefhellt upstairs in the inn, learn Polymorph I, Frostbolt II and Arcane Missiles I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.28\t65.72\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Priestess Josetta upstairs in the inn, learn Renew I and Fade I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.1\t66.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brother Wilhelm, learn Hammer of Justice I, Purify and Parry.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.18\t66.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Josephine Carson, learn Concussive Shot, Parry and Raptor Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t44.39\t66.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Maximillian Crowe in the inn's cellar, learn Fear and Bane of Agony.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t44.4\t65.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Imp Firebolt II from Cylina Darkheart and use it with your Imp summoned.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road northwest into Stormwind and turn in {q61} to Morgan Pestle.\nT\t\t61\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain your chosen primary professions: all nine are available in Stormwind. Use this stop for Alchemy, Enchanting, Engineering or Tailoring, which are not taught in Goldshire. Blacksmithing and Leatherworking are available here or around Goldshire. Alternatively, learn Alchemy from Alchemist Mallory north of Goldshire toward Northshire, or Tailoring from Eldrin at Eastvale Logging Camp. Train any chosen Mining, Herbalism or Skinning not already learned from your starter quest book or a trainer.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords, Staves, Daggers or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves or Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Staves.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage/Priest/Warlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable early wand at the Auction House, such as a Lesser Magic Wand. Equip it; stand still for 0.5 seconds before shooting.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire if ready; otherwise follow the main road southeast.\nH\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern road toward the Tower of Azora.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t91725\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Hamish Bergwort inside the tower, then accept {q91723}.\nA\t\t91723\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t35\t\nA\t\t37\t\nA\t\t52\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t91733\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5545\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t91732\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Bundles of Wood around Eastvale's cleared logging grounds for {q5545}.\nC\t\t5545\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5545\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Prowlers and five Young Forest Bears along the eastern forest for {q52}, pulling singly.\nC\t\t52\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Waterlogged Saw beside the downstream riverbank for {q91733}.\nC\t\t91733\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Waterlogged Axe on the island at the river fork for {q91733}.\nC\t\t91733\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Waterlogged Toolbox by the wrecked boat for {q91733}, then return north along the bank.\nC\t\t91733\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t91733\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t52\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 before the northern circuit; finish on level 8-9 wildlife outside Eastvale if needed.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tExamine the half-eaten body beside the river, then turn in {q37}.\nT\t\t37\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t45\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t61.6\t54.1\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern path to Jasperlode Mine's entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter and follow the mine's main passage until the exploration completes for {q76}.\nC\t\t76\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Kobold Geomancers in Jasperlode Mine, collecting four Mining Tools from its passages for {q91723} and {q91732}. Pull enemies back into cleared passages.\nC\t\t91723\t\t\nC\t\t91732\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Geosculptor Yip deep inside Jasperlode Mine and collect 'Geomancy for Curious Young Wizards' for {q91777}. Be ready for the three elementals he summons when defeated.\nC\t\t91777\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Mother Fang in the mine's rear chamber and collect 'Arcane Explainer: Magical Stuff in Simple Words' for {q91777}, then leave through the entrance.\nC\t\t91777\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t91723\t\nA\t\t91724\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Stone Cairn Lake's western shore north and collect five Stolen Enchanting Supplies from the gnoll camps north of Stone Cairn Lake for {q91725}.\nC\t\t91725\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRound the lake's northern shore and kill eight Defias Rogue Wizards near Stone Cairn Lake for {q91724}, pulling away from their camps.\nC\t\t91724\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the camp and inspect Rolf's corpse, then turn in {q45}.\nT\t\t45\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t71\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t91732\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t71\t\nA\t\t39\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t91725\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t91724\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road west, then take the Northshire road to the abbey.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q91777} to Brother Paxton in the library.\nT\t\t91777\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire if ready; otherwise follow the road south.\nH\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t39\t\nT\t\t76\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 before the class unlocks; finish on level 9-10 wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1860} from Zaldimar Wefhellt upstairs in the inn.\nA\t\t1860\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q2205} from Keryn Sylvius upstairs in the inn.\nA\t\t2205\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.09\t65.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Lyria Du Lac, learn Bloodrage and Rend II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1638}; keep the training message for Stormwind.\nA\t\t1638\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nA\t\t94792\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Rockhide Boar for {q94792}, then return to Josephine.\nC\t\t94792\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t94792\t\nA\t\t94863\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Gray Forest Wolf for {q94863}, then return to Josephine.\nC\t\t94863\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t94863\t\nA\t\t94864\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Young Forest Bear for {q94864}, then return to Josephine.\nC\t\t94864\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t94864\t\nA\t\t94793\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.18\t66.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Josephine Carson, learn Aspect of the Hawk, Serpent Sting II and Track Humanoids.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94793} and learn Beast Training, Call Pet, Dismiss Pet, Feed Pet and Revive Pet from Isaac Chan.\nT\t\t94793\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.72\t66.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Isaac Chan, learn Growl II, Great Stamina I and Natural Armor I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t44.24\t65.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy meat for the wolf from Toddrick before leaving Goldshire.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t75.49\t76.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tTame a Prowler as your permanent wolf. Feed it meat and use Bite II in combat until learned for Beast Training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tOpen Beast Training and teach Growl II and the available stamina and armor ranks. Enable Bite and Growl for solo work.\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire if ready; otherwise follow the main road west.\nH\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1685\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road northwest to Stormwind for the class handoffs and training.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t1638\t\nA\t\t1639\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t1639\t\nA\t\t1640\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tChallenge Bartleby and subdue him, then speak to him for {q1640}.\nC\t\t1640\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t1640\t\nA\t\t1665\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1665} to Harry Burlguard. Learn Defensive Stance, Taunt and Sunder Armor I.\nT\t\t1665\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a useful leveling weapon you can equip; keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready. Reserve money for class training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tKeep a usable ranged weapon and its ammunition, or a thrown weapon, for pulling enemies into cleared ground.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Dual Wield, Sap I, Slice and Dice I and Sprint I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t2205\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable weapon upgrade and an off-hand dagger at the Auction House. Equip both weapons after learning Dual Wield.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nT\t\t1860\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Frost Nova I, Conjure Water II and Frost Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Resurrection I, Mind Blast I, Lesser Heal III and Shadow Word: Pain II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q94773}, then turn in {q94773} and learn Divine Grace.\nA\t\t94773\t\nT\t\t94773\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Lay on Hands, Blessing of Protection I, Devotion Aura II, Seal of Righteousness II, Seal of Fury I and Righteous Fury.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette Cloyce, learn Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, Demon Skin II and Immolate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1685\t\nA\t\t1688\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.53\t84.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Imp Firebolt II from Spackle Thornberry if still unlearned and use it with your Imp summoned.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Stormwind by its main gate and follow the roads through Goldshire to Brackwell's pumpkin patch.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Surena and her guards at the Brackwell house, then take her choker for {q1688}.\nC\t\t1688\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire if ready; otherwise follow the road back.\nH\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road to Stormwind and return to Gakin in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1688\t\nA\t\t1689\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Bloodstone Choker at Gakin's summoning circle and subdue the Voidwalker for {q1689}.\nC\t\t1689\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1689} and learn Summon Voidwalker. Summon it and enable Torment for solo work.\nT\t\t1689\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 before the Ironforge handoff. If short, hunt level 9-10 wildlife along the eastern forest roads, then return to Stormwind.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 12 for Redemption. Complete remaining Elwynn Forest quests, such as Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty from Deputy Rainer at Westbrook Garrison or Princess Must Die! from Ma Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm, or hunt level 9-10 wildlife. Return to Stormwind.\nX\t\t\t12\t\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep ten Linen Cloth for the class quest; buy any shortfall at the Auction House.\nK\t\t2589\t10\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Blessing of Might II, Holy Strike II and Seal of the Crusader II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1641}, then turn in {q1641} to Duthorian Rall and take the Tome of Divinity.\nA\t\t1641\t\nT\t\t1641\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Tome of Divinity, then accept {q1642}.\nU\t\t6775\t\nA\t\t1642\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nT\t\t1642\t\nA\t\t1643\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nT\t\t1643\t\nA\t\t1644\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1644} to Stephanie Turner with ten Linen Cloth, then accept {q1780}.\nT\t\t1644\t\nA\t\t1780\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nT\t\t1780\t\nA\t\t1781\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nT\t\t1781\t\nA\t\t1786\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road through Goldshire to Stone Cairn Lake. Use the Symbol of Life on Henze Faulk on the eastern shore for {q1786}.\nU\t\t6866\t\nC\t\t1786\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1786} to Henze immediately after reviving him.\nT\t\t1786\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nA\t\t1787\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Defias Script from the nearby Defias Rogue Wizards for {q1787}.\nC\t\t1787\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to Stormwind and the Cathedral of Light.\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nT\t\t1787\t\nA\t\t1788\t\nS\tHuman Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1788} and learn Redemption.\nT\t\t1788\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.5\t47.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t" },
  { name = "1-11 Teldrassil (Alliance)", title = "1-11 Teldrassil", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 1, hi = 11, next = "11-14 Loch Modan (Alliance)", defaultFor = "NightElf", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Shadowglen, Dolanaar and Darnassus; the moonwells and northern glades. Ends in Ironforge at 11 for Loch Modan.",
    steps = "S\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tStand still for 0.5 seconds before Auto Shot.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t456\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t458\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill seven Young Nightsabers and four Young Thistle Boars around Shadowglen for {q456}.\nC\t\t456\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t456\t\nA\t\t457\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nA\t\t3117\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nA\t\t3116\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nA\t\t3120\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nA\t\t3118\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nA\t\t3119\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q458}. Choose a free Herbalism, Mining or Skinning book; use it when eligible to learn your chosen profession.\nT\t\t458\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t459\t\nA\t\t97977\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 2 on nearby Young Nightsabers before leaving Shadowglen's clearing.\nX\t\t\t2\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t3116\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.64\t38.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alyissia, learn Battle Shout I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t3117\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.66\t40.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Track Beasts from Ayanna Everstride.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t3120\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.63\t40.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Mark of the Wild I from Mardant Strongoak.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t3118\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.64\t38.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Frahun Shadewhisper, learn Stealth I. Climb Aldrassil's ramp to the trainer.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Aldrassil's ramp to Shanda, then turn in {q3119}.\nT\t\t3119\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.17\t40.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shanda, learn Power Word: Fortitude I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill seven Mangy Nightsabers and seven Thistle Boars around the northern clearing for {q457}.\nC\t\t457\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Gnarlpine Totems from the western camps for {q97977}.\nC\t\t97977\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Fel Moss from Grell and Grellkin along the western clearing for {q459}.\nC\t\t459\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t459\t\nT\t\t97977\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t457\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 3 on Grell and Thistle Boars before the spider woods.\nX\t\t\t3\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t916\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4495\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4495\t\nA\t\t3519\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3519\t\nA\t\t3521\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven Hyacinth Mushrooms around Shadowglen for {q3521}.\nC\t\t3521\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Moonpetal Lilies along the northern clearing for {q3521}.\nC\t\t3521\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Webwood Ichor and ten Webwood Venom Sacs from the spiders north of Aldrassil for {q3521} and {q916}.\nC\t\t3521\t3\t\nC\t\t916\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3521\t\nA\t\t3522\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun directly to Iverron and turn in {q3522} before the antidote expires.\nT\t\t3522\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to your initial Shadowglen binding if ready; otherwise follow the path south from Iverron to Aldrassil.\nH\t\tHearth to Shadowglen\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t916\t\nA\t\t917\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 4 on Webwood Spiders before entering Shadowthread Cave.\nX\t\t\t4\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.64\t38.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alyissia, learn Charge I and Rend I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.66\t40.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Aspect of the Monkey and Serpent Sting I from Ayanna Everstride.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.63\t40.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Moonfire I, Rejuvenation I and useful available Wrath and Healing Touch ranks from Mardant Strongoak.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.17\t40.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shanda, learn Lesser Heal II and Shadow Word: Pain I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.64\t38.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Frahun Shadewhisper, learn Pick Pocket and Backstab I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t57.01\t26.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Shadowthread Cave from the southern mouth and collect a Webwood Egg for {q917}. Pull spiders singly and leave through the same entrance.\nC\t\t917\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf Githyiss drops his fang during the cave visit, use it to accept {q97236}.\nA\t\t97236\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t917\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t57.81\t41.65\t\t\t\nT\t\t97236\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t920\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Aldrassil by its ramp to Tenaron Stormgrip. Turn in {q920}, then accept {q921}.\nT\t\t920\t\nA\t\t921\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the Crystal Phial at the Shadowglen moonwell for {q921}.\nU\t\t5185\t\nC\t\t921\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t921\t\nA\t\t928\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Lost Journal beside Tenaron atop Aldrassil and accept {q96630}.\nA\t\t96630\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.17\t40.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf already level 5, accept {q5622} from Shanda as you descend Aldrassil; skip otherwise.\nA\t\t5622\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2159\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t488\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96630\t\nA\t\t96606\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tType /sit beside Lyreena Duskblade's campfire and wait until Boosted Rest appears for {q96606}.\nC\t\t96606\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96606\t\nA\t\t96634\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2159\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 before the village profession training and Timberling quest; finish on nearby wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.62\t59.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Keldamyr; sell junk. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Dolanaar\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.29\t56.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Byancie.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2438\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t475\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t997\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t57.12\t61.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Zarrin.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96634\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t57.19\t61.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Nyoma; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t57.19\t61.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Nyoma for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t928\t\nA\t\t929\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t997\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t918\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t919\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t60.02\t72.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill level 5-6 Timberlings around eastern Lake Al'Ameth and collect eight Timberling Seeds, collecting twelve Timberling Sprouts as you clear for {q919} and {q918}.\nC\t\t919\t\t\nC\t\t918\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t919\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t918\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t922\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t64.75\t51.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Nightsaber Fangs, three Strigid Owl Feathers and three Webwood Spider Silk from the level 5-6 wildlife east of Dolanaar for {q488}.\nC\t\t488\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t488\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t489\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Fel Cones beneath the southern trees for {q489}.\nC\t\t489\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t489\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 on Timberlings and eastern wildlife before the Starbreeze circuit.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.22\t59.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kyra Windblade, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.68\t59.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dazalar, learn Arcane Shot I and Hunter's Mark I. Restock arrows with Jeena Featherbow at 55.89,59.21.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.38\t60.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jannok Breezesong, learn Gouge I and Sinister Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.95\t61.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kal, learn Wrath II and Thorns I, plus available healing ranks.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.56\t56.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5622} if carrying it.\nT\t\t5622\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.56\t56.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Laurna Morninglight, learn Power Word: Shield I and Smite II. Use your shield for solo pulls; once you have a wand, finish weakened enemies with it.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: SEEK_REDEMPTION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q489}.\nA\t\t489\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect three Fel Cones beneath the southern trees for {q489}.\nC\t\t489\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q489}.\nT\t\t489\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: SEEK_REDEMPTION\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t475\t\nA\t\t476\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Emerald Dreamcatcher from Tallonkai's Dresser in Starbreeze Village for {q2438}.\nC\t\t2438\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the Jade Phial at the Starbreeze moonwell for {q929}.\nU\t\t5619\t\nC\t\t929\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t929\t\nA\t\t933\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t476\t\nA\t\t483\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2438\t\nA\t\t2459\t\nA\t\t932\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 on level 6-7 wildlife before the northern Gnarlpine camps.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t69.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill seven Gnarlpine Mystics. Clear Ferocitas and his guards, loot the necklace and open it to recover the Missing Jewel for {q2459}.\nC\t\t2459\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2459\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t487\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Gnarlpine Ambushers along the road west of Dolanaar for {q487}.\nC\t\t487\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t487\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 on level 7-8 spiders or nightsabers before the cave visits.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.22\t59.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kyra Windblade, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.68\t59.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dazalar, learn Concussive Shot, Parry and Raptor Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.38\t60.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jannok Breezesong, learn Evasion and Eviscerate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.95\t61.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kal, learn Entangling Roots I and Healing Touch II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.56\t56.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Laurna Morninglight, learn Renew I and Fade I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west into Darnassus and turn in {q922} to Rellian Greenspyre, then accept {q923}.\nT\t\t922\t\nA\t\t923\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain your chosen Alchemy, Enchanting, Leatherworking, Tailoring, Herbalism or Skinning in Darnassus. Dolanaar also teaches Alchemy and Herbalism. Alternatively, learn Leatherworking from Nadyia Maneweaver and Skinning from Radnaal Maneweaver along the Darnassus road, or Enchanting from Alanna Raveneye at Oracle Glade. Blacksmithing and Engineering are taught in neither Dolanaar nor Darnassus: learn them from Delfrum Flintbeard and Jenna Lemkenilli in Auberdine during the later mainland stop. Train any chosen Herbalism or Skinning not already learned from your starter quest book or a trainer. Use Kurdram Stonehammer during the Auberdine stop for Mining training still needed after your starter book or Shadowglen's junior trainer.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarnassus\t57.56\t46.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ilyenia Moonfire, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Bows, Staves, Daggers, Thrown or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarnassus\t57.56\t46.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ilyenia Moonfire, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Bows, Thrown or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarnassus\t57.56\t46.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ilyenia Moonfire, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarnassus\t57.56\t46.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ilyenia Moonfire, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves or Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t56.37\t51.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable early wand at the Auction House, such as a Lesser Magic Wand. Equip it; stand still for 0.5 seconds before shooting.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t47.89\t56.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Fishing from Astaia.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t46.94\t57.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Voloren; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Dolanaar if ready; otherwise follow the road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Dolanaar\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.57\t56.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and clear bag space before Ban'ethil.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t44.4\t57.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Ban'ethil Barrow Den through its doorway for the relics and Rageclaw.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDescend the den's spiral passage and cross the bridge to Oben Rageclaw's spirit, then accept {q2541}.\nA\t\t2541\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the den's passages to the Chest of the Raven Claw for {q483}.\nC\t\t483\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Black Feather Quill from its separate chest for {q483}.\nC\t\t483\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Sapphire of Sky from its chest for {q483}.\nC\t\t483\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Rune of Nesting from the fourth chest for {q483}.\nC\t\t483\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Shaman Voodoo Charm from the den's Gnarlpine Shamans for {q2541}.\nC\t\t2541\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2541\t\nA\t\t2561\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Rageclaw, then use the Voodoo Charm on his body for {q2561}.\nC\t\t2561\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2561\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t44.68\t58.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom, accept {q99053} and escort her out through the cleared passages for {q99053}.\nA\t\t99053\t\nC\t\t99053\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99053\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t483\t\nA\t\t486\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the trail north from Dolanaar to Fel Rock's entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Fel Rock's passages and ramps to Lord Melenas and take his head for {q932}; check the ledges as well as the lower chamber.\nC\t\t932\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Dolanaar if ready; otherwise leave Fel Rock by the cleared entrance and follow the path back to town.\nH\t\tHearth to Dolanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t932\t\nA\t\t98403\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t490\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t46.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Gnarlpine Fangs from the western camps for {q490}.\nC\t\t490\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t490\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the Tourmaline Phial at the Pools of Arlithrien moonwell for {q933}.\nU\t\t5621\t\nC\t\t933\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q930} from the Strange Fruited Plant.\nA\t\t930\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t930\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t933\t\nA\t\t7383\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 before the northern woodland circuit; finish on level 8-9 spiders if needed.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t41.87\t33.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Mossy Tumors from Timberling Mire Beasts in the northern woods for {q923}.\nC\t\t923\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t937\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Bloodfeather Belts from the harpies near the Oracle Glade for {q937}. Pull into cleared ground.\nC\t\t937\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t937\t\nA\t\t98392\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the Amethyst Phial at the Oracle Glade moonwell for {q7383}.\nU\t\t18152\t\nC\t\t7383\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Dolanaar if ready; otherwise return along the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Dolanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7383\t\nA\t\t935\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 on level 9-10 northern wildlife before the class unlocks.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nA\t\t5925\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1684} from Kyra Windblade.\nA\t\t1684\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t56.38\t60.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jannok Breezesong, learn Dual Wield, Sap I, Slice and Dice I and Sprint I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nA\t\t2241\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5629} from Laurna Morninglight.\nA\t\t5629\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nA\t\t6063\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Webwood Lurker for {q6063}, then return to Dazalar.\nC\t\t6063\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6063\t\nA\t\t6101\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Nightsaber Stalker for {q6101}, then return to Dazalar.\nC\t\t6101\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6101\t\nA\t\t6102\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Strigid Screecher for {q6102}, then return to Dazalar.\nC\t\t6102\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6102\t\nA\t\t6103\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to Darnassus for the class handoffs and Rellian's report.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t935\t\nA\t\t98046\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6103} and learn Beast Training, Call Pet, Dismiss Pet, Feed Pet and Revive Pet from Jocaste.\nT\t\t6103\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t40.38\t8.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jocaste, learn Aspect of the Hawk, Serpent Sting II and Track Humanoids. At Silvaria (42.47,9.17), learn Growl II, Great Stamina I and Natural Armor I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5925\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t35.37\t8.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Mathrengyl Bearwalker, learn Mark of the Wild II, Moonfire II, Rejuvenation II and Nature's Grasp I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5921} and learn Teleport: Moonglade.\nA\t\t5921\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t923\t\nA\t\t2498\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t2241\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98046\t\nA\t\t98065\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98065\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Temple of the Moon's ramp to Priestess Alathea on the upper balcony, then turn in {q5629}. Learn Starshards from her lesson.\nT\t\t5629\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarnassus\t39.52\t81.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5627} if Alathea offers the lesson.\nA\t\t5627\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q5627} and learn Starshards.\nT\t\t5627\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t39.52\t81.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Priestess Alathea, learn Resurrection I, Mind Blast I, Lesser Heal III and Shadow Word: Pain II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t56.37\t51.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable weapon upgrade and an off-hand dagger at the Auction House; equip both weapons after learning Dual Wield.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t58.94\t35.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Darnath Bladesinger, learn Bloodrage and Rend II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t1684\t\nA\t\t1683\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t56.37\t51.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a useful leveling weapon you can equip; keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready. Reserve money for class training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tKeep a usable ranged weapon and its ammunition, or a thrown weapon, for pulling enemies into cleared ground.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t49.0\t61.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Darnassus by the eastern road. Take the winding hill path west of Dolanaar toward Vorlus's moonwell.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Vorlus Vilehoof at the hilltop moonwell and collect his horn for {q1683}.\nC\t\t1683\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the hill path and road to Elanaria in Darnassus, then turn in {q1683}. Learn Defensive Stance, Taunt and Sunder Armor I.\nT\t\t1683\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5921} to Dendrite Starblaze, then accept {q5929}.\nT\t\t5921\t\nA\t\t5929\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with the Great Bear Spirit for {q5929}.\nC\t\t5929\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5929\t\nA\t\t5931\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the Druid flight to Rut'theran Village, then use the portal into Darnassus.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5931\t\nA\t\t6001\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tUse Darnassus's western portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.38\t94.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point before boarding the Auberdine boat.\nP\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.33\t45.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t43.5\t45.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east to the Moonkin Stone.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Cenarion Moondust at the stone, defeat Lunaclaw and speak to his spirit for {q6001}.\nU\t\t15208\t\nC\t\t6001\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Auberdine, take the Rut'theran boat and enter Darnassus through the portal.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6001} and learn Bear Form.\nT\t\t6001\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t35.37\t8.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Mathrengyl Bearwalker, learn Demoralizing Roar I for Bear Form.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn east by the road to Dolanaar.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t43.69\t47.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tTame a Webwood Silkspinner as your permanent pet. Feed it meat to keep it happy, and use Bite II in combat until learned for Beast Training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tOpen Beast Training and teach your pet Growl II and the available stamina and armor ranks. Enable Bite and Growl for solo work.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2498\t\nA\t\t2499\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Oakenscowl and loot the Gargantuan Tumor for {q2499}.\nC\t\t2499\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2499\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Ursal's guards and defeat him for {q486}.\nC\t\t486\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Dolanaar if ready; otherwise return along the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Dolanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t486\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t51.3\t45.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path northwest to the Cleft and form a party for Xethorr and his spiders.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb through the Cleft, killing eight Befouled Webwoods, then enter the small cave and defeat Xethorr the Wicked and collect Mature Fel Moss for {q98403}. Leave by the cleared Cleft path.\nC\t\t98403\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Hatescreech and loot her amulet for {q98392}.\nC\t\t98392\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Windmistress Gaedress and loot her amulet for {q98392}.\nC\t\t98392\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Witchmother Arysa and loot her amulet for {q98392}.\nC\t\t98392\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98392\t\nA\t\t98398\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98398\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t940\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Dolanaar if ready; otherwise return along the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Dolanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98403\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to Darnassus for the final reports.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t940\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: CROWN_OF_THE_EARTH\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q98046}.\nA\t\t98046\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q98046}, then accept {q98065}.\nT\t\t98046\t\nA\t\t98065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q98065}.\nT\t\t98065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: CROWN_OF_THE_EARTH\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 before the mainland journey. If short, hunt level 9-10 wildlife in Teldrassil, then return to Darnassus.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities before the mainland journey.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the western city portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.38\t94.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point if not already known, then take the Auberdine boat.\nP\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.33\t45.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before changing ships.\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarkshore\t38.25\t41.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tBefore the Stormwind boat, train any chosen Blacksmithing with Delfrum Flintbeard (38.19,40.93), Engineering with Jenna Lemkenilli (38.30,41.12), or Mining with Kurdram Stonehammer here, if still needed. They stand together by the northern forge; otherwise continue to the boat.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Stormwind boat from Auberdine, then follow the harbor road into the city.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.95\t72.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the gryphon point.\nP\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.5\t47.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the gryphon point before continuing.\nP\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Ironforge at 11 or above." },
  { name = "1-14 Zephras Isle (Alliance)", title = "1-14 Zephras Isle", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 1, hi = 14, next = "14-19 Westfall (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance Skyborne", bethink = true,
    about = "Thendal Grove, Shen'dar Highlands and Valanaar; the High Order story and mainland arrival. Ends in Ironforge at 14.",
    steps = "S\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tStand still for 0.5 seconds before Auto Shot.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92460\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92460\t\nA\t\t92461\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92462\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Juvenile Vuldren and eight Pesky Cirrusflies around the grove for {q92461} and {q92462}.\nC\t\t92461\t\t\nC\t\t92462\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92461\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 2 on Juvenile Vuldren and Pesky Cirrusflies in the grove before the next pickups.\nX\t\t\t2\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nA\t\t92532\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nA\t\t92483\t\nS\tSkyborne Mage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q92481} from Rorian the Dayseeker.\nA\t\t92481\t\nS\tSkyborne Mage\t\t\nT\t\t92481\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t41.57\t23.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dorii Brightwhisper, learn Arcane Intellect I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nA\t\t92482\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t92482\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t42.46\t23.67\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Track Beasts from Tai'ree Farsight.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Folded Parchment, then accept {q92485}.\nA\t\t92485\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t92485\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t41.71\t23.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xyton Silverwind, learn Mark of the Wild I and available early spells.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92462\t\nA\t\t92463\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93552\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t46.59\t17.83\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t48.13\t29.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Windstone Clusters from Raw Windstones during the northern quests and Cirrusfly Queen quest for {q93552}.\nC\t\t93552\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t94414\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Halaan Hawk Eye to show you the anchor for {q94414}.\nC\t\t94414\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94414\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92474\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the Thendal Village watchtower to Blademaster Ren, then turn in {q92532}.\nT\t\t92532\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.65\t24.17\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Blademaster Ren, learn Battle Shout I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tMeet Akeri Duskblade inside the watchtower, then turn in {q92483}.\nT\t\t92483\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.73\t24.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Akeri Duskblade, learn Stealth I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the watchtower, jump from the top and use Walk on Air to slow your fall for {q92474}.\nC\t\t92474\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92474\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92464\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92597\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92464\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92465\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Read Leyline at the ley line for {q92597}.\nC\t\t92597\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Roiling Winds and seven Al'Aketh Converts on the northern slopes for {q92465}.\nC\t\t92465\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92465\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 3 on Roiling Winds and Converts on the northern slopes before taking the return message.\nX\t\t\t3\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92469\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the Cirrusfly Queen east of the grove for {q92463}.\nC\t\t92463\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92597\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q93552}. Choose a free Herbalism, Mining or Skinning book; use it when eligible to learn your chosen profession.\nT\t\t93552\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92469\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 4 on level 3-4 wildlife along the western grove path before the western quests.\nX\t\t\t4\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92471\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.65\t24.17\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Blademaster Ren, learn Charge I and Rend I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t41.71\t23.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Moonfire I, Rejuvenation I, Wrath and Healing Touch at Xyton Silverwind.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t42.46\t23.67\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Tai'ree Farsight, learn Aspect of the Monkey and Serpent Sting I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.73\t24.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Akeri Duskblade, learn Pick Pocket and Backstab I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t41.57\t23.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dorii Brightwhisper, learn Frostbolt I and Conjure Water I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92471\t\nA\t\t92470\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92473\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six claws from Scrawny Ursera along the western path for {q92473}.\nC\t\t92473\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t38.3\t27.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the hillside path to Thendal Cave's entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Ursera Scavengers, then clear through the cave to Urs'anah and take her head for {q92470}.\nC\t\t92470\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to your initial Thendal Grove binding if ready; otherwise leave the cave by its entrance and follow the western path back to the village.\nH\t\tHearth to Thendal Grove\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92473\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92470\t\nA\t\t96638\t\nA\t\t92472\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92544\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Al'Aketh Brutes and four Neophytes. Clear around Malduko Cloudcrush, then defeat him for {q92544}.\nC\t\t92544\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92544\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south to Shen'dar Village.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96638\t\nA\t\t96101\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tType /sit beside Raan Wildwind's campfire and wait until Boosted Rest appears for {q96101}.\nC\t\t96101\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96101\t\nA\t\t96646\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92472\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93461\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the inn by its ramp. Speak with Coriella Calmbreeze for {q93461}, then bind and sell junk. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Shen'dar Village\nC\t\t93461\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Rathiril Sunlance for {q93461}.\nC\t\t93461\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93461\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92517\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92596\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSit with your faction representative and hear the introduction for {q92596}.\nC\t\t92596\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92596\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 before fighting Prideclaw; finish on Scrawny Ursera or Al'Aketh Neophytes along the western path if needed.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t94413\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain your chosen primary professions in Shen'dar Village, including any gathering profession not already learned from your starter book or a trainer. Engineering follows at the Strange Hermit during the later Shadowgale Forest visit.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.11\t46.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Naleeia Tattermend.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93318\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t45.05\t48.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Fishing from Fenn Fairweather.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t45.05\t48.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Fenn Fairweather; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92516\t\nA\t\t93319\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92515\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93951\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.85\t43.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Zerril Softbreeze.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96646\t\nA\t\t92553\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.85\t43.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Zerril Softbreeze; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.85\t43.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Zerril Softbreeze for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect three Small Eggs from nesting birds and eight Strider Meat from Galestriders during the highland quests.\nK\t\t6889\t3\t\t\nK\t\t5469\t8\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Prideclaw Pelts from the western highlands for {q92515}.\nC\t\t92515\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92515\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 on nearby Prideclaws before the hippogryph grounds and bandit camp.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.96\t45.32\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Corsan Earthrazer, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t44.85\t43.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Naeluna Swiftmend, learn Wrath II and Thorns I, plus available healing ranks.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t45.26\t44.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Elayaa Easewind, learn Arcane Shot I and Hunter's Mark I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.05\t43.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Miriaan Mistblade, learn Gouge I and Sinister Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t44.89\t45.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenaan Spellwind, learn Fireball II, Fire Blast I, Conjure Food I and Comprehend Scroll. Use Comprehend Scroll on untranslated scrolls you find.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Windshaper Novice Seers in the highlands for {q94413}.\nC\t\t94413\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Hippogryph Youths and six Protectors, collecting eight Hippogryph Down feathers around the nesting grounds. Clear around a Matriarch and defeat her for {q92516} and {q93951}.\nC\t\t92516\t\t\nC\t\t93951\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Vulgara's approach and form a party; clear a retreat before engaging.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Vulgara and take her head for {q93318}.\nC\t\t93318\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t48.8\t36.5\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Highlands Bandits and collect ten Pilfered Windstones at the northern camp. Enter the hideout behind the waterfall and clear to Badwind Bennic; defeat him for {q93319} and {q92517}.\nC\t\t93319\t\t\nC\t\t92517\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to the village if ready; otherwise follow the road back.\nH\t\tHearth to Shen'dar Village\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92553\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93951\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93319\t\nT\t\t92516\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93318\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92517\t\nA\t\t93036\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93036\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q92529} and ask Sania for the Mark of Akir disguise before leaving.\nA\t\t92529\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94413\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92529\t\nA\t\t92528\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUnder the Mark of Akir disguise, listen to the High Missionary and investigate Falaath Village for {q92528}.\nC\t\t92528\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92528\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 before the highland camps; finish on isolated highland birds or bandits if needed.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92550\t\nA\t\t93926\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92551\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover ten Stolen Supply Packs while killing six Stormcallers and four Living Lightning around Falaath. Clear to Commander Cyclas, defeat him and take his head for {q92550} and {q92551}.\nC\t\t92550\t\t\nC\t\t92551\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93926\t\nA\t\t93927\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t42.37\t62.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Bloody Note at the Western Watch.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Skypriest Aanders, then collect Raani's Lucky Feather and the Shadowsong Family Signet beside him for {q93927}.\nC\t\t93927\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t41.13\t64.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Raani's Lucky Feather.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t40.98\t64.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Shadowsong Family Signet.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to the village if ready; otherwise take the road back.\nH\t\tHearth to Shen'dar Village\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92551\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92550\t\nT\t\t93927\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92701\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93948\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 on level 7-8 cultists around the cleared Falaath outskirts before heading south.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.96\t45.32\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Corsan Earthrazer, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t44.85\t43.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Entangling Roots I and Healing Touch II from Naeluna Swiftmend.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t45.26\t44.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Elayaa Easewind, learn Concussive Shot, Parry and Raptor Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t45.26\t44.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf already level 10, accept {q94007} from Elayaa Easewind before leaving Shen'dar; skip otherwise.\nA\t\t94007\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.05\t43.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Miriaan Mistblade, learn Evasion and Eviscerate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t44.89\t45.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenaan Spellwind, learn Polymorph I, Frostbolt II and Arcane Missiles I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road south to Valanaar.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93948\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92701\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93949\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92699\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92699\t\nA\t\t92709\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHear your faction leader's account for {q92709}.\nC\t\t92709\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92709\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92727\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92741\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92679\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHear Alvarion's request for {q92679}.\nC\t\t92679\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t61.64\t73.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Donaal Downbreeze at the inn; sell and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Valanaar\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93317\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t57.88\t77.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable wand at Zelena Favorbreeze's Auction House, such as a Lesser Magic Wand. Equip it; stand still for 0.5 seconds before shooting.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Windsong Crawler Meat from the rivers west of Valanaar for {q93317}.\nC\t\t93317\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to Aamelia in the orchard. Turn in {q92679}, then accept {q92682}, {q92683} and {q92684}.\nT\t\t92679\t\nA\t\t92682\t\nA\t\t92683\t\nA\t\t92684\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAround the orchard, collect ten Ripe Stormapples, kill five Hungry Bandits and collect seven Tenderloins from Ornery Galestriders. Use the Flutterfly Swatter on Flutterflies before combat and collect five Flutterfly Dust from the ground for {q92682}, {q92683}, and {q92684}.\nC\t\t92682\t\t\nC\t\t92683\t\t\nC\t\t92684\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92698\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92698\t\nT\t\t92682\t\nT\t\t92683\t\nT\t\t92684\t\nA\t\t92685\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t43.27\t74.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven Bloodstained Masks from Bandit Highwaymen on the western path for {q92685}.\nC\t\t92685\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92685\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 on level 8-9 galestriders or bandits before defending the orchard.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92693\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Aamelia to begin her defense, then protect her through the waves for {q92693}.\nC\t\t92693\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92693\t\nA\t\t92703\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: CRAB_SEASON\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect six Windsong Crawler Meat from the rivers west of Valanaar for {q93317}.\nC\t\t93317\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: CRAB_SEASON\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Valanaar if ready; otherwise follow the road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Valanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92703\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93317\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Skyhoppers around Valanaar until eight Enchanted Skyhoppers are defeated for {q93949}.\nC\t\t93949\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93949\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: VALANAAR_INTRODUCTION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q92699}.\nA\t\t92699\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q92699}, then accept {q92709}.\nT\t\t92699\t\nA\t\t92709\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Hear your faction leader's account for {q92709}.\nC\t\t92709\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q92709}.\nT\t\t92709\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q92727}.\nA\t\t92727\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q92741}.\nA\t\t92741\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: VALANAAR_INTRODUCTION\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92727\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92849\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t52.08\t69.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the cage and continue along the path into the Shriekling Den.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92849\t\nA\t\t92850\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Shriekling Den and follow its passages to the Shriekling Matriarch. Defeat her and take her head for {q92850}.\nC\t\t92850\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Valanaar if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared cave entrance and follow the road back.\nH\t\tHearth to Valanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92850\t\nA\t\t99260\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99260\t\nA\t\t92840\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Index of Esoteria at the Windstone Formations on the western slopes for {q92840}.\nC\t\t92840\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92840\t\nA\t\t92834\t\nA\t\t92860\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92860\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93320\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 on isolated level 9-10 cultists along the Valanaar approach before the class unlocks and tower circuit.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q94003}; keep it for the Shrine of Akir assault.\nA\t\t94003\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.86\t72.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Seena Skybreaker, learn Bloodrage and Rend II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t57.88\t77.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zelena Favorbreeze's Auction House, buy a useful weapon of a type you already know. Keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready; reserve money for training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.56\t73.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eltheen Nightbreeze, learn Dual Wield, Sap I, Slice and Dice I and Sprint I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t57.88\t77.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zelena Favorbreeze's Auction House, buy a usable weapon upgrade and an off-hand dagger; equip both weapons after learning Dual Wield.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t65.93\t80.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anathamaas Aetherwind, learn Frost Nova I, Conjure Water II and Frost Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.61\t72.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94007} to Quel'ana Quickgale if carrying Elayaa's referral.\nT\t\t94007\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nA\t\t94978\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Windsong Crawler for {q94978}, then return to Quel'ana Quickgale.\nC\t\t94978\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t94978\t\nA\t\t94979\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Ornery Galestrider for {q94979}, then return to Quel'ana Quickgale.\nC\t\t94979\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t94979\t\nA\t\t94013\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Vuldren Alpha for {q94013}, then return to Quel'ana Quickgale.\nC\t\t94013\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t94013\t\nA\t\t94050\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.61\t72.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quel'ana Quickgale, learn Aspect of the Hawk, Serpent Sting II and Track Humanoids.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94050} and learn Beast Training, Call Pet, Dismiss Pet, Feed Pet and Revive Pet from Quel'dora Quickgale.\nT\t\t94050\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.62\t72.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quel'dora Quickgale, learn Growl II, Great Stamina I, Natural Armor I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t45.04\t77.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTame a Vuldren Alpha as your permanent pet. Feed it suitable food and use Bite II until learned for Beast Training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTeach your pet the available Growl, stamina and armor ranks through Beast Training; enable Bite and Growl for solo work.\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t94006\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t94006\t\nA\t\t94638\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Ur'endra on the western slope for {q94638}.\nC\t\t94638\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94638} and learn Bear Form.\nT\t\t94638\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Valanaar if ready; otherwise return along the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Valanaar\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t64.01\t75.1\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Lotheluum Starbreeze, learn Demoralizing Roar I, Mark of the Wild II, Moonfire II, Rejuvenation II and Nature's Grasp I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t94484\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t94896\t\nA\t\t94897\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93320\t\nA\t\t92642\t\nA\t\t92645\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill four Al'Aketh Healers and eight Brawlers in the Gustberry Lowlands, collecting ten Windstone Charms from the cultists for {q92642} and {q92834}. Pull away from the road patrols.\nC\t\t92642\t\t\nC\t\t92834\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the guards around Commander Belguilos, then defeat him for {q92645}.\nC\t\t92645\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92642\t\nT\t\t92645\t\nA\t\t92880\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92880\t\nA\t\t92881\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92881\t\nA\t\t92643\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t98512\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Al'Aketh Assassins along the western approach for {q98512}.\nC\t\t98512\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98512\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the fallen turncoat and investigate the body; hear the nearby account for {q92643}.\nC\t\t92643\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92643\t\nA\t\t92644\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92644\t\nA\t\t94568\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tListen to Talaanis explain the plans for {q94568}.\nC\t\t94568\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94568\t\nA\t\t92640\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Valennia and the faction leaders to prepare the counterattack for {q92640}.\nC\t\t92640\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92640\t\nA\t\t93065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the road north into Shadowgale Forest.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94484\t\nA\t\t94485\t\nA\t\t94486\t\nA\t\t94487\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 before the forest quests; finish on isolated level 10-11 cultists around the cleared lowland camps if needed.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93165\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Tears of the Lady moss along the forest rocks for {q94485}.\nC\t\t94485\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twenty Binding Feathers and eight Shriekling Talons from Shadowgale Shrieklings for {q94486} and {q92741}.\nC\t\t94486\t\t\nC\t\t92741\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93159\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with the Strange Hermit for {q93159}.\nC\t\t93159\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93159\t\nA\t\t93160\t\nA\t\t93172\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Shadowgale Acorns around the forest floor for {q93160}.\nC\t\t93160\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat ten Wind Hollows in the forest for {q93172}.\nC\t\t93172\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Abandoned Belongings around Ban'aethal for {q94896}.\nC\t\t94896\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Resaan Nimbuswalker and recover the heirloom for {q94897}.\nC\t\t94897\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93160\t\nT\t\t93172\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover ten Bloody Heirlooms and five Cultist Ears from Al'Aketh Stormchasers and Footsoldiers at the northern camps for {q94487} and {q93165}.\nC\t\t94487\t\t\nC\t\t93165\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94485\t\nT\t\t94486\t\nT\t\t94487\t\nA\t\t94488\t\nA\t\t94489\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93165\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Commander Haalien at the northern camp for {q94488}; loot and keep his Ripped Missive if available.\nC\t\t94488\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t64.48\t34.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Nightfang Den by its path. Click each of the seven injured druids to heal them, then speak with Jorel Windsinger inside for {q94489}.\nC\t\t94489\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94488\t\nT\t\t94489\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRead a personally found Ripped Missive, then accept {q94490}.\nU\t\t265476\t\nA\t\t94490\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t61.76\t39.14\t\t\t\nT\t\t94490\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t61.76\t39.14\t\t\t\nA\t\t94491\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Valanaar if ready; otherwise leave the den by its entrance and take the road south.\nH\t\tHearth to Valanaar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94896\t\nT\t\t94897\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t64.01\t75.1\t\t\t\nT\t\t94491\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 12 on Shadowgale Shrieklings, Wind Hollows or the cleared cultist camps before the shrine assault.\nX\t\t\t12\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.86\t72.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Seena Skybreaker, learn Battle Shout II, Overpower I and Shield Bash I. Keep a one-handed weapon and shield ready for Shield Bash interrupts.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.56\t73.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eltheen Nightbreeze, learn Kick I, Parry and Backstab II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t65.93\t80.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anathamaas Aetherwind, learn Fireball III, Conjure Food II and Slow Fall. Keep a few Light Feathers for Slow Fall.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t64.01\t75.1\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Enrage, Regrowth I and Revive I from Lotheluum Starbreeze.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.61\t72.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quel'ana Quickgale, learn Arcane Shot II, Distracting Shot I, Mend Pet I and Wing Clip I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.62\t72.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quel'dora Quickgale, learn Great Stamina II, Natural Armor II. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93065\t\nA\t\t92947\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear seven Guardians, seven Spiritcallers and seven Blademasters at the Shrine of Akir, then report to Hyusaa for {q92947}.\nC\t\t92947\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tDuring the shrine assault, defeat Zaal Stormshield on the western side and recover the Skybreaker Bulwark for {q94003}.\nC\t\t94003\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92947\t\nA\t\t93958\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93958\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t93835\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal to the Rohashi Spires. Join the faction leaders and follow the confrontation through to its conclusion for {q93835}.\nC\t\t93835\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Valanaar with the leaders.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92741\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92834\t\nT\t\t93835\t\nA\t\t94369\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94369\t\nA\t\t93089\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94003} to Seena Skybreaker. Learn Defensive Stance, Taunt and Sunder Armor I.\nT\t\t94003\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 14 before leaving the island. If needed, hunt Al'Aketh Guardians along the cleared shrine approach, then return by the main road to Valanaar.\nX\t\t\t14\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.86\t72.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Seena Skybreaker, learn Demoralizing Shout I, Revenge I and Tactical Mastery.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.56\t73.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eltheen Nightbreeze, learn Garrote I, Expose Armor I and Sinister Strike III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t65.93\t80.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anathamaas Aetherwind, learn Arcane Intellect II, Frostbolt III, Fire Blast II and Arcane Explosion I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t59.61\t72.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quel'ana Quickgale, learn Eagle Eye, Eyes of the Beast and Scare Beast I. Restock ammunition and suitable pet food before the voyage.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93089\t\nA\t\t94946\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tZephras Isle\t65.9\t83.5\t\t\t\nI\t\tBoard the eastern skycutter for Dalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94946\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t94947\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t94912\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t6121\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t12.04\t56.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the skyborne portal inside the Violet Citadel to Stormwind.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t94947\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t94912\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Bash I, Healing Touch III, Thorns II and Wrath III. Learn any earlier useful ranks still available.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t94914\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords, Staves, Daggers or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t64.07\t68.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you lack a usable ranged or thrown weapon, buy a ranged weapon you can equip and matching ammunition from Marda Weller for pulling enemies into cleared ground.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District to Ironforge for its flight point, needed later. The next guide returns to Stormwind.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.5\t47.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Ironforge's gryphon point.\nP\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t18.15\t51.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Firebrew for the Moonglade return; buy five Earthroot at the Auction House.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Ironforge\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t94914\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6121\t\nA\t\t6122\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the Druid flight to Rut'theran Village.\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.38\t94.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the regular gryphon point before boarding the Auberdine boat.\nP\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat to Auberdine.\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.33\t45.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the gryphon point on arrival.\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Cliffspring River uphill to the falls; fill the Empty Cliffspring Sampler at the cave mouth for {q6122}. Stay near the entrance.\nU\t\t15844\t\nC\t\t6122\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6122\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t6123\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t43.37\t45.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tGather twelve Lunar Fungus from Lunar Fungal Blooms around the nearby woods for {q6123}.\nC\t\t6123\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6123\t\nA\t\t6124\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Curative Animal Salve on ten Sickly Deer in Darkshore for {q6124}.\nU\t\t15826\t\nC\t\t6124\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6124\t\nA\t\t6125\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the flight to Rut'theran Village, then use the village portal into Darnassus.\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6125} and learn Cure Poison.\nT\t\t6125\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Ironforge if ready. Otherwise take the Rut'theran boat to Auberdine, then the Stormwind boat and Deeprun Tram to Ironforge.\nH\t\tHearth to Ironforge\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train your chosen professions. Continue from Ironforge at 14.\nV\t\tvendor\t" },
  { name = "11-14 Loch Modan (Alliance)", title = "11-14 Loch Modan", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 11, hi = 14, next = "14-19 Westfall (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Thelsamar and Silver Stream Mine, Ironband's report and shipment, then one Hall of Thanes clear. Ends in Ironforge with level-14 training.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at 11 in Ironforge. Keep Old Ironforge Incursion only if Underground Map is completed; do not farm the map.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.5\t47.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point if not already known.\nP\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.09\t58.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Nissa Firestone if not already trained.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t60.08\t36.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Daryl Riknussun if not already trained.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t48.07\t6.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Fishing from Grimnur Stonebrand if not already trained.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear Hall of Thanes once with a five-player party around 13-14.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t86.28\t48.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east through Dun Morogh and the southern tunnel to South Gate Outpost. Avoid mountain shortcuts and the northern Wetlands route.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t86.4\t47.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the uphill path from South Gate Outpost to Bruegs Kindleborn.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tMeet Bruegs Kindleborn near the southern pass. Turn in {q94449}, then accept {q94465}.\nT\t\t94449\t\nA\t\t94465\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t86.28\t48.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to South Gate Outpost and continue through the southern tunnel.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q413} if carried from Dun Morogh; otherwise continue through the tunnel.\nT\t\t413\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q414} if Mountaineer Barleybrew offers it after your delivery.\nA\t\t414\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through the next tunnel into Loch Modan, then follow the road south to the Valley of Kings guard tower.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Southern tower: two objectives from the same safe enemies.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t224\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t267\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten level 11-12 Stonesplinter Troggs and ten Scouts; collect eight Trogg Stone Teeth for {q224} and {q267}. Use the open slopes east of the tower; avoid the southern cave and level 13+ casters.\nC\t\t224\t\t\nC\t\t267\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t224\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t267\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t237\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern road to Ironband's camp, then accept {q298}; stay above the excavation and avoid the ogres.\nA\t\t298\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern shore road west to Thelsamar; leave Skullthumpers and Seers until 13.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Thelsamar: bind the hearth and unlock the useful flight connection.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t33.94\t50.95\t\t\t\nP\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t32.63\t49.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q414} if carrying the stout.\nT\t\t414\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t416\t\nA\t\t1339\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t418\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.53\t48.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind at Thelsamar for mine, trogg and city returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Thelsamar\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.53\t48.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tInside the inn, collect Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works from the Gnomish Tome on the table near Drac Roughcut. Keep it for Garion Wendell in Stormwind.\nK\t\t208860\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock drinks.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t31.4\t58.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the narrow ridge trail to the Shrine of the Dormant Flame.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nT\t\t94465\t\nA\t\t94466\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t31.4\t58.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tDescend by the same trail and return to Thelsamar.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t298\t\nA\t\t301\t\nS\tDwarf/Gnome\t\t\nA\t\t6387\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.49\t33.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep three Bear Meat, three Boar Intestines and three Spider Ichor from level 10-12 wildlife during the northern circuit.\nK\t\t3172\t3\t\t\nK\t\t3173\t3\t\t\nK\t\t3174\t3\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t25.07\t32.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead north and collect twelve ears from level 10-11 Tunnel Rat Vermin, Scouts and Kobolds outside the mine for {q416}.\nC\t\t416\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1339}, then accept {q1338}; carry Stormpike's Request to Furen Longbeard on the next Stormwind visit. Accept {q307}.\nT\t\t1339\t\nA\t\t1338\t\nA\t\t307\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 12 on level 11-12 wildlife or the outside rat camps before entering the mine.\nX\t\t\t12\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tApproach Silver Stream Mine along the western shore; avoid deep water and the trogg islands.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.46\t19.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four loads of Miners' Gear near the mine entrance for {q307}. Pull level 12-13 Diggers and Geomancers singly; avoid level-14 Surveyors. Keep an exit clear.\nC\t\t307\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.46\t19.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect one Fire Tar from the Tunnel Rat Geomancers near the mine entrance.\nK\t\t5026\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t307\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Thelsamar if ready; otherwise follow the western shore.\nH\t\tHearth to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t418\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t416\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Level 12 training and flight tutorial use the same city visit.\nS\tDwarf/Gnome\t\t\nT\t\t6387\t\nA\t\t6391\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tDwarf/Gnome\t\t\nT\t\t6391\t\nA\t\t6388\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t48.07\t6.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Journeyman Fishing with Grimnur Stonebrand (50 skill); skip if not ready.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.35\t5.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Shadow Bolt III, Health Funnel and Curse of Weakness II. At Jubahl Corpseseeker (52.70,6.08), buy and use Imp Phase Shift.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ancestral Spirit I, Fire Nova I, Healing Wave III and Purge I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Kick I, Parry and Backstab II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Inner Fire I, Power Word: Fortitude II and Power Word: Shield II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Fireball III, Conjure Food II and Slow Fall. Keep a few Light Feathers for Slow Fall.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t301\t\nA\t\t302\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind for Druid training.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Enrage, Regrowth I and Revive I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the tram back to Ironforge before continuing.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t60.08\t36.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Journeyman Cooking with Daryl Riknussun (50 skill); skip if not ready.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Battle Shout II, Overpower I and Shield Bash I. Keep a one-handed weapon and shield ready for Shield Bash interrupts.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Arcane Shot II, Distracting Shot I, Mend Pet I and Wing Clip I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.86\t85.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Belia Thundergranite, learn Great Stamina II, Natural Armor II. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, one- and two-handed Maces, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes or one- and two-handed Maces.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Axes, one-handed Maces, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, two-handed Maces or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Maces or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Maces.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers, Crossbows or Thrown.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Crossbows or Thrown.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman/Druid/Mage/Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.09\t58.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Journeyman First Aid with Nissa Firestone (50 skill); skip if not ready.\nS\tDwarf/Gnome\t\t\nT\t\t6388\t\nA\t\t6392\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\tDwarf/Gnome\t\t\nT\t\t6392\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t302\t\nA\t\t273\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 13 before leaving Thelsamar for the wagon and southern trogg camps. If short, hunt nearby wildlife or Tunnel Rats outside the mine.\nX\t\t\t13\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock drinks and clear bag space.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern road to Huldar's wagon. An ambush may already be in progress when you arrive. Turn in {q273}, then accept {q454}.\nT\t\t273\t\nA\t\t454\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t454\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q309}; avoid the elite patrol during Miran's shipment escort.\nA\t\t309\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t65.12\t65.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tStay with Miran and protect the shipment to Ironband's camp for {q309}.\nC\t\t309\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t309\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Complete the next safe trogg tier before returning for the dungeon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern road back to the guard tower. Kill ten level 13-14 Skullthumpers and ten Seers in the outer camps for {q237}; avoid the Grawmug cave and banner waves.\nC\t\t237\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Reagent Pouch from level 13-14 Stonesplinter Seers in the outer southern camps for {q94466} before returning to the guard tower.\nC\t\t94466\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t31.4\t58.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north and climb the shrine's ridge trail.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nT\t\t94466\t\nA\t\t94467\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tDrink the Fire Sapta at the shrine. Defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire and loot its Glowing Ember for {q94467}.\nU\t\t6636\t\nC\t\t94467\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tPlace the ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame, then turn in {q94467}.\nT\t\t94467\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t94468\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t31.4\t58.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tDescend by the same ridge trail.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t237\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern road through the Dun Morogh tunnel.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Bruegs Kindleborn, then turn in {q94468}. Receive your Fire Totem and learn Searing Totem I; keep the totem in your bags.\nT\t\t94468\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t86.4\t47.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tDescend by the same trail to South Gate Outpost.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Thelsamar if ready; otherwise take the road. Fly to Ironforge for Hall of Thanes.\nH\t\tHearth to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Hall of Thanes: the normal plan is one group clear, not a solo attempt.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the Forlorn Cavern and follow the entrance down into Old Ironforge, then continue toward Hall of Thanes.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q96403} from Thom Filch on the Old Ironforge approach.\nA\t\t96403\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q96394} from Afadra Dunwall in Old Ironforge before reaching the instance portal.\nA\t\t96394\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a Hall of Thanes party with a tank and healer.\nS\tHunter/Warlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn off pet taunts while another player tanks.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q96395} from the Ghostly Attendant in Anvilmar's Rest before fighting Faldrim.\nA\t\t96395\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Faldrim Anvilmar for {q96395}, then return to the Ghostly Attendant before moving deeper.\nC\t\t96395\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96395\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill fifteen Enraged Apparitions and ten Tormented Souls for {q96394} before leaving the opening section.\nC\t\t96394\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect eight Dwarven Heirlooms, including the final vaults for {q96403}.\nC\t\t96403\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Durgen Dirgehammer and loot his head for {q96393} only while the quest is in your log.\nC\t\t96393\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect and use the Treaty of Understanding quest starter in the final Reliquary vaults, then accept {q98423}.\nA\t\t98423\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in the opening quests on the cleared return, then finish the High Seat rewards before hearthing.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96403\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96394\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t39.09\t56.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the High Seat, turn in {q96393} if completed.\nT\t\t96393\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98423\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- Finish the level checkpoint after the scheduled clear and its turn-ins.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 14 before training. If short, return to Thelsamar and hunt level 12-13 wildlife, then fly back to Ironforge.\nX\t\t\t14\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.35\t5.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Corruption II, Drain Life and Curse of Recklessness. At Jubahl (52.70,6.08), buy and use Imp Blood Pact II and Fire Shield I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Demoralizing Shout I, Revenge I and Tactical Mastery.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Earth Shock III, Lightning Bolt III and Stoneskin Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Garrote I, Expose Armor I and Sinister Strike III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Cure Disease, Psychic Scream I, Renew II and Smite III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Blessing of Wisdom I and Holy Light III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Arcane Intellect II, Frostbolt III, Fire Blast II and Arcane Explosion I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Eagle Eye, Eyes of the Beast and Scare Beast I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities; keep Thelsamar bound.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Ironforge at 14. Carry Stormpike's Request to Stormwind." },
  { name = "14-19 Westfall (Alliance)", title = "14-19 Westfall", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 14, hi = 19, next = "19-22 Redridge Mountains (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Ironforge to Westfall; overlapping farm, Defias and Toxic Soil work; a short Lakeshire visit; training at 16 and 18; one prepared Deadmines clear. Ends in Lakeshire.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Ironforge at 14. Keep your current binding until Sentinel Hill.\nX\t\t\t14\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear Deadmines once at 18+ with a suitable tank/healer party.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFollow Alba's Toxic Soil chain below; buy ten Rough Dynamite during the Stormwind visit.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tSkyborne Warrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, one- and two-handed Maces, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Rogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Axes, one-handed Maces, Guns or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t61.17\t89.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Buliwyf Stonehand, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Maces or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Warrior/Skyborne Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers, Crossbows or Thrown.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Rogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Crossbows or Thrown.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/Skyborne Mage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t62.23\t89.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bixi Wobblebonk, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.09\t58.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Journeyman First Aid with Nissa Firestone (50 skill); skip if not ready.\nS\tSkyborne\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t60.08\t36.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Journeyman Cooking with Daryl Riknussun (50 skill); skip if not ready.\nS\tSkyborne\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t48.07\t6.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Journeyman Fishing with Grimnur Stonebrand (50 skill); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind's Dwarven District. Shoni's dungeon quest needs no Ironforge breadcrumb trip.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t64.62\t37.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1338} if carrying Stormpike's Request.\nT\t\t1338\t\nS\tDwarf Warrior/Dwarf Hunter/Gnome Warrior/Gnome Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords or Staves.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Paladin/Gnome Paladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Rogue/Dwarf Mage/Gnome Rogue/Gnome Mage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Bash I, Healing Touch III, Thorns II and Wrath III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tBuy five Earthroot at the Auction House before the Cure Poison journey.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth at 44.15,45.23 for the Druid flight to Rut'theran, then use the Darnassus portal.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q6121} from Mathrengyl Bearwalker.\nA\t\t6121\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6121\t\nA\t\t6122\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the Druid flight to Rut'theran Village.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.38\t94.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the regular gryphon point before boarding the Auberdine boat.\nP\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat to Auberdine.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.33\t45.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the gryphon point on arrival.\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t54.92\t33.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Cliffspring River uphill to the falls; fill the Empty Cliffspring Sampler at the cave mouth for {q6122}. Stay near the entrance.\nU\t\t15844\t\nC\t\t6122\t\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6122\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t6123\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t43.37\t45.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tGather twelve Lunar Fungus from Lunar Fungal Blooms around the nearby woods for {q6123}.\nC\t\t6123\t\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6123\t\nA\t\t6124\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Curative Animal Salve on ten Sickly Deer in Darkshore for {q6124}.\nU\t\t15826\t\nC\t\t6124\t\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t6124\t\nA\t\t6125\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the flight to Rut'theran Village, then use the village portal into Darnassus.\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6125} and learn Cure Poison.\nT\t\t6125\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Rut'theran boat to Auberdine, then the Stormwind boat; continue from the city.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.95\t72.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Stormwind's gryphon point if you don't already have it.\nP\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the main gate and follow the road through Goldshire, then west into Westfall. Avoid Duskwood and river shortcuts.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t64\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t36\t\nA\t\t151\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot farm oats; keep Stringy Vulture Meat, Goretusk Snouts, Murloc Eyes, Okra and Goretusk Livers.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t36\t\nA\t\t38\t\nA\t\t22\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestfall\t49.88\t36.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Goretusk Livers from Young Goretusks during the northern farm circuits for {q22}.\nC\t\t22\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestfall\t53.29\t33.63\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Westfall Stew ingredients during the northern farm and shore circuit.\nK\t\t729\t3\t\t\nK\t\t730\t3\t\t\nK\t\t731\t3\t\t\nK\t\t732\t3\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t9\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92909\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south to Sentinel Hill for the overlapping quests before clearing the farms.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92742\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t52.86\t53.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Heather for Lakeshire, city and dungeon returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Sentinel Hill\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t52.86\t53.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you did not collect Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works in Thelsamar, take it from the Gnomish Tome on the inn's table. Keep the book for Stormwind.\nK\t\t208860\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and clear bags. Keep quest ingredients and oil.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t153\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.55\t52.64\t\t\t\nP\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t102\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t12\t\nA\t\t65\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill northern Defias Trappers and Smugglers for Militia and bandanas; loot oats and ingredients. Avoid southern Defias and rare elites.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.7\t18.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Alba's Well Water Sample Kit at the Jansen Stead well and collect the Jansen sample.\nU\t\t254545\t\nK\t\t254546\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Furlbrow's Pocket Watch from the farmhouse wardrobe for {q64}; clear the entrance and pull separately.\nC\t\t64\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Handfuls of Oats from sacks in the farm areas already visited for {q151}.\nC\t\t151\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t64\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t151\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill 20 level 14-15 Harvest Watchers in Saldean's fields, collecting fourteen Golem Isosprings and five Harvester Gyrostabilizers for {q9} and {q92909}. Avoid Foe Reaper 4000 and level 17-18 Harvest Reapers.\nC\t\t9\t\t\nC\t\t92909\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t9\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92909\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t46.1\t38.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Molsen Farm well sample for {q92742}; finish both samples before returning to Alba.\nU\t\t254545\t\nC\t\t92742\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish 15 Trappers and 15 Smugglers in the northern/central farms for {q12}; avoid southern Highwaymen.\nC\t\t12\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92742\t\nA\t\t92744\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t53.24\t11.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven Longshore Murloc Gills on the northern shore from isolated level 11-13 Raiders/Coastrunners for {q92744}. Keep a dry retreat; avoid the stronger western/southern camps.\nC\t\t92744\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t22\t\nT\t\t38\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92744\t\nA\t\t92745\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill four level 12-13 Kobold Diggers near the Jangolode entrance for {q92745}. Keep an exit; avoid deeper packs and rare elites.\nC\t\t92745\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six level 14-15 Riverpaw Miners at Gold Coast Quarry and collect eight Gnoll Paws for {q102} and {q92745}. Pull from the open rim; avoid lower packs.\nC\t\t102\t\t\nC\t\t92745\t2\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise take the road east. Turn in the ready town quests.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t102\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t12\t\nA\t\t13\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92745\t\nA\t\t92747\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 15 on isolated level 14-15 Harvest Watchers or Goretusks before Moonbrook; avoid rare elites.\nX\t\t\t15\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIn Moonbrook village, kill 15 Looters and 15 Pillagers, collect 15 Red Leather Bandanas and recover eight Suspicious Industrial Supplies from the buildings, including the schoolhouse, for {q13}, {q92747}, and {q153}. Use cleared corners against Pillagers; stay out of the mine.\nC\t\t13\t\t\nC\t\t92747\t\t\nC\t\t153\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise take the cleared road.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92747\t\nA\t\t92748\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t153\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t13\t\nA\t\t14\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue the delivery circuit to Lakeshire before the next city training stop.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock. Keep Sentinel Hill bound.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Elwynn road through Goldshire and Eastvale into Redridge, then north to Lakeshire. Avoid Duskwood, Chatter, level 17+ enemies and deep gnoll camps.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tMeet Guard Parker on the Lakeshire road, then accept {q244}; keep clear of dangerous camps.\nA\t\t244\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t25.5\t59.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Ariena Stormfeather's flight point.\nP\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q244}, then accept {q246}. Accept {q98407} from Deputy Feldon for the nearby lower-level Thrashers.\nT\t\t244\t\nA\t\t246\t\nA\t\t98407\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q118}; carry the shoes note to Goldshire during the upcoming city trip.\nA\t\t118\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t120\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t129\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t65\t\nA\t\t132\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t129\t\nA\t\t130\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Spiked Collars from level 14-15 Redridge Thrashers in the western camp for {q98407}. Avoid the higher-level southern gnolls.\nC\t\t98407\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98407\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t130\t\nA\t\t131\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t131\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t25.5\t59.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise fly, connecting through Stormwind if needed.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q132} to Gryan at Sentinel Hill, then accept {q135}.\nT\t\t132\t\nA\t\t135\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t53.29\t33.63\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 16 before flying to Stormwind for training. If short, hunt level 14-15 Harvest Watchers in Saldean's fields, avoiding Foe Reaper 4000 and level 17-18 Harvest Reapers, then return to Sentinel Hill.\nX\t\t\t16\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for deliveries, dungeon preparation and level-16 training.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q120} to General Marcus Jonathan at the city gate, then accept {q121}.\nT\t\t120\t\nA\t\t121\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the road south to Goldshire and turn in {q118} to Smith Argus, then accept {q119}.\nT\t\t118\t\nA\t\t119\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Stormwind by the main road and buy ten Rough Dynamite at the Trade District auction house.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92748\t\nA\t\t92749\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHand in ten Rough Dynamite for {q92749}.\nK\t\t4358\t10\t\t\nC\t\t92749\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92749\t\nA\t\t92750\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92750\t\nA\t\t92751\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Mathias Shaw inside SI:7. Turn in {q135}, then accept {q141}.\nT\t\t135\t\nA\t\t141\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q2281} from Renzik the Shiv.\nA\t\t2281\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Thieves' Tools from Sloan McCoy and keep them in your bags.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Pick Lock, Feint I and Eviscerate III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Heroic Strike III, Mocking Blow I and Shield Block.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.31\t40.82\t\t\t\nA\t\t168\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q167} from Wilder Thistlenettle, or an eligible share; clear the undead mine with the dungeon party.\nA\t\t167\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92751\t\nA\t\t92752\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t62.63\t34.11\t\t\t\nA\t\t2040\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Life Tap II and Unending Breath. At Spackle Thornberry (39.53,84.53), buy and use Voidwalker Sacrifice I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Cure Poison, Lightning Shield II and Rockbiter Weapon III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Heal I and Mind Blast II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Retribution Aura I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Arcane Missiles II and Flamestrike I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t48.95\t86.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tBring Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works to Garion Wendell in the Mage Tower library, then accept {q79093}.\nA\t\t79093\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t48.95\t86.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q79093} with the book and learn Study.\nT\t\t79093\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q97286} if Garion offers it.\nA\t\t97286\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nT\t\t97286\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t48.95\t86.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Study in the library with a Light Feather. Open the Bundle of Scrolls; use Comprehend Scroll on eligible untranslated scrolls.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Immolation Trap I, Mongoose Bite I and Raptor Strike III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Moonfire III, Rejuvenation III and Swipe I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth at 44.15,45.23 for the Druid flight to Rut'theran, then use the village portal into Darnassus.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q26} from Mathrengyl Bearwalker.\nA\t\t26\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t26\t\nA\t\t29\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.1\t53.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tDive into Lake Elune'ara and loot a Shrine Bauble from a Bauble Container.\nK\t\t15877\t1\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tUse the bauble at the Shrine of Remulos for {q29}.\nU\t\t15877\t\nC\t\t29\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q29} to Tajarri.\nT\t\t29\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t272\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Alliance flight point.\nP\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine.\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t48.87\t11.32\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern coast to the offshore rock and collect the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility from the submerged Strange Lockbox.\nK\t\t15883\t1\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Auberdine and take the Menethil Harbor boat.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t9.49\t59.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the gryphon point.\nP\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Sentinel Hill.\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the coast to the Gold Coast shore for the submerged lockbox.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t17.94\t33.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tFrom the Gold Coast shore, swim west to the submerged Strange Lockbox and collect the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance. Use the nearby air bubbles between dives.\nK\t\t15882\t1\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCombine the two pendant halves beside the Shrine of Remulos for {q272}.\nU\t\t15883\t\nC\t\t272\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t272\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t5061\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the flight to Rut'theran, then enter Darnassus through the portal.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5061} and learn Aquatic Form from Mathrengyl.\nT\t\t5061\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise return through the portal to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat and follow the harbor road into the city.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you are not already at Sentinel Hill, hearth there if ready; otherwise fly there. Finish both deliveries before Lakeshire.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92752\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q92753}; keep the Extra-Destructive Explosives for the dungeon forge and turn in to Alba at the rear exit.\nA\t\t92753\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t141\t\nA\t\t142\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire for the return letters and the level-16 gnoll quest.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2281}, then accept {q2282} from Lucius.\nT\t\t2281\t\nA\t\t2282\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q119}, then accept {q122}. Accept {q124}; keep the scales and stronger gnoll quests for the next Redridge chapter.\nT\t\t119\t\nA\t\t122\t\nA\t\t124\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t121\t\nA\t\t143\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alther's Mill, use Pick Lock on the practice lockboxes until 80 Lockpicking. Pick Lucius's Lockbox and recover the Token of Thievery for {q2282}.\nC\t\t2282\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2282} to Lucius.\nT\t\t2282\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten level 15-16 Mongrels and six level 16-17 Poachers in the outer southern camps for {q246}. Stop runners; avoid stronger spiders, eastern hills and packed camps.\nC\t\t246\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t246\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t25.5\t59.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q143}, then accept {q144}; carry Gryan's response for the next planned Lakeshire visit.\nT\t\t143\t\nA\t\t144\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the level 14-15 Defias Messenger patrolling between Moonbrook and the northern farms for {q142}; follow the road and ask nearby players.\nC\t\t142\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t142\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t155\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t42.55\t71.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort the Defias Traitor along his route to the hideout for {q155}. Stay with him and clear ahead carefully.\nC\t\t155\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t155\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t166\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.67\t47.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q214} after the escort and Red Leather Bandanas.\nA\t\t214\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 17 on level 15-16 Riverpaw Brutes in open ground before the final Militia tier.\nX\t\t\t17\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill 15 Highwaymen, five Pathstalkers and five Knuckledusters, up to level 18, in the outer southern fields for {q14}. Avoid dense Dagger Hills camps, level-20 rares and the mine.\nC\t\t14\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise follow the road northeast.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t14\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 18 before Deadmines and training. If short, hunt level 16-17 wildlife on the cleared western fields before flying to Stormwind.\nX\t\t\t18\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Bane of Agony II, Create Soulstone and Searing Pain; learn Drain Soul for the Soulstone prerequisite. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Firebolt III and Voidwalker Consume Shadows I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Disarm and Thunder Clap II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Flame Shock II, Flametongue Weapon II, Healing Wave IV, Stoneclaw Totem II and Tremor Totem.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Ambush I, Gouge II and Poised.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Grace II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Dispel Magic I, Power Word: Shield III and Shadow Word: Pain III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Desperate Prayer II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Starshards II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Blessing of Freedom, Divine Protection II, Seal of Fury II and Seal of Righteousness III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Fireball IV and Remove Lesser Curse.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Hawk II, Multi-Shot I, Serpent Sting III and Track Undead.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Great Stamina III, Natural Armor III. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Entangling Roots II, Faerie Fire I, Hibernate I, Maul II, Nature's Grasp II and Regrowth II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and clear bags. Train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.95\t72.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sentinel Hill by ready hearth or flight; keep it bound for the dungeon return.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestfall\t42.55\t71.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road to Moonbrook and reach the mine entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Deadmines party with a tank/healer ready for the level-21 final boss.\nS\tSkyborne Hunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn off Growl while another player tanks.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDescend through the mines together using the dungeon map underground.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tBefore the portal, clear the undead side tunnels together for four Miners' Union Cards and Foreman Thistlenettle's badge for {q168} and {q167}.\nC\t\t168\t\t\nC\t\t167\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tEnter the Deadmines instance together; complete the city, Defias and explosives objectives during the clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Shoni, loot the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from Sneed's Shredder for {q2040}.\nC\t\t2040\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tPlant the Extra-Destructive Explosives at the forge near Gilnid for {q92753}.\nU\t\t254553\t\nC\t\t92753\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Red Silk Bandanas.\nK\t\t915\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Edwin VanCleef with the group and loot his head for {q166}.\nC\t\t166\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot your own Unsent Letter from VanCleef; keep it for the Stormwind turn-ins.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTake the rear exit, or return by the cleared route.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t38.61\t83.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the rear exit in the hills, meet Alba Fairmoon and turn in {q92753}.\nT\t\t92753\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t92819\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestfall\t38.7\t83.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Detonator beside Alba for {q92819}.\nC\t\t92819\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t38.61\t83.7\t\t\t\nT\t\t92819\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill if ready; otherwise follow the road northeast.\nH\t\tHearth to Sentinel Hill\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.33\t47.52\t\t\t\nT\t\t166\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.67\t47.35\t\t\t\nT\t\t214\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for the remaining city rewards.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse your Unsent Letter from Deadmines to accept {q373}.\nU\t\t2874\t\nA\t\t373\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q373} to Baros Alexston in City Hall, then accept {q389}; keep it for the Stockades preparation.\nT\t\t373\t\nA\t\t389\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t62.63\t34.11\t\t\t\nT\t\t2040\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.31\t40.82\t\t\t\nT\t\t168\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t167\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t144\t\nA\t\t145\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t18.91\t34.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 19 before continuing. If short, hunt level 17-18 Redridge Brutes on the outer northern slopes, avoiding Yowler and linked packs, then return to Lakeshire. Keep the Darkshire letter and both Redridge quests.\nX\t\t\t19\t\t\t" },
  { name = "19-22 Redridge Mountains (Alliance)", title = "19-22 Redridge Mountains", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 19, hi = 22, next = "22-23 Duskwood (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Lakeshire's lake and western quests, level-20 training, then Render's Valley, northern Blackrock, Tharil'zun and eastern gnoll outings. Ends in Stormwind with level-22 training.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Lakeshire at 19 with the Darkshire letter and carried gnoll/scales quests.\nX\t\t\t19\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t91\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t21.92\t44.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind for the training and eastern-camp returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t34\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t180\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t127\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t95999\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t125\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t20\t\nA\t\t98387\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t26.3\t72.22\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t49.5\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Great Goretusk Snouts, five Tough Condor Meat and five Crisp Spider Meat. Keep the spider meat collection for Alther's Mill. Avoid Bellygrub until the scheduled fight.\nK\t\t2296\t5\t\t\nK\t\t1080\t5\t\t\nK\t\t1081\t5\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3741\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover Hilary's Necklace from the shallow town lakebed for {q3741}.\nC\t\t3741\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover Oslow's Toolbox from the Sunken Chest for {q125}; clear the shore before diving.\nC\t\t125\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Underbelly Scales from level 17-18 Black Dragon Whelps for {q122}.\nC\t\t122\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3741\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t125\t\nA\t\t89\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Brutes and eight Mystics; collect five Iron Pikes and five Iron Rivets for {q124} and {q89}. Avoid Yowler.\nC\t\t124\t\t\nC\t\t89\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Great Goretusk Snouts and five Tough Condor Meat from southern Great Goretusks and Dire Condors for {q92} and {q92}. Keep any Crisp Spider Meat; finish collecting it during Alther's Mill. Avoid Bellygrub.\nC\t\t92\t1\t\nC\t\t92\t2\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise take the western road.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t124\t\nA\t\t126\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t89\t\nA\t\t98386\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve level 19-20 Greater Tarantulas and destroy six eggs at Alther's Mill for {q98386}. Collect the remaining Crisp Spider Meat from the same spiders for {q92}. Avoid Chatter.\nC\t\t98386\t\t\nC\t\t92\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: ALTHERS_MILL\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Alther's Mill, use Pick Lock on the practice lockboxes until 80 Lockpicking. Pick Lucius's Lockbox and recover the Token of Thievery for {q2282}.\nC\t\t2282\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q2282} to Lucius.\nT\t\t2282\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: ALTHERS_MILL\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98386\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 20 before class training. If short, hunt Greater Tarantulas around the cleared Alther's Mill approach, then return to Lakeshire.\nX\t\t\t20\t\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t21.71\t46.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Penny, keeping a free slot for the training tame.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t62.12\t76.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern lakeshore east. Tame a Greater Tarantula; use Bite III in combat until the learning message appears.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t21.71\t46.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Penny, release the training tame and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite III when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Bronze Tube for Viktori's telescope in Duskwood.\nK\t\t4371\t1\t\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter/Paladin/Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.88\t69.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Woo Ping, learn Polearms if needed for a weapon you plan to use (1 gold before discounts).\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain level-20 spells, including Demon Armor, Shadow Bolt IV, Immolate III, Curse of the Elements I, Rain of Fire, Health Funnel II and Ritual of Summoning.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Cleave I, Dual Wield, Rend III, Retaliation, Slam I and Victory Rush.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ghost Wolf, Totemic Recall, Call of the Elements, Frost Shock I, Frostbrand Weapon I, Lesser Healing Wave I, Lightning Bolt IV and Searing Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t94494\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar, then follow the western shore road north.\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nT\t\t94494\t\nA\t\t94495\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern road through Dun Algaz into the Wetlands. Take the ramp to Hervdana Saegrund's cave behind the southern waterfall, then turn in {q94495}. Accept {q94497}.\nT\t\t94495\t\nA\t\t94497\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t64.8\t74.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tDescend by the ramp and fill the brown waterskin at the foot of the falls for {q94497}.\nU\t\t265732\t\nC\t\t94497\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn up the ramp to Hervdana's cave. Turn in {q94497}, then accept {q94499}.\nT\t\t94497\t\nA\t\t94499\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through Dun Algaz to Thelsamar and fly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t73.7\t61.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern bank east to Stonewatch Falls and fill the red waterskin near the Nightcrawler murlocs for {q94499}.\nU\t\t265747\t\nC\t\t94499\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Lakeshire and fly to Thelsamar, then take the Dun Algaz road north.\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn up the waterfall ramp to Hervdana. Turn in {q94499}, then accept {q94500}.\nT\t\t94499\t\nA\t\t94500\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t9.49\t59.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to Menethil Harbor and take its flight point.\nP\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t5.0\t63.5\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine boat from Menethil Harbor; confirm the destination before boarding.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.34\t45.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point on arrival, then follow the southern road into Ashenvale and continue to Astranaar.\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t37.0\t51.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the blue waterskin in Astranaar's lake for {q94500}.\nU\t\t265772\t\nC\t\t94500\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.41\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point.\nP\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine.\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Menethil Harbor boat.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east from Menethil and climb the waterfall ramp to Hervdana. Turn in {q94500}, then accept {q94501}.\nT\t\t94500\t\nA\t\t94501\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through Dun Algaz to Norric Lochthane. Turn in {q94501}, then accept {q94502}.\nT\t\t94501\t\nA\t\t94502\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly from Thelsamar to Sentinel Hill for the purification.\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t45.57\t59.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Stendel's Pond for the water spirit.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tDrink the Water Sapta at the Forgotten Shrine. Defeat the level-22 Corrupt Minor Manifestation of Water and loot its bracers for {q94502}.\nU\t\t6637\t\nC\t\t94502\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tPlace the bracers and Remaining Drops of Purest Water at the Forgotten Shrine, then turn in {q94502}.\nT\t\t94502\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t94503\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94503} to the friendly Minor Manifestation of Water that appears in the pond, then accept {q94505}.\nT\t\t94503\t\nA\t\t94505\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sentinel Hill and fly to Thelsamar.\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Norric, then turn in {q94505}. Receive your Water Totem and learn Healing Stream Totem I; keep the totem in your bags.\nT\t\t94505\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t33.94\t50.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise return to Thelsamar and fly there.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Stealth II, Backstab III and Rupture I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Fear Ward, Devouring Plague I, Flash Heal I, Holy Fire I, Inner Fire II, Mind Soothe I, Renew III, Shackle Undead I and Fade II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5676}, then turn in {q5676} and learn Feedback from High Priestess Laurena.\nA\t\t5676\t\nT\t\t5676\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nA\t\t94819\t\nS\tDwarf Priest/Gnome Priest\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for your racial lesson.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5641} and learn Chastise from High Priest Rohan.\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94819} and learn Contingency Plan from High Priestess Mims.\nT\t\t94819\t\nS\tDwarf Priest/Gnome Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.5\t47.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise fly there.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nA\t\t5673\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Stormwind harbor boat to Auberdine.\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal into Darnassus.\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5673} and learn Elune's Grace from Priestess Alathea.\nT\t\t5673\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q5672} if Alathea offers the lesson.\nA\t\t5672\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q5672} and learn Elune's Grace.\nT\t\t5672\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise return through the portal to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat.\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Stormwind, fly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Blessing of Kings, Consecration I, Flash of Light I, Exorcism I, Holy Strike III and Devotion Aura III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nA\t\t1793\t\nT\t\t1793\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Tome of Valor, then accept {q1649}.\nU\t\t6776\t\nA\t\t1649\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t1649\t\nA\t\t1650\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Sentinel Hill, follow the western shore south to Daphne Stilwell and turn in {q1650}.\nT\t\t1650\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nA\t\t1651\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tProtect Daphne through the Defias waves for {q1651}, staying within reach to heal her.\nC\t\t1651\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t1651\t\nA\t\t1652\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the shore road to Sentinel Hill and fly to Stormwind.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1652} and learn Sense Undead.\nT\t\t1652\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Blink, Evocation, Blizzard I, Mana Shield I, Frostbolt IV, Conjure Water III and Polymorph II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t50.39\t85.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Larimaine Purdue, learn Teleport: Stormwind.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t47.44\t82.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Runes of Teleportation from Owen Vaughn.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aimed Shot I, Arcane Shot III, Aspect of the Cheetah, Disengage I, Distracting Shot II, Dual Wield, Freezing Trap I and Mend Pet II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Growl III. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.11\t74.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Maple Seeds from Kyra Boucher for Rebirth.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth at 44.15,45.23 for the Druid flight to Rut'theran, then use the portal into Darnassus.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q98393} from Mathrengyl Bearwalker.\nA\t\t98393\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t98393\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98341\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98394\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q98341} to the Avatar of Saeyleenan.\nT\t\t98341\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q98394} to the Great Cat Spirit.\nT\t\t98394\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98404\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98396\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t71.7\t61.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path to the Stormrage Barrow Den entrance. Use the Great Cat Spirit Statue for its temporary stealth blessing.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t72.4\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the den passages under the blessing and collect the Relic of the Fang.\nK\t\t280502\t1\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t75.2\t67.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through the den passages for the Relic of the Claw. Renew the blessing at the entrance when needed.\nK\t\t280679\t1\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t74.4\t65.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Relic of the Silent Shadow from its separate chamber, then leave through the den entrance.\nK\t\t280680\t1\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the three relics for {q98404}.\nC\t\t98404\t\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the three relics for {q98396}.\nC\t\t98396\t\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t98404\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t98396\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98738\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98731\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid\t\t\nT\t\t98738\t\nS\tNightElf Druid\t\t\nT\t\t98731\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nA\t\t98397\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.15\t45.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Silva Fil'naveth for the flight to Rut'theran, then use the Darnassus portal.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q98397} and learn Cat Form.\nT\t\t98397\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t35.37\t8.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Demoralizing Roar II, Shred I, Rebirth I, Mark of the Wild III, Healing Touch IV, Starfire I and Omen of Clarity.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise return through the portal to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat.\nS\tSkyborne Druid/NightElf Druid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Stormwind, fly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.53\t84.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Voidwalker Torment II.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1716} from Gakin in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar.\nA\t\t1716\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Stormwind harbor boat to Auberdine.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.34\t45.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point, then follow the southern road into Ashenvale and continue to Astranaar.\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.41\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point before following the southeastern road toward the Barrens.\nP\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tPass through the broken fence east of Mor'shan Rampart, keeping clear of its Horde guards. Follow the Gold Road south, passing east of the Crossroads and staying outside Camp Taurajo.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1716} to Takar the Seer, then accept {q1738}.\nT\t\t1716\t\nA\t\t1738\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north around the Crossroads and through the broken fence east of Mor'shan Rampart. Follow the Ashenvale road west past Astranaar to Maestra's Post, then approach the Ruins of Ordil'Aran to the northeast.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Heartswood tree in the ruins.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Dark Strand guards and take the Heartswood from the tree for {q1738}.\nC\t\t1738\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise return to Astranaar, fly to Auberdine and take the Stormwind boat.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf in Lakeshire, fly to Stormwind before returning to Gakin.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1738\t\nA\t\t1739\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Heartswood Core at Gakin's summoning circle and subdue the Succubus for {q1739}.\nC\t\t1739\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1739} to learn Summon Succubus.\nT\t\t1739\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t64.93\t70.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions. Expert Enchanting (level 20, 125 skill) is taught by Kitta Firewind atop the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you are not already in Lakeshire, hearth there if ready; otherwise fly there.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t150\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Spotted Sunfish and eight Murloc Fins from the western shore camps for {q127} and {q150}.\nC\t\t127\t\t\nC\t\t150\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t127\t\nT\t\t150\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t128\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before leaving Lakeshire.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t69.3\t84.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern lakeshore road to Render's Valley.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t69.3\t84.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Grunts and Outrunners for ten Battleworn Axes; collect eight Stolen Weapons from racks and loose weapons, and ten Blackrock Supplies from containers in the lower Render's Valley camps for {q20} and {q98387}.\nC\t\t20\t\t\nC\t\t98387\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party at the cave entrance for Incinerator Gar'im, then enter and defeat him and loot his broken staff for {q95999}.\nC\t\t95999\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise return by the southern lakeshore road.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t95999\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t20\t\nT\t\t98387\t\nA\t\t19\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 21 before the northern quests. If short, hunt isolated Greater Tarantulas around Alther's Mill, then return to Lakeshire.\nX\t\t\t21\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill level-24 Bellygrub in his field and loot his tusk for {q34}.\nC\t\t34\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t22.56\t21.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the northern path to Render's Rock.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Yowler's guards, then kill him and loot his paw for {q126}.\nC\t\t126\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Render's Rock and kill fifteen Blackrock Champions for {q128}. Keep the entrance route clear.\nC\t\t128\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Corporal Keeshan inside the cave and accept {q219}.\nA\t\t219\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Keeshan back to Lakeshire; stay with him and protect him through the road ambushes for {q219}.\nC\t\t219\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t34\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t126\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t128\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t219\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 22 before Tharil'zun and the eastern gnoll camps. If short, hunt isolated level 21-22 gnolls outside the cleared northern camps.\nX\t\t\t22\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before leaving Lakeshire.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t64.36\t59.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Stonewatch's approach, form a party for Tharil'zun.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tApproach Stonewatch together; clear the guards, defeat Tharil'zun and loot his head for {q19}.\nC\t\t19\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Shadowhide Pendants from the eastern gnoll camps, kill Lieutenant Fangore and loot his paw for {q91} and {q180}; avoid Rohh the Silent.\nC\t\t91\t\t\nC\t\t180\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready; otherwise return by road.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t91\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t180\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t19\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Drain Life II, Create Healthstone II, Curse of Weakness III and Eye of Kilrogg.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Battle Shout III, Intimidating Shout and Sunder Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Cure Disease, Fire Nova II, Poison Cleansing Totem, Totemic Call and Water Breathing. Keep a few Shiny Fish Scales for Water Breathing.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Vanish I, Distract, Garrote II and Sinister Strike IV. Keep Flash Powder for Vanish.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Heal II, Mind Blast III, Resurrection II and Smite IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Concentration Aura, Holy Light IV, Seal of Justice, Blessing of Might III and Seal of the Crusader III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Conjure Food III, Fire Blast III, Frost Ward I and Scorch I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Hunter's Mark II and Scorpid Sting I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Moonfire IV, Rejuvenation IV, Soothe Animal I and Wrath IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy an extra Bronze Tube for the poison quest; keep two in your bags so one remains for Viktori.\nK\t\t4371\t2\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t50.58\t60.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread inside Duncan's Textiles.\nK\t\t8431\t1\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t69.24\t71.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Simple Wildflowers from Bernard Gump.\nK\t\t3421\t1\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Leaded Vial from Sloan McCoy; restock Flash Powder for Vanish.\nK\t\t3372\t1\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q2360} from Master Mathias Shaw.\nA\t\t2360\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nF\t\tSentinel Hill\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t2360\t\nA\t\t2359\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tRead Kearnen's Journal before approaching the tower; keep your Thieves' Tools ready.\nU\t\t8046\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tUse Stealth and Pick Pocket on a Malformed Defias Drone before combat to obtain the Defias Tower Key for {q2359}.\nC\t\t2359\t2\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tClear the tower and defeat Klaven Mortwake upstairs. Use Pick Lock on the Duskwood Chest beside him and take Klaven Mortwake's Journal for {q2359}.\nC\t\t2359\t1\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2359} to learn Poisons. Keep Recipe: Thistle Tea; learn the recipe when your Cooking allows.\nT\t\t2359\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nA\t\t2607\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Doc Mixilpixil in the cellar of the SI:7 building. Turn in {q2607}, then accept {q2608}.\nT\t\t2607\t\nA\t\t2608\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tUse /lay beside Doc and let him examine you for {q2608}.\nC\t\t2608\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t2608\t\nA\t\t2609\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2609} to Doc with the flowers, vial, thread and one Bronze Tube. Keep the remaining tube for Viktori.\nT\t\t2609\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tUse Eau de Mixilpixil to remove the Touch of Zanzil.\nU\t\t8432\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Crippling Poison I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients from Sloan McCoy, make Instant Poison I and Crippling Poison I, and apply the usable poisons to your weapons.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Stormwind at 22. Keep the Bronze Tube and Darkshire letter." },
  { name = "22-23 Duskwood (Alliance)", title = "22-23 Duskwood", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 22, hi = 23, next = "23-25 Wetlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Darkshire, the western roads, thread deliveries and the first Night Watch tier in Tranquil Gardens. Carries Rot Blossoms into the later graveyard quests. Ends in Stormwind before the Wetlands visit.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind at 22.\nX\t\t\t22\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t77.49\t44.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south into Duskwood and west to Darkshire. Take Felicia Maline's flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q145}, then accept {q146}; keep Ello's reply for the later planned Lakeshire visit.\nT\t\t145\t\nA\t\t146\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q96139} from Sirra Von'Indi.\nA\t\t96139\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t174\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGive Viktori the Bronze Tube brought from Stormwind for {q174}.\nC\t\t174\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t174\t\nA\t\t175\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t163\t\nA\t\t164\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q165} while already speaking to Elaine.\nA\t\t165\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t101\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Ghoul Fangs, ten Skeleton Fingers and five Vials of Spider Venom during the Duskwood quests.\nK\t\t1129\t10\t\t\nK\t\t1130\t5\t\t\nK\t\t2378\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t56\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t73.87\t44.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Trelayne for western story and cemetery returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Darkshire\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and buy drinks; keep six Gooey Spider Legs for Grual before his quest becomes available.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to Raven Hill. Avoid Stitches, Mor'Ladim, the northern graveyard and southern Defias farms.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t245\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t163\t\nA\t\t5\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Raven Hill Tome from the house table for {q96139}; clear the entrance and avoid the northern cemetery.\nC\t\t96139\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen level 18-19 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders along the western roads for {q245}; collect six. Keep venom; avoid rares and undead camps.\nC\t\t245\t\t\nK\t\t2251\t6\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tMeet Sven west of the graveyard using the outside paths, then turn in {q164} and accept {q95}.\nT\t\t164\t\nA\t\t95\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t226\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve level 19-20 Starving Dire Wolves and eight level 20-21 Rabid Dire Wolves on the western outskirts for {q226}. Avoid Lupos, stronger wolves and the graveyard.\nC\t\t226\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t226\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo around the graveyard's eastern outside edge to Abercrombie, then turn in {q165}; avoid the undead and Mor'Ladim. Accept {q148}.\nT\t\t165\t\nA\t\t148\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the outside paths east to Watcher Dodds and turn in {q245}.\nT\t\t245\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Darkshire if ready; otherwise follow the main road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Darkshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5\t\nA\t\t93\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGive Grual the six Gooey Spider Legs already collected for {q93}.\nC\t\t93\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t93\t\nA\t\t240\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t148\t\nA\t\t149\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96139\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south to Tranquil Gardens; approach Blind Mary's house from the eastern edge, then turn in {q175} and {q149}. Accept {q177} and {q154}.\nT\t\t175\t\nT\t\t149\t\nA\t\t177\t\nA\t\t154\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Skeletal Warriors and six Skeletal Mages in the southern rows for {q56}.\nC\t\t56\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the crypt entrance, kill the Insane Ghoul and loot Mary's Looking Glass for {q177}.\nC\t\t177\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t177\t\nA\t\t181\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t154\t\nA\t\t157\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t56\t\nA\t\t57\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q240} with Grual's cakes at Raven Hill, then follow the graveyard's outside edge to Abercrombie.\nT\t\t240\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t157\t\nA\t\t158\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Darkshire if ready; otherwise use the outside paths and main road, avoiding Stitches.\nH\t\tHearth to Darkshire\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q158}, then accept {q156}; keep it for the later Fiend and Horror quest.\nT\t\t158\t\nA\t\t156\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q377} for the planned Stockades clear.\nA\t\t377\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t146\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 23 before the Wetlands journey.\nX\t\t\t23\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind; keep Darkshire bound until Menethil.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q3765} for the upcoming Blackfathom visit.\nA\t\t3765\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Stormwind at 23. Keep Night Watch, Gather Rot Blossoms, Totem of Infliction, Look to the Stars, Crime and Punishment and The Corruption Abroad." },
  { name = "23-25 Wetlands (Alliance)", title = "23-25 Wetlands", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 23, hi = 25, next = "25-28 Duskwood (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Menethil, Greenwarden and the quarry quests, level-24 training, then Blackfathom Deeps at 25. Ends in Ironforge.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind at 23. Keep the carried Duskwood quests and The Corruption Abroad.\nX\t\t\t23\t\t\t\nS\tHuman/Dwarf/Gnome/NightElf\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar.\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\tSkyborne\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tSkyborne\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t86.28\t48.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Dun Morogh's road east through South Gate Pass into Loch Modan, then take the road north to Thelsamar.\nS\tSkyborne\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t33.94\t50.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before crossing town.\nP\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind patrolling Mountaineer Kadrell in Thelsamar, then accept {q468}.\nA\t\t468\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north through Loch Modan to the Dun Algaz approach. Turn in {q468}, then accept {q455}.\nT\t\t468\t\nA\t\t455\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTraverse Dun Algaz; kill eight level 19-20 Dragonmaw Scouts and six level 20-21 Grunts near its Wetlands exit for {q455}. Pull from the edges; avoid stronger eastern camps.\nC\t\t455\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north to Einar Stonegrip and accept {q469}, then continue west to Menethil.\nA\t\t469\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road west to Menethil Harbor. Keep to open ground and avoid the higher-level raptors and stealthed marsh enemies.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q98282} for the Thelgen Rock spider quest.\nA\t\t98282\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t463\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t10.7\t60.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Helbrek for the Wetlands returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Menethil Harbor\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, buy drinks and make bag space. Keep the Duskwood quest items for the return circuit.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t9.49\t59.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Shellei Brondir's flight point.\nP\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t455\t\nA\t\t98197\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t469\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t484\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t305\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Khaz Modan Timber and thirty Khaz Modan Iron from debris around Menethil Harbor for {q98197}.\nC\t\t98197\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98197\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Young Crocolisk Skins from level 21-22 Young Wetlands Crocolisks outside town for {q484}. Avoid ordinary Wetlands Crocolisks, up to 24.\nC\t\t484\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Whelgar's camp by its outside path and ramp, then turn in {q305}; stay above the raptor quarry. Accept {q306}.\nT\t\t305\t\nA\t\t306\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q294}, the first raptor quest; finish both types after reaching 24.\nA\t\t294\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect an Unruptured Stalker Gland from level 21-22 Cave/Leech Stalkers at Thelgen Rock for {q98282}. Pull out from the entrance; avoid the deeper cave.\nC\t\t98282\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Thelgen Rock by the cleared entrance and follow the road north to the Greenwarden. Turn in {q463}, then accept {q276}.\nT\t\t463\t\nA\t\t276\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen level 20-21 Mosshide Gnolls and ten level 21-22 Mongrels in the southeastern outer camps for {q276}. Stop runners; avoid stronger types.\nC\t\t276\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t276\t\nA\t\t277\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t61.13\t58.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect nine Crude Flints from level 22-23 Fenrunners/Mistweavers for {q277}. Pull casters into cleared ground; avoid Trappers, Brutes and Alphas.\nC\t\t277\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q277}, then accept {q275}; the Fen Creeper quest follows the level-24 checkpoint below.\nT\t\t277\t\nA\t\t275\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Menethil if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared approach and road west.\nH\t\tHearth to Menethil Harbor\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98282\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t306\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t484\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 24 before class training.\nX\t\t\t24\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for level-24 training and the Blackfathom quest; keep Menethil bound.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.08\t7.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Corruption III, Drain Soul II, Drain Mana and Sense Demons; train Shadowburn when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Demoralizing Shout II, Execute I, Heroic Strike IV and Revenge II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ancestral Spirit II, Earth Shock IV, Frost Resistance Totem I, Healing Wave V, Lightning Shield III, Rockbiter Weapon IV, Stoneskin Totem III and Strength of Earth Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Detect Traps, Eviscerate IV and Shank I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Mind-numbing Poison I (100 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Holy Fire II, Mana Burn I, Power Word: Fortitude III and Power Word: Shield IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Hammer of Justice II, Blessing of Protection II, Blessing of Wisdom II, Redemption II and Turn Undead I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t31.32\t27.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Runes of Teleportation from Ginny Longberry.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.5\t7.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Milstaff Stormeye, learn Teleport: Ironforge.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Counterspell, Fireball V, Arcane Missiles III and Flamestrike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Beast Lore, Raptor Strike IV and Track Hidden.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.86\t85.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Belia Thundergranite, learn Great Stamina IV, Natural Armor IV. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for Druid training.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Ferocious Bite I, Rake I, Regrowth III, Remove Curse, Revive II, Swipe II and Thorns III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Ironforge before continuing.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t52.7\t6.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Imp Fire Shield II and Voidwalker Sacrifice II / Suffering I from Jubahl.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q971} from Gerrig Bonegrip for the later Blackfathom visit.\nA\t\t971\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q98815} for the later Excavation Site dungeon visit.\nA\t\t98815\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten level 22-23 Mottled Raptors and ten level 24-25 Screechers outside the quarry for {q294}. Pull into cleared ground and avoid rares.\nC\t\t294\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t294\t\nA\t\t295\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t299\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Scytheclaws and ten Razormaws; collect four named tablet fragments from quarry relics for {q295} and {q299}.\nC\t\t295\t\t\nC\t\t299\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t295\t\nA\t\t296\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t299\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the approach to Sarltooth, kill him and loot a talon for {q296}.\nC\t\t296\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t296\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road around the quarry. Kill twelve level 24-25 Fen Creepers in the marsh near Greenwarden for {q275}; approach hidden water spawns slowly and pull onto cleared ground. Avoid stronger crocolisks/gnoll camps.\nC\t\t275\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q275}, then accept {q95646} for the later Excavation Site dungeon clear.\nT\t\t275\t\nA\t\t95646\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Menethil if ready; otherwise take the road west.\nH\t\tHearth to Menethil Harbor\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 25 before Blackfathom Deeps. If short, hunt level 24-25 Fen Creepers around the cleared Greenwarden paths, then return to Menethil.\nX\t\t\t25\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine ship from Menethil Harbor; confirm its destination with the dockmaster.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.34\t45.58\t\t\t\nP\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3765\t\nA\t\t1275\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept an eligible {q1198} share if offered; keep it for Blackfathom.\nA\t\t1198\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept an eligible {q1199} share for the post-clear Darnassus delivery.\nA\t\t1199\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock before leaving Auberdine for Blackfathom.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t14.5\t14.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel south through Darkshore into Ashenvale, then west to northern Zoram Strand. Avoid the Horde outpost; reach the ruins entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Blackfathom party at the ruins entrance with a tank and healer ready for Aku'mai at 28. Follow the flooded approach together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Blackfathom through Aku'mai with the party.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse Unending Breath for the underwater sections.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAfter the turtle room, find Argent Guard Thaelrid on the side island and turn in {q1198} before proceeding toward Kelris.\nT\t\t1198\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1200} directly from Thaelrid.\nA\t\t1200\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect your Lorgalis Manuscript from the underwater Pitted Iron Chest in the alcove beyond the turtle room for {q971}.\nC\t\t971\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Corrupted Brain Stems from the naga and satyrs during the clear for {q1275}.\nC\t\t1275\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Twilight Pendants from the cultists when Twilight Falls is active for {q1199}.\nC\t\t1199\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Twilight Lord Kelris and personally loot his head for {q1200}.\nC\t\t1200\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Old Serra'kis during the underwater sweep. After Kelris, activate one brazier at a time; defeat its wave and recover before the next. Defeat Aku'mai beyond the door, avoiding poison clouds.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the altar behind Aku'mai, then speak to Morridune to teleport to the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1200\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tChoose the Gravestone Scepter if it improves your wand.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1199\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Darnassus's western portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point if unknown.\nP\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine.\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1275\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Menethil Harbor boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for the manuscript delivery.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t971\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Ironforge at 25+. Keep the Duskwood quests, second raptor quest and both Excavation quests." },
  { name = "25-28 Duskwood (Alliance)", title = "25-28 Duskwood", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 25, hi = 28, next = "28-31 Wetlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Duskwood stories and Stalvan investigation, one Stockades clear, level-26 training and quests for named enemies. Ends in Stormwind at 28.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Ironforge at 25+. Keep Night Watch, Gather Rot Blossoms, the other Duskwood quests and both Excavation quests.\nX\t\t\t25\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Ghoul Fangs, ten Skeleton Fingers and five Vials of Spider Venom during the Duskwood quests.\nK\t\t1129\t10\t\t\nK\t\t1130\t5\t\t\nK\t\t2378\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t95772\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t386\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t73.87\t44.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind for western cemetery/story returns; keep Darkshire bound during city trips.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Darkshire\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t74.02\t46.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Steven Black, keeping a free slot for the training tame.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t48.55\t61.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western road to the central woods. Tame a Black Ravager; use Bite IV in combat until the learning message appears.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t74.02\t46.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Steven Black, release the training tame and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite IV when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t66\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t66\t\nA\t\t67\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKeep a personally dropped Old History Book for the final Stormwind visit; do not farm it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to Raven Hill. Avoid Stitches and level-35 Mor'Ladim; use cleared outer cemetery rows.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen level 24-25 Skeletal Fiends and fifteen level 23-24 Horrors in the lower eastern graveyard, collecting eight Rot Blossoms at the same time for {q57} and {q156}. Avoid stronger northern undead.\nC\t\t57\t\t\nC\t\t156\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: SVENS_REVENGE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q95}.\nA\t\t95\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: SVENS_REVENGE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tExpect level 25-26 spirits when opening Stalvan's containers.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west into Westfall and enter Moonbrook's schoolhouse, then turn in {q67}.\nT\t\t67\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t68\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Darkshire if ready; otherwise take the road, avoiding Stitches.\nH\t\tHearth to Darkshire\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q156}, then accept {q159}; keep the juice for the next planned Sven and Abercrombie circuit.\nT\t\t156\t\nA\t\t159\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t57\t\nA\t\t58\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t68\t\nA\t\t69\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: MARYS_LOOKING_GLASS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Clear the crypt entrance, kill the Insane Ghoul and loot Mary's Looking Glass for {q177}.\nC\t\t177\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q177}, then accept {q181}.\nT\t\t177\t\nA\t\t181\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: MARYS_LOOKING_GLASS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for the Stockades preparation.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the road to Goldshire and speak to Farley. Turn in {q69}, then accept {q70}.\nT\t\t69\t\nA\t\t70\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLoot the upstairs Storage Chest; defeat the spirit for {q70}.\nC\t\t70\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Stormwind and speak to Folsom. Turn in {q70}, then accept {q72}.\nT\t\t70\t\nA\t\t72\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t72\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t74\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Nikova Raskol patrolling Old Town and accept {q388}.\nA\t\t388\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t51.49\t69.38\t\t\t\nT\t\t389\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t391\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t387\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 26 before entering the Stockades. If short, return to Darkshire and hunt isolated level 25-26 undead in the outer Raven Hill rows, then fly back.\nX\t\t\t26\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Life Tap III, Searing Pain II, Curse of Tongues and Detect Invisibility I. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Blood Pact III and Voidwalker Consume Shadows II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Challenging Shout, Charge II and Mocking Blow II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Far Sight, Flametongue Weapon III, Lightning Bolt V, Magma Totem I and Mana Spring Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Cheap Shot, Kick II, Ambush II and Expose Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Grace III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Flash Heal II, Renew IV and Shadow Word: Pain IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Desperate Prayer III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Starshards III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Seal of Fury III, Seal of Righteousness IV, Flash of Light II and Retribution Aura II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Cone of Cold I, Frost Nova II and Frostbolt V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Immolation Trap II, Rapid Fire, Serpent Sting IV and Track Elementals.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Abolish Poison, Dash I, Healing Touch V, Maul III and Starfire II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Stockades entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer ready for the level-29 final boss.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Stockades together, including side rooms for named prisoners. Clear around Dextren before his fear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Defias Prisoners, eight Convicts and eight Insurgents, and collect ten Red Wool Bandanas during the same clear for {q387} and {q388}.\nC\t\t387\t\t\nC\t\t388\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Targorr the Dread and personally loot his head for {q386}.\nC\t\t386\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Dextren Ward and personally loot his hand for {q377}.\nC\t\t377\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill Bazil Thredd with the party; loot his head for {q391} when the quest is active.\nC\t\t391\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t387\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t391\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t392\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t57.74\t47.86\t\t\t\nT\t\t392\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t393\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t388\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.31\t70.74\t\t\t\nT\t\t393\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t350\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t66.03\t74.1\t\t\t\nT\t\t350\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t2745\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t73.23\t35.58\t\t\t\nT\t\t2745\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t2746\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t33.95\t57.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep three Silk Cloth from the dungeon or buy the shortfall. Collect two Clara's Fresh Apples beside her house outside Stormwind for {q2746}.\nC\t\t2746\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t73.23\t35.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tyrion with three Silk Cloth and two apples, then turn in {q2746}.\nT\t\t2746\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t434\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t72.8\t35.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Tyrion to start the event. Stay for the conversation, then defeat Lescovar and Marzon for {q434}.\nC\t\t434\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t66.03\t74.1\t\t\t\nT\t\t434\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t394\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.31\t70.74\t\t\t\nT\t\t394\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t395\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t57.74\t47.8