    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind at 28. Keep Mor'Ladim, the Wetlands/Excavation quests and any Southshore library delivery.\nX\t\t\t28\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Shadow Bolt V, Bane of Agony III and Banish. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Firebolt IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Overpower II, Shield Wall and Thunder Clap III. Keep Shield Wall ready for heavy incoming damage while using a shield.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Sap II, Backstab IV, Feint II and Rupture II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Instant Poison II (120 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Devouring Plague II, Heal III, Mind Blast IV and Psychic Scream II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Holy Strike IV, Exorcism II and Shadow Resistance Aura I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Arcane Intellect III, Conjure Mana Agate and Blizzard II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aimed Shot II, Arcane Shot IV, Aspect of the Hawk III, Frost Trap and Mend Pet III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Nature's Grasp III, Challenging Roar, Cower I, Entangling Roots III, Moonfire V, Rejuvenation V and Rip II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92489\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92456\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Fire Resistance Totem I, Flame Shock III, Flametongue Totem I, Frostbrand Weapon II, Lesser Healing Wave II, Stoneclaw Totem III and Water Walking. Keep a few Fish Oil for Water Walking.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t464\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t95647\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t10.7\t60.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind in Menethil for Wetlands and Excavation returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Menethil Harbor\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: ORMERS_REVENGE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Follow the road east to Whelgar's camp by its outside path, then accept {q299}.\nA\t\t299\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill ten Scytheclaws and ten Razormaws; collect four named tablet fragments from quarry relics for {q295} and {q299}.\nC\t\t295\t\t\nC\t\t299\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q295}, then accept {q296}.\nT\t\t295\t\nA\t\t296\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q299}.\nT\t\t299\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Clear the approach to Sarltooth, kill him and loot a talon for {q296}.\nC\t\t296\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q296}.\nT\t\t296\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: ORMERS_REVENGE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 29 before the Excavation Site clear.\nX\t\t\t29\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Dragonmaw War Banners from level 28-29 Centurions in outer Angerfang camps en route for {q464}. Avoid the level-30 rare Battlemaster and higher packs.\nC\t\t464\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t47.7\t56.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel through Thelgen Rock and follow the uphill road southeast of Whelgar's Excavation. Enter the blue mist beneath the large tree.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Excavation Site party with a tank and healer ready for the level-31 Relic Guardian.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear through Saltspine, Shadetooth and the Relic Guardian.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Daewyn Songblade inside and report Dorin's search, then turn in {q95772}.\nT\t\t95772\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t95795\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Ardin Grassman inside and learn what happened to him, then turn in {q95647}.\nT\t\t95647\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t95809\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Thicket Raptor Hides and your Highland Horror's Root Core for {q98815} and {q95646} before leaving their areas.\nC\t\t98815\t\t\nC\t\t95646\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot and use your Titan Relic after the Relic Guardian to accept {q95810}.\nU\t\t270865\t\nA\t\t95810\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the cleared route.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t38.81\t52.39\t\t\t\nT\t\t95810\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nA\t\t98824\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the road to the Greenwarden and turn in {q95646} with the Root Core.\nT\t\t95646\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tReturn to Menethil. Hearth if ready; otherwise take the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Menethil Harbor\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t95809\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t464\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98815\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for the relic delivery.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t69.93\t18.55\t\t\t\nT\t\t98824\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for level-30 training.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 30 before training and the Dalaran journey.\nX\t\t\t30\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Demon Armor II, Immolate IV, Drain Life III, Curse of the Elements II, Create Soulstone II, Subjugate Demon and Hellfire. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Voidwalker Torment III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1798} from Gakin.\nA\t\t1798\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire, follow Duskwood's western road south into Stranglethorn, then stay on the main road to Booty Bay. Pass Grom'gol without entering it.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.52\t77.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point, then board the Ratchet ship.\nP\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t63.08\t37.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point before visiting Strahad Farsan north of town.\nP\t\tRatchet\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1798\t\nA\t\t1758\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Menethil if ready; otherwise take the Booty Bay ship.\nH\t\tHearth to Menethil Harbor\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1758} to Krom Stoutarm, then accept {q1802}.\nT\t\t1758\t\nA\t\t1802\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind; keep the book collection for the Hillsbrad visit.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Cleave II, Rend IV and Slam II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nA\t\t1718\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire, follow Duskwood's western road south into Stranglethorn, then stay on the main road to Booty Bay. Pass Grom'gol without entering it.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.52\t77.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point on arrival, then take the Ratchet ship.\nP\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t63.08\t37.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tRatchet\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t66.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the coast south from Ratchet to the shallow crossing, then swim out to Fray Island.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t1718\t\nA\t\t1719\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t68.62\t49.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tHave food and bandages ready for The Affray.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tStep onto the grate to begin. Defeat the challengers, recover before engaging level-33 Big Will, then defeat him for {q1719}.\nC\t\t1719\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1719} to Klannoc Macleod. Learn Berserker Stance and Intercept.\nT\t\t1719\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t63.08\t37.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the coast to Ratchet and take the Booty Bay ship.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Berserker Rage.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Astral Recall, Call of the Ancestors, Grounding Totem, Healing Stream Totem II, Nature Resistance Totem I, Reincarnation, Searing Totem III and Windfury Weapon I. Keep an Ankh for Reincarnation.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t94789\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil, then follow the road northeast through the Wetlands and across the Thandol Span into Arathi Highlands.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road northeast toward Veyric's camp, avoiding the elemental circles. Turn in {q94789} to Veyric Thunderhame and receive your Air Totem; keep it in your bags.\nT\t\t94789\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t45.79\t46.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Refuge Pointe and take the flight point.\nP\t\tRefuge Pointe\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t31.32\t27.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a few Ankhs from Ginny Longberry for Reincarnation.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Disarm Trap, Kidney Shot I, Garrote III and Sinister Strike V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Feedback II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Deadly Poison I (130 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Sloan McCoy.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Spirit I, Fade III, Holy Fire III, Inner Fire III, Mind Control I, Power Word: Shield V, Prayer of Healing I, Shadow Protection I and Smite V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Chastise II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Contingency Plan II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Seal of Light I, Consecration II, Holy Light V, Lay on Hands II, Devotion Aura IV and Divine Intervention.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t47.44\t82.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Symbols of Divinity from Owen Vaughn for Divine Intervention.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Ice Armor I, Fireball VI, Fire Blast IV and Conjure Water IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1947} from your Mage trainer; keep the introduction for Tabetha.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Beast, Distracting Shot III, Feign Death, Mongoose Bite II and Scare Beast II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Growl IV, Great Stamina V, Natural Armor V. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Travel Form, Bash II, Faerie Fire II, Mark of the Wild IV, Rebirth II, Regrowth IV, Shred II, Tranquility I and Wrath V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.11\t74.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Stranglethorn Seeds from Kyra Boucher for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire and report Daewyn's fate to Dorin.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t95795\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Southshore ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Darla Harris's flight point.\nP\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.57\t57.09\t\t\t\nT\t\t538\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t51.17\t58.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind in Southshore for the Dalaran return; keep it at the final Stormwind endpoint.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92432\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tClear the murlocs and collect the Moldy Tome from the ground for {q1802}.\nC\t\t1802\t1\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Southshore and fly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t45.62\t90.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern Barrens road, staying outside Camp Taurajo. Pass the Great Lift guards and descend to Thousand Needles for Splithoof Hold.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tClear the lift guards and ride the elevator down; do not jump. Follow the northern canyon wall east to Splithoof Crag.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t44.4\t36.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Splithoof Hold by its southern cave mouth. Keep right at the forks, following the upper passage past the stream.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tOpen the Damaged Chest in the upper passage and take the Tattered Manuscript for {q1802}.\nC\t\t1802\t2\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared entrance, return up the Great Lift to Ratchet and take the Booty Bay ship.\nH\t\tHearth to Southshore\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1802} to Krom, then accept {q1804}.\nT\t\t1802\t\nA\t\t1804\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil and follow the road east to the Angerfang Encampment.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Rods of Channeling from Dragonmaw Bonewarders and Shadowwarders for {q1804}.\nC\t\t1804\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Menethil and fly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1804} to Strahad, then accept {q1795}.\nT\t\t1804\t\nA\t\t1795\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Tome of the Cabal at Strahad's summoning circle and subdue the Felhunter for {q1795}.\nC\t\t1795\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1795} to learn Summon Felhunter.\nT\t\t1795\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise take the Booty Bay ship and fly to Southshore.\nH\t\tHearth to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOptional: Run Shadowfang Keep for gear and collect the Black Tome from Arugal's table; use it at the Ambermill Leyline Focus to obtain the Tome of Dalaran, then return to Southshore. Only one party member needs the tome to summon Lyn the Ignored in City of Dalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSilverpine Forest\t68.6\t45.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel by the western Hillsbrad road to Lordamere Lake, then along the shore to Modera. Avoid Tarren Mill and hostile mage camps.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92432\t\nA\t\t92458\t\nA\t\t92457\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player City of Dalaran party with a tank and healer ready for the level-33 Shade of the Archmage.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Dalaran Sewer Key; open the gate beside Modera and follow the sewer passage to the portal together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAvoid beams, ground effects and Unstable Sentinel's Malfunction. Spread on the final boss.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear from the Underbelly through Atrexis, the city bosses and Violet Citadel to the Shade.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill eight Seeking Remnants, eight Saturated Remnants and eight Mana Echoes for {q92457}.\nC\t\t92457\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Fel Infused Blossom in the central garden for {q92456} before leaving that area.\nC\t\t92456\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Arcanic Enigma, the Mana Elemental, with the party for {q92489}.\nC\t\t92489\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the Shade and loot your Arcane Mote for {q92458}.\nC\t\t92458\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Image of Archmage Modera outside by the cleared exit, then turn in {q92458}.\nT\t\t92458\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q92457} when its three counters are complete from this clear.\nT\t\t92457\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t92459\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the friendly City of Dalaran and turn in {q92459} to Archmage Celindra.\nT\t\t92459\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q96800} from Magus Olvek; keep it for the Scarlet Monastery Library.\nA\t\t96800\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise return by the lake and Hillsbrad road.\nH\t\tHearth to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for the two city rewards.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92489\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t92456\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Stormwind with Southshore bound; keep Mor'Ladim and the later city deliveries." },
  { name = "31-33 Hillsbrad Foothills (Alliance)", title = "31-33 Hillsbrad Foothills", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 31, hi = 33, next = "33-34 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "One Gnomeregan clear, Southshore's coast, the southern Alterac camps and the Duskwood finales. Ends at the Stranglethorn border.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind at 31 with Southshore bound. Keep Mor'Ladim and the later city deliveries.\nX\t\t\t31\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2928\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2924\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2929\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1179}; keep the crash helmets for the Shimmering Flats.\nA\t\t1179\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2922\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2930\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1453}; keep this delivery for Nijel's Point.\nA\t\t1453\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1050}; keep it for Scarlet Monastery's Library.\nA\t\t1050\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before leaving Ironforge.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Ironforge for Kharanos, then accept {q2926}.\nA\t\t2926\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t24.3\t39.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west to Gnomeregan; reach the elevator entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Gnomeregan party at the entrance with a tank and healer ready for level-34 Thermaplugg.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the elevator down and follow the entrance tunnels.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Techbot in the outer loading area and loot his Memory Core for {q2922}.\nC\t\t2922\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Ozzie's Empty Leaden Collection Phial on living Irradiated Invaders until it is full for {q2926}.\nC\t\t2926\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake a White Punch Card from the outer enemies and use Matrix Punchograph 3005-A for a Yellow Punch Card before entering.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Gnomeregan through the main portal. Start Blastmaster Emi Shortfuse's demolition event and protect her through Grubbis. Defeat Viscous Fallout, then follow the ramps toward the Clean Zone.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twelve Essential Artificials from Artificial Extrapolators during the clear for {q2924}.\nC\t\t2924\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts from the dungeon's enemies.\nK\t\t9309\t24\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse Matrix Punchographs 3005-B, 3005-C and 3005-D in that order as the party progresses through the dungeon, exchanging yellow for blue, red and finally the Prismatic Punch Card for {q2930}.\nC\t\t2930\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Electrocutioner 6000 and Crowd Pummeler to Thermaplugg. Stop mobile alarm-bots before they summon help; assign players to the bomb buttons before the final pull.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Thermaplugg for {q2929}.\nC\t\t2929\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse your personally looted Grime-Encrusted Ring, then accept {q2945}.\nU\t\t9326\t\nA\t\t2945\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Clean Zone by the cleared ramps. Clean your quest ring at the Sparklematic 5200 for three silver, then turn in {q2945}.\nT\t\t2945\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAccept {q2947}; keep the clean ring for Talvash in Ironforge.\nA\t\t2947\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Kernobee in the Dormitory beside the Clean Zone. Clear the path back to Clockwerk Run and confirm everyone is ready before waking him and accepting {q2904}.\nA\t\t2904\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Kernobee straight to Clockwerk Run for {q2904}; stay inside the portal until his final dialogue grants credit.\nC\t\t2904\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared main entrance and elevator. Return to Ozzie in Kharanos, then turn in {q2926}.\nT\t\t2926\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ironforge, then turn in {q2924}.\nT\t\t2924\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t36.38\t3.61\t\t\t\nT\t\t2947\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2930\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2929\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2922\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2928} with the guts.\nT\t\t2928\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t70.95\t72.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise fly there.\nH\t\tHearth to Southshore\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t555\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t536\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t564\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t48.94\t55.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Soothing Spices from Micha Yance; keep three more for the later Dustwallow visit.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t505\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Tidehunters and ten Oracles on the Western Strand for {q536}.\nC\t\t536\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t536\t\nA\t\t559\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Murloc Heads from the western Coastrunners and Muckdwellers for {q559}.\nC\t\t559\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t559\t\nA\t\t560\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t560\t\nA\t\t561\t\nA\t\t500\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t561\t\nA\t\t562\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Daggerspine Shorehunters and ten Sirens on the Eastern Strand for {q562}.\nC\t\t562\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the river north and collect ten Turtle Meat from level 30-31 Snapjaws for {q555}. Stay on the eastern bank and well clear of Tarren Mill.\nC\t\t555\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south by the river to Southshore, then turn in {q555}.\nT\t\t555\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q562}, then accept {q563}; keep Farren's report for the coming Stormwind visit.\nT\t\t562\t\nA\t\t563\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 32 before the Alterac expedition; finish any remaining XP on the level 30-32 coastal enemies.\nX\t\t\t32\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tApproach the southern Syndicate camps from the road. Kill twelve Syndicate Footpads and eight Thieves for {q505}.\nC\t\t505\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t510\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t511\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the southern road, then turn in {q505}. Turn in {q510}, then accept {q512}.\nT\t\t505\t\nT\t\t510\t\nA\t\t512\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t511\t\nA\t\t514\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven signet rings from Syndicate Wizards and Spies at Strahnbrad for {q512}. Avoid the stronger northern Syndicate camps.\nC\t\t512\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t30.58\t78.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Mountain Lions and ten Hulking Mountain Lions in the southern foothills for {q564}. Starving and Feral Mountain Lions do not count.\nC\t\t564\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t47.42\t60.37\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect nine Dirty Knucklebones from the outer Crushridge Ogres for {q500}. Stay out of the elite ruins and avoid the stronger northern types.\nC\t\t500\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Southshore, then turn in {q564}.\nT\t\t564\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t500\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t512\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q659}; keep this delivery for the Arathi visit.\nA\t\t659\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q514}, then accept {q525}; keep the decrypted letter for the Southshore return.\nT\t\t514\t\nA\t\t525\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Chain Lightning I, Fire Nova III, Healing Wave VI, Lightning Bolt VI, Lightning Shield IV, Purge II and Windfury Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t563\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Fear II, Shadow Ward and Curse of Weakness IV; train Shadowburn when talented. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Voidwalker Sacrifice III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Battle Shout IV, Execute II, Hamstring II, Heroic Strike V and Shield Bash II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Gouge III and Eviscerate V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Wound Poison I (140 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Abolish Disease, Flash Heal III, Mana Burn II, Renew V and Shadow Word: Death I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Blessing of Might IV, Frost Resistance Aura I and Seal of the Crusader IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Frostbolt VI, Conjure Food IV, Arcane Missiles IV and Flamestrike III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Flare, Raptor Strike V and Track Demons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Demoralizing Roar III, Ferocious Bite II, Healing Touch VI, Poised, Ravage I and Track Humanoids.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire and bind for the western graveyard returns.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t73.87\t44.41\t\t\t\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Darkshire\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the cemetery approach, form a party for Mor'Ladim.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWith the party, clear the cemetery patrol path, kill level-35 elite Mor'Ladim and loot his skull for {q228}.\nC\t\t228\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Darkshire if ready; otherwise return by the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Darkshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t228\t\nA\t\t229\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t229\t\nA\t\t231\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q231} to the Weathered Grave.\nT\t\t231\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t16.89\t31.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 33 before the northern jungle circuit; finish remaining XP on the outer cemetery's Skeletal Raiders. Avoid Mor'Ladim's patrol.\nX\t\t\t33\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t44.71\t86.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south from Raven Hill to the Stranglethorn border.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the crash helmets, Reclaimers' delivery, Mythology of the Titans, Further Mysteries, Hints of a New Plague and A Fine Mess." },
  { name = "33-34 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", title = "33-34 Stranglethorn Vale", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 33, hi = 34, next = "34-35 Thousand Needles (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Booty Bay preparation, Nesingwary's quests and the northern supply circuit. Ends aboard the Ratchet ship.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at the northern Stranglethorn border at 33. Keep A Fine Mess for Scooty and the later deliveries.\nX\t\t\t33\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior/Warlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Darkshire and fly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf not already in Booty Bay, follow the main road south. Pass Grom'gol without entering it; avoid the stronger roadside camps.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2904\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t575\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.04\t77.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Skindle for the northern quests.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t189\t\nA\t\t213\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t201\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t198\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.42\t77.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Expert Fishing - The Bass and You from Old Man Heming (125 Fishing); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before returning north.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.52\t77.79\t\t\t\nP\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road west from Darkshire, then take the road south into Stranglethorn.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind patrolling Private Thorsen on the Rebel Camp road, then turn in {q198}.\nT\t\t198\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q203} and {q204} from Sergeant Yohwa.\nA\t\t203\t\nA\t\t204\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Kurzen Jungle Fighters and collect seven Jungle Remedies from Kurzen's forces for {q203} and {q204}.\nC\t\t203\t\t\nC\t\t204\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Venom Fern Extract from the Kurzen Compound's stockpile for {q204}.\nC\t\t204\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Rebel Camp and turn in {q203} and {q204}.\nT\t\t203\t\nT\t\t204\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q207} from Brother Nimetz; keep the tablet search for the level-39 visit.\nA\t\t207\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.66\t10.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Nesingwary's camp for {q201}.\nC\t\t201\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t583\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t583\t\nA\t\t194\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t185\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t190\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Young Stranglethorn Tigers west of camp for {q185}.\nC\t\t185\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Young Panthers east of camp for {q190}.\nC\t\t190\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Large River Crocolisk Skins from the northern river crocolisks for {q575}.\nC\t\t575\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t185\t\nA\t\t186\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t190\t\nA\t\t191\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Stranglethorn Tigers in the northwestern jungle for {q186}.\nC\t\t186\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Panthers for {q191}.\nC\t\t191\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Stranglethorn Raptors on the western slopes for {q194}. Avoid the troll ruins and stronger coastal murlocs.\nC\t\t194\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Tumbled Crystals from Venture Co. Geologists at the northern mine for {q213}.\nC\t\t213\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t29.82\t19.1\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Bloodscalp Ears from the outer Bal'lal camps for {q189}. Avoid the deeper northern ruins.\nC\t\t189\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t186\t\nA\t\t187\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q191}, then accept {q192}; keep Shadowmaw Panthers for the later visit.\nT\t\t191\t\nA\t\t192\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t194\t\nA\t\t195\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Elder Stranglethorn Tigers for {q187}.\nC\t\t187\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Lashtail Raptors for {q195}.\nC\t\t195\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t187\t\nA\t\t188\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q195}, then accept {q196}; keep Jungle Stalkers for a later Stranglethorn visit.\nT\t\t195\t\nA\t\t196\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the sloping approach up Sin'Dall's hill, kill her and loot the paw for {q188}.\nC\t\t188\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t188\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return south by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t189\t\nT\t\t213\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t201\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q575}, then accept {q577}; keep the Snapjaw skin quest for the later Stranglethorn visit.\nT\t\t575\t\nA\t\t577\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 34 before leaving for Kalimdor.\nX\t\t\t34\t\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east through Thoradin's Wall to Veyric Thunderhame and accept {q96264}; keep it for Razorfen Kraul.\nA\t\t96264\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to Southshore.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the ship to Ratchet. Keep the jungle quests and city deliveries." },
  { name = "34-35 Thousand Needles (Alliance)", title = "34-35 Thousand Needles", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 34, hi = 35, next = "35-37 Desolace (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Thalanaar and Razorfen Kraul, the Shimmering Flats, then capital deliveries and training. Ends in Darnassus.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tArrive in Ratchet from Booty Bay at 34. Keep the crash helmets and later deliveries.\nX\t\t\t34\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t63.08\t37.16\t\t\t\nP\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t62.05\t39.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Wiley for the return from the Shimmering Flats.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Ratchet\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1221\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t62.32\t37.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Crate with Holes, Snufflenose Command Stick and Owner's Manual beside Mebok. Read the manual and keep all three.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before the Thalanaar quest pickup.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t45.62\t90.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern Barrens road, keeping clear of the Crossroads and Camp Taurajo. At the Great Lift, clear the hostile guards and use the elevator; do not jump.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the skeleton a short way down the road from the Great Lift and read Henrig Lonebrow's Journal, then accept {q1100}.\nU\t\t5791\t\nA\t\t1100\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t89.5\t45.85\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the canyon road west to Thalanaar; avoid Freewind Post and the centaur camps.\nP\t\tThalanaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1100\t\nA\t\t1101\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t42.33\t89.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn east along the canyon and ride the Great Lift up. Take the western thorn path to Razorfen Kraul.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SHAMAN_RAZORFEN_PREPARATION\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before this Razorfen Kraul clear, visit Veyric Thunderhame in Arathi Highlands and accept {q96264}. Return through Southshore, Booty Bay and Ratchet. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest.\nA\t\t96264\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SHAMAN_RAZORFEN_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a five-player Razorfen Kraul party with a tank and healer.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter and clear one route through the dungeon. Avoid the cauldron near Roogug; you can become stuck inside.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAfter clearing the lower passages, use the crate to summon your Snufflenose Gopher. Use the Command Stick near tuber patches; collect six Blueleaf Tubers for {q1221} and keep the crate and stick.\nC\t\t1221\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear through Roogug, Aggem, Jargba, Ramtusk and Agathelos. Reach Heralath Fallowbrook near Willix in the rear side area and accept {q1142} before clearing Charlga's remaining quilboar.\nA\t\t1142\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect Treshala's Pendant from the remaining quilboar before leaving.\nK\t\t5825\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Charlga Razorflank and loot your medallion for {q1101}.\nC\t\t1101\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot Charlga's information on the quilboar's plans for {q96264}.\nC\t\t96264\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Willix near the rear huts. Clear his return path and confirm everyone is ready before speaking to him and accepting {q1144}.\nA\t\t1144\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tEscort Willix to the entrance and speak to him at the end for {q1144}.\nC\t\t1144\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1144\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared entrance.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Gold Road north to the Dustwallow road, then follow the marsh paths to Tabetha; avoid Brackenwall Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_MARSH_INTRODUCTION\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Library clear, visit your Mage trainer in Stormwind and accept {q1947}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-ups.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Travel through Booty Bay and Ratchet to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh, then turn in {q1947}.\nT\t\t1947\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_MARSH_INTRODUCTION\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1947}, then accept {q1948} and {q1949}. Keep Items of Power for the Shimmering Flats.\nT\t\t1947\t\nA\t\t1948\t\nA\t\t1949\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Ratchet if ready; otherwise return by the marsh road and Gold Road.\nH\t\tHearth to Ratchet\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Gold Road south to the Great Lift.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn down the Great Lift and west to Thalanaar, then turn in {q1101}.\nT\t\t1101\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the canyon road east to the Shimmering Flats. Stay clear of the Horde lift at Freewind Post.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1179\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1105\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1104\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1110\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1111}; keep Kravel's parts order for Ratchet.\nA\t\t1111\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1176\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1175\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Salty Scorpid Venoms for {q1104}, nine Hardened Tortoise Shells for {q1105}, thirty Rocket Car Parts for {q1110} and ten Hollow Vulture Bones for {q1176}; kill ten Saltstone Basilisks, ten Saltstone Crystalhides and six Saltstone Gazers for {q1175}.\nC\t\t1104\t\t\nC\t\t1105\t\t\nC\t\t1110\t\t\nC\t\t1176\t\t\nC\t\t1175\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1175\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1176\t\nA\t\t1178\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1110}, then accept {q5762}; keep Kravel's crate for Hemet on the next Stranglethorn visit.\nT\t\t1110\t\nA\t\t5762\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1104\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1105\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1107}; keep the tail-fin collection for the later Stranglethorn coast visit.\nA\t\t1107\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1949} to Magus Tirth, then accept {q1950}.\nT\t\t1949\t\nA\t\t1950\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTarget Plucky Johnson, use /beckon and speak to him in human form for {q1950}.\nC\t\t1950\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1950}, then accept {q1951}; keep it for the Scarlet Monastery Library.\nT\t\t1950\t\nA\t\t1951\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1106}; keep Fizzle's letter for a later Badlands visit.\nA\t\t1106\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t51.01\t29.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern pass into Tanaris; stay on the road to Gadgetzan and avoid the desert camps.\nP\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t89.5\t45.85\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Ratchet if ready; otherwise return through the flats and canyon to Thalanaar and fly to Ratchet.\nH\t\tHearth to Ratchet\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1221\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1111}, then accept {q1112}; keep the parts for the next Shimmering Flats visit.\nT\t\t1111\t\nA\t\t1112\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1178\t\nA\t\t1180\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship. Turn in {q1180}, then accept {q1181}.\nT\t\t1180\t\nA\t\t1181\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1181}, then accept {q1182}; keep the blueprint task for the later northern Stranglethorn circuit.\nT\t\t1181\t\nA\t\t1182\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Corruption IV, Create Healthstone III, Drain Mana II, Rain of Fire II and Searing Pain III. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Fire Shield III and Voidwalker Consume Shadows III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Demoralizing Shout III, Revenge III and Sunder Armor III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Blind, Sprint II and Ambush III. Keep Blinding Powder for Blind.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Grace IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Blinding Powder (150 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Blinding Powder at the Auction House for Blind, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Heal IV, Levitate, Mind Blast V, Resurrection III and Shadow Word: Pain V. Keep a few Light Feathers for Levitate.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Desperate Prayer IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Starshards IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Divine Shield I, Flash of Light III, Blessing of Wisdom III, Seal of Fury IV and Seal of Righteousness V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Mage Armor I and Cone of Cold II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Disengage II, Explosive Trap I and Serpent Sting V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Maul IV, Moonfire VI, Rake II, Rejuvenation VI, Starfire III, Swipe III and Thorns IV. Learn Lacerate II when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6141\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Frost Shock II, Rockbiter Weapon V, Sentry Totem and Stoneskin Totem IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal into Darnassus.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t69.54\t67.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1142} if you recovered the pendant during the clear.\nT\t\t1142\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter/Rogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDarnassus\t57.56\t46.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ilyenia Moonfire, learn Bows if needed for a weapon you plan to use.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Darnassus. Keep the Desolace and Scarlet Monastery deliveries, Southshore letters and carried Stranglethorn/Flats quests." },
  { name = "35-37 Desolace (Alliance)", title = "35-37 Desolace", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 35, hi = 37, next = "37-38 Arathi Highlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Nijel's Point, Thunder Axe Fortress, the northern naga coast and southern quest circuits. Prepares the Scarlet Monastery visit and ends in Southshore.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Darnassus after the Thousand Needles journey. Keep Reclaimers' Business in Desolace, Brother Anton, Mythology of the Titans and the Southshore letters.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine.\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.41\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south into Ashenvale and east to Astranaar.\nP\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tAshenvale\t49.48\t67.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road southeast to Shandrina at Silverwind Refuge beside Mystral Lake. Buy and use Expert Cookbook (125 Cooking); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t42.59\t71.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road southwest to the Talondeep Path; traverse its tunnel into Stonetalon. Keep clear of Sun Rock Retreat and follow the western mountain road south to Desolace.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t64.66\t10.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the eastern ramp into Nijel's Point before visiting its quest givers.\nP\t\tNijel's Point\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t66.27\t6.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Lyshaerya for the fortress and coast returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Nijel's Point\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6141\t\nA\t\t261\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1453\t\nA\t\t1454\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1387\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1437\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern road west to the abandoned wagon and search its chest, then turn in {q1437}.\nT\t\t1437\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1465\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Nijel's Point. Turn in {q1465}, then accept {q1438}.\nT\t\t1465\t\nA\t\t1438\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern road west to Ethel Rethor, then accept {q5741}.\nA\t\t5741\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDescend by the beach path and search Karnitol's Chest by the wreck, then turn in {q1454}.\nT\t\t1454\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1455\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 35 before Thunder Axe Fortress.\nX\t\t\t35\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t54.86\t26.13\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Thunder Axe Fortress through its gate for Dalinda's rescue and the fortress objectives.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Dalinda in the northern building. Turn in {q1438}, then accept {q1439}.\nT\t\t1438\t\nA\t\t1439\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the separate southern building, kill Tyranis and loot his pendant for {q1439}.\nC\t\t1439\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the fortress tower's stairs; kill the Burning Blade Seer and loot the Sceptre of Light for {q5741}.\nC\t\t5741\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Dalinda after clearing the escort exit and turn in {q1439}.\nT\t\t1439\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1440\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Dalinda out of Thunder Axe Fortress for {q1440}; stay with her through the gate ambush.\nC\t\t1440\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise take the northern road and eastern ramp.\nH\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1455\t\nA\t\t1456\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1440\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5501\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t69.35\t42.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Centaur Ears from Kolkar in the eastern valley for {q1387}.\nC\t\t1387\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5561\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t51.14\t60.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Kodo Kombobulator on one Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo at a time. Lead it to Smeed and speak to it there; repeat until five have been delivered for {q5561}.\nC\t\t5561\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5561\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6134\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the central road north and the western road to Ethel Rethor. Turn in {q5741}, then accept {q6027}.\nT\t\t5741\t\nA\t\t6027\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t34.36\t8.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the northern shore for Karnitol's Satchel and the northern island statue.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Karnitol's Satchel from Slitherblade Sea Witches and Tidehunters on the northern coast for {q1456}.\nC\t\t1456\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel to the northern island. Use the Gem of the Serpent at the Serpent Statue, defeat Lord Kragaru and loot the Book of the Ancients for {q6027}.\nC\t\t6027\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6027\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise take the northern road and eastern ramp.\nH\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1456}, then accept {q1457}; keep the satchel delivery for Ironforge.\nT\t\t1456\t\nA\t\t1457\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1387\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 36 before the southern quests. If short, hunt isolated level 35-36 centaurs on the central plains.\nX\t\t\t36\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Kodo Bones at the Kodo Graveyard for {q5501}; clear space before each pickup and defeat the summoned apparitions.\nC\t\t5501\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tPlace the Crate of Ghost Magnets in the Valley of Bones, step back and kill the attracted spectres to collect eight Ghost-o-plasms for {q6134}. Keep the crate.\nC\t\t6134\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill thirty Undead Ravagers on the valley's outer slopes for {q261}. The spectres do not count toward this quest.\nC\t\t261\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6134\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5501\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise return by the central road and eastern ramp.\nH\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t261\t\nA\t\t1052\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine.\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Menethil ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for the satchel delivery.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1457\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1052}, then accept {q1053}; keep this quest active through the Library, Armory and Cathedral visits.\nT\t\t1052\t\nA\t\t1053\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t51.17\t58.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind for the Scarlet Monastery return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_LIBRARY_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Library clear, visit Magus Olvek in friendly Dalaran and accept {q96800}. Return along the lakeshore and road to Southshore. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest.\nA\t\t96800\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Library clear, visit your Mage trainer in Stormwind and accept {q1947}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-ups.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Travel through Booty Bay and Ratchet to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh, then turn in {q1947}.\nT\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Tabetha, accept {q1948} and {q1949}.\nA\t\t1948\t\nA\t\t1949\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Magus Tirth on the Shimmering Flats and turn in {q1949}, then accept {q1950}.\nT\t\t1949\t\nA\t\t1950\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Target Plucky Johnson, use /beckon and speak to him in human form for {q1950}.\nC\t\t1950\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Magus Tirth, turn in {q1950} and accept {q1951}. Return through Ratchet and Booty Bay to Southshore before the Monastery journey.\nT\t\t1950\t\nA\t\t1951\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_LIBRARY_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west into Silverpine, then north by the main road. Pass The Sepulcher without entering and skirt the Undercity ruins and Brill; avoid their guards.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t84.8\t32.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Scarlet Monastery's entrance vestibule.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player party with a tank and healer for the Graveyard clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the left-hand Graveyard portal together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Graveyard through Interrogator Vishas and Bloodmage Thalnos, then return to the vestibule.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the right-hand Library portal, join a five-player party with a tank and healer. Defeat Houndmaster Loksey for In the Name of the Light, then clear through Arcanist Doan.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Houndmaster Loksey for {q1053}. Keep the other three bosses for the later visit.\nC\t\t1053\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Mythology of the Titans from the bookshelf in the Library's final rooms for {q1050}.\nC\t\t1050\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect The Lost Magic of the Runemasters from the table in Doan's room for {q96800}.\nC\t\t96800\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Rituals of Power from the Library bookshelves for {q1951}.\nC\t\t1951\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAfter defeating Doan, take The Scarlet Key from his strongbox. Keep it for the Armory and Cathedral.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise return through Tirisfal and Silverpine by the same approach.\nH\t\tHearth to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for the book delivery and training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1050\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.08\t7.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Shadow Bolt VI, Life Tap IV, Health Funnel IV, Create Firestone II and Create Spellstone. At Jubahl (52.70,6.08), buy and use Voidwalker Suffering II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Mocking Blow III and Whirlwind.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ancestral Spirit III, Earth Shock V, Flametongue Weapon IV, Lesser Healing Wave III, Magma Totem II, Mana Spring Totem II and Windwall Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Backstab V, Expose Armor III and Rupture III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Instant Poison III (160 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Devouring Plague III, Dispel Magic II, Holy Fire IV, Mind Soothe II, Power Word: Fortitude IV and Power Word: Shield VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Holy Strike V, Redemption III, Exorcism III, Fire Resistance Aura I and Retribution Aura III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Fireball VII and Blizzard III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Aimed Shot III, Arcane Shot V, Immolation Trap III, Mend Pet IV and Viper Sting I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.86\t85.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Belia Thundergranite, learn Great Stamina VI, Natural Armor VI. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for Druid training.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Frenzied Regeneration, Pounce I, Regrowth V, Revive III and Rip III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Ironforge before continuing.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Southshore with Hints of a New Plague, In the Name of the Light and The Scarlet Key." },
  { name = "37-38 Arathi Highlands (Alliance)", title = "37-38 Arathi Highlands", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 37, hi = 38, next = "38-39 Dustwallow Marsh (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Refuge Pointe, the Witherbark, Kinelory's escort, Trelane's relics, Stromgarde, Faldir's Cove and the binding stones. Ends in Stormwind.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Southshore after the Monastery book delivery, with Southshore bound. Keep Hints of a New Plague, In the Name of the Light and The Scarlet Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_FURTHER_MYSTERIES\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q525} to Magistrate Henry Maleb in Southshore.\nT\t\t525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_FURTHER_MYSTERIES\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before the Arathi circuits.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.42\t58.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Wesley, keeping a free slot for the training tame.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t19.92\t54.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east through Thoradin's Wall to the western grassland. Tame a Plains Creeper; use Bite V in combat until the learning message appears.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.42\t58.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Wesley, release the training tame and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite V when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t45.73\t46.1\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east through Hillsbrad and Thoradin's Wall, then southeast to Refuge Pointe.\nP\t\tRefuge Pointe\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t681\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t684\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t685\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t691\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SHAMAN_RAZORFEN_LOOT\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If the scheduled Razorfen Kraul clear is still ahead, collect Charlga's information for {q96264}. If it has already been cleared without this quest, skip the quest instead of repeating the dungeon.\nC\t\t96264\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SHAMAN_RAZORFEN_LOOT\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96264} to Veyric Thunderhame, then return toward Northfold Manor.\nT\t\t96264\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Syndicate Highwaymen and six Mercenaries at Northfold Manor for {q681}.\nC\t\t681\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to Quae's camp north of Go'Shek Farm, then turn in {q659}; avoid Hammerfall and the farm buildings.\nT\t\t659\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 37 before the eastern expedition.\nX\t\t\t37\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t658\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tPull the Courier and her bodyguards together on open ground south of the farm for {q658}.\nC\t\t658\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t658\t\nA\t\t657\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q657} to Kinelory.\nT\t\t657\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t660\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Kinelory into Go'Shek Farm and back for {q660}; stay with her through the building and return ambushes.\nC\t\t660\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t660\t\nA\t\t661\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead southeast to Witherbark Village, keeping clear of Go'Shek Farm. Collect ten Witherbark Tusks from the trolls and four Witherbark Medicine Pouches from Witch Doctors. Enter the cave south of the village and collect a Shadow Hunter Knife from a Shadow Hunter for {q691}.\nC\t\t691\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_ITEMS_OF_POWER\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: If missing Tabetha's quest, visit your Mage trainer in Stormwind and accept {q1947}.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Reach Tabetha through Booty Bay and Ratchet, then turn in {q1947} and accept {q1948}. Return through Ratchet, Booty Bay and Southshore to Arathi before collecting the totem sticks.\nT\t\t1947\t\nA\t\t1948\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_ITEMS_OF_POWER\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Witherbark Totem Sticks from the same trolls for Items of Power.\nK\t\t7273\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Refuge Pointe and turn in {q691}.\nT\t\t691\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t681\t\nA\t\t682\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t693\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t54.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Boulderfist Hall's southern cave and take the left fork. Clear the nearby ogres before pulling Kor'gresh Coldrage, then loot his wand for {q693}.\nC\t\t693\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Refuge Pointe and turn in {q693}, then accept {q694}.\nT\t\t693\t\nA\t\t694\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t26.97\t58.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tIn Stromgarde's friendly quarter, buy and use Expert First Aid - Under Wraps from Deneb Walker (125 First Aid); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t26.97\t58.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Manual: Heavy Silk Bandage and Manual: Mageweave Bandage from Deneb Walker; use them at 180 and 210 First Aid respectively. Skip manuals already learned.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Stromgarde's main gate, form a party for the Boulderfist ogres.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Stromgarde's western ogre quarter with the party and collect an Azure Agate from a Boulderfist Shaman for {q694}.\nC\t\t694\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Refuge Pointe and turn in {q694}, then accept {q695}.\nT\t\t694\t\nA\t\t695\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q695} to Skuerto, then accept {q696}.\nT\t\t695\t\nA\t\t696\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Stromgarde's main gate, form a five-player party with a tank and healer for the badges, Trelane's relics, Marez Cowl and Falconcrest.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Stromgarde by the main gate with the party. Collect seven badges from Syndicate Prowlers, Conjurors and Magi in the occupied eastern streets for {q682}.\nC\t\t682\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Marez Cowl in the Syndicate quarter; clear her nearby guards, kill her and loot her head for {q684}.\nC\t\t684\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the route into the occupied manor and defeat level-40 elite Falconcrest with Otto. Loot both heads for {q685} before leaving.\nC\t\t685\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCross to the western ogre quarter and clear the tower entrance. Use the Enchanted Agate at the Runed Pedestal to summon its defenders.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the tower's floors and open Trelane's Footlocker, Lockbox and Chest for {q696}. Each container summons ogres; defeat the ambush and let everyone loot before opening the next.\nC\t\t696\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t30.0\t67.0\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t21.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Stromgarde and follow its outside eastern wall south, then west along the southern slope. Use the tunnel to Faldir's Cove; do not jump from the cliffs.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t663\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t663\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t662\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t664\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t665\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Professor Phizzlethorpe to the cave and back. Protect him from the water-elemental ambush for {q665}.\nC\t\t665\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t665\t\nA\t\t666\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t23.05\t84.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Maiden's Folly through its hull openings and collect its Charts.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t23.39\t85.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Maiden's Folly Log inside the wreck.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t20.46\t85.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Spirit of Silverpine and collect its Charts.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Spirit of Silverpine Log for {q662}.\nC\t\t662\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Daggerspine Raiders and three Sorceresses for {q664}.\nC\t\t664\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWear the Goggles of Gem Hunting and collect ten Calcified Elven Gems from the seabed for {q666}.\nC\t\t666\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Faldir's Cove, then turn in {q662}.\nT\t\t662\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t664\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t666\t\nA\t\t668\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q668}, then accept {q669}; keep the sample gem for Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay.\nT\t\t668\t\nA\t\t669\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the tunnel and follow the road to Refuge Pointe.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t682\t\nT\t\t684\t\nT\t\t685\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q696}, then accept {q697}; keep the letter for Archmage Malin in Stormwind.\nT\t\t696\t\nA\t\t697\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 38 before the binding stones.\nX\t\t\t38\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead northeast to the Shards of Myzrael and accept {q642}.\nA\t\t642\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Motes of Myzrael from the kobolds in Drywhisker Gorge for {q642}; stay clear of Hammerfall.\nC\t\t642\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q642} at the Iridescent Shards inside the gorge, then accept {q651}.\nT\t\t642\t\nA\t\t651\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the guardians around the Stone of East Binding and take the Cresting Key for {q651}.\nC\t\t651\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead southwest to the Circle of Outer Binding. Clear the guardians and take the Thundering Key for {q651}.\nC\t\t651\t3\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Thundering Exiles around the central stone at the Circle of Outer Binding. Use the ten Witherbark Totem Sticks at the stone, then loot the Bolt Charged Bramble for {q1948}.\nC\t\t1948\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to the Circle of West Binding. Clear the guardians and take the Burning Key for {q651}.\nC\t\t651\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q651} at the Stone of Inner Binding, then return by the road to Refuge Pointe.\nT\t\t651\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t661\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1260} from Angus Stern in the Blue Recluse.\nA\t\t1260\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q697} to Archmage Malin.\nT\t\t697\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 38 before training and the next journey.\nX\t\t\t38\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Bane of Agony IV, Drain Life IV, Drain Soul III and Detect Invisibility II; train Siphon Life when talented. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Firebolt V and Blood Pact IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Pummel I, Slam III and Thunder Clap IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Garrote IV and Sinister Strike VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Deadly Poison II and Mind-numbing Poison II (170 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Flash Heal IV, Renew VI and Smite VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Seal of Wisdom I, Holy Light VI, Blessing of Protection III and Turn Undead II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Frostbolt VII, Fire Blast V and Conjure Mana Jade.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Hawk IV and Wing Clip II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Nature's Grasp IV, Entangling Roots IV, Healing Touch VII, Hibernate II, Shred III, Soothe Animal II and Wrath VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions. Keep three Soothing Spices for Jarl.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Stormwind with Southshore bound; keep Morgan Stern, the Scarlet Key and In the Name of the Light, the Booty Bay gem and carried jungle/Flats quests." },
  { name = "38-39 Dustwallow Marsh (Alliance)", title = "38-39 Dustwallow Marsh", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 38, hi = 39, next = "39-42 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Theramore, Shady Rest Inn, the northern shore, Darkmist spiders and the deserters. Ends in Booty Bay.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind at 38. Keep three Soothing Spices and the carried jungle/Flats quests.\nX\t\t\t38\t\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Disease Cleansing Totem, Flametongue Totem II, Frost Resistance Totem II, Frostbrand Weapon III, Lightning Bolt VII, Stoneclaw Totem IV and Strength of Earth Totem III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBoard the Theramore ship; confirm its destination with the dockmaster.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t67.48\t51.3\t\t\t\nP\t\tTheramore\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t66.18\t51.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Tailoring from Timothy Worthington upstairs in the building beside the docks (level 35, 200 Tailoring); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t66.44\t51.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock. Buy three Soothing Spices from Helenia Olden if you do not have them.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1282\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t66.59\t45.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Janene for the northern marsh and deserter returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Theramore\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1260} to Morgan Stern if carrying his introduction.\nT\t\t1260\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1204\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Captain Garran Vimes on the upper floor of Foothold Citadel, then turn in {q1282}.\nT\t\t1282\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t67.76\t48.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, complete Triage when eligible (level 35 and 225 First Aid) to learn Artisan First Aid. Use his bandages to save fifteen patients before six die: critically injured first, then badly injured. Skip this checklist if not ready.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t58.61\t60.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf ready at 225 Fishing, visit Nat Pagle's island southwest of Theramore and accept {q6607}; otherwise skip this detour.\nA\t\t6607\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin the road northwest of Theramore and follow it west to the burned Shady Rest Inn.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSearch the Theramore Guard Badge inside the inn, then accept {q1252}.\nA\t\t1252\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tExamine the Black Shield on the fireplace, then accept {q1253}.\nA\t\t1253\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Hoofprints outside, then accept {q1284}.\nA\t\t1284\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead northeast to Mudcrush Durtfeet and accept {q1177}; stay south of Brackenwall Village.\nA\t\t1177\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead northeast to Swamplight Manor. Accept {q1218}, then turn in {q1218}.\nA\t\t1218\t\nT\t\t1218\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1206\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the report in the Loose Dirt beside the manor, then accept {q1219}.\nA\t\t1219\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t61.4\t27.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Forked Mudrock Tongues from Mudrock Tortoises and Spikeshells along the northern shore for {q1204}; the tongues drop infrequently.\nC\t\t1204\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Mirefin Heads from the northern shore's murlocs for {q1177}.\nC\t\t1177\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead west to Stinky. Clear nearby raptors and spiders before speaking to him and accepting {q1222}.\nA\t\t1222\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tProtect Stinky while he gathers his plant, then stay with him until the escort completes for {q1222}.\nC\t\t1222\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t32.46\t23.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern marsh paths west and collect forty Unpopped Darkmist Eyes from the spiders outside Darkmist Cavern for {q1206}; avoid the Widow and cave interior.\nC\t\t1206\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn east to Swamplight Manor and turn in {q1206}.\nT\t\t1206\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Theramore if ready; otherwise follow the northern marsh paths and road back to town.\nH\t\tHearth to Theramore\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1204\t\nT\t\t1222\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SHADY_REST_PICKUPS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At burned Shady Rest Inn, search the Theramore Guard Badge and accept {q1252}.\nA\t\t1252\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Examine the Black Shield on the fireplace and accept {q1253}.\nA\t\t1253\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Inspect the Hoofprints outside and accept {q1284}. Return by the road to Theramore.\nA\t\t1284\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SHADY_REST_PICKUPS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind a patrolling Theramore Lieutenant. Turn in {q1219}, then accept {q1220}.\nT\t\t1219\t\nA\t\t1220\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1252\t\nT\t\t1253\t\nT\t\t1284\t\nT\t\t1220\t\nA\t\t1259\t\nA\t\t1319\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1319\t\nA\t\t1320\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1259} to Adjutant Tesoran in Foothold Citadel, then accept {q1285}.\nT\t\t1259\t\nA\t\t1285\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1320\t\nT\t\t1285\t\nA\t\t1286\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Theramore by the northern road, then follow the road west and head north to Mudcrush Durtfeet. Turn in {q1177}; stay clear of Brackenwall Village.\nT\t\t1177\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to the Shady Rest road, then take the southern branch to the deserter tower. Defeat Balos Jacken until he yields, then speak to him and turn in {q1286}. Avoid the dragonspawn farther south.\nT\t\t1286\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1287\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Theramore if ready; otherwise return by the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Theramore\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1287\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_NAT_PAGLE_PICKUP\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If ready at 225 Fishing, visit Nat Pagle's island southwest of Theramore and accept {q6607}. Skip if not ready or the quest was already completed.\nA\t\t6607\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_NAT_PAGLE_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t669\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 39 before the northern Stranglethorn circuit. If short, hunt isolated level 37-38 Shadowmaw Panthers east of the Gurubashi Arena, then return to Booty Bay.\nX\t\t\t39\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Booty Bay at 39 with Theramore bound. Keep In the Name of the Light, The Scarlet Key and the northern jungle/Flats quests." },
  { name = "39-42 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", title = "39-42 Stranglethorn Vale", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 39, hi = 42, next = "42-44 Badlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Northern and southern jungle circuits, one Drowned City clear, Scarlet Monastery's Armory and Cathedral, class training, the Flats deliveries and one Razorfen Downs clear. Ends in Booty Bay for the Swamp of Sorrows journey.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Booty Bay at 39. Keep the northern jungle quests, Hemet's crate, Encrusted Tail Fins, Kravel's parts, Goblin Sponsorship, The Scarlet Key and In the Name of the Light.\nX\t\t\t39\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t19.5\t20.9\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t74.4\t3.7\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t62.1\t51.4\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t22.8\t76.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tFor Nat Pagle, collect the Savage Coast Blue Sailfin, Misty Reed Mahi Mahi, Feralas Ahi and Sar'theris Striker for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.04\t77.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Skindle for the northern circuit.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t209\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q95789} and {q95791} from Krazek upstairs in the inn.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t28.99\t75.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Blacksmithing from Brikk Keencraft in the house behind the shops near Booty Bay's land exit (level 35, 200 Blacksmithing); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before the northern jungle journey.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel north by the main road to the Bloodscalp ruins, passing Grom'gol without entering.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_KURZEN_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp and accept {q203} and {q204}.\nA\t\t203\t\nA\t\t204\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill fifteen Kurzen Jungle Fighters and collect seven Jungle Remedies at Kurzen's Compound for {q203} and {q204}.\nC\t\t203\t\t\nC\t\t204\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Take the Venom Fern Extract from the compound's stockpile for {q204}.\nC\t\t204\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Sergeant Yohwa and turn in {q203} and {q204}.\nT\t\t203\t\nT\t\t204\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q207} from Brother Nimetz before searching the troll ruins.\nA\t\t207\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_KURZEN_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the First Troll Legend at Bal'lal Ruins for {q207}.\nC\t\t207\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Second Troll Legend at the underwater ruins for {q207}.\nC\t\t207\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Third and Fourth Troll Legends in Zul'Kunda for {q207}.\nC\t\t207\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Brother Nimetz at the Rebel Camp. Turn in {q207}, then accept {q205}.\nT\t\t207\t\nA\t\t205\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q574} from Sergeant Yohwa.\nA\t\t574\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t45.5\t8.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Stockpile cave at Kurzen's Compound. Kill ten Kurzen Commandos and six Headshrinkers for {q574}, then leave by the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t574\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Rebel Camp and turn in {q574}, then accept {q202}.\nT\t\t574\t\nA\t\t202\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t45.5\t8.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Stockpile entrance, form a party for Colonel Kurzen.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the cave with the party, killing six Kurzen Elite and four Subchiefs. Continue to Colonel Kurzen's chamber, clear his guards, defeat him and loot his head for {q202}. Leave by the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t202\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Skullsplitter Fetishes from level 39-40 Skullsplitter Mystics and eighteen Skullsplitter Tusks from those Mystics and nearby Warriors for {q205} and {q209}; avoid the higher-level trolls and patrols.\nC\t\t205\t\t\nC\t\t209\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_DROWNED_CITY_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: After Troll Witchery, accept {q95786} if the scheduled Drowned City clear is still ahead. If it is already behind you, skip this introduction, Take Two With Water, Magics of the Drowned City and Ancient Gurubashi Secrets instead of repeating the dungeon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_DROWNED_CITY_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Rebel Camp and turn in {q205}, then accept {q95786}.\nT\t\t205\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t202\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north to Darkshire.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore for Loremaster Dibbs.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.57\t57.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95786} to Dibbs, then accept {q95787} and {q95788}. Keep the hide and charcoal.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western Hillsbrad road to Lordamere Lake and enter friendly Dalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_PAST_DUE_BOOK\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If still in the scheduled Library clear, collect The Lost Magic of the Runemasters from Doan's table for {q96800}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest instead of repeating the dungeon.\nC\t\t96800\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_PAST_DUE_BOOK\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96800} to Magus Olvek.\nT\t\t96800\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q96773} and {q96770} from Archmage Lan'dalock outside the Violet Hold; keep them for Razorfen Downs and Zul'Farrak.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t16.17\t71.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q97130} from Archmage Timear outside the Violet Hold.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t18.1\t65.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q96771} from Ranath Nightstride in the Dalaran inn; keep it for Krol'dok Stronghold.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the lakeshore and road to Southshore.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire for the northern jungle circuit.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west, then south into Stranglethorn to the northern river. Collect five Snapjaw Crocolisk Skins for {q577}; ordinary River Crocolisks do not count.\nC\t\t577\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t42.64\t18.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Venture Co. tower, kill Foreman Cozzle and loot his key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOpen Cozzle's Footlocker in the nearby house and take the Fuel Regulator Blueprints for {q1182}.\nC\t\t1182\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Shadowmaw Panthers at the eastern hunting grounds for {q192}; avoid the deeper eastern camps.\nC\t\t192\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5762\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t192\t\nA\t\t193\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bhag'thera's hunting grounds, form a party, clear the nearby panthers and loot her fang for {q193}.\nC\t\t193\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Saltscale shore, form a party to collect ten Encrusted Tail Fins from the Saltscale murlocs for {q1107}.\nC\t\t1107\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t21.87\t25.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the western Vile Reef cavern approach.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Drowned City party with a tank and healer.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t21.87\t25.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western edge of the Vile Reef with the party. Clear the Brinescale naga guarding the cavern just west of the reef.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the underwater cavern into Sunken Hollow and meet at the instance portal.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Drowned City at 39+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Voodoo-Infused Artifacts from Saltseer pirates for {q95789}. The party may not find enough for everyone in one clear; skip this quest and its turn-in if short.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill three Saltseer Coroners and Captain Dreadrise for {q95791}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the submerged passages and dry platforms with the party.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse the hide and charcoal on all four I'lalai tablets for {q95787}, and collect five I'lalai Fetishes for {q95788}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Deathless Marrow and loot an Ancient Gurubashi Idol for {q97130}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Min'loth the Serpent to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared cavern to the Vile Reef, then follow the coast back to the main road.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return south by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t209\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95791} to Krazek.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q95789} to Krazek if you collected all ten artifacts; otherwise skip this turn-in.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1182}, then accept {q1183}; keep the blueprints for Pozzik on the Flats.\nT\t\t1182\t\nA\t\t1183\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t577\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore through the known connections.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t51.17\t58.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind for the Monastery return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.57\t57.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95787} and {q95788} to Loremaster Dibbs, then accept {q95799} and {q95798}. Keep the translations for Historian Karnik in Ironforge.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western road and lakeshore to Dalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t12.14\t70.32\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95798} to Abra Cadabra.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t16.17\t71.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q97130} to Archmage Timear outside the Violet Hold.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to Southshore before the Monastery journey.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t84.8\t32.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west to Silverpine, then north by its main road. Skirt The Sepulcher, the Undercity ruins and Brill avoiding their guards.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player party with a tank and healer for the Armory. Keep your Scarlet Key and the quest with Loksey already credited.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUnlock and enter the Armory with the party. Clear its patrols and defeat Herod; move out of his whirlwind, then gather and defeat the incoming trainees.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tReturn to the vestibule after defeating Herod for {q1053}.\nC\t\t1053\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Cathedral portal, join a five-player party with a tank and healer, then unlock and enter. Clear the side rooms and the full cathedral before pulling Mograine.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Mograine and Whitemane through the resurrection phase for {q1053}.\nC\t\t1053\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise return by the Tirisfal and Silverpine approach.\nH\t\tHearth to Southshore\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1053\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t57.91\t48.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 40 before class training and Razorfen Downs. If needed, hunt Syndicate Spies on the outer camp slopes; avoid the northern elite ruins and stronger assassins.\nX\t\t\t40\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Southshore and fly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain Demon Armor III, Immolate V, Curse of the Elements III, Create Soulstone III and Howl of Terror; train Shadowburn when talented. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Voidwalker Torment IV and Sacrifice IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Cleave III, Execute III, Heroic Strike VI, Plate Mail and Rend V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Mail, Chain Heal I, Chain Lightning II, Call of the Spirits, Flame Shock IV, Healing Stream Totem III, Healing Wave VII, Lightning Shield V, Searing Totem IV and Windfury Weapon II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Safe Fall, Stealth III, Feint III and Eviscerate VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Feedback III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Wound Poison II (180 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Sloan McCoy.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Spirit II, Fade IV, Greater Heal I, Inner Fire IV, Mana Burn III, Mind Blast VI, Prayer of Healing II, Shackle Undead II and Shadow Word: Death II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Chastise III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Contingency Plan III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Plate Mail, Consecration III, Hammer of Justice III, Devotion Aura V, Shadow Resistance Aura II and Seal of Light II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1661}, then turn in {q1661} to Duthorian Rall to learn Summon Warhorse.\nA\t\t1661\t\nT\t\t1661\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t50.39\t85.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Larimaine Purdue, learn Portal: Stormwind.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Frostfire Bolt I, Conjure Water V, Ice Armor II, Frost Nova III and Polymorph III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t47.44\t82.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Runes of Portals and replenish Runes of Teleportation from Owen Vaughn.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Beast II, Aspect of the Pack, Distracting Shot IV, Freezing Trap II, Hunter's Mark III, Mail, Raptor Strike VI, Track Giants and Volley I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Growl V. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Cower II, Dire Bear Form, Feline Grace, Ferocious Bite III, Hurricane I, Innervate, Mark of the Wild V, Moonfire VII, Prowl II, Rebirth III, Rejuvenation VII and Tranquility II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.11\t74.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Ashwood Seeds from Kyra Boucher for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t4488\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3636\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t60.39\t75.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Allison for the Razorfen Downs return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Stormwind City\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tFor Artisan Cooking at Gadgetzan, buy twelve Giant Eggs, ten Zesty Clam Meat and twenty Alterac Swiss from the Auction House when ready for 225 Cooking. Skip this preparation if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t4488\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q4490}, then turn in {q4490} to Strahad to learn Summon Felsteed.\nA\t\t4490\t\nT\t\t4490\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan through Theramore.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.34\t27.72\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Engineering from Buzzek Bracketswing outside the inn (level 35, 200 Engineering); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.63\t28.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dirge Quikcleave in the inn, complete Clamlette Surprise with the purchased ingredients to learn Artisan Cooking (225 Cooking). Skip if not ready or missing ingredients.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1107\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1112\t\nA\t\t1114\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1114\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1115}; keep Kravel's inquiry for the next Booty Bay visit.\nA\t\t1115\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1183\t\nA\t\t1186\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1186\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Gadgetzan and fly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel south by the Barrens road, avoiding the Crossroads and Camp Taurajo. Take the eastern thorn path at the Great Lift, staying above the elevator.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Myriam Moonsinger outside Razorfen Downs, then accept {q6626}.\nA\t\t6626\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Razorfen Downs party with a tank and healer ready for level-41 Amnennar.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t48.61\t89.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the outer thorn passages with the party: eight Razorfen Battleguards, eight Thornweavers and eight Death's Head Cultists for {q6626}. The objectives are outside the instance.\nC\t\t6626\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6626\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Razorfen Downs together. Ring the gong for each wave, clear it before the next ring, then defeat Tuten'kash. Continue through the lower passages and upper spiral.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWith the party, accept {q3523} from Belnistrasz; leave the escort unaccepted until everyone has turned this in and confirmed they're ready.\nA\t\t3523\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLet everyone turn in {q3523}, then confirm that the party is ready before starting the escort.\nT\t\t3523\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce everyone has turned in and confirmed they're ready, accept {q3525}.\nA\t\t3525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the escort route, accompany Belnistrasz to the idol and protect him through the ritual for {q3525}.\nC\t\t3525\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q3525} at Belnistrasz's Brazier after the ritual to claim the reward.\nT\t\t3525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tComplete the clear through Mordresh, Glutton and Amnennar for {q3636}.\nC\t\t3636\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot the blue orb beside Amnennar for {q96773}. Have everyone collect it promptly before leaving.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.53\t77.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready. Otherwise leave by the cleared route, return to Ratchet, boat to Booty Bay and fly to Stormwind.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Green Hills pages 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26 and 27 at the Auction House. Keep the fifteen pages together.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3636\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Jade at the Auction House for Items of Power.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Gold Road south to the Dustwallow road, then visit Tabetha by the marsh paths.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_WAND_CATCHUP\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Library clear, visit your Mage trainer in Stormwind and accept {q1947}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-ups.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Travel through Booty Bay and Ratchet to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh, then turn in {q1947}.\nT\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Tabetha, accept {q1948} and {q1949}.\nA\t\t1948\t\nA\t\t1949\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Magus Tirth on the Shimmering Flats and turn in {q1949}, then accept {q1950}.\nT\t\t1949\t\nA\t\t1950\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Target Plucky Johnson, use /beckon and speak to him in human form for {q1950}.\nC\t\t1950\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Magus Tirth, turn in {q1950} and accept {q1951}. Return through Ratchet and Booty Bay to Southshore before the Monastery journey.\nT\t\t1950\t\nA\t\t1951\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Witherbark Totem Sticks in Arathi, clear the Thundering Exiles at the Circle of Outer Binding and use the sticks at its central stone. Loot the Bolt Charged Bramble for {q1948}.\nC\t\t1948\t2\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect Rituals of Power during the scheduled Library clear for {q1951}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this wand quest and its follow-ups instead of repeating it.\nC\t\t1951\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Buy one Jade, return through Booty Bay and Ratchet to Tabetha and turn in {q1948} and {q1951}.\nT\t\t1948\t\nT\t\t1951\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_WAND_CATCHUP\nS\tMage\t\t\nT\t\t1948\t\nT\t\t1951\t\nA\t\t1952\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Tabetha after her ritual and turn in {q1952}. Accept {q1954}.\nT\t\t1952\t\nA\t\t1954\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ratchet by the marsh road and Gold Road.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Desolace.\nF\t\tNijel's Point\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect an Infernal Orb from Burning Blade Summoners in Mannoroc Coven for {q1954}.\nC\t\t1954\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the flight point.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet and return by the marsh paths to Tabetha.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1954}. Clear the nearby wildlife and form a party for the level-40 elite Demon of the Orb before accepting {q1955}.\nT\t\t1954\t\nA\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the summoned demon for {q1955} and turn in {q1955} immediately, before the timer expires.\nC\t\t1955\t\t\nT\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1956}; keep it for Uldaman.\nA\t\t1956\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ratchet by the marsh road and Gold Road.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1448\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t628\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q606}. Accept {q2872}; keep Stoley's delivery for Steamwheedle Port.\nA\t\t606\t\nA\t\t2872\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q580}; keep the grog errand for the Hinterlands coast.\nA\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.04\t77.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Skindle. Repair and restock in the inn.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t621\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1115}, then accept {q1116}. Accept {q2864}; keep Tran'rek's introduction for Gadgetzan.\nT\t\t1115\t\nA\t\t1116\t\nA\t\t2864\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t617\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t595\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Bloodsail Correspondence in the cove north of Booty Bay, then turn in {q595}.\nT\t\t595\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t597\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Mistvale Giblets from Elder Mistvale Gorillas for {q606}; keep ten Gorilla Fangs for Unbagwa.\nC\t\t606\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t606\t\nA\t\t607\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t597\t\nA\t\t599\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t576\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t607\t\nA\t\t609\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t599\t\nA\t\t604\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t587\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 41 before the southern quests. If short, hunt isolated level 40-41 Jungle Stalkers on open ground.\nX\t\t\t41\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the southern Bloodsail camps, kill ten Swashbucklers, collect fifteen Snuff and recover Dizzy's Eye. Take the Charts and Orders from the shore camp for {q604}, {q587}, and {q576}.\nC\t\t604\t\t\nC\t\t587\t\t\nC\t\t576\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.05\t60.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Unbagwa's cave and finish collecting ten Gorilla Fangs from nearby gorillas. Form a party with area damage or crowd control for Mokk's waves, then give the fangs to Unbagwa to begin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tProtect Unbagwa through the waves and loot Mokk's heart for {q348}.\nC\t\t348\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t40.0\t58.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou may want to group up for Voodoo Dues if you find the tightly packed camps challenging. Kill Chucky Ten Thumbs at the Zanzil ruins and take his ring.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t34.92\t51.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Jon-Jon the Crow and take his spyglass.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Maury and take his clubbed foot for {q609}.\nC\t\t609\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Zanzil's Mixture from the nearby Zanzil trolls and undead for {q621}.\nC\t\t621\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return south by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t621\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t604\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t587\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t609\t\nA\t\t613\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t576\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north by the road. Kill ten Jungle Stalkers on the hills west of the road for {q196}.\nC\t\t196\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t19.5\t20.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's fishing quest, fish from the Savage Coast for the Savage Coast Blue Sailfin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Bundles of Akiris Reed from the Brinescale naga in the Vile Reef for {q617}.\nC\t\t617\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill an Elder Saltwater Crocolisk and loot its skin for {q628}.\nC\t\t628\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t193\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t196\t\nA\t\t197\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t338\t\nA\t\t339\t\nT\t\t339\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t340\t\nT\t\t340\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t341\t\nT\t\t341\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t342\t\nT\t\t342\t\nT\t\t338\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the road south to Tethis's territory. Form a party and kill him for {q197}.\nC\t\t197\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t197\t\nA\t\t208\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt King Bangalash's hill approach, form a party and clear the hill, then take his head for {q208}.\nC\t\t208\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Mosh'Ogg mound entrance, form a party for Maury's Key. Collect Maury's Key from its ogres for {q613} before advancing into the cave.\nC\t\t613\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t208\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return south by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t617\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t623\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t613\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t628\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish the jungle circuit in Booty Bay. Keep Dream Dust in the Swamp, the Akiris delivery, Martek's letter, Stoley's introduction, Tran'rek's introduction and the grog errand for the onward chapters." },
  { name = "42-44 Badlands (Alliance)", title = "42-44 Badlands", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 42, hi = 44, next = "44-45 Tanaris (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
