    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V108_DROWNED_REWARD_DELIVERIES\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.57\t57.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: If you completed Take Two With Water, visit Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore and accept {q95799}. Keep the translations for the scheduled Ironforge visit. Skip this delivery if you did not complete its dungeon prerequisite.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t50.57\t57.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: If you completed Magics of the Drowned City, accept {q95798} from Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore. Skip this delivery if you did not complete its dungeon prerequisite.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t12.14\t70.32\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Follow the road to Dalaran and turn in {q95798} to Abra Cadabra, then return to Southshore. Skip this detour if you did not take the delivery.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V108_DROWNED_REWARD_DELIVERIES\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire and ride east through Deadwind Pass to the Swamp of Sorrows. Stay on the road through the pass.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Nat Pagle, collect the Savage Coast Blue Sailfin, Misty Reed Mahi Mahi, Feralas Ahi and Sar'theris Striker for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1396\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHunt eight Young Sawtooth Crocolisks, ten Sorrow Spinners and ten Swamp Jaguars in the western swamp for {q1396}. Keep clear of Stonard's road and guards.\nC\t\t1396\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1396\t\nA\t\t1421\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Specks of Dream Dust from the green whelps in the western swamp for {q1116}.\nC\t\t1116\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Wizards' Reagents from the Caravan Chest in Fallow Sanctuary for {q1421}.\nC\t\t1421\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Draenethyst Crystals from the sanctuary for {q1389}.\nC\t\t1389\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the immediate camp before speaking to Galen and accepting {q1393} to begin his escort.\nA\t\t1393\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Galen to safety for {q1393}.\nC\t\t1393\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1393\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1421\t\nA\t\t1398\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t74.4\t3.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's quest, fish the Misty Reed Strand for the Misty Reed Mahi Mahi.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight pieces of Sundried Driftwood along the eastern strand for {q1398}.\nC\t\t1398\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t70.2\t45.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tApproach the Temple of Atal'Hakkar in the Pool of Tears; explore its exterior for {q1448}, then return west around Stonard.\nC\t\t1448\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1398\t\nA\t\t1425\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide south into the Blasted Lands, then follow the road east to Nethergarde Keep. Turn in {q1425}.\nT\t\t1425\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t65.54\t24.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point.\nP\t\tNethergarde Keep\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1116\t\nA\t\t1117\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1448\t\nA\t\t1449\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 42 before training. If short, return by Darkshire to hunt western Swamp Jaguars; return by the same flight.\nX\t\t\t42\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette Cloyce, train Death Coil, Curse of Weakness V, Curse of Recklessness III, Shadow Ward II and Searing Pain IV. At Spackle nearby, buy and use Voidwalker Consume Shadows IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Battle Shout V and Intercept II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Vanish II, Kick III, Slice and Dice II and Ambush IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Grace V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Holy Fire V, Power Word: Shield VII, Psychic Scream III, Shadow Protection II and Shadow Word: Pain VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Desperate Prayer V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Starshards V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Cleanse, Flash of Light IV, Blessing of Might V, Seal of Fury V, Seal of Righteousness VI and Seal of the Crusader V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Arcane Intellect IV, Conjure Food V, Fireball VIII and Cone of Cold III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Serpent Sting VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Great Stamina VII, Natural Armor VII. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Demoralizing Roar IV, Faerie Fire III, Maul V, Ravage II, Regrowth VI and Starfire IV. Learn Lacerate III when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Frost Oil, one Gyrochronatom, one Healing Potion, one Lesser Invisibility Potion and one Patterned Bronze Bracers for Lotwil and Lucien. Repair and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Fire Nova IV, Fire Resistance Totem II, Grace of Air Totem I and Windfury Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1360\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2398\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t77.54\t11.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95799} to Historian Karnik.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar.\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.53\t48.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Hearthstove for the Badlands and Uldaman returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2500\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t738\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide south through the open pass into the Badlands.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t719\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t718\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Supply Crate from the digsite for {q718}.\nC\t\t718\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Ryedol's Lucky Pick from the Shadowforge dwarves at Hammertoe's Digsite for {q719}.\nC\t\t719\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Crumpled Map at the digsite, then accept {q720}.\nA\t\t720\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t719\t\nT\t\t720\t\nA\t\t721\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t718\t\nA\t\t733\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q732} from Garek.\nA\t\t732\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2418\t\nA\t\t703\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1106\t\nA\t\t1108\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t710\t\nA\t\t713\t\nT\t\t713\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t714\t\nT\t\t714\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t715\t\nT\t\t715\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Small Stone Shards and Ghak's Rock Elemental Shards from Lesser Rock Elementals on the western slopes for {q710} and {q2500}.\nC\t\t710\t\t\nC\t\t2500\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t710\t\nA\t\t711\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Buzzard Wings and Ghak's Buzzard Gizzards from the nearby buzzards for {q703} and {q2500}.\nC\t\t703\t\t\nC\t\t2500\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead Agmond's remains, then turn in {q738}.\nT\t\t738\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t739\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Murdaloc and twelve Stonevault Bonesnappers at the Stonevault camp, collecting ten Indurium Flakes from the Bonesnappers for {q739} and {q1108}.\nC\t\t739\t\t\nC\t\t1108\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t709\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Large Stone Slabs from ordinary Rock Elementals on the southern ridge for {q711}.\nC\t\t711\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t711\t\nA\t\t712\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Bracers of Rock Binding from Greater Rock Elementals for {q712}.\nC\t\t712\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the western Dustbelcher camps, form a party for Boss Tho'grun and Lotwil's guardian.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Boss Tho'grun's patrol with the party, defeat him and his guards, then loot the Sign of the Earth for {q732}.\nC\t\t732\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn with the party to Lotwil's camp. Turn in {q712}, then accept {q734}.\nT\t\t712\t\nA\t\t734\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t734\t\nA\t\t716\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t716\t\nA\t\t777\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t777\t\nA\t\t778\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Lotwil again, then defeat the summoned Fam'retor Guardian with the party and take the shackles for {q778}.\nC\t\t778\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t778\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q732} to Garek.\nT\t\t732\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_BADLANDS_DIGSITE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Take the Supply Crate at Hammertoe's Digsite for {q718}.\nC\t\t718\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q718} to Sigrun Ironhew, then accept {q733}.\nT\t\t718\t\nA\t\t733\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect Ryedol's Lucky Pick from the digsite's Shadowforge dwarves for {q719}.\nC\t\t719\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Read the Crumpled Map at the digsite and accept {q720}.\nA\t\t720\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to the excavation camp, turn in {q719} and {q720}, then accept {q721}.\nT\t\t719\t\nT\t\t720\t\nA\t\t721\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect Ghak's Buzzard Gizzards from the Badlands buzzards for {q2500}.\nC\t\t2500\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_BADLANDS_DIGSITE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven Scrap Metal from the Dustbelcher Warriors and Mystics in the northeastern camp for {q733}.\nC\t\t733\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t733\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t48.39\t49.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Crag Coyote Fangs requested by Ghak from the central coyotes.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1108\t\nA\t\t1137\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t703\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass into Loch Modan.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t739\t\nA\t\t704\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Thelsamar if ready; otherwise follow the road west.\nH\t\tHearth to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2500\t\nA\t\t17\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock in Thelsamar.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide south through the pass to Uldaman's northern excavation ramps.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_PREPARATION\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Uldaman clear, visit Tabetha and accept {q1954}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this staff chain.\nA\t\t1954\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Mannoroc Coven in Desolace and collect an Infernal Orb from Burning Blade Summoners for {q1954}.\nC\t\t1954\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Tabetha and turn in {q1954}. Clear nearby wildlife and form a party for the level-40 elite Demon of the Orb before accepting {q1955}.\nT\t\t1954\t\nA\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Defeat the summoned demon for {q1955} and turn in {q1955} before its timer expires.\nC\t\t1955\t\t\nT\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q1956} from Tabetha, then return through Ratchet, Booty Bay and Stormwind and Loch Modan to Uldaman before joining the clear.\nA\t\t1956\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t43.8\t10.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Uldaman's northern excavation entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Uldaman party with a tank and healer ready for Archaedas. Complete the outer-tunnel quests together, then continue through the full dungeon.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tBadlands\t34.04\t24.42\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Magenta Fungus Caps in the outer tunnels and dungeon for {q17}; keep the full stack for Ghak.\nC\t\t17\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Dentrium and eight An'Alleum Power Stones from the outer-tunnel Shadowforge dwarves for {q2418}.\nC\t\t2418\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t721\t\nA\t\t722\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Magregan Deepshadow with the party and take Hammertoe's Amulet for {q722}.\nC\t\t722\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tablet of Ryun'eh from the Ancient Chest for {q709}.\nC\t\t709\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Krom Stoutarm's Chest in the North Common Hall of the outer tunnels for {q1360}.\nC\t\t1360\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Carved Stone Urns in the outer tunnels for {q704}.\nC\t\t704\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t722\t\nA\t\t723\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Uldaman together. Visit Baelog before continuing through the instance.\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat the Obsidian Sentinel and loot the Obsidian Power Source for {q1956}.\nC\t\t1956\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2398\t\nA\t\t2240\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead Baelog's Journal and take Gni'kiv's Medallion from Baelog's Chest. Defeat Revelosh for the Shaft of Tsol, combine the pieces into the Staff of Prehistoria, and use it in the Map Chamber.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Ironaya with the party and explore the hidden chamber for {q2240}.\nC\t\t2240\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear the scorpion room between the Map Chamber and Temple Hall, then learn Artisan Enchanting from Annora (level 35, 200 Enchanting); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue the clear through the trogg and earthen halls to Archaedas.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Archaedas with the party; let the tank gather awakened guardians before attacking them.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Discs of Norgannon, speak to the Lore Keeper of Norgannon and complete his explanation, then accept {q2278}.\nA\t\t2278\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tActivate the Discs of Norgannon again to turn in {q2278}.\nT\t\t2278\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccess the Discs again to accept {q2279}, the miniature-disc follow-up for Ironforge.\nA\t\t2279\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared outer tunnels and return to the Badlands camps.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t723\t\nA\t\t724\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2418\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t709\t\nA\t\t727\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass into Loch Modan.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t704\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Thelsamar if ready; otherwise follow the road west.\nH\t\tHearth to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t17\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide to Thelsamar and fly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2279\t\nA\t\t2439\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2240\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t724\t\nA\t\t725\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t725\t\nA\t\t726\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t726\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1360\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t727\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2439} with Magellas's voucher to Dinita Stonemantle at the Vault.\nT\t\t2439\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain the following abilities when available at your level; skip unavailable ranks. Restock and train chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.35\t5.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Briarthorn, train Corruption V, Shadow Bolt VII, Drain Mana III, Health Funnel V and Subjugate Demon II. At Jubahl Corpseseeker nearby (52.70,6.08), buy and use Imp Fire Shield IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Demoralizing Shout IV, Overpower III and Revenge IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Lesser Healing Wave IV, Lightning Bolt VIII, Nature Resistance Totem II, Rockbiter Weapon VI and Stoneskin Totem V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Backstab VI, Rupture IV and Shank II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Instant Poison IV (200 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Devouring Plague IV, Flash Heal V, Mind Control II, Mind Vision II and Renew VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Holy Strike VI, Exorcism IV, Blessing of Wisdom IV, Frost Resistance Aura II and Hammer of Wrath I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Frostbolt VIII, Blizzard IV and Mana Shield IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.5\t7.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Milstaff Stormeye, learn Portal: Ironforge.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t31.32\t27.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Runes of Portals and replenish Runes of Teleportation from Ginny Longberry.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Aimed Shot IV, Arcane Shot VI, Explosive Trap II, Mend Pet V and Mongoose Bite III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for Druid training.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Barkskin, Healing Touch VIII, Rake III, Rip IV, Swipe IV and Thorns V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Ironforge before continuing.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Shimmering Flats deliveries and the carried Arathi letter; the next journey starts from Ironforge." },
  { name = "44-45 Tanaris (Alliance)", title = "44-45 Tanaris", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 44, hi = 45, next = "45-47 Feralas (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "The Hinterlands preparations, Tanaris coast quests and Tome of Twilight preparation for one Krol'dok Stronghold clear. Ends at Thalanaar.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Ironforge after Uldaman. Fly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide east to Durnholde, then north through the pass behind the keep into the Hinterlands. Follow the road west to Aerie Peak.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t11.07\t46.15\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before climbing the aviary.\nP\t\tAerie Peak\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1449\t\nA\t\t1450\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1450\t\nA\t\t1451\t\nA\t\t2988\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t13.39\t43.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Leatherworking from Drakk Stonehand downstairs inside Wildhammer Keep (level 35, 200 Leatherworking); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2880\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t23.28\t58.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tCheck the first Witherbark Cage at Zun'watha.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t23.13\t58.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tCheck the second cage in the same camp.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCheck the third cage at Hiri'watha for {q2988}.\nC\t\t2988\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish collecting five Troll Tribal Necklaces from the Witherbark trolls for {q2880}.\nC\t\t2880\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2988\t\nA\t\t2989\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2880\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1451\t\nA\t\t1452\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTanaris\t49.88\t35.28\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t61.73\t64.4\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t55.01\t49.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep one checklist of Rhapsody's three Roc Gizzards, three Groddoc Livers and three Ironfur Livers during the Kalimdor circuit.\nK\t\t6257\t3\t\t\nK\t\t6258\t3\t\t\nK\t\t6259\t3\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern Hinterlands road to the Atal'ai Exile, then accept {q1446}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nA\t\t1446\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t48.67\t68.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Altar of Zul's stair approach, form a party for the summit investigation.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t48.67\t68.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear up the Altar of Zul stairs with the party, inspect the top and return by the cleared stairs for {q2989}.\nC\t\t2989\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2989\t\nA\t\t2990\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Nethergarde Keep through the known connections.\nF\t\tNethergarde Keep\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2990\t\nA\t\t2991\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Theramore boat and visit the docks.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t623\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q7070}; keep the fragment errand for Maraudon.\nA\t\t7070\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock in Theramore before leaving town.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Tabetha southwest of Theramore, then accept {q2846}; keep her tiara quest for Zul'Farrak.\nA\t\t2846\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_LOOT\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If still in the scheduled Uldaman clear, loot the Obsidian Power Source from the Obsidian Sentinel for {q1956}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-ups instead of repeating the dungeon.\nC\t\t1956\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_LOOT\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1956} to Tabetha. Clear the nearby wildlife, then accept {q1957}.\nT\t\t1956\t\nA\t\t1957\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat twelve Mana Surges within the time limit for {q1957}, then turn in {q1957}.\nC\t\t1957\t\t\nT\t\t1957\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1958}, then turn in {q1958} to claim the staff.\nA\t\t1958\t\nT\t\t1958\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Theramore and fly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t992\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2864\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Gadgetzan wanted poster, then accept {q2781}.\nA\t\t2781\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.51\t27.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Fizzgrimble in the inn. Repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1707\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1690\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Wastewander Bandits and ten Thieves east of Gadgetzan, collecting five Wastewander Water Pouches for {q1690} and {q1707}.\nC\t\t1690\t\t\nC\t\t1707\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1690\t\nA\t\t1691\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1707\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Wastewander Shadow Mages, eight Rogues and six Assassins for {q1691}.\nC\t\t1691\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Caliph's guards and defeat him for {q2781}.\nC\t\t2781\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t49.88\t35.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Rhapsody's three Roc Gizzards from ordinary Rocs on the way toward Sandsorrow Watch.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the Sandsorrow water hole and defeat the disturbed insects for {q992}.\nC\t\t992\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q992}, then accept {q82}; keep the insect-parts quest for the later southern Tanaris circuit.\nT\t\t992\t\nA\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1691\t\nT\t\t2781\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide east to Steamwheedle Port.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8365\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2875\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3520\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8366\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2872\t\nA\t\t2873\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t71.58\t43.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the coast south through the Lost Rigger Cove tunnel to the pirate compound.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Southsea Pirates, ten Freebooters, ten Dock Workers and ten Swashbucklers, collecting twenty Southsea Pirate Hats for {q8366} and {q8365}.\nC\t\t8366\t\t\nC\t\t8365\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Stoley's Shipment from the building in the compound for {q2873}.\nC\t\t2873\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Andre Firebeard and loot his head for {q2875}.\nC\t\t2875\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tOpen Pirate's Footlockers looted during the pirate clear. If you find a Ship Schedule, use it to accept {q2876}; keep its delivery for the port return.\nU\t\t9250\t\nA\t\t2876\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the tunnel to Steamwheedle Port.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2875\t\nT\t\t8366\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t67.06\t23.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2876} if you obtained the Ship Schedule.\nT\t\t2876\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8365\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2873\t\nA\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before boarding the Powderfuse Port ship.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Powderfuse Port ship from Steamwheedle Port to the Riverglades.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t76.62\t53.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tFrom Powderfuse Port, follow the inland roads south to Farholde Keep.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q94879} from Ashe Amberhall in the keep.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the roads northwest to Sunnyglade. Collect five Twilight Pages from the ruined houses for {q94879}.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t66.72\t81.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ashe Amberhall in Farholde Keep, turn in {q94879} and accept {q94881}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sunnyglade. Collect twenty-five Twilight Charms from Twilight Shadowmancers and Twilight Neophytes for {q94881}.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t66.72\t81.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ashe Amberhall, turn in {q94881} and accept {q94907}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the roads northwest through Sunnyglade to Twilight's Shroud.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse a conduit to summon a Twilight Thrall, weaken it and use to capture it for {q94907}.\nU\t\t268646\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t66.72\t81.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ashe Amberhall, turn in {q94907} and accept {q94984}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the roads northwest through Sunnyglade toward Krol'dok Stronghold.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_KROLDOK_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t18.1\t65.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Krol'dok Stronghold clear, visit Ranath Nightstride in Dalaran's inn and accept {q96771}. Return through Southshore, Booty Bay, Ratchet and Steamwheedle Port to the Riverglades. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_KROLDOK_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t37.5\t37.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the cave west of Krol'dok Stronghold's closed fortress gates. Join a five-player party with a tank and healer, then clear the guarded approach together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Krol'dok Stronghold together at 44+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Zalfan Moonshadow for {q96771}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Nar'gurk and loot the Tome of Twilight for {q94984}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Krol'dok Stronghold through its final boss, Overlord Mugg, then leave by the cleared approach.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the roads through Sunnyglade to Farholde Keep.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t66.72\t81.07\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q94984} to Ashe Amberhall.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan if ready; otherwise return to Powderfuse Port, take the Steamwheedle ship and ride west to Gadgetzan.\nH\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1117}, then accept {q1118}; keep Kravel's scheme for the later Booty Bay visit.\nT\t\t1117\t\nA\t\t1118\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1137\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2770\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Gadgetzan. Keep Stoley's bottle for Booty Bay, the three Roc Gizzards, Rhapsody's checklist, Screecher Spirits and the Gahz'rilla, Nekrum's Medallion and Tiara of the Deep quests for Zul'Farrak.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thalanaar for the Feralas journey.\nF\t\tThalanaar\t" },
  { name = "45-47 Feralas (Alliance)", title = "45-47 Feralas", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 45, hi = 47, next = "47-48 Tanaris (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Feathermoon and Solarsal, the missing courier, the High Wilderness and the Forgotten Coast. Includes the Darnassus deliveries and level-46 training.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t89.58\t39.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart from Thalanaar. Reach level 45 before taking Zorbin's work; if needed, hunt ordinary Ironfur Bears along the eastern road.\nX\t\t\t45\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Rhapsody, collect three Roc Gizzards, three Groddoc Livers and three Ironfur Livers.\nK\t\t6257\t3\t\t\nK\t\t6258\t3\t\t\nK\t\t6259\t3\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Nat Pagle, collect the Savage Coast Blue Sailfin, Misty Reed Mahi Mahi, Feralas Ahi and Sar'theris Striker for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road west, passing Camp Mojache without entering. Continue to the Forgotten Coast dock.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t44.81\t43.42\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Zorbin beside the dock.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7003\t\nA\t\t7721\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold; remain aboard for the island landing.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t30.24\t43.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t30.97\t43.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Shyria in the inn; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Feathermoon Stronghold\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t32.62\t43.78\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Alchemy from Kylanna Windwhisper at the treehouse in the island's northeast corner (level 35, 200 Alchemy); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2821\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2866\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4124\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4124\t\nA\t\t4125\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2982\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t31.47\t43.15\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Antarius, keeping a free slot for the training tame.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t31.03\t48.48\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path south out of Feathermoon and tame a Longtooth Runner on the island; use Bite VI in combat until the learning message appears.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInvestigate the Solarsal Gazebo south of the stronghold, then turn in {q2866}.\nT\t\t2866\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2867\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t31.47\t43.15\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north to Antarius in Feathermoon.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t31.47\t43.15\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Antarius, release the training tame and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite VI when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2867\t\nA\t\t3130\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3130\t\nA\t\t2869\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Hatecrest Naga Scales from the naga around Solarsal for {q2869}.\nC\t\t2869\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2869\t\nA\t\t2870\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t28.5\t70.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel south across the island chain to Shalzaru's cave entrance. Clear the cave, defeat Lord Shalzaru and take his relic for {q2870}.\nC\t\t2870\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared cave entrance and return north across the islands.\nH\t\tHearth to Feathermoon Stronghold\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2870\t\nA\t\t2871\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2871\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat back to the Forgotten Coast. Follow the shore south to the courier's wreck.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4125\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4127\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Thick Yeti Hides from Feral Scar Yetis for {q2821}; use the outer slopes and pull away from cave mouths. Avoid Bloodroar the Stalker.\nC\t\t2821\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon if ready; otherwise return to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the boat.\nH\t\tHearth to Feathermoon Stronghold\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2821\t\nA\t\t7733\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4127\t\nA\t\t4129\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4129\t\nA\t\t4130\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4130\t\nA\t\t4131\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat to the Forgotten Coast and follow the main road east.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t65.94\t45.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Moonweavers' ledge by the hillside path above the Grimtotem camp. Clear the cage approach before beginning Kindal's timed rescue.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2969\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t65.91\t47.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tOpen the Bamboo Cage and protect Kindal and at least six Sprite Darters through their escape for {q2969}. Stay with the rescue.\nC\t\t2969\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2969\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2970\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve Grimtotem Naturalists, ten Raiders and six Shamans for {q2970}.\nC\t\t2970\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2970\t\nA\t\t2972\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t75.07\t25.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Gordunni Brutes in the northern ogre camp, then return to the main road.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t55.01\t49.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Ironfur Livers from Grizzled Ironfur Bears; keep all nine Kalimdor ingredients.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t62.1\t51.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's quest, fish the Verdantis River for the Feralas Ahi.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t61.73\t64.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Groddoc Livers from ordinary Groddoc Apes for Rhapsody.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the southern trail to the High Wilderness and kill eight Gordunni Warlocks and eight Shamans for {q2982}.\nC\t\t2982\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Woodpaw camps and search the Large Leather Backpacks, then turn in {q4131}.\nT\t\t4131\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4135\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Undelivered Parcel from the backpacks and use it to accept {q4281}.\nA\t\t4281\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Writhing Deep's hive tunnels down to Raschal's pod rather than crossing the ground above. Turn in {q4135} at the pod.\nT\t\t4135\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4265\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFree Raschal and escort him out for {q4265}; keep his path clear before he advances.\nC\t\t4265\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4281\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly from Thalanaar to Feathermoon.\nF\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4265\t\nA\t\t4266\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2982\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4266\t\nA\t\t4267\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal into Darnassus.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4267\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2972\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t40.6\t82.13\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Elissa Dumas, learn Teleport: Darnassus.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 46 before training. If needed, return by Feathermoon to hunt outer Feral Scar Yetis, then fly back through Rut'theran.\nX\t\t\t46\t\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t35.37\t8.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Mathrengyl Bearwalker, learn Bash III, Dash II, Moonfire VIII, Pounce II, Rejuvenation VIII, Shred IV and Wrath VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine.\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Menethil boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.35\t5.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Briarthorn, train Life Tap V, Drain Life V, Create Healthstone IV, Create Firestone III and Rain of Fire III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Charge III, Mocking Blow IV, Slam IV and Sunder Armor IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Chain Heal II, Flametongue Weapon V, Frost Shock III, Magma Totem III, Mana Spring Totem III and Windwall Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Gouge IV, Garrote V, Expose Armor IV and Sinister Strike VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Deadly Poison III (210 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Greater Heal II, Mind Blast VII, Resurrection IV and Smite VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Holy Light VII, Blessing of Sacrifice I and Retribution Aura IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Fire Blast VI, Mage Armor II and Arcane Explosion V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Aspect of the Wild I, Immolation Trap IV, Scare Beast III and Viper Sting II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2963\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2963}, then accept {q2946}; keep the miniature discs for Uldum in southern Tanaris.\nT\t\t2963\t\nA\t\t2946\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.5\t47.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon if ready; otherwise fly to Menethil.\nH\t\tHearth to Feathermoon Stronghold\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Menethil, take the Theramore boat and fly to Feathermoon.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3445\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat to the Forgotten Coast and follow the road toward the northern yeti cave.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t55.01\t32.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides for {q7733}.\nC\t\t7733\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill three Vale Screechers, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on each corpse and speak to each released spirit for {q3520}.\nC\t\t3520\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t44.4\t39.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Water Elemental Cores from Sea Sprays and Sea Elementals for {q7721}.\nC\t\t7721\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker on the coast's giants before killing them. Collect fifteen Miniaturization Residues for {q7003}.\nC\t\t7003\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7003\t\nT\t\t7721\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the boat to Feathermoon.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7733\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Feathermoon with Rhapsody's nine ingredients, Screecher Spirits, Gahz'rilla, Tiara of the Deep, Nekrum's Medallion and Angelas's Sunken Temple introduction.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan for the southern Tanaris circuit.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t" },
  { name = "47-48 Tanaris (Alliance)", title = "47-48 Tanaris", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 47, hi = 48, next = "48-49 Searing Gorge (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Southern Tanaris and one Zul'Farrak clear, followed by Sharpbeak's rescue and the Ancient Egg in the Hinterlands. Ends in Stormwind.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Gadgetzan after the Feralas journey. Keep Rhapsody's nine ingredients, Screecher Spirits, the Sunken Temple introduction, and the three carried Zul'Farrak quests.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V108_ZUMRAH_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t15.88\t73.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Zul'Farrak clear, visit Archmage Lan'dalock outside Dalaran's Violet Hold and accept {q96770}. Return through Southshore, Booty Bay, Ratchet and Gadgetzan. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest instead of repeating it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V108_ZUMRAH_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3042\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2605\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2768\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.51\t27.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Fizzgrimble. Repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2865\t\nA\t\t3362\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3520\t\nA\t\t3527\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3445\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3444\t\nA\t\t3161\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Centipaar Insect Parts in the Noxious Lair for {q82}.\nC\t\t82\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Dunemaul Brutes, ten Enforcers and Gor'marok the Ravager in the Dunemaul Compound's cave for {q5863}.\nC\t\t5863\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWear Marvon's detector helmet and collect thirty Gahz'ridian Ornaments from the sand mounds around the ruins for {q3161}.\nC\t\t3161\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Gnarled Thistleshrubs and eight Rootshapers collecting a Laden Dew Gland from the interspersed Thistleshrub Dew Collectors for {q2605} and {q3362}.\nC\t\t2605\t\t\nC\t\t3362\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the miniature discs to the Uldum Pedestal, then turn in {q2946}.\nT\t\t2946\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2954\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to the Stone Watcher of Norgannon and hear his full explanation for {q2954}.\nC\t\t2954\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the pedestal again, then turn in {q2954}.\nT\t\t2954\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2977\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2605\t\nA\t\t2606\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3362\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2606\t\nA\t\t2641\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t10\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3161\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t55.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to the Gaping Chasm's spiral descent. Take the north-facing tunnel partway down the spiral to Scrimshank's gear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnels into the large rectangular chamber and take Scrimshank's Surveying Gear from its western corner for {q10}.\nC\t\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan if ready; otherwise leave through the cleared tunnels and ride north.\nH\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t10\t\nA\t\t110\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t110\t\nA\t\t113\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t113\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t162\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t39.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 47 before Zul'Farrak. If needed, hunt ordinary Rocs and Glasshide Basilisks in the northern desert; return to Gadgetzan to repair.\nX\t\t\t47\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t39.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide northwest to Zul'Farrak's entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Zul'Farrak party with a tank and healer. Arrange for one member to bring the Mallet of Zul'Farrak for Gahz'rilla.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Zul'Farrak together at 47+. Keep the temple stairs, scarabs and named bosses in this single clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twenty Vials of Troll Temper during the clear.\nK\t\t9523\t20\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect five Uncracked Scarab Shells from the scarabs for {q2865}.\nC\t\t2865\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear through Antu'sul, Theka the Martyr and Witch Doctor Zum'rah; loot Theka's First Mosh'aru Tablet. Do not open several graves at once.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot Zum'rah's Head from Witch Doctor Zum'rah for {q96770}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAt the pyramid, defeat the Executioner and use his key to release the prisoners. Keep together through the stair defense; defeat Nekrum Gutchewer and loot his medallion for {q2991}.\nC\t\t2991\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLet the prisoners recover and speak to Weegli to open the final gate. Speak to Sergeant Bly after the defense and defeat his group and loot the Divino-matic Rod for {q2768}.\nC\t\t2768\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Hydromancer Velratha and loot her tiara and Second Mosh'aru Tablet for {q2846}.\nC\t\t2846\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect both Mosh'aru Tablets for {q3527}.\nC\t\t3527\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHave the mallet carrier ring Gahz'rilla's gong. Defeat Gahz'rilla and take the Electrified Scale for {q2770}.\nC\t\t2770\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Chief Ukorz Sandscalp and Ruuzlu with the party to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared entrance and ride southeast.\nH\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2768\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3042\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2865\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3527\t\nA\t\t4787\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2770\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Gadgetzan and fly to Theramore.\nF\t\tTheramore Isle\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2846\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWetlands\t9.49\t59.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Theramore and take the Menethil boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Nethergarde Keep.\nF\t\tNethergarde Keep\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2991\t\nA\t\t2992\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRemain with Thadius during his divination for {q2992}.\nC\t\t2992\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2992\t\nA\t\t2993\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Aerie Peak.\nF\t\tAerie Peak\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2993\t\nA\t\t2994\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2877\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1452\t\nA\t\t1469\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Violet Tragan from the lake beside the Altar of Zul for {q2641}.\nC\t\t2641\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Green Sludges and ten Jade Oozes around Skulk Rock for {q2877}.\nC\t\t2877\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t53.38\t67.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Jintha'Alor's stair approach and form a party for Sharpbeak and the Ancient Egg, with a healer and crowd control for the elite packs.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t53.38\t67.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Jintha'Alor's full stair route with the party; do not drop between tiers.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Vile Priestess Hexx and loot Sharpbeak's Cage Key, open the cage and stay for Sharpbeak's release for {q2994}.\nC\t\t2994\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue with the party into the cave behind the upper terraces and take the Ancient Egg for {q4787}. Return by the cleared stairs.\nC\t\t4787\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern road down to the coast and collect twelve bottles of Pupellyverbos Port from the beach for {q580}; avoid Revantusk Village.\nC\t\t580\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn up the coastal road to Aerie Peak.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2877\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2994\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1469\t\nA\t\t1475\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 48 before the next Searing Gorge circuit. If needed, fly back to Aerie Peak and hunt Green Sludges and Jade Oozes around Skulk Rock, then return by flight.\nX\t\t\t48\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette, train Bane of Agony V, Banish II, Create Spellstone II, Soul Fire and eligible Shadowburn or other talented ranks. At Spackle nearby, buy and use Imp Firebolt VI, Voidwalker Sacrifice V and Suffering III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Execute IV, Heroic Strike VII and Thunder Clap V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ancestral Spirit IV, Chain Lightning III, Earth Shock VI, Flametongue Totem III, Frostbrand Weapon IV, Healing Wave VIII, Lightning Shield VI and Stoneclaw Totem V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Sap III and Eviscerate VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Wound Poison III (220 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Holy Fire VI, Mana Burn IV, Power Word: Fortitude V, Power Word: Shield VIII and Shadow Word: Death III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t47.44\t82.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Holy Candles from Owen Vaughn for Prayer of Fortitude.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Redemption IV, Fire Resistance Aura II and Seal of Wisdom II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Conjure Mana Citrine, Fireball IX, Flamestrike V and Arcane Missiles VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Hawk V, Disengage III and Raptor Strike VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Great Stamina VIII, Natural Armor VIII. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Nature's Grasp V, Entangling Roots V, Ferocious Bite IV, Regrowth VII and Revive IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy fifteen Silk Cloth for the Grimesilt Outhouse. Repair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Codex: Prayer of Fortitude at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t60.39\t75.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Allison for the Searing Gorge return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Stormwind City\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Ancient Egg, Marvon's Stone Circle request, Temple tablets quest, Violet Tragan, Stoley's bottle, the grog delivery and the Maraudon fragment quest." },
  { name = "48-49 Searing Gorge (Alliance)", title = "48-49 Searing Gorge", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 48, hi = 49, next = "49-50 Desolace (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Thorium Point, the Cauldron and the Torch of Retribution. Ends in Ironforge.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar and ride south into the Badlands. Take the western road into Searing Gorge; use the open Badlands pass.\nF\t\tThelsamar\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t37.93\t30.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern ridge road to Thorium Point and collect its flight point before the camp sweep.\nP\t\tThorium Point\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7701\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7728\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7723\t\nA\t\t7724\t\nA\t\t7727\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3441\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tListen to Kalaran's complete story for {q3441}.\nC\t\t3441\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3441\t\nA\t\t3442\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4449\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t68.1\t33.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Golem Oil from Tempered War Golems on the eastern plateau.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFor the outhouse, kill eight Dark Iron Geologists and keep the fifteen purchased Silk Cloth for {q4449}.\nC\t\t4449\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Hearts of Flame from Blazing Elementals in the southeastern basin for {q3442}.\nC\t\t3442\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4449\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf a Dark Iron dwarf drops the Grimesilt Outhouse Key, use it to accept {q4451}.\nA\t\t4451\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t65.59\t62.17\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4451} if you obtained the key.\nT\t\t4451\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3442\t\nA\t\t3443\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twenty Heavy War Golems around the Cauldron for {q7723}.\nC\t\t7723\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twenty Greater Lava Spiders on the western plateaus for {q7724}.\nC\t\t7724\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Lookout's Spyglass from Dark Iron Lookouts at the western tower for {q7728}.\nC\t\t7728\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Smithing Tuyere from Dark Iron Steamsmiths near the Cauldron's western rim for {q7728}.\nC\t\t7728\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t39.76\t21.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Cauldron's northern ramps to enter the Slag Pit. Follow its passages to the raised work platforms; do not jump into the lava.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Dark Iron Taskmasters and fifteen Slavers inside and around the Slag Pit, collecting eight Thorium Plated Daggers for {q7729} and {q3443}.\nC\t\t7729\t\t\nC\t\t3443\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party at the upper platform for Overseer Maltorius, clear his guards and defeat him with the party. Take the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux beside him for {q7701} and {q7722}.\nC\t\t7701\t\t\nC\t\t7722\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnels down to the Incendosaur lava cavern and kill twenty for {q7727}. Return by the tunnel ramps.\nC\t\t7727\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the northern ramps and return to Kalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3443\t\nA\t\t3452\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Twilight camp approach, form a party and clear the Twilight camps northwest of the Cauldron and collect a Symbol of Ragnaros for {q3452}.\nC\t\t3452\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3452\t\nA\t\t3453\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWait for Kalaran to finish forging the torch for {q3453}.\nC\t\t3453\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3453\t\nA\t\t3454\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3454\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3462\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3462\t\nA\t\t3463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the sentry-tower approach, form a party for the four braziers. Equip the Torch of Retribution before using each brazier; restore your weapon afterward.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the western tower and use its brazier for {q3463}.\nC\t\t3463\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLight the southern tower for {q3463}.\nC\t\t3463\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLight the eastern tower for {q3463}.\nC\t\t3463\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLight the northern tower for {q3463}, then return to Maltrake.\nC\t\t3463\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStay for Kalaran's departure, then open the Hoard of the Black Dragonflight and accept {q3481}.\nA\t\t3481\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3481\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Thorium Point for the ready rewards.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7723\t\nT\t\t7724\t\nT\t\t7727\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7728\t\nT\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7701\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2977\t\nA\t\t2964\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2964\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Ironforge. Keep the Ancient Egg, Violet Tragan, Stoley's bottle, grog delivery and all Sunken Temple preparations. The next journey finishes Maraudon, Alcaz Prison and the level-50 class quest." },
  { name = "49-50 Desolace (Alliance)", title = "49-50 Desolace", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 49, hi = 50, next = "50-52 Un'Goro Crater (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "One Maraudon clear, Alcaz Prison at 50 and the northern delivery circuit. Keep the prepared Sunken Temple quests for level 52.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Ironforge after Searing Gorge. Keep the Ancient Egg, Violet Tragan, Stoley's bottle, Whiskey Slim's grog and all Temple quests.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Nat Pagle, collect the Savage Coast Blue Sailfin, Misty Reed Mahi Mahi, Feralas Ahi and Sar'theris Striker for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western road and lakeshore into friendly Dalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_KROLDOK_LOOT\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If still in the scheduled Krol'dok Stronghold clear, defeat Zalfan Moonshadow for {q96771}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest instead of repeating the dungeon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_KROLDOK_LOOT\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t18.1\t65.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96771} to Ranath Nightstride in the inn.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t15.88\t73.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96773} and {q96770} to Archmage Lan'dalock, then accept {q96772} for Alcaz Prison.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to Southshore.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1118}, then accept {q1119} and take the Fool's Stout for Kravel.\nT\t\t1118\t\nA\t\t1119\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship and collect Marvon's Stone Circle before flying onward.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Stone Circle from Marvon's Chest in his Ratchet workshop for {q3444}.\nC\t\t3444\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Nijel's Point.\nF\t\tNijel's Point\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7065\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t66.27\t6.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Lyshaerya. Repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Nijel's Point\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7041\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Willow at Scrabblescrew's Camp on the way south, then accept {q7028}.\nA\t\t7028\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace and read his instructions, then accept {q7067}.\nA\t\t7067\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDesolace\t22.8\t76.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's quest, fish from Sar'theris Strand for the Sar'theris Striker; avoid Shadowprey Village and its guards.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t29.76\t56.17\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 49 before entering Maraudon. If needed, hunt Cursed Centaur and the outer Shadowshard elementals.\nX\t\t\t49\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Valley of Spears caverns and speak to Cavindra near the orange approach, then accept {q7044}.\nA\t\t7044\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t33.22\t65.67\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill Talendria's Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool before entering either instance branch.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Maraudon party with a tank and healer for the outer khans, both entrance branches and Princess Theradras.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Shadowshard Fragments from the outer cavern's Rumblers and Smashers for {q7070}; these passages are outside the instance.\nC\t\t7070\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse the Amulet of Spirits on the five khans as directed by the Pariah's Instructions, defeat them and collect all five gems. The first three are in the outer caverns; the other two are in the orange and purple dungeon branches. Combine the gems with the amulet into the Amulet of Union for {q7067}.\nC\t\t7067\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t28.15\t62.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat The Nameless Prophet in the outer caverns and loot the Amulet of Spirits.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t29.66\t60.48\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the amulet on the Spirit of Kolk, defeat him and take the First Khan's gem.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t29.43\t56.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the purple outer approach to Gelk; use the amulet, defeat him and loot the Second Khan's gem.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t35.79\t60.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the orange outer approach to Magra; use the amulet, defeat him and loot the Third Khan's gem. Keep the filled vial and Legends of Maraudon ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Maraudon's orange branch together at 49+. Complete both entrance branches and Earth Song Falls in this same instance; keep the party and instance together throughout.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Theradric Crystal Carvings during the clear.\nK\t\t17684\t15\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the orange branch through Noxxion and Razorlash. Loot Noxxion's Celebrian Rod and the orange-branch khan's gem.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBacktrack through the cleared orange route to the outer caverns and enter the purple branch without resetting the instance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Filled Cerulean Vial on Vylestem Vines, then kill the emerging Noxxious Scion to heal eight plants for {q7041}.\nC\t\t7041\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the purple branch through Lord Vyletongue. Loot his Celebrian Diamond and the purple-branch khan's gem; combine the Amulet of Union when all five gems are collected.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue to Celebras and defeat him. Speak to Celebras the Redeemed with both scepter pieces, then turn in {q7044}. Accept {q7046}.\nT\t\t7044\t\nA\t\t7046\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAssist Celebras through the ritual and read the Incantation of Celebras when prompted for {q7046}.\nC\t\t7046\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7046\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Earth Song Falls with the five-player party, clearing Landslide, Tinkerer Gizlock and Rotgrip.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Princess Theradras with the party for {q7065}; fight with solid ground behind you.\nC\t\t7065\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Zaetar's Spirit after the Princess and accept {q7066}.\nA\t\t7066\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared passages to the Valley of Spears, then ride south to the Centaur Pariah.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7067\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Willow on the return north, then turn in {q7028}.\nT\t\t7028\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise ride north by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Nijel's Point\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7041\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Theramore.\nF\t\tTheramore Isle\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7070\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t67.76\t48.97\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, learn Heavy Mageweave Bandage (240 First Aid), Runecloth Bandage (260) and Heavy Runecloth Bandage (290) when eligible after Triage. Skip ranks already learned or not yet usable.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t58.61\t60.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying all four fish, turn in {q6607} to Nat Pagle to learn Artisan Fishing; skip if the quest was not taken.\nT\t\t6607\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t66.6\t45.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Theramore and bind for the island expedition.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Theramore Isle\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 50 before Alcaz Prison. If short, hunt isolated level 48-49 southern marsh wildlife, then return to the coast.\nX\t\t\t50\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t75.0\t14.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern coastline north to the mainland crossing toward Alcaz Island.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Alcaz Prison party with a tank and healer on the mainland coast. Swim to the western pier together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLand at Alcaz Island's western pier, then follow the island path north to the prison building with the party; keep clear of Doctor Weavil's hilltop compound.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Alcaz Prison together at 50+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot Zarla's Journal from Blazeroar for {q96772}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Alcaz Prison through its final boss, Blazeroar, then leave by the cleared entrance.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Theramore if ready; otherwise return together to the coast by the same crossing and follow the shore south.\nH\t\tHearth to Theramore Isle\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2641\t\nA\t\t2661\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2661\t\nA\t\t2662\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRemain with Marin until he finishes the elixir for {q2662}.\nC\t\t2662\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2662\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide south to Marvon before visiting Steamwheedle Port.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3444\t\nA\t\t3446\t\nA\t\t3447\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4787\t\nA\t\t3528\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1119\t\nA\t\t1121\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1121} to the Goblin Pit Boss with the Fool's Stout.\nT\t\t1121\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1122} and take Kravel's report for Booty Bay.\nA\t\t1122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gadgetzan and fly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western road and lakeshore to Dalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAlterac Mountains\t15.88\t73.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96772} to Archmage Lan'dalock.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to Southshore.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette, train Demon Armor IV, Immolate VI, Death Coil II, Curse of the Elements IV, Curse of Tongues II, Detect Invisibility III, Create Soulstone IV and Searing Pain V. Train eligible talented ranks. At Spackle nearby, buy and use Imp Blood Pact V, Voidwalker Torment V and Consume Shadows V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Cleave IV, Recklessness and Rend VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8417} from Wu Shen; keep it for the Sunken Temple journey.\nA\t\t8417\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Healing Stream Totem IV, Lightning Bolt IX, Searing Totem V and Windfury Weapon III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Kidney Shot II and Ambush V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Grace VI and Feedback IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Crippling Poison II (230 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Sloan McCoy.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Spirit III, Fade V, Flash Heal VI, Inner Fire V, Prayer of Healing III, Renew VIII and Shadow Word: Pain VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Desperate Prayer VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Starshards VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Chastise IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Contingency Plan IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Holy Wrath I, Consecration IV, Flash of Light V, Divine Shield II, Lay on Hands III, Seal of Righteousness VII, Seal of Fury VI, Seal of Light III and Devotion Aura VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Frostfire Bolt II, Conjure Water VI, Ice Armor III, Frostbolt IX and Cone of Cold IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Beast III, Distracting Shot V, Serpent Sting VII, Track Dragonkin and Volley II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Growl VI. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Healing Touch IX, Hurricane II, Mark of the Wild VI, Maul VI, Ravage III, Rebirth IV, Starfire V and Tranquility III. Learn Lacerate IV when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q9063} from the trainer; keep the introduction for Torwa Pathfinder.\nA\t\t9063\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.11\t74.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Hornbeam Seeds from Kyra Boucher for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t8419\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Felcloth at the Auction House for Impsy.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t60.39\t75.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Allison for the Temple return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Stormwind City\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Astranaar.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide east through Ashenvale, then take the road north into southern Felwood.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8460} from Grazle near the Emerald Sanctuary.\nA\t\t8460\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Deadwood Warriors, six Pathfinders and six Gardeners in the southern Deadwood camp for {q8460}.\nC\t\t8460\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8460\t\nA\t\t8462\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Unfriendly reputation with Timbermaw Hold; keep hunting southern Deadwood furbolgs if needed.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road north toward Talonbranch Glade.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t8419\t\nA\t\t8421\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t42.64\t47.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Bloodvenom Essence from Tainted Oozes at Bloodvenom Falls.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t48.7\t20.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north to Irontree Woods and collect ten Rotting Wood from Irontree Wanderers and Stompers for {q8421}; avoid the Withered Protector.\nC\t\t8421\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t8421\t\nA\t\t8422\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t62.49\t24.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east to Talonbranch Glade and collect its flight point before continuing north.\nP\t\tTalonbranch Glade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8462} to Nafien outside Timbermaw Hold.\nT\t\t8462\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Timbermaw Hold's tunnel to Moonglade; avoid fighting the Timbermaw furbolgs.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7066\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t48.1\t67.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Alliance flight point outside Nighthaven.\nP\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the portal into Darnassus.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q162}, then accept {q4493}; keep Gracina's introduction for Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.\nT\t\t162\t\nA\t\t4493\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q3764} from Staghelm for the Un'Goro journey.\nA\t\t3764\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.4\t94.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return through the portal to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat and follow the harbor road into the city.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Stormwind at 50+. Keep the Temple preparations and feather quest for the level-52 journey." },
  { name = "50-52 Un'Goro Crater (Alliance)", title = "50-52 Un'Goro Crater", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 50, hi = 52, next = "52-54 Felwood (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Torwa's quests, the Gorishi hive, crystal pylons and Marshal's Refuge rescues. Ends in Stormwind after the Darnassus reports and level-52 training.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind with level-50 training, March of the Silithid and Un'Goro Soil. Keep the soil quest for the Darnassus return.\nX\t\t\t50\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twenty Un'Goro Soil from dirt piles around the crater for {q3764}; keep these separate from Pestlezugg's five.\nC\t\t3764\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Mithril Casing for A-Me 01. Repair and restock; keep room for crystals, soil and the gorilla pelts.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4493\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4496\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4504\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide southwest through Tanaris to the crater's eastern descent. Follow the descending path; avoid jumping from the rim.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4289\t\nA\t\t4290\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q9063} to Torwa Pathfinder, then accept {q9052}.\nT\t\t9063\t\nA\t\t9052\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect eight Bloodcap from Bloodpetal creatures and eight Gorishi Stings from the hive insects for {q9052} during the crater circuit.\nC\t\t9052\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake a Piece of Threshadon Carcass from the Fresh Threshadon Carcass for {q4290}.\nC\t\t4290\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4290\t\nA\t\t4291\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStep near the ravasaur nests to draw out Lar'korwi Mates; collect two Pheromone Glands for {q4291}.\nC\t\t4291\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4291\t\nA\t\t4292\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead north through the eastern side of the crater, watching for Devilsaur patrols. Continue west along the northern wall to Marshal's Refuge.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t45.23\t5.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before entering the camp.\nP\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock at the camp.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4284\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3881\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3883\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3882\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4141\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect Bloodpetal Sprouts from the small sprout plants during the crater circuit; keep them for the Temple return.\nK\t\t11315\t3\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4503\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4243\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4492\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4501\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven of each Power Crystal color from deposits on the northern flats: red, blue, yellow and green for {q4284}.\nC\t\t4284\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4284\t\nA\t\t4285\t\nA\t\t4287\t\nA\t\t4288\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Northern Crystal Pylon for {q4285}.\nC\t\t4285\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t69.05\t17.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Fungal Rock through its cave mouth; have the Mithril Casing ready for A-Me 01.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Gorilla, two Stomper and two Thunderer pelts at Fungal Rock for {q4289}.\nC\t\t4289\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4243\t\nA\t\t4244\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4244} with the Mithril Casing.\nT\t\t4244\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4245\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort A-Me 01 out of Fungal Rock and back to Karna for {q4245}.\nC\t\t4245\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4245\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t47.08\t34.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Super Sticky Tar from Tar Beasts and Tar Creepers on the northern flats for {q4504}.\nC\t\t4504\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Bloodpetals from Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers on the northeastern flats for {q4141}.\nC\t\t4141\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t58.06\t33.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Dinosaur Bones and eight Webbed Diemetradon Scales from Young Diemetradons in the northeastern flats for {q3882} and {q4503}.\nC\t\t3882\t\t\nC\t\t4503\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Crate of Foodstuffs from the eastern expedition camp for {q3881}; keep the Research Equipment objective open.\nC\t\t3881\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t80.53\t39.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Webbed Pterrordax Scales from Fledgling Pterrordax along the eastern rim for {q4503}.\nC\t\t4503\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the eastern pylon platform and inspect it for {q4287}.\nC\t\t4287\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 51 before fighting Lar'korwi and the named enemies in the east. If needed, hunt Young Diemetradons in the northeastern flats.\nX\t\t\t51\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t79.65\t49.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tLar'korwi is a level 56 non-elite. Get help if needed. Use the Preserved Threshadon Meat and Pheromone Mixture at Lar'korwi's summoning site. Defeat Lar'korwi and take his head for {q4292}.\nC\t\t4292\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: LARKORWI_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q4291}, then accept {q4292}.\nT\t\t4291\t\nA\t\t4292\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: LARKORWI_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4292\t\nT\t\t4289\t\nA\t\t4301\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Gorishi Scent Gland from the southern hive's insects and five Un'Goro Soil from dirt piles for {q4496}. Keep another twenty soil for Jenal.\nC\t\t4496\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the hive and use the Scraping Vial in a chamber with hanging larvae for {q3883}. Leave by the cleared tunnels.\nC\t\t3883\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten ordinary Pterrordax along the southern rim for {q4501}.\nC\t\t4501\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Research Equipment from the southwestern camp for {q3881}.\nC\t\t3881\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Frenzied Pterrordax along the western rim for {q4501}.\nC\t\t4501\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q974} from Krakle.\nA\t\t974\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the western pylon platform and inspect it for {q4288}.\nC\t\t4288\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Fungal Rock's entrance for U'cha.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear to U'cha in the upper cave and take his pelt for {q4301}.\nC\t\t4301\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west to Marshal's Refuge for the ready rewards.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4503\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4141\t\nA\t\t4142\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4501\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3882\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3883\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3881\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4285\t\nT\t\t4288\t\nT\t\t4287\t\nA\t\t4321\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4321\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4504\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4496\t\nA\t\t4507\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 52 before the hive queen. If short, hunt the northern tar pits' Tar Beasts and Tar Creepers.\nX\t\t\t52\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide back down the eastern crater path and return to the Gorishi hive.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t43.85\t81.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Gorishi hive entrance, form a party for the Hive Queen; have the lure ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the queen's chamber through the hive tunnels. Use the Gorishi Queen Lure and defeat the guards and Hive Queen; loot her brain for {q4507}.\nC\t\t4507\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: LARKORWI\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t79.65\t49.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Use the Preserved Threshadon Meat and Pheromone Mixture at Lar'korwi's summoning site. Defeat Lar'korwi and take his head for {q4292}.\nC\t\t4292\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q4292}.\nT\t\t4292\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: LARKORWI\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Torwa and turn in {q4301}.\nT\t\t4301\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t9052\t\nA\t\t9051\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party for approaching a level 54-55 elite Devilsaur. Hibernate it and use the Devilsaur Barb for {q9051}; keep it controlled while withdrawing. The quest requires the test, not a kill.\nC\t\t9051\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Torwa and turn in {q9051}, then accept {q9053}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t9051\t\nA\t\t9053\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t49.69\t45.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Fire Plume Ridge by its path for the volcano objectives and Ringo's rescue.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Krakle's Thermometer at the hottest spot for {q974}, and collect nine Un'Goro Ash from the fire elementals for {q4502}.\nC\t\t974\t\t\nC\t\t4502\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Ringo after finishing the volcano objectives and turn in {q4492}.\nT\t\t4492\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4491\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLead Ringo down the path and north to Spraggle for {q4491}. Use Spraggle's Canteen whenever he faints.\nC\t\t4491\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4491\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn southwest to Krakle. Turn in {q974}, then accept {q980}; keep it for Donova Snowden in Winterspring.\nT\t\t974\t\nA\t\t980\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the refuge and fly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4507\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4508\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Feathermoon.\nF\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the mainland boat, then follow the road north toward the Twin Colossals to Gregan Brewspewer.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4142}, then accept {q4143}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t4142\t\nA\t\t4143\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south by road to the dock and take the Feathermoon boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Darnassus portal.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4508\t\nA\t\t4510\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDarnassus\t40.6\t82.13\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Elissa Dumas, learn Portal: Darnassus.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4510\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3764\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return through the portal to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat and follow the harbor road into the city.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t60.39\t75.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Allison. Repair and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Stormwind City\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette Cloyce, train Shadow Bolt VIII, Drain Soul IV, Health Funnel VI, Curse of Weakness VI and Shadow Ward III. Train eligible talented ranks.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Battle Shout VI, Intercept III and Shield Bash III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Fire Nova V, Flame Shock V, Lesser Healing Wave V, Strength of Earth Totem IV and Windfury Totem III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Backstab VII, Feint IV and Rupture V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Instant Poison V and Mind-numbing Poison III (240 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Devouring Plague V, Greater Heal III, Mind Blast VIII and Mind Soothe III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Greater Blessing of Might I, Blessing of Might VI, Exorcism V, Hammer of Wrath II, Holy Strike VII, Shadow Resistance Aura III, Turn Undead III and Seal of the Crusader VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t47.44\t82.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Symbols of Kings from Owen Vaughn for Greater Blessings.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Conjure Food VI and Blizzard V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aimed Shot V, Arcane Shot VII and Mend Pet VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Cower III, Demoralizing Roar V, Moonfire IX, Rejuvenation IX and Rip V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8151} from Ulfir Ironbeard in Stormwind.\nA\t\t8151\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8254} from Brother Joshua; buy one Ichor of Undeath at the Auction House for Ogtinc.\nA\t\t8254\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8250} from Maginor Dumas in the Mage Quarter.\nA\t\t8250\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8233} from Osborne the Night Man.\nA\t\t8233\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern Hillsbrad road and Ravenholdt's hillside path to the manor. Turn in {q8233}, then accept {q8234}.\nT\t\t8233\t\nA\t\t8234\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the hillside path and road to Southshore.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Theramore ship.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly from Theramore to Astranaar.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Ashenvale road east into Azshara, then continue to Talrendis Point.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t11.9\t77.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point.\nP\t\tTalrendis Point\t\nS\tHunter/Priest\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Ogtinc northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t8151\t\nA\t\t8153\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nT\t\t8254\t\nA\t\t8255\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8153}.\nC\t\t8153\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Healthy Courser Glands from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8255}.\nC\t\t8255\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ogtinc and turn in {q8153}, then accept {q8231}.\nT\t\t8153\t\nA\t\t8231\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ogtinc and turn in {q8255}, then accept {q8256}.\nT\t\t8255\t\nA\t\t8256\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8256} with the purchased Ichor of Undeath, then accept {q8257}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8256\t\nA\t\t8257\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Wavethrasher Scales from Wavethrashers on the eastern coast for {q8231}.\nC\t\t8231\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ogtinc and turn in {q8231}, then accept {q8232}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8231\t\nA\t\t8232\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Sealed Azure Bag from Timbermaw Shamans for {q8234}.\nC\t\t8234\t\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the hillside path to Sanath Lim-yo below Archmage Xylem's tower.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8250} to Sanath.\nT\t\t8250\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Archmage Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8251} from Xylem.\nA\t\t8251\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t8234\t\nA\t\t8235\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Nyrill for transport back down.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Glittering Dust from the Blood Elves for {q8251}.\nC\t\t8251\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Encoded Fragments from Forest Oozes for {q8235}.\nC\t\t8235\t\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sanath.\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nT\t\t8251\t\nA\t\t8252\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8235}, then accept {q8236}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8235\t\nA\t\t8236\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Nyrill for transport down, then collect six Enchanted Coral from Spitelash Sirens for {q8252}.\nC\t\t8252\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sanath.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8252}, then accept {q8253}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8252\t\nA\t\t8253\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Nyrill for transport back down.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the paths to Talrendis Point.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8415} from Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.\nA\t\t8415\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north through Alterac into the Western Plaguelands, then east to Chillwind Camp.\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.92\t85.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point.\nP\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5401}, then turn in {q5401} and equip the Argent Dawn Commission.\nA\t\t5401\t\nT\t\t5401\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8415} to Commander Ashlam Valorfist, then accept {q8414}.\nT\t\t8415\t\nA\t\t8414\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twenty Minion's Scourgestones from the Sorrow Hill undead while wearing the Commission for {q8414}.\nC\t\t8414\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tVisit High Priest Thel'danis at Caer Darrow and turn in {q8414}, then accept {q8416}.\nT\t\t8414\t\nA\t\t8416\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Commander Ashlam at Chillwind Camp. Turn in {q8416}, then accept {q8418}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8416\t\nA\t\t8418\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t" },
  { name = "52-54 Felwood (Alliance)", title = "52-54 Felwood", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 52, hi = 54, next = "54-55 Burning Steppes (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "One Sunken Temple clear at 52, northern Blasted Lands quests and the Jaedenar and northern Felwood circuits. Ends in Stormwind with Winterspring preparation.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind after the Un'Goro reports and training, with Stormwind bound for the Temple return. Keep the Temple preparations and completed northern deliveries.\nX\t\t\t52\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_TEMPLE_SHARED_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit the Atal'ai Exile in the southern Hinterlands and accept {q1446}. Return through Aerie Peak to Stormwind. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest.\nA\t\t1446\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Muigin at Marshal's Refuge and accept {q4141} before the Temple clear; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t4141\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect fifteen Bloodpetals from northeastern Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers for {q4141}.\nC\t\t4141\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Muigin, turn in {q4141} and accept {q4142}.\nT\t\t4141\t\nA\t\t4142\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Gregan Brewspewer near Feralas's Twin Colossals, turn in {q4142} and accept {q4143}. Collect three Bloodpetal Sprouts in Un'Goro for the return, then return through Ratchet and Booty Bay to Stormwind.\nT\t\t4142\t\nA\t\t4143\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_TEMPLE_SHARED_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_TEMPLE_CLASS_PREPARATION\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind and accept {q9063}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this chain.\nA\t\t9063\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Torwa Pathfinder in eastern Un'Goro, turn in {q9063} and accept {q9052}.\nT\t\t9063\t\nA\t\t9052\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect eight Bloodcap from Bloodpetals and eight Gorishi Stings from the hive insects for {q9052}.\nC\t\t9052\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Torwa, turn in {q9052} and accept {q9051}.\nT\t\t9052\t\nA\t\t9051\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Form a party to approach a level 54-55 elite Devilsaur. Hibernate it and use the Devilsaur Barb for {q9051}; withdraw while it is controlled.\nC\t\t9051\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Torwa, turn in {q9051} and accept {q9053}. Return through Gadgetzan to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t9051\t\nA\t\t9053\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Ulfir Ironbeard in Stormwind and accept {q8151}; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8151\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Ogtinc in Azshara, turn in {q8151} and accept {q8153}.\nT\t\t8151\t\nA\t\t8153\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8153}.\nC\t\t8153\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Ogtinc, turn in {q8153} and accept {q8231}.\nT\t\t8153\t\nA\t\t8231\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect six Wavethrasher Scales on Azshara's eastern coast for {q8231}.\nC\t\t8231\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Ogtinc, turn in {q8231} and accept {q8232}. Return through Talrendis Point, Ratchet and Booty Bay to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8231\t\nA\t\t8232\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Brother Joshua in Stormwind and accept {q8254}. Buy one Ichor of Undeath; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8254\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Ogtinc in Azshara, turn in {q8254} and accept {q8255}.\nT\t\t8254\t\nA\t\t8255\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect four Healthy Courser Glands from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8255}.\nC\t\t8255\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Ogtinc, turn in {q8255} and accept {q8256}.\nT\t\t8255\t\nA\t\t8256\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q8256} with the Ichor of Undeath and accept {q8257}. Return through Talrendis Point, Ratchet and Booty Bay to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8256\t\nA\t\t8257\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Osborne the Night Man in Stormwind and accept {q8233}; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8233\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Lord Jorach Ravenholdt in Hillsbrad, turn in {q8233} and accept {q8234}.\nT\t\t8233\t\nA\t\t8234\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Azshara and collect the Sealed Azure Bag from Timbermaw Shamans for {q8234}.\nC\t\t8234\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Take Sanath Lim-yo's transport to Xylem, turn in {q8234} and accept {q8235}. Use Nyrill's transport down.\nT\t\t8234\t\nA\t\t8235\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Encoded Fragments from Forest Oozes for {q8235}.\nC\t\t8235\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Sanath to Xylem, turn in {q8235} and accept {q8236}. Use Nyrill's transport down and return through Talrendis Point, Ratchet and Booty Bay to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8235\t\nA\t\t8236\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Maginor Dumas in Stormwind and accept {q8250}; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8250\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara and turn in {q8250}. Take his transport to Xylem and accept {q8251}, then use Nyrill's transport down.\nT\t\t8250\t\nA\t\t8251\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Glittering Dust from the Blood Elves for {q8251}.\nC\t\t8251\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Sanath to Xylem, turn in {q8251} and accept {q8252}. Use Nyrill's transport down.\nT\t\t8251\t\nA\t\t8252\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect six Enchanted Coral from Spitelash Sirens for {q8252}.\nC\t\t8252\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Sanath to Xylem, turn in {q8252} and accept {q8253}. Use Nyrill's transport down and return through Talrendis Point, Ratchet and Booty Bay to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8252\t\nA\t\t8253\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Duthorian Rall in Stormwind and accept {q8415}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this chain.\nA\t\t8415\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Chillwind Camp, accept {q5401}, turn in {q5401} and equip the Argent Dawn Commission before collecting Scourgestones.\nA\t\t5401\t\nT\t\t5401\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Commander Ashlam Valorfist, turn in {q8415} and accept {q8414}. Keep the Argent Dawn Commission equipped.\nT\t\t8415\t\nA\t\t8414\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect twenty Minion's Scourgestones from Sorrow Hill undead while wearing the Commission for {q8414}.\nC\t\t8414\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit High Priest Thel'danis at Caer Darrow, turn in {q8414} and accept {q8416}.\nT\t\t8414\t\nA\t\t8416\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Commander Ashlam, turn in {q8416} and accept {q8418}. Return to Stormwind before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8416\t\nA\t\t8418\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_TEMPLE_CLASS_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darkshire and ride through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows.\nF\t\tDarkshire\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road around Stonard to the Blasted Lands border and speak to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. Turn in {q8417}, then accept {q8423}.\nT\t\t8417\t\nA\t\t8423\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south into the Blasted Lands and kill seven level 52-53 Helboar on the northern plains for {q8423}.\nC\t\t8423\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north to the Fallen Hero. Turn in {q8423}, then accept {q8424}.\nT\t\t8423\t\nA\t\t8424\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tClear the northern and eastern camps: twenty Shadowsworn Adepts, ten Cultists and twenty Thugs for {q8424}.\nC\t\t8424\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to the Fallen Hero. Turn in {q8424}, then accept {q8425}; keep it for the Sunken Temple clear.\nT\t\t8424\t\nA\t\t8425\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t70.2\t45.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Pool of Tears and the temple's south-facing entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Sunken Temple party with a tank and healer ready for Eranikus. Keep the Egg of Hakkar, the two Marvon quests and Brohann's tablet quest.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSwim across and climb the stairs, then follow the interior passages down to the instance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Atal'ai Tablets while clearing the temple's outer passages with the party for {q1475}; follow the tunnels before entering the instance portal.\nC\t\t1475\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Sunken Temple together at 52+. Complete the lower statue circuit and the upper temple in this one clear.\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot two Amber, two Blue and two Green Voodoo Feathers from the six balcony defenders: Gasher, Zul'Lor, Hukku, Mijan, Zolo and Loro for {q8422}.\nC\t\t8422\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect two Amber, two Blue and two Green Voodoo Feathers from Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor and Loro during the balcony clear for {q8425}.\nC\t\t8425\t\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect two Amber, two Blue and two Green Voodoo Feathers from the six balcony defenders for {q8418}.\nC\t\t8418\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect five Atal'ai Haze from Deep Lurkers, Murk Worms and Saturated Oozes during the lower-ring clear for {q4143}.\nC\t\t4143\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the lower ring and activate its six statues in this order: south, north, southwest, southeast, northwest, northeast. Descend to the Pit of Refuse.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Atal'alarion, then inspect the Altar of Hakkar and the Idol of Hakkar.\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot the Putrid Vine from Atal'alarion for {q9053}.\nC\t\t9053\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3446\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3447\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish collecting five Atal'ai Haze from the lower passages for {q4143}, then continue to the upper ring and defeat all six balcony defenders to remove Jammal'an's barrier.\nC\t\t4143\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the dragonkin and defeat Jammal'an and Ogom with the party; loot Jammal'an's head for {q1446}. Finish the named dragon encounters before approaching Eranikus.\nC\t\t1446\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Tooth of Morphaz for {q8232}.\nC\t\t8232\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Azure Key for {q8236}.\nC\t\t8236\t\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Arcane Shard for {q8253}.\nC\t\t8253\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Blood of Morphaz for {q8257}.\nC\t\t8257\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hakkar's chamber, use the Egg of Hakkar to begin the ritual. Defeat the waves, use Hakkari Blood to extinguish the braziers, then defeat the Avatar of Hakkar. Loot the Essence of Hakkar and use it from your bags to fill the egg for {q3528}.\nC\t\t3528\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the Shade of Eranikus with the party to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you loot the Essence of Eranikus, use it to accept {q3373}.\nA\t\t3373\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you obtained the Essence, place it in the Essence Font in Eranikus's chamber and turn in {q3373}.\nT\t\t3373\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared temple and follow the road around Stonard to the Blasted Lands border.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road to the Fallen Hero at the Blasted Lands border, then turn in {q8425}. Choose and equip Diamond Flask; use it before demanding fights.\nT\t\t8425\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Bloodmage Drazial and Bloodmage Lynnore on the northern Blasted Lands road.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2581\t\nA\t\t2583\t\nA\t\t2585\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2601\t\nA\t\t2603\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Snickerfang Jowls from the northern hyenas.\nK\t\t8391\t5\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fourteen Vulture Gizzards from Black Slayers.\nK\t\t8396\t14\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Scorpok Pincers from Scorpok Stingers.\nK\t\t8393\t6\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Blasted Boar Lungs from Ashmane Boars.\nK\t\t8392\t6\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eleven Basilisk Brains from Redstone Basilisks.\nK\t\t8394\t11\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2581\t\nT\t\t2583\t\nT\t\t2585\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2601\t\nT\t\t2603\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north through the Swamp of Sorrows and Deadwind Pass to Darkshire.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road and hillside path to Ravenholdt.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8236} to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt.\nT\t\t8236\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the path and road to Southshore.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t65.53\t24.37\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise follow the road to Nethergarde Keep and fly. If already in Stormwind after the class detour, continue.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1475\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Aerie Peak.\nF\t\tAerie Peak\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern Hinterlands road to the Atal'ai Exile.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1446\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to Aerie Peak.\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Chillwind Camp.\nF\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\tHuman Paladin/Dwarf Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8418} to Commander Ashlam Valorfist.\nT\t\t8418\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan for Yeh'kinya.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3528\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5065} from Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port; keep the tablet search for the level-58 Plaguelands journey.\nA\t\t5065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Marshal's Refuge.\nF\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4143\t\nA\t\t4144\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4144} with the reserved Bloodpetal Sprouts.\nT\t\t4144\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern crater paths to Torwa.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t9053\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the eastern path to Marshal's Refuge.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\tHunter/Mage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Azshara for the class rewards.\nF\t\tTalrendis Point\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8232} to Ogtinc.\nT\t\t8232\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Sanath.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8253} to Archmage Xylem.\nT\t\t8253\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Nyrill for transport down.\nS\tHunter/Mage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the paths to Talrendis Point.\nS\tHunter/Mage\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gadgetzan and fly to Astranaar.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Ashenvale road east and take the northern road into Felwood. Visit the Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8257} to Greta Mosshoof at the Emerald Sanctuary.\nT\t\t8257\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4101\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4421\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5155\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5156\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eleven Jadefire Felsworns in the southern satyr camp for {q4421}.\nC\t\t4421\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t37.37\t66.1\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north, then the western trail into the second Jadefire camp. Kill nine Rogues and nine Shadowstalkers there.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Xavathras for {q4421}.\nC\t\t4421\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the outer Jaedenar camps: four Hounds, four Guardians, six Adepts and six Cultists for {q5155}.\nC\t\t5155\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4421\t\nA\t\t4906\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5155\t\nA\t\t5157\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the Empty Canteen at the Jaedenar Moonwell for {q5157}.\nC\t\t5157\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8422}. Choose the Abyss Shard for its lasting Voidwalker summon utility; keep the trinket.\nT\t\t8422\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Niby and Impsy beside Bloodvenom Falls, then accept {q7601}.\nA\t\t7601\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7601\t\nA\t\t7602\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFelwood\t36.23\t45.87\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t65.96\t16.48\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t57.73\t50.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep one checklist of the three Flawless Fel Essences; collect them during the Shadow Hold, Blasted Lands and Azshara circuits.\nK\t\t18624\t1\t\t\nK\t\t18622\t1\t\t\nK\t\t18623\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill two Entropic Beasts and two Entropic Horrors in Shatter Scar Vale; explore the corrupted pools for {q5156}.\nC\t\t5156\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 53 before the northern satyr camps.\nX\t\t\t53\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a small party for Xavaric and his guards. Defeat Xavaric for {q4906}. Loot his Flute of Xavaric and use it to accept {q939}.\nC\t\t4906\t4\t\nA\t\t939\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect five Jadefire Felbind samples from the Jadefire satyrs for {q939} during this camp clear.\nC\t\t939\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Jadefire Hellcallers for {q4906}.\nC\t\t4906\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Jadefire Betrayers for {q4906}.\nC\t\t4906\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Jadefire Tricksters for {q4906}.\nC\t\t4906\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south along the main road to Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5156\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5249\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4906\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t939\t\nA\t\t4441\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5157\t\nA\t\t5158\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south to Astranaar and fly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5158\t\nA\t\t5159\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village and take the Darnassus portal.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Eridan's Vial in the Temple of the Moon pool for {q4441}.\nC\t\t4441\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Astranaar and follow the road north to Emerald Sanctuary.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5159\t\nA\t\t5165\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4441\t\nA\t\t4442\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4442}; keep the Flute of the Ancients for Arei.\nT\t\t4442\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 54 before the northern escort and Shadow Hold.\nX\t\t\t54\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north to Irontree Woods. Collect fifteen Blood Amber from Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders for {q4101}; avoid Dessecus.\nC\t\t4101\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Flute of the Ancients near Irontree Woods' southern ruins to summon Arei.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the nearby approach and accept {q4261} when ready for the escort.\nA\t\t4261\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tProtect Arei north to the road and defeat the ambush for {q4261}.\nC\t\t4261\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8461} from Nafien near Timbermaw Hold.\nA\t\t8461\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Deadwood Den Watchers, six Avengers and six Shamans for {q8461}; return to Nafien.\nC\t\t8461\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8461}, then accept {q8465}; keep Salfa's introduction for the Winterspring passage.\nT\t\t8461\t\nA\t\t8465\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReach Unfriendly reputation with Timbermaw Hold again if needed after the Azshara quest; continue killing Deadwood furbolgs here until ready for the tunnel.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the known Talonbranch Glade flight point, then ride north to Emerald Sanctuary from Astranaar.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4101\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_FELWOOD_EARLIER_HANDOFFS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Form a small party for Xavaric and his guards and defeat him for {q4906}.\nC\t\t4906\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Emerald Sanctuary and turn in {q4906}, {q5157} and {q5156}.\nT\t\t4906\t\nT\t\t5157\t\nT\t\t5156\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q5249} from Kelek Skykeeper.\nA\t\t5249\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_FELWOOD_EARLIER_HANDOFFS\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t35.45\t59.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the western Jaedenar trail to Shadow Hold's entrance. Form a five-player party with a tank and healer for the deep chambers and Shadow Lord Fel'dan.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnel ramps and use the Purified Moon Well Water to extinguish all four braziers for {q5165}.\nC\t\t5165\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Felwood Flawless Fel Essence from Jaedenar Legionnaires during this Shadow Hold outing; keep it for Impsy.\nK\t\t18624\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared approach and return together to Greta at Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5165\t\nA\t\t5242\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Shadow Hold with the party. Defeat Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan in the chamber beyond Rakaiah, and loot Fel'dan's head for {q5242}. Stop there; avoid the deeper demon rooms.\nC\t\t5242\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared tunnels and return to Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5242\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Ashenvale road east to Forest Song.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4261} to Kayneth Stillwind.\nT\t\t4261\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.41\t47.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return west by road to Astranaar and fly to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat and follow the harbor road into the city.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette, train Corruption VI, Drain Life VI, Drain Mana IV, Hellfire III and Howl of Terror II. At Spackle nearby (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Fire Shield V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Demoralizing Shout V, Hamstring III, Revenge V and Slam V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Garrote VI and Sinister Strike VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Deadly Poison IV (250 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Holy Fire VII, Power Word: Shield IX and Smite VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Greater Blessing of Wisdom I, Blessing of Wisdom V, Hammer of Justice IV, Holy Light VIII and Blessing of Sacrifice II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Fireball X, Fire Blast VII and Frost Nova IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Explosive Trap III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Great Stamina IX, Natural Armor IX. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Faerie Fire IV, Rake IV, Regrowth VIII, Shred V, Soothe Animal III, Swipe V, Thorns VI and Wrath VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions. Keep The New Springs, Speak to Salfa and To Winterspring! for the next northern journey.\nV\t\tvendor\t" },
  { name = "54-55 Burning Steppes (Alliance)", title = "54-55 Burning Steppes", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 54, hi = 55, next = "55-56 Western Plaguelands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Morgan's Vigil, the Firegut and dragonkin circuits, Windsor's trail and Blackrock Depths preparation. Ends in Ironforge with Winterspring preparation.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind after Felwood.\nX\t\t\t54\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Chain Heal III, Frost Resistance Totem III, Rockbiter Weapon VII and Stoneskin Totem VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Kharanos.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos, then accept {q4126}; keep his recipe errand for the Grim Guzzler.\nA\t\t4126\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ironforge. Buy twelve Relic Coffer Keys at the Auction House for the vault, then fly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north along the road into the Burning Steppes. Follow the southern road east to Morgan's Vigil.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.33\t68.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before climbing to the camp.\nP\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3823\t\nA\t\t4283\t\nA\t\t4286\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4182\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4262\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.24\t24.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel northwest to the neutral goblins at Flame Crest; keep clear of the Horde flightmaster.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4726\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4296\t\nA\t\t4123\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4136\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t86.92\t30.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the dragonkin hunting grounds, form a party for Dragonkin Menace and the Broodling Essence.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on Black Broodlings before killing them and collect eight Broodling Essence from the crystals they leave. Kill fifteen Black Broodlings, ten Black Dragonspawn, four Black Wyrmkin and one Black Drake with the party for {q4182} and {q4726}.\nC\t\t4182\t\t\nC\t\t4726\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue east to Cyrus's cave at Slither Rock. Keep the Black Dragonflight Molt from the Searing Gorge chest ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4022\t\nT\t\t4022\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4024\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t80.18\t42.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn southwest to Dreadmaul Rock, then follow its ramps between levels. Kill fifteen Firegut Ogre Mages, seven Ogres and seven Brutes for {q3823}.\nC\t\t3823\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Morgan's Vigil. Turn in {q3823}, then accept {q3824}.\nT\t\t3823\t\nA\t\t3824\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4182\t\nA\t\t4183\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west toward the Blackrock orc camps.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifty Blackrock Medallions from the Blackrock orcs for {q4283}.\nC\t\t4283\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tablet Transcript from the Tablet of the Seven at the Ruins of Thaurissan for {q4296}.\nC\t\t4296\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Gor'tesh and take his head for {q3824}.\nC\t\t3824\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Blackrock Mountain. Descend the central chains to the rock tomb, take the lower chain to the quarry and follow the path toward Blackrock Depths.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the quarry approach, form a party for Overmaster Pyron.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Overmaster Pyron in the exterior quarry passages for {q4262}, then return to Morgan's Vigil.\nC\t\t4262\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4262\t\nA\t\t4263\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_DRAGONKIN_MENACE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Morgan's Vigil, turn in {q4182}, then accept {q4183}.\nT\t\t4182\t\nA\t\t4183\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_DRAGONKIN_MENACE\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4283\t\nT\t\t3824\t\nA\t\t3825\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4183\t\nA\t\t4184\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4184\t\nA\t\t4185\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Lady Katrana Prestor for {q4185}, then return to Bolvar for his answer.\nC\t\t4185\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4185\t\nA\t\t4186\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Nethergarde Keep.\nF\t\tNethergarde Keep\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t57.73\t50.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Blasted Lands Flawless Fel Essence from Felguard Sentries; keep clear of the Dark Portal and stronger demons.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Nethergarde and fly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4186\t\nA\t\t4223\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Morgan's Vigil.\nF\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4223\t\nA\t\t4224\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t81.0\t46.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Dreadmaul Rock's ramps and plant the head at the Soft Dirt Mound on top for {q3825}.\nC\t\t3825\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide to the neutral Flame Crest cave.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4296\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4726\t\nA\t\t4808\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Ragged John and hear his complete account of Windsor for {q4224}.\nC\t\t4224\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Morgan's Vigil.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3825\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4224\t\nA\t\t4241\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.33\t68.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 55 before the Plaguelands journey. If needed, hunt Firegut ogres and return to repair.\nX\t\t\t55\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Morgan's Vigil and fly to Ironforge. Keep the Blackrock Depths quests for the level-56 clear.\nF\t\tIronforge\t" },
  { name = "55-56 Western Plaguelands (Alliance)", title = "55-56 Western Plaguelands", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 55, hi = 56, next = "56-57 Winterspring (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "The four Scourge cauldrons, Andorhal and the wildlife quests, then one complete Blackrock Depths clear at 56. Ends at Talonbranch Glade for Winterspring.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Ironforge. Fly to Southshore and ride north through Alterac, then east across the southern Western Plaguelands road to Chillwind Camp; keep clear of the Bulwark.\nX\t\t\t55\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.92\t85.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before the camp sweep.\nP\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5401}; equip the Argent Dawn Commission while fighting Scourge in the Plaguelands.\nA\t\t5401\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5401\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5092\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5343}; keep the four-deed quest for Scholomance.\nA\t\t5343\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Skeletal Flayers and ten Slavering Ghouls at Sorrow Hill for {q5092}.\nC\t\t5092\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5092\t\nA\t\t5097\t\nA\t\t5215\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5215\t\nA\t\t5216\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Cauldron Lord Bilemaw, loot his key and take a sample at the Felstone Field Cauldron for {q5216}.\nC\t\t5216\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5216\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5217\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Andorhal's western approach, clear each tower doorway before using the Beacon Torch.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Chromie in the ruined inn at Andorhal, then accept {q4971}.\nA\t\t4971\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Temporal Displacer beside the silos and kill ten revealed Temporal Parasites for {q4971}.\nC\t\t4971\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4971\t\nA\t\t4972\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Andorhal Watches from the lockboxes in the city rubble for {q4972}.\nC\t\t4972\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4972\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5097}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5097\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5097}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5097\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5097}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5097\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5097}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5097\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5217\t\nA\t\t5219\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5097\t\nA\t\t211\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Cauldron Lord Malvinious, take his key and sample Dalson's Tears Cauldron for {q5219}.\nC\t\t5219\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5219\t\nA\t\t5220\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead Mrs. Dalson's Diary in the barn. Accept {q5058}, then turn in {q5058}.\nA\t\t5058\t\nT\t\t5058\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the Wandering Skeleton around the farm and loot the Dalson Outhouse Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the outhouse behind the farmhouse, accept {q5059}, then turn in {q5059} to unlock the door.\nA\t\t5059\t\nT\t\t5059\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the released Farmer Dalson and loot the Dalson Cabinet Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOpen the Locked Cabinet upstairs in the farmhouse. Accept {q5060}, then turn in {q5060}.\nA\t\t5060\t\nT\t\t5060\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5220\t\nA\t\t5222\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4984\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Diseased Wolves across the Western Plaguelands for {q4984}.\nC\t\t4984\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4984\t\nA\t\t4985\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Diseased Grizzlies along the eastern and northern farm trails for {q4985}.\nC\t\t4985\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4985\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4986\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern farm trails to Kirsta Deepshadow, south of Hearthglen. Accept {q6004}.\nA\t\t6004\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill two Scarlet Medics, two Hunters, two Magi and two Knights in the Scarlet camps south and southeast of Kirsta for {q6004}; keep clear of Hearthglen's elite guards.\nC\t\t6004\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Kirsta. Turn in {q6004}, then accept {q6023}.\nT\t\t6004\t\nA\t\t6023\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party for the guarded Scarlet positions. Defeat Huntsman Radley near the road and Cavalier Durgen at the northern tower for {q6023}; avoid Hearthglen's gate.\nC\t\t6023\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Kirsta. Turn in {q6023}, then accept {q6025}; keep the tower reconnaissance for the later Scarlet Illusion visit.\nT\t\t6023\t\nA\t\t6025\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Cauldron Lord Razarch, take his key and sample the Writhing Haunt Cauldron for {q5222}.\nC\t\t5222\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5222\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5223\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5223\t\nA\t\t5225\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Gahrron's Withering. Defeat Cauldron Lord Soulwrath, take his key and sample the cauldron for {q5225}.\nC\t\t5225\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5225\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5226\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5226\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5237\t\nT\t\t5237\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.92\t85.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 56 before leaving for training; if needed, hunt Diseased Wolves or northern Scarlet camps then return to Chillwind.\nX\t\t\t56\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t50.35\t5.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Briarthorn, train Fear III, Life Tap VI, Curse of Recklessness IV and Soul Fire II. At Jubahl Corpseseeker (52.70,6.08), buy and use Voidwalker Sacrifice VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.34\t90.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kelv Sternhammer, learn Execute V, Heroic Strike VIII and Mocking Blow V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Chain Lightning IV, Flametongue Weapon VI, Grace of Air Totem II, Healing Wave IX, Lightning Bolt X, Lightning Shield VII, Magma Totem IV, Mana Spring Totem IV and Windwall Totem III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Expose Armor V and Eviscerate VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t51.96\t14.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Wound Poison IV (260 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t24.73\t8.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priest Rohan, learn Flash Heal VII, Mana Burn V, Psychic Scream IV, Renew IX, Shadow Protection III and Shadow Word: Death IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t23.13\t6.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Brandur Ironhammer, learn Retribution Aura V and Frost Resistance Aura III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tome of Arcane Brilliance at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t27.25\t8.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bink, learn Arcane Intellect V, Frostbolt X, Arcane Missiles VII and Flamestrike VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t31.32\t27.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Arcane Powder from Ginny Longberry for Arcane Brilliance once learned. Replenish your teleport and portal runes.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.89\t83.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Olmin Burningbeard, learn Aspect of the Wild II, Immolation Trap V, Raptor Strike VIII and Viper Sting III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for Druid training.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Ferocious Bite V, Healing Touch X and Pounce III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire and bind before continuing to Blackrock Mountain.\nF\t\tLakeshire\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t21.92\t44.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind at the inn for the Depths return; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Morgan's Vigil.\nF\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through Blackrock Mountain's chains and quarry to the instance portal.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Blackrock Depths portal, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for the full clear; arrange a member with the Shadowforge Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Blackrock Depths together at 56+. Clear the prison and lower city before the upper halls.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twenty Dark Iron Fanny Packs during this clear.\nK\t\t11468\t20\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat High Interrogator Gerstahn and loot the prison key. Unlock Marshal Windsor's cell and speak to him, then turn in {q4241}.\nT\t\t4241\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q4242}; keep Windsor's message for Maxwell after the clear.\nA\t\t4242\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Bael'Gar and use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on his remains to capture the Fiery Essence for {q4024}.\nC\t\t4024\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear the Ring of Law, then reach Fineous Darkvire and Lord Incendius through the city. Defeat Incendius for {q4263}.\nC\t\t4263\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear the vault approach. Open the twelve Relic Coffers with your keys, defeat the activated defenders and Watchman Doomgrip, then click the separate Heart of the Mountain beside the Secret Safe for {q4123}.\nC\t\t4123\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHave the key carrier open the Shadowforge route. Continue through General Angerforge and Golem Lord Argelmach to the Grim Guzzler.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBefore fighting in the bar, buy six Dark Iron Ale Mugs from Plugger Spazzring. Give Private Rocknot pairs of mugs until he opens the rear door; stay clear of the exploding kegs and defeat Phalanx when hostile.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tSpeak to Ribbly and defeat his group and take his head for {q4136}.\nC\t\t4136\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tBreak the Thunderbrew Lager Kegs in the side room to draw out Hurley Blackbreath; defeat him and loot the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe for {q4126}.\nC\t\t4126\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Ambassador Flamelash and the Summoners' Tomb. Clear the Lyceum together; take torches from Flamekeepers and light both braziers to open the way.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Magmus, then Emperor Dagran Thaurissan with the party. Spare Princess Moira; control her healing while the tank holds the Emperor.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Blackrock Mountain by the Burning Steppes exit and ride to the neutral Flame Crest camp, then Cyrus's cave for the ready rewards.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4136\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4123\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4024\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire if ready, then fly to Morgan's Vigil. Otherwise ride south to Morgan's Vigil.\nH\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4242\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4263\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4286\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge, then visit Kharanos.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4126\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ironforge. Repair and restock; keep Felnok Steelspring, Speak to Salfa and To Winterspring!.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Astranaar.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Ashenvale road east into Azshara and continue to Talrendis Point.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t11.9\t77.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Alliance flight point.\nP\t\tTalrendis Point\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q92345} from Commander Truesong.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Darnassus portal.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4986\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q92345} to Mathrengyl Bearwalker, then accept {q92344}; keep it for Blackmaw Hold.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.4\t94.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Talonbranch Glade.\nF\t\tTalonbranch Glade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Winterspring deliveries, Get to the Roots of It, Unfinished Business and Barov Family Fortune." },
  { name = "56-57 Winterspring (Alliance)", title = "56-57 Winterspring", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 56, hi = 57, next = "57-58 Feralas (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Starfall and Everlook, Umi's yeti work, the southern wildkin, one Blackmaw Hold clear. Ends at Feathermoon.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at Talonbranch Glade with The New Springs, To Winterspring! and Speak to Salfa.\nX\t\t\t56\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Felwood's main road into Timbermaw Hold and take its Moonglade branch; avoid fighting Timbermaw furbolgs.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5527} from Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven.\nA\t\t5527\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through Timbermaw Hold and take its Winterspring branch.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8465\t\nA\t\t8464\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_NEW_SPRINGS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: If missing The New Springs, visit Krakle in Un'Goro and accept {q974}.\nA\t\t974\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Climb Fire Plume Ridge by its path and use Krakle's Thermometer at the hottest spot for {q974}.\nC\t\t974\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Krakle, turn in {q974} and accept {q980}. Return through Gadgetzan, Felwood and Timbermaw Hold to Donova in Winterspring.\nT\t\t974\t\nA\t\t980\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_NEW_SPRINGS\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t980\t\nA\t\t5082\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5249\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4861\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue east by the road to Everlook.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3783\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t62.33\t36.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Alliance flight point.\nP\t\tEverlook\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4808\t\nA\t\t4809\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t61.36\t38.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Vizzie; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6028\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6030\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t64.05\t39.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Thick Yeti Furs from the Ice Thistle Yetis on the outer slopes for {q3783}.\nC\t\t3783\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3783\t\nA\t\t977\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Ice Thistle cave; collect two Pristine Yeti Horns from Matriarchs and Patriarchs for {q977}.\nC\t\t977\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Everlook if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared cave entrance and follow the road back to town.\nH\t\tHearth to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t977\t\nA\t\t5163\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Legacki in Everlook for {q5163}; keep the toy for Sprinkle and Quixxil.\nC\t\t5163\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Winterfall Shamans, eight Den Watchers and eight Ursa around Winterfall Village for {q8464}.\nC\t\t8464\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Uncracked Chillwind Horns from the Chillwind chimaeras for {q4809}.\nC\t\t4809\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south. Stop at Jaron's wrecked camp before going deeper into the southern valley.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4861\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4863\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4863\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4864\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t61.41\t60.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Jaron's Supplies from the snow beside the wagon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Blue-feathered Amulet from the Crazed Owlbeasts for {q4864}.\nC\t\t4864\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Everlook if ready; otherwise return by the southern road.\nH\t\tHearth to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4809\t\nA\t\t4810\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4864\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the remaining Winterfall furbolgs in the western camps for {q5082}.\nC\t\t5082\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5082\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8464\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Everlook if ready; otherwise follow the road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Astranaar.\nF\t\tAstranaar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Ashenvale road east into Azshara and continue to Talrendis Point.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V108_BLACKMAW_ROOTS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Blackmaw Hold clear, take Talrendis Point's flight point and accept {q92345} from Commander Truesong. If the clear is already behind you, skip this chain instead of repeating the dungeon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Fly to Rut'theran Village and take the Darnassus portal. Turn in {q92345} to Mathrengyl Bearwalker, then accept {q92344}. Return through the portal and fly back to Talrendis Point.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V108_BLACKMAW_ROOTS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the high ground north of the Ruins of Eldarath and accept {q92069} from Ogtinc.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3601\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSearch the Thalassian Base Camp's Equipment boxes and collect Kim'jael's four belongings for {q3601}.\nC\t\t3601\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3601\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Azshara Flawless Fel Essence from Legashi Satyrs for {q7602}.\nC\t\t7602\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t38.6\t33.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 57 before Blackmaw Hold. If needed, hunt Legashi Satyrs then reach the northern gate.\nX\t\t\t57\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Blackmaw Hold party with a tank and healer. Follow the northern gate's tunnel into the mountain together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Blackmaw Hold together at 57+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Nordrassil Root Caps during the clear for {q92344}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot Withermaw's Claws of the Great Bear and Bonesnout the Unbroken's Tusks of the Unbroken for {q92069}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Blackmaw Hold through Varrox Bleakhoof, then leave by the cleared approach.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t42.4\t42.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the high ground to Ogtinc and turn in {q92069}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the high ground and main road to Talrendis Point.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Talonbranch Glade.\nF\t\tTalonbranch Glade\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tRide south by Felwood's main road to Impsy.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7602\t\nA\t\t7603\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReach Kroshius's remains and form a party for Kroshius.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Fel Fire at Kroshius's remains, defeat the awakened infernal with the party and take the Infernal Core for {q7603}.\nC\t\t7603\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tComplete Niby's demonstration, then turn in {q7603} to learn Inferno.\nT\t\t7603\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north by the main road to Talonbranch Glade.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village.\nF\t\tRut'theran Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Darnassus portal and turn in {q92344} to Mathrengyl Bearwalker.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.4\t94.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the portal to Rut'theran Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Feathermoon.\nF\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep Felnok's package, the Everlook reports, Umi's Mechanical Yeti and Barov Family Fortune." },
  { name = "57-58 Feralas (Alliance)", title = "57-58 Feralas", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 57, hi = 58, next = "58-59 Eastern Plaguelands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "The Cenarion Hold circuit and Dire Maul preparation, one Dire Maul East clear, then level-58 training. Ends in Stormwind.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at Feathermoon after Blackmaw Hold.\nX\t\t\t57\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before the Silithus preparation.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7488\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7482\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t31.3\t43.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Vivianna, buy and use Recipe: Lobster Stew, Recipe: Baked Salmon and Recipe: Mightfish Steak when eligible at 275 Cooking. Skip recipes already learned or not yet usable.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_RELIQUARY_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Dire Maul East clear, visit Rabine Saturna in Moonglade and accept {q5527}. Return to Feralas before the Silithus journey. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-up.\nA\t\t5527\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_RELIQUARY_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Sprinkle for {q5163}; keep it for Quixxil.\nC\t\t5163\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Marshal's Refuge.\nF\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide west through Un'Goro's western pass into Silithus, then follow the road to Cenarion Hold.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSilithus\t50.58\t34.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before entering the hold.\nP\t\tCenarion Hold\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8284\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSilithus\t51.89\t39.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Calandrath; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Cenarion Hold\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Twilight Tablet Fragments from the Twilight Tablet piles in the Crystal Vale for {q8284}.\nC\t\t8284\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8284\t\nA\t\t8285\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8285\t\nA\t\t8279\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 3 from this Twilight Keeper camp for {q8279}.\nC\t\t8279\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 1 from this Twilight Keeper camp for {q8279}.\nC\t\t8279\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 2 from this Twilight Keeper camp for {q8279}.\nC\t\t8279\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern desert trail to Hermit Ortell.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8279\t\nA\t\t8287\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Reliquary of Purity from the Dusty Reliquary in Southwind Village's northern lodge for {q5527}; the spirits can release insects when defeated.\nC\t\t5527\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Cenarion Hold if ready; otherwise return north by the desert trail.\nH\t\tHearth to Cenarion Hold\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8287\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Moonglade.\nF\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5527} to Rabine Saturna, then accept {q5526}.\nT\t\t5527\t\nA\t\t5526\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Feralas.\nF\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t30.97\t43.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Shyria. Repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Feathermoon Stronghold\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the mainland boat to the Forgotten Coast, follow the road east around Camp Mojache to Azj'Tordin at Lariss Pavilion and accept {q7441}.\nA\t\t7441\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path into Dire Maul's central courtyard. At the eastern entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Dire Maul East.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul East together at 57+. Speak to Pusillin and follow him through the wing; clear each passage before advancing to his next position.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Pusillin at his final platform. Loot Azj'Tordin's book and the Crescent Key for {q7441}.\nC\t\t7441\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear Lethtendris and Pimgib; loot Lethtendris's Web for {q7488}.\nC\t\t7488\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Hydrospawn and Zevrim Thornhoof. Speak to Old Ironbark after Zevrim's defeat and follow him to the final courtyard.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Alzzin the Wildshaper and his reinforcements.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect a Felvine Shard and seal it in the Reliquary of Purity for {q5526} before leaving.\nC\t\t5526\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Emerald Dream during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7506}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18364\t\nA\t\t7506\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Greatest Race of Hunters during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7503} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18361\t\nA\t\t7503\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Light and How to Swing It during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7501} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18359\t\nA\t\t7501\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7504} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18362\t\nA\t\t7504\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7498} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18356\t\nA\t\t7498\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Codex of Defense during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7499}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18357\t\nA\t\t7499\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Arcanist's Cookbook during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7500}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18358\t\nA\t\t7500\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Frost Shock and You during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7505}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18363\t\nA\t\t7505\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Harnessing Shadows during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7502}; keep it for the library visit.\nA\t\t7502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared entrance to Lariss Pavilion.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7441\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon if ready; otherwise return to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the island boat.\nH\t\tHearth to Feathermoon Stronghold\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7488\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SILITHUS_AND_SPRINKLE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Gadgetzan and use Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Sprinkle for {q5163}.\nC\t\t5163\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Reach Cenarion Hold through Marshal's Refuge and accept {q8284}.\nA\t\t8284\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect eight Twilight Tablet Fragments in the Crystal Vale for {q8284}.\nC\t\t8284\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Cenarion Hold, turn in {q8284} and accept {q8285}.\nT\t\t8284\t\nA\t\t8285\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q8285} to Geologist Larksbane, then accept {q8279}.\nT\t\t8285\t\nA\t\t8279\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect Twilight Lexicon Chapters 1, 2 and 3 from the Twilight Keeper camps for {q8279}.\nC\t\t8279\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Hermit Ortell, turn in {q8279} and accept {q8287}.\nT\t\t8279\t\nA\t\t8287\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Cenarion Hold and turn in {q8287}.\nT\t\t8287\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SILITHUS_AND_SPRINKLE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Moonglade.\nF\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5526} to Rabine Saturna.\nT\t\t5526\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 58 before training and the Plaguelands journey.\nX\t\t\t58\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette, train Bane of Agony VI, Death Coil III, Rain of Fire IV and Searing Pain VI. At Spackle nearby, buy and use Imp Firebolt VII and Voidwalker Consume Shadows VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Pummel II, Sunder Armor V and Thunder Clap VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Fire Resistance Totem III, Flametongue Totem IV, Frost Shock IV, Frostbrand Weapon V and Stoneclaw Totem VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Sprint III, Kick IV and Ambush VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Divine Grace VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Greater Heal IV, Mind Blast IX, Mind Control III, Resurrection V and Shadow Word: Pain VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Desperate Prayer VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tNightElf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Starshards VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Flash of Light VI, Seal of Fury VII, Seal of Righteousness VIII and Seal of Wisdom III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Conjure Mana Ruby, Mage Armor III and Cone of Cold V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Hawk VI, Hunter's Mark IV, Mongoose Bite IV, Serpent Sting VIII and Volley III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Nature's Grasp VI, Entangling Roots VI, Hibernate III, Maul VII, Moonfire X, Ravage IV, Rejuvenation X and Starfire VI. Learn Lacerate V when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t60.39\t75.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Allison. Keep Felnok's package, the Everlook reports, Umi's toy and the four-deed quest.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Stormwind City\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Crescent Key and the Telmius search for the level-59 Dire Maul North visit." },
  { name = "58-59 Eastern Plaguelands (Alliance)", title = "58-59 Eastern Plaguelands", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 58, hi = 59, next = "59-60 Un'Goro Crater (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "Lower Blackrock Spire, the Darrowshire investigation and Stratholme Living at 59, then Dire Maul North. Ends at Feathermoon.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Stormwind after Dire Maul East and the Cenarion Hold circuit. Keep the four-deed quest, Umi's toy, Felnok's package and the two Everlook reports.\nX\t\t\t58\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MOSHARU_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Lower Blackrock Spire clear, visit Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port and accept {q5065}. Return through Ratchet and Booty Bay to Stormwind before the Plaguelands journey. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-up.\nA\t\t5065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MOSHARU_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Chillwind Camp.\nF\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east into the Eastern Plaguelands.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the roads to Zul'Mashar's approach and form a party for the guarded tablet search.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the approach and stairs, then recover the Third Mosh'aru Tablet at the top of the ziggurat and the Fourth at its base for {q5065}. Avoid walking over the graves.\nC\t\t5065\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the cleared approach and Plaguelands roads to Chillwind Camp.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Theramore ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide east to Steamwheedle Port. Turn in {q5065} to Prospector Ironboot, then accept {q4788}.\nT\t\t5065\t\nA\t\t4788\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.24\t37.72\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Jenova Stoneshield for the Bloodaxe Worg tame; keep a free stable slot and suitable pet food. Include the tame when arranging the Lower Blackrock Spire clear.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4766\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Morgan's Vigil.\nF\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4766\t\nA\t\t4764\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4701\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide to the neutral goblins at Flame Crest.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4810\t\nA\t\t4734\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4729\t\nA\t\t4862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west into Blackrock Mountain; take the ramp and chain to the Spire balcony and reach the portal. Join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Lower Blackrock Spire and the outer Quartermaster.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Lower Blackrock Spire together at 58+. Take the descending route to the lower wing.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Warosh near the entrance and read his scroll, then accept {q4867}.\nA\t\t4867\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Highlord Omokk and loot Omokk's Head. Collect the Roughshod Pike at the ogre area for Urok's challenge.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Bijou and accept {q5001} before continuing the search for her belongings.\nA\t\t5001\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Spire Spider Eggs in the spider passages for {q4862}.\nC\t\t4862\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Mother Smolderweb, then clear the path to Urok's platform. Place the Roughshod Pike and Omokk's Head at Urok's Tribute Pile; defeat the waves and Urok Doomhowl and collect Warosh's Mojo for {q4867}.\nC\t\t4867\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFind Bijou's Belongings in the lower chambers for {q5001}, then return them to her before leaving the wing.\nC\t\t5001\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5001}, then accept {q5002}; keep Bijou's information for Maxwell.\nT\t\t5001\t\nA\t\t5002\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tContinue through War Master Voone and the worg chambers. Capture a Bloodaxe Worg Pup with Kibler's cage for {q4729}.\nC\t\t4729\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets in the troll chambers for {q4788}.\nC\t\t4788\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTame an adult Bloodaxe Worg in the cleared worg chambers. Feed it, teach the available Growl and passive ranks through Beast Training, and use Bite VIII until learned. Keep this pet through the clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Halycon and Gizrul the Slavener for {q4701}.\nC\t\t4701\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tComplete the clear through the final orc halls and Overlord Wyrmthalak.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf Wyrmthalak drops General Drakkisath's Command, use it to accept {q5089}.\nA\t\t5089\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared lower wing and give Warosh his mojo, then turn in {q4867}.\nT\t\t4867\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave the Spire with the party. Find Scarshield Quartermaster on the outer balcony and defeat him.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf he drops Blackhand's Command, use it to accept {q7761} and keep the attunement quest for Upper Blackrock Spire.\nA\t\t7761\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn together through Blackrock Mountain to the Burning Steppes.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4729\t\nT\t\t4862\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4701\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5002\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.74\t69.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5089} if you obtained the command.\nT\t\t5089\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.74\t69.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5102} if the command delivery was completed; keep it for the upper wing.\nA\t\t5102\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Morgan's Vigil and fly to Chillwind Camp.\nF\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6028\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5142\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern Western Plaguelands road east into Eastern Plaguelands and continue to Darrowshire.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Tirion Fordring by the western river and accept {q5542}, {q5543} and {q5544}.\nA\t\t5542\t\nA\t\t5543\t\nA\t\t5544\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill twenty Plaguehound Runts, five Plaguehounds and five level 58-59 Frenzied Plaguehounds for {q5542}.\nC\t\t5542\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill thirty Plaguebats for {q5543} and collect fifteen Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat from Carrion Grubs for {q5544} during the Plaguelands circuit.\nC\t\t5543\t\t\nC\t\t5544\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue to Darrowshire.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5142\t\nA\t\t5149\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t32.58\t79.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tSearch Darrowshire's ruined houses for the doll's head, left side and right side; combine them into Pamela's Doll for {q5149}.\nC\t\t5149\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5149\t\nA\t\t5152\t\nA\t\t5241\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Light's Hope Chapel for the dungeon quests.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.81\t49.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point first.\nP\t\tLight's Hope Chapel\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5243\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5214\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5212\t\nA\t\t5529\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5241\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6030\t\nA\t\t5251\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.79\t50.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock, buy and use Formula: Powerful Anti-Venom if Honored with the Argent Dawn and at 300 First Aid; skip if not ready or already learned.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5281\t\nA\t\t6021\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish the Plaguehound, Plaguebat and Carrion Grub objectives, then return to Tirion by the western river.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5542\t\nT\t\t5543\t\nT\t\t5544\t\nA\t\t5742\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSit beside Tirion and hear his story for {q5742}.\nC\t\t5742\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5742\t\nA\t\t5781\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Zaeldarr the Outcast in the Undercroft and take his head for {q6021}.\nC\t\t6021\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Undercroft graveyard and form a party for the grave's summoned defenders. Examine the Loose Dirt Mound, defeat the attackers and recover Taelan's Hammer for {q5781}.\nC\t\t5781\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tirion. Turn in {q5781}, then accept {q5845}.\nT\t\t5781\t\nA\t\t5845\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Symbol of Lost Honor from Northdale's lake for {q5845}.\nC\t\t5845\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tirion. Turn in {q5845}, then accept {q5846}.\nT\t\t5845\t\nA\t\t5846\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west into Western Plaguelands and visit Marlene at Sorrow Hill.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5152\t\nA\t\t5153\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Joseph's Wedding Ring from his monument for {q5153}.\nC\t\t5153\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5153\t\nA\t\t5154\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t45.27\t69.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Andorhal's approach, form a party for Araj.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Araj's nearby defenders, defeat him with the party and take the Phylactery Shard from the object left at his position for {q211}.\nC\t\t211\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the Annals of Darrowshire in the Andorhal town hall for {q5154}.\nC\t\t5154\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5154\t\nA\t\t5210\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Artist Renfray at Caer Darrow. Turn in {q5846}, then accept {q5848}; keep it for Stratholme's Scarlet Bastion.\nT\t\t5846\t\nA\t\t5848\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t211\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Light's Hope Chapel.\nF\t\tLight's Hope Chapel\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6021\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5210\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock at Light's Hope before leaving for Stratholme Living.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6164\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover Augustus's Receipt Book from the inn at Terrordale for {q6164}.\nC\t\t6164\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6164\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5281\t\nA\t\t5282\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 59 before Stratholme Living. If short, kill Plaguebats on the nearby roads before continuing to Stratholme.\nX\t\t\t59\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t26.84\t19.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the main road northwest to Stratholme's main gate.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Stratholme's main gate, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Stratholme Living.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter through the main gate at 59+ and clear the streets toward the Scarlet Bastion.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Plagued Flesh Samples during the clear.\nK\t\t13174\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRecover five Stratholme Holy Water from supply crates for {q5243}; clear the rats or insects when a trapped crate opens.\nC\t\t5243\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Stratholme Holy Water from the supply crates encountered during the clear. Keep them for your Charger quest and save additional vials for Houses of the Holy.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse Egan's Blaster on Spectral and Ghostly Citizens, then on the released Restless Souls; free fifteen for {q5282}.\nC\t\t5282\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Aurius in the chapel and accept {q5122}.\nA\t\t5122\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tSearch Ezra Grimm's smoke shop, defeat Ezra and take the tobacco for {q5214}.\nC\t\t5214\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Scarlet Bastion and defeat Archivist Galford for {q5251}; leave the archive unburned until the painting pickups are finished.\nC\t\t5251\t1\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTake Of Love and Family from behind the twin-moons painting before anyone burns the archive for {q5848}.\nC\t\t5848\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBurn the Scarlet Archive after everyone who needs the painting has looted it for {q5251}.\nC\t\t5251\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Medallion of Faith from its Scarlet chest for {q5122}.\nC\t\t5122\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Balnazzar to finish the Scarlet Bastion. If his head drops, keep it for Duke Nicholas.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Light's Hope for the ready reports.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5214\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5251\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf carrying Balnazzar's head, use it after reporting the archive to accept {q5262}.\nA\t\t5262\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5262} if you obtained the head.\nT\t\t5262\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5263} if the head delivery was completed.\nA\t\t5263\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5212\t\nA\t\t5213\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tirion by the western river and turn in {q5848}, then accept {q5861}.\nT\t\t5848\t\nA\t\t5861\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west to Myranda at Uther's Tomb. Turn in {q5861}, then accept {q5862}.\nT\t\t5861\t\nA\t\t5862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_UNFINISHED_BUSINESS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before taking Myranda's Scarlet Illusion, visit Kirsta Deepshadow south of Hearthglen and accept {q6004}.\nA\t\t6004\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill two Scarlet Medics, two Hunters, two Magi and two Knights south and southeast of Kirsta for {q6004}; avoid Hearthglen's elite guards.\nC\t\t6004\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Kirsta, turn in {q6004} and accept {q6023}.\nT\t\t6004\t\nA\t\t6023\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Form a party for Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen. Defeat them at the guarded road and tower positions for {q6023}.\nC\t\t6023\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Kirsta, turn in {q6023} and accept {q6025}. Return to Myranda for a fresh Scarlet Illusion before entering Hearthglen; dismiss pets.\nT\t\t6023\t\nA\t\t6025\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_UNFINISHED_BUSINESS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Myranda for the Scarlet Illusion, dismiss pets and reach Taelan in Hearthglen while disguised.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWhile still disguised, climb Hearthglen's watchtower to overlook the town for {q6025}, then continue to Taelan.\nC\t\t6025\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5862} to Taelan with Tirion's Gift.\nT\t\t5862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Taelan, form a party for the escort. Wait until everyone who needs it has turned in the gift and confirmed readiness before accepting {q5944}.\nA\t\t5944\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Taelan through Hearthglen and remain through Tirion's arrival and the final conversation for {q5944}.\nC\t\t5944\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5944\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Kirsta and turn in {q6025}.\nT\t\t6025\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep The Active Agent, Above and Beyond if offered, The Medallion of Faith, Houses of the Holy and The Restless Souls for the final Stratholme Undead clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.92\t85.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise follow the road south to Chillwind Camp and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Feathermoon.\nF\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t31.47\t43.15\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable the worg with Antarius and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite VIII when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock; keep the Crescent Key from Pusillin.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the mainland boat, follow the Dire Maul courtyard path and unlock the northern wing with the Crescent Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dire Maul's northern entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Dire Maul North.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul North together at 59+. Clear the ogre guards and their patrols in order.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf a Gordok Shackle Key drops, take it to Knot Thimblejack in the courtyard and accept {q5525}.\nA\t\t5525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5525} to free Knot if you obtained the key.\nT\t\t5525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Guard Fengus, Guard Slip'kik and Captain Kromcrush. Defeat King Gordok and Cho'Rush the Observer to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared entrance. Use the Crescent Key to reach the Athenaeum library through its outer access door.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Telmius Dreamseeker's remains in the library and examine them for {q7482}.\nC\t\t7482\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIn the Dire Maul library, turn in {q7506} to Lorekeeper Javon if carrying The Emerald Dream.\nT\t\t7506\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7503} to Lorekeeper Mykos in the library if carrying it.\nT\t\t7503\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7501} to Lorekeeper Mykos and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas if carrying the book.\nT\t\t7501\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7504} to Lorekeeper Javon and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas if carrying it.\nT\t\t7504\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7498} to Lorekeeper Kildrath and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas if carrying it.\nT\t\t7498\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_DIRE_MAUL_BOOKS\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying Codex of Defense, use it to accept {q7499}.\nU\t\t18357\t\nA\t\t7499\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying The Arcanist's Cookbook, use it to accept {q7500}.\nU\t\t18358\t\nA\t\t7500\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying Frost Shock and You, use it to accept {q7505}.\nU\t\t18363\t\nA\t\t7505\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_DIRE_MAUL_BOOKS\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7499} to Lorekeeper Kildrath if carrying Codex of Defense.\nT\t\t7499\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7500} to Lorekeeper Kildrath if carrying The Arcanist's Cookbook.\nT\t\t7500\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7505} to Lorekeeper Javon if carrying Frost Shock and You.\nT\t\t7505\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf carrying Harnessing Shadows, turn in {q7502} to Lorekeeper Mykos and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas.\nT\t\t7502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the island boat to Feathermoon; keep Stormwind bound.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7482\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish at Feathermoon with Stormwind bound. Repair and restock; keep the Stratholme Undead quests, Umi's Mechanical Yeti, the Scholomance deeds and hatchlings quests, Doomrigger's Clasp, Egg Freezing and any Upper Spire attunement or Drakkisath quest." },
  { name = "59-60 Un'Goro Crater (Alliance)", title = "59-60 Un'Goro Crater", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 59, hi = 60, next = "", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", bethink = true,
    about = "One Shaper's Terrace clear, final class training, Upper Blackrock Spire, Scholomance, Stratholme Undead and Dire Maul West. Ends in Stormwind at 60.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at Feathermoon after Dire Maul North, with Stormwind bound. Keep the Stratholme Undead quests, Barov Family Fortune, Plagued Hatchlings, Doomrigger's Clasp, Egg Freezing, any upper-wing attunement or Drakkisath quest, and Umi's Mechanical Yeti.\nX\t\t\t59\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan for the tablet delivery.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port and turn in {q4788}, then return to Gadgetzan.\nT\t\t4788\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Marshal's Refuge.\nF\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Quixxil for {q5163}; keep it for Umi in Everlook.\nC\t\t5163\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock at Marshal's Refuge before the ascent.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t18.1\t61.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the approach north from Marshal's Refuge onto the crater's raised northern terrace. Use the rising path to the titan complex entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shaper's Terrace entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Shaper's Terrace together at 59+.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Shaper's Terrace through Nanaya, completing the other encounters along the route, then leave by the cleared approach.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSilithus\t50.58\t34.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 60 before final class training and the last dungeon circuit. If needed, return to Marshal's Refuge, fly to Cenarion Hold and hunt southern Dredge Crushers or Twilight camps.\nX\t\t\t60\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t45.23\t5.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return to Marshal's Refuge and fly to Ratchet.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Ratchet, take the Booty Bay ship and fly to Stormwind.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t60.39\t75.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Allison. Repair and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Stormwind City\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t39.24\t84.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Demisette, train Demon Armor V, Immolate VII, Bane of Doom, Create Healthstone V, Create Soulstone V and Create Spellstone III. Train eligible talented ranks. At Spackle (39.53,84.53), buy and use Imp Blood Pact VI, Voidwalker Torment VI and Suffering IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t80.55\t59.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Wu Shen, learn Cleave V, Overpower IV and Rend VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you have Manual of Heroic Strike IX or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Heroic Strike IX.\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you have Manual of Battle Shout VII or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Battle Shout VII.\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you have Manual of Revenge VI or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Revenge VI.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge for Shaman training.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t47.14\t13.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ancestral Spirit V, Earth Shock VII, Healing Stream Totem V, Lesser Healing Wave VI, Lightning Shield VIII, Nature Resistance Totem III, Searing Totem VI and Windfury Weapon IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tablet of Healing Wave X at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tablet of Strength of Earth Totem V at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tIronforge\t25.81\t75.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tablet of Grace of Air Totem III at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind before continuing.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Stealth IV, Gouge V, Backstab VIII and Rupture VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHuman Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Feedback V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t77.43\t65.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Osborne the Night Man, learn Instant Poison VI (280 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.63\t70.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Sloan McCoy.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Devouring Plague VI, Divine Spirit IV, Fade VI, Holy Fire VIII, Inner Fire VI, Power Word: Fortitude VI, Power Word: Shield X, Prayer of Healing IV, Prayer of Spirit and Shackle Undead III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDwarf Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Chastise V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tGnome Priest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.53\t44.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt High Priestess Laurena, learn Contingency Plan V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Codex: Prayer of Fortitude II at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Codex: Prayer of Shadow Protection at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t47.44\t82.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Sacred Candles from Owen Vaughn for your group prayers.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.61\t49.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Arthur the Faithful, learn Greater Blessing of Kings, Greater Blessing of Might II, Greater Blessing of Wisdom II, Holy Strike VIII, Redemption V, Exorcism VI, Consecration V, Holy Wrath II, Hammer of Wrath III, Seal of Light IV, Devotion Aura VII and Fire Resistance Aura III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nA\t\t7638\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t7638\t\nA\t\t7637\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t49.56\t85.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jennea Cannon, learn Fireball XI, Frostfire Bolt III, Polymorph IV and Blizzard VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.35\t36.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Einris Brightspear, learn Aspect of the Beast IV, Aimed Shot VI, Arcane Shot VIII, Distracting Shot VI, Freezing Trap III, Mend Pet VII and Wing Clip III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t67.32\t36.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Karrina Mekenda, learn Growl VII, Great Stamina X, Natural Armor X. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t35.84\t67.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheldras Moontree, learn Hurricane III, Mark of the Wild VII, Prowl III, Rebirth V, Regrowth IX, Revive V, Rip VI and Tranquility IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.11\t74.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Ironwood Seeds from Kyra Boucher for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7562\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ten Elixirs of Shadow Power, six Large Brilliant Shards, twenty-five Dark Iron Ore, thirty-five Black Dragonscales and three Arcanite Bars at the Auction House. Keep gold for Shadowy Potions, Xorothian Stardust and Gorzeeki's three final ritual items.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tStormwind City\t61.18\t71.28\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy forty Runecloth, six Arcanite Bars, ten Arthas' Tears, twenty Enriched Manna Biscuits, one Azerothian Diamond and one Pristine Black Diamond. Keep five Stratholme Holy Water and 350 gold for the class-quest fees.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ironforge.\nF\t\tIronforge\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7637} to High Priest Rohan with the 150-gold donation for the Exorcism Censer, then accept {q7639}.\nT\t\t7637\t\nA\t\t7639\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t7639\t\nA\t\t7640\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Chillwind, then take the Plaguelands road to Terrordale.\nF\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Exorcism Censer on the green patches and defeat twenty-five Terrordale Spirits for {q7640}.\nU\t\t18752\t\nC\t\t7640\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.92\t85.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return to Chillwind Camp and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t7640\t\nA\t\t7641\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tCheck that you carry five Stratholme Holy Water for the collection.\nK\t\t13180\t5\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t7641\t\nA\t\t7642\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7642} to Grimand with the requested materials and 150 gold, then accept {q7648}.\nT\t\t7642\t\nA\t\t7648\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7648}, then accept {q7643}; keep the Arcanite Barding for Dire Maul West.\nT\t\t7648\t\nA\t\t7643\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Southshore.\nF\t\tSouthshore\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q7645}, then turn in {q7645} to Merideth Carlson with twenty Enriched Manna Biscuits and 50 gold. Keep the Manna-Enriched Horse Feed with the Arcanite Barding for Dire Maul West.\nA\t\t7645\t\nT\t\t7645\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Southshore's flight master and fly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Morgan's Vigil.\nF\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t12.69\t31.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide west to Mor'zul and Gorzeeki at the Altar of Storms.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7562\t\nA\t\t7563\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7623\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki Wildeyes for the Jaedenar visit. Keep the purchased mount materials in your bags.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Morgan's Vigil and fly to Menethil Harbor.\nF\t\tMenethil Harbor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Auberdine boat.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Everlook.\nF\t\tEverlook\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5163\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect thirty Raging Beast's Blood from the Crazed Owlbeasts for {q7563}; stay clear of the southern demon camps.\nC\t\t7563\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Everlook and fly to Talonbranch Glade.\nF\t\tTalonbranch Glade\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Felwood's main road south to Jaedenar. Drink a Shadowy Potion before entering Shadow Hold, keep it active and keep pets passive among the now-friendly demons.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7623\t\nA\t\t7624\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tConfront Ulathek, defeat him and take The Traitor's Heart for {q7624}. Keep the Shadowy Potion effect active for the return to Banehollow.\nC\t\t7624\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7624\t\nA\t\t7625\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan beside Banehollow. Leave through the same passages while the potion remains active.\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.41\t47.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise leave Felwood by the main road and fly from Astranaar to Auberdine.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tAuberdine\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Auberdine, take the Stormwind boat and follow the harbor road into the city.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Morgan's Vigil and return to Mor'zul and Gorzeeki at the Altar of Storms.\nF\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7563\t\nA\t\t7564\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7564\t\nT\t\t7625\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7626\t\nA\t\t7627\t\nA\t\t7628\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7626\t\nT\t\t7627\t\nT\t\t7628\t\nA\t\t7630\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7630\t\nA\t\t7629\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Imp in a Jar for Scholomance.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.33\t68.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Morgan's Vigil: from the Altar of Storms, ride east; from Everlook, fly to Auberdine, boat to Menethil and fly to Morgan's Vigil. Repair and restock before the upper Spire journey.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel into Blackrock Mountain and up to the Spire portal. Reach the upper wing's door.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the upper Spire door, join a group with tanks and healers; arrange a member with the Seal of Ascension to open it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Upper Blackrock Spire together at 60. Clear the rune rooms and free Pyroguard Emberseer, then defeat him.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAfter clearing the Rookery safely, use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg to test Egg Freezing for {q4734}.\nC\t\t4734\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Solakar Flamewreath, then clear Rend's arena waves and defeat Rend.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tContinue through The Beast and the dragonkin halls. Take Doomrigger's Clasp from Doomrigger's Coffer for {q4764}.\nC\t\t4764\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat General Drakkisath and his guards with the group to finish the clear for {q5102}.\nC\t\t5102\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Blackhand's Command, touch Drakkisath's Brand behind the General to turn in {q7761} for the attunement.\nT\t\t7761\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Blackrock Mountain for Flame Crest, then continue to Morgan's Vigil.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4734\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.74\t69.02\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5102} if the General objective was active.\nT\t\t5102\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4764\t\nA\t\t4765\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Morgan's Vigil and fly to Chillwind Camp.\nF\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Eva Sarkhoff on Caer Darrow before entering Scholomance.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5382\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tInclude Imp Delivery when arranging the Scholomance quest clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Scholomance party with a tank and healer; arrange a member with the Skeleton Key. Arrange the full quest clear, including Eva's follow-ups, Jandice and Kirtonos.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Scholomance together at 60. Leave Jandice's basement and Kirtonos's balcony for their quest steps while clearing the main halls first.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect the four deeds: Southshore on a table in the first large room; Tarren Mill on a table before the hatchlings; Brill in Ras Frostwhisper's room; Caer Darrow in Lord Alexei Barov's room for {q5343}.\nC\t\t5343\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill twenty Plagued Hatchlings before clearing Rattlegore's room for {q5529}.\nC\t\t5529\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Rattlegore and the path to Ras Frostwhisper, then defeat Ras.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Imp in a Jar at the laboratory and stay until J'eevee finishes the parchment for {q7629}.\nC\t\t7629\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through the classroom bosses. Defeat Doctor Theolen Krastinov and burn both Sarkhoff remains in his room for {q5382}.\nC\t\t5382\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Darkmaster Gandling after the six lower-room bosses. Return through the cleared halls to Eva without resetting the instance.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5382\t\nA\t\t5515\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRe-enter the same instance with the party. Clear Jandice Barov's basement, defeat her and take Krastinov's Bag of Horrors for {q5515}.\nC\t\t5515\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Eva by the cleared halls.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5515\t\nA\t\t5384\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the same instance's balcony with the party. Place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier and defeat Kirtonos the Herald to finish the clear for {q5384}.\nC\t\t5384\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5384}. Keep the Spectral Essence reward for speaking to Caer Darrow's spirits.\nT\t\t5384\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5343\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Chillwind and fly to Light's Hope.\nF\t\tLight's Hope Chapel\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5529\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Stratholme's service entrance and join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Stratholme Undead; arrange a member with the Key to the City to open it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter through the service entrance at 60 and turn in {q5122} to Aurius in the chapel.\nT\t\t5122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the undead district's three ziggurats through Baroness Anastari, Nerub'enkan and Maleki the Pallid; clear each interior's acolytes.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRecover the Scourge Data from the ziggurat chest for {q5213}.\nC\t\t5213\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Magistrate Barthilas and loot the Key to the City, then enter Slaughter Square.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Ramstein and the ensuing waves, then Baron Rivendare to finish the clear. Loot Rivendare's head for {q5263} if the quest is active.\nC\t\t5263\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Aurius in Rivendare's room after the fight and accept {q5125} to claim his reckoning reward.\nA\t\t5125\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5125\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Egan at Terrordale, then turn in {q5282}.\nT\t\t5282\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Light's Hope for the ready Stratholme rewards.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5263} with the Baron's head if the quest was active.\nT\t\t5263\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5264} if Above and Beyond was completed.\nA\t\t5264\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5213\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.9\t48.41\t\t\t\nT\t\t5264\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.9\t48.41\t\t\t\nA\t\t5265\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5243\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.96\t48.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5265} to claim the Argent Hold reward if offered.\nT\t\t5265\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Morgan's Vigil and return to Gorzeeki and Mor'zul at the Altar of Storms.\nF\t\tMorgan's Vigil\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7629\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7631\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy J'eevee's Jar, Black Lodestone and Xorothian Glyphs from Gorzeeki. Read Mor'zul's Instructions.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t55.6\t54.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Drain Soul on Blackrock Soldiers until you carry at least twenty Soul Shards for Dire Maul's ritual.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind. If coming from the Altar of Storms, return to Morgan's Vigil first.\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4765\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Feathermoon.\nF\t\tFeathermoon Stronghold\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tHave all three ritual items and at least twenty Soul Shards ready for Dire Maul West.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the mainland boat and travel to Dire Maul's central courtyard. Reach the western entrance.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tInclude the Dreadsteed ritual when arranging the Dire Maul West clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dire Maul's western entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer. Bring the Crescent Key and unlock the wing together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul West together at 60. Speak to the Shen'dralar Ancient above the courtyard and accept {q7461} before continuing deeper.\nA\t\t7461\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Tendris Warpwood and the courtyard pylon's guardians.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tAfter Tendris's defeat, turn in {q7643} to the Ancient Equine Spirit with the Manna-Enriched Horse Feed and Arcanite Barding.\nT\t\t7643\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q7644}; keep the Blessed Arcanite Barding for Lord Grayson.\nA\t\t7644\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through the upper walkways, Illyanna Ravenoak and Magister Kalendris, clearing each pylon's guardians.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Prison of Immol'thar and clear the guardians of its remaining pylons. Check that all five pylons are deactivated, then defeat Immol'thar.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tClear Immol'thar's prison before the Dreadsteed ritual. Use J'eevee's Jar to place the bell, wheel and candle.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tDefend the ritual with the party, using Black Lodestone and Soul Shards to reactivate extinguished ritual objects. Keep the tank free to gather incoming demons.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tWhen the nine summoning runes are active and the ritual is complete, use the Xorothian Glyphs. Defeat the Xorothian Dreadsteed and Lord Hel'nurath with the party for {q7631}.\nC\t\t7631\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7631} to the Dreadsteed Spirit to bind the mount and learn Summon Dreadsteed.\nT\t\t7631\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue to the Athenaeum and defeat Prince Tortheldrin to finish Dire Maul West for {q7461}.\nC\t\t7461\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Shen'dralar Ancient through the cleared halls, then turn in {q7461}.\nT\t\t7461\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7462\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Athenaeum and turn in {q7462} to claim the Treasure of the Shen'dralar.\nT\t\t7462\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q7463} from Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum before leaving.\nA\t\t7463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared western entrance.\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t64.8\t30.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tCross the central courtyard to Dire Maul East's main entrance and find a five-player party with a tank and healer for Hydrospawn.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul East and clear the corridors and pool approach to Hydrospawn. Defeat him and take the Hydrospawn Essence for {q7463}.\nC\t\t7463\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared eastern entrance. Return to the Athenaeum through its outer access door, using the Crescent Key.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7463} to Lorekeeper Lydros and learn Conjure Water VII.\nT\t\t7463\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t30.24\t43.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return to Feathermoon and fly to Ratchet.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Ratchet, take the Booty Bay ship and fly to Stormwind.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t7644\t\nA\t\t7646\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7646} to Lord Grayson with the Azerothian Diamond and Pristine Black Diamond, then accept {q7647} and open Lord Grayson's Satchel. Keep the Divination Scryer and Blessed Arcanite Barding ready.\nT\t\t7646\t\nA\t\t7647\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before flying to Chillwind. Follow the road to Caer Darrow and reach Scholomance's entrance.\nF\t\tChillwind Camp\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t70.22\t73.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Scholomance, find a five-player party with a tank and healer for Judgment and Redemption; arrange a Skeleton Key to enter.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Scholomance and clear the approach to the Great Ossuary. Defeat Rattlegore and clear his room before the ritual.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tJudge the spirit waves with Seal of Wisdom for Banal Spirits, Justice for Malicious Spirits, Righteousness for Corrupted Spirits and Light for Shadowed Spirits.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tPlace the Divination Scryer in the cleared room. Defeat the waves and their Aspects, then Death Knight Darkreaver. Loot the Charger's Lost Soul and use it at the placed Scryer to redeem it for {q7647}.\nU\t\t18746\t\nC\t\t7647\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7647} to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger with the Charger's Redeemed Soul and Blessed Arcanite Barding. Learn Summon Charger.\nT\t\t7647\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared entrance.\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.92\t85.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Stormwind if ready; otherwise return to Chillwind Camp and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Stormwind City\nF\t\tStormwind\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Stormwind at level 60 with the full dungeon journey complete." },
  { name = "1-11 Durotar (Horde)", title = "1-11 Durotar", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Horde", lo = 1, hi = 11, next = "11-19 The Barrens (Horde)", defaultFor = "Orc/Troll", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
