    steps = "S\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tStand still for 0.5 seconds before Auto Shot.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4641\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4641\t\nA\t\t788\t\nA\t\t97279\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Mottled Boars on the valley floor for {q788}.\nC\t\t788\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t788\t\nA\t\t789\t\nS\tOrc Hunter\t\t\nA\t\t3087\t\nS\tTroll Hunter\t\t\nA\t\t3082\t\nS\tOrc Warlock\t\t\nA\t\t3090\t\nS\tTroll Warlock\t\t\nA\t\t98575\t\nS\tOrc Mage\t\t\nA\t\t98576\t\nS\tTroll Mage\t\t\nA\t\t3086\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nA\t\t3085\t\nS\tOrc Rogue\t\t\nA\t\t3088\t\nS\tOrc Warrior\t\t\nA\t\t2383\t\nS\tTroll Warrior\t\t\nA\t\t3065\t\nS\tOrc Shaman\t\t\nA\t\t3089\t\nS\tTroll Shaman\t\t\nA\t\t3084\t\nS\tTroll Rogue\t\t\nA\t\t3083\t\nS\tOrc Rogue\t\t\nT\t\t3088\t\nS\tTroll Rogue\t\t\nT\t\t3083\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t41.28\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Rwag, learn Stealth I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tOrc Mage\t\t\nT\t\t98576\t\nS\tTroll Mage\t\t\nT\t\t3086\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.51\t69.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Mai'ah, learn Arcane Intellect I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nT\t\t3085\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.36\t68.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ken'jai, learn Power Word: Fortitude I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tOrc Warrior\t\t\nT\t\t2383\t\nS\tTroll Warrior\t\t\nT\t\t3065\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.89\t69.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Frang, learn Battle Shout I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tOrc Shaman\t\t\nT\t\t3089\t\nS\tTroll Shaman\t\t\nT\t\t3084\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.39\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shikrik, learn Rockbiter Weapon I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tOrc Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t3087\t\nS\tTroll Hunter\t\t\nT\t\t3082\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.84\t69.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Track Beasts from Jen'shan.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 2 before training; finish on nearby boars if needed.\nX\t\t\t2\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1485\t\nS\tOrc Warlock\t\t\nT\t\t3090\t\nS\tTroll Warlock\t\t\nT\t\t98575\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t40.65\t68.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Immolate.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t792\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4402\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGather ten Cactus Apples and six Abandoned Training Weapons while collecting ten Scorpid Worker Tails around the northern valley training grounds for {q4402}, {q97279}, and {q789}.\nC\t\t4402\t\t\nC\t\t97279\t\t\nC\t\t789\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t790\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 3 before Sarkoth; finish on nearby workers if needed.\nX\t\t\t3\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the path onto Sarkoth's hill, clear nearby scorpids and take his claw for {q790}.\nC\t\t790\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t790\t\nA\t\t804\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t97279\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t804\t\nT\t\t789\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4402}. Choose a free Herbalism, Mining or Skinning book; use it when eligible to learn your chosen profession.\nT\t\t4402\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5441\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Foreman's Blackjack on five sleeping Lazy Peons along the valley's edges for {q5441}.\nC\t\t5441\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5441\t\nA\t\t6394\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 4 before the northern familiar camps and cave.\nX\t\t\t4\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.89\t69.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Frang, learn Charge I and Rend I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.4\t69.17\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Canaga Earthcaller.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.4\t69.17\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept Call of Earth from Canaga Earthcaller.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.39\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shikrik, learn Earth Shock I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t40.65\t68.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Corruption and Curse of Weakness.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.84\t69.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jen'shan, learn Aspect of the Monkey and Serpent Sting I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.51\t69.04\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Mai'ah, learn Frostbolt I and Conjure Water I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.36\t68.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ken'jai, learn Lesser Heal II and Shadow Word: Pain I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t41.28\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Rwag, learn Pick Pocket and Backstab I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve Vile Familiars on the northern approach for {q792}. Pull into cleared ground.\nC\t\t792\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Vile Familiar Heads on the northern approach for {q1485}.\nC\t\t1485\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1485} to Ruzan to learn Summon Imp, then summon it, then accept {q1499}.\nT\t\t1485\t\nA\t\t1499\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1499\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t792\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t794\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Burning Blade Coven by its path; take Thazz'ril's Pick from the cleared side chamber for {q6394}.\nC\t\t6394\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the approach to Yarrog Baneshadow, defeat him and take the Burning Blade Medallion for {q794}.\nC\t\t794\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Felstalker Hooves from level 3-4 Felstalkers in Burning Blade Coven for {q1516}; leave by the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t1516\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to your initial Valley of Trials binding if ready; otherwise leave Burning Blade Coven by the cleared path and return to the Den.\nH\t\tHearth to Valley of Trials\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t794\t\nA\t\t805\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Lost Journal beside Zureetha Fargaze and accept {q96652}.\nA\t\t96652\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nT\t\t1516\t\nA\t\t1517\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t41.6\t73.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the hidden path south of the Den up to Spirit Rock.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the narrow hill path behind the Valley of Trials to Spirit Rock. Drink the Earth Sapta beside the rock, then turn in {q1517} to the Minor Manifestation of Earth.\nU\t\t6635\t\nT\t\t1517\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t1518\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Canaga Earthcaller, then turn in {q1518}. Receive your Earth Totem and learn Stoneskin Totem I; keep the totem in your bags.\nT\t\t1518\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6394\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 before the Sen'jin quest pickups; finish on nearby valley creatures if needed.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nA\t\t5649\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2161\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t805\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t823\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t826\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t808\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t818\t\nA\t\t97225\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t817\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t786\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96652\t\nA\t\t96604\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tType /sit beside Brakk's campfire and wait until Boosted Rest appears for {q96604}.\nC\t\t96604\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96604\t\nA\t\t96655\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t823\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t806\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2161\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.51\t41.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Grosk; repair. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Razor Hill\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 before training and Encroachment; finish on isolated southern boars and scorpids if needed.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t791\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.11\t42.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Cook Torka.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96655\t\nA\t\t815\t\nA\t\t96825\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t784\t\nA\t\t837\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t96822\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.39\t42.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Jark; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.39\t42.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Jark for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.17\t41.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Rawrk in Razor Hill.\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.19\t42.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Tarshaw Jaggedscar, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.42\t42.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Swart, learn Earthbind Totem and Healing Wave II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.37\t41.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dhugru Gorelust, learn Life Tap and Shadow Bolt II. Buy and use Imp Blood Pact I from Kitha nearby (54.71,41.50).\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.85\t43.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Thotar, learn Arcane Shot I and Hunter's Mark I. Restock ammunition.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nT\t\t5649\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.26\t42.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Tai'jin, learn Power Word: Shield I and Smite II. Use your shield for solo pulls; once you have a wand, finish weakened enemies with it.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.98\t43.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaplak, learn Gouge I and Sinister Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t56.31\t75.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road south to Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin Village. Learn Fireball II, Fire Blast I, Conjure Food I and Comprehend Scroll. Use Comprehend Scroll on untranslated scrolls you find.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.95\t43.5\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Razor Hill by the main road before heading to the western Razormane grounds.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill four Razormane Quilboars on the near western slopes for {q837}; leave the deeper camps for later.\nC\t\t837\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Prickly Pear Fruit in the cleared Razormane grounds for {q96825}.\nC\t\t96825\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96825\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 before the Razormane Scouts and Tiragarde Keep.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill four Razormane Scouts on the near western slopes for {q837}.\nC\t\t837\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern road to Tiragarde Keep and clear before entering buildings.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover Turroc's Raider's Bow, Battleaxe and Shield in the keep outskirts for {q96822}.\nC\t\t96822\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Kul Tiras Sailors and eight Marines around the keep, collecting eight Canvas Scraps. Clear the tower stairs before defeating Lieutenant Benedict for {q784} and {q791}.\nC\t\t784\t\t\nC\t\t791\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t59.26\t57.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tLoot Benedict's Key, then take the opposite stairs to the tower's upper exterior walkway and open Benedict's Chest. Use the Aged Envelope to accept {q830}.\nU\t\t4881\t\nA\t\t830\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t784\t\nT\t\t830\t\nA\t\t831\t\nA\t\t825\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t791\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96822\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover three Gnomish Tools from the eastern shipwrecks for {q825}.\nC\t\t825\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Intact Makrura Eyes and eight Crawler Mucus from the coastal creatures for {q818}.\nC\t\t818\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t825\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 before the Echo Isles. Finish on isolated coastal enemies if needed.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.19\t42.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Tarshaw Jaggedscar, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.42\t42.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Swart, learn Earth Shock II, Lightning Bolt II, Lightning Shield I, Rockbiter Weapon II and Stoneclaw Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.37\t41.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dhugru Gorelust, learn Bane of Agony and Fear. Buy Imp Firebolt II from Kitha nearby (54.71,41.50) and use it with your Imp summoned.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.85\t43.49\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Thotar, learn Concussive Shot, Parry and Raptor Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t54.26\t42.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Tai'jin, learn Renew I and Fade I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.98\t43.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaplak, learn Evasion and Eviscerate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.12\t63.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road north to Orgrimmar and collect the flight point if not already known. Stay out of the canyons.\nP\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t831\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Polymorph I, Frostbolt II and Arcane Missiles I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain your chosen primary professions: all nine are available in Orgrimmar. Learn Leatherworking or Tailoring here; neither is taught in Razor Hill. Alternatively, learn Blacksmithing, Engineering and Mining in Razor Hill, or Alchemy, Enchanting and Herbalism in Sen'jin Village. Train any chosen Mining, Herbalism or Skinning not already learned from your starter quest book or a trainer.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Bows, Daggers, Thrown or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Axes, Bows, Thrown or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Daggers or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage/Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter/Priest/Warlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.53\t19.63\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hanashi, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a useful leveling weapon you can equip; keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready. Keep a ranged weapon and ammunition, or a thrown weapon, for pulling. Reserve money for class training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage/Priest/Warlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable early wand at the Auction House, such as a Lesser Magic Wand. Equip it; stand still for 0.5 seconds before shooting.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Razor Hill if ready; otherwise follow the main road south.\nH\t\tHearth to Razor Hill\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t53.25\t81.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road to Sen'jin Village, then the coast south to Lau'Tiki. Learn Apprentice Fishing before crossing to the Echo Isles.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCross from Sen'jin's shore to the Echo Isles and collect four Durotar Tiger Furs for {q817}. Clear the landing before advancing.\nC\t\t817\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Taillasher Eggs from the shore nests for {q815}.\nC\t\t815\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Forgotten Loa Idols on the islands for {q97225}.\nC\t\t97225\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Hexed Trolls and eight Voodoo Trolls, then clear to Zalazane and take his head for {q826}.\nC\t\t826\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Minshina's Skull from the circle of power after clearing its guards for {q808}.\nC\t\t808\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t826\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t808\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t97225\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t818\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t817\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t56.06\t73.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Zansoa; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west to Kolkar Crag for the attack plans. Clear the ravine instead of dropping from the surrounding cliffs.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBurn this set of Kolkar Attack Plans after clearing its guards for {q786}.\nC\t\t786\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBurn this set of Kolkar Attack Plans after clearing its guards for {q786}.\nC\t\t786\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBurn this set of Kolkar Attack Plans after clearing its guards for {q786}.\nC\t\t786\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t786\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Razor Hill if ready; otherwise take the southern road north.\nH\t\tHearth to Razor Hill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t815\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 before the deeper Razormane camps; finish on coastal wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill four Razormane Dustrunners west of Razor Hill for {q837}, pulling out of their camps.\nC\t\t837\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill four Razormane Battleguards on the outer western approach for {q837}.\nC\t\t837\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t837\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t816\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHunt Dreadmaw Crocolisks along the Southfury River and collect Kron's Amulet for {q816}. Avoid swimming into the deep river.\nC\t\t816\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t816\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t834\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t48.09\t34.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Drygulch Ravine by the southern path and recover five Sacks of Supplies for {q834}. Stay on the paths between its ledges.\nC\t\t834\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t834\t\nA\t\t835\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t51.82\t23.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve Dustwind Savages and eight Storm Witches in the northern ravine for {q835}, then return by the cleared path.\nC\t\t835\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t835\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t42.12\t26.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Thunder Ridge clear Fizzle's guards and take his claw for {q806}.\nC\t\t806\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t806\t\nA\t\t828\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 before the class unlock and northern cave; finish on the outer Razormane camps if needed.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\tOrc Rogue\t\t\nA\t\t1859\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nA\t\t6062\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Dire Mottled Boar for {q6062}, then return to Thotar.\nC\t\t6062\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6062\t\nA\t\t6083\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern coast north and use the Taming Rod on an isolated Surf Crawler for {q6083}, then return to Thotar.\nC\t\t6083\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6083\t\nA\t\t6082\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Armored Scorpid for {q6082}, then return to Thotar.\nC\t\t6082\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6082\t\nA\t\t6081\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1506\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t840\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north to Orgrimmar by the main road.\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Frost Nova I, Conjure Water II and Frost Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Resurrection I, Mind Blast I, Lesser Heal III and Shadow Word: Pain II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tOrc Rogue\t\t\nT\t\t1859\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Dual Wield, Sap I, Slice and Dice I and Sprint I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable weapon upgrade and an off-hand dagger at the Auction House; equip both weapons after learning Dual Wield.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5652}, then turn in {q5652} and learn Hex of Weakness from Ur'kyo.\nA\t\t5652\t\nT\t\t5652\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6081} and learn Beast Training, Call Pet, Dismiss Pet, Feed Pet and Revive Pet from Ormak Grimshot.\nT\t\t6081\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\t