m him.\nA\t\t832\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t827\t\nA\t\t829\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Orgrimmar by the main road.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5726\t\nA\t\t5727\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t829\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t49.47\t50.59\t\t\t\nT\t\t832\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Neeru Fireblade and ask about the Burning Blade while carrying the insignia for {q5727}.\nC\t\t5727\t\t\nS\tOrc Warlock/Troll Warlock\t\t\nT\t\t1501\t\nA\t\t1504\t\nS\tOrc Warlock/Troll Warlock\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gan'rul's summoning circle, use the Glyphs of Summoning to summon and subdue the Voidwalker for {q1504}.\nC\t\t1504\t\t\nS\tOrc Warlock/Troll Warlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1504} and learn Summon Voidwalker. Summon it and enable Torment for solo work.\nT\t\t1504\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5727\t\nA\t\t5728\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 before the Barrens journey. If short, hunt isolated northern Durotar creatures, then return by the main road.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t54.1\t68.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Gryshka. Repair, restock and train useful available class abilities and chosen professions.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep Conscript of the Horde and Hidden Enemies for the next journey; start from Orgrimmar." },
