ner, learn Moonfire I, Rejuvenation I and useful available Wrath and Healing Touch ranks.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t44.35\t76.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Seer Ravenfeather.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t44.35\t76.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept Call of Earth from Seer Ravenfeather.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t95805\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCarry the Smoldering Incense directly to the Ritual Fire and turn in {q95805} before its ten-minute timer expires.\nT\t\t95805\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Battleboar Snouts and eight Battleboar Flanks from Battleboars on the southern mesa for {q780}.\nC\t\t780\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t59.8\t82.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake and read the Dirt-stained Map in Brambleblade Ravine, then accept {q781}.\nU\t\t4851\t\nA\t\t781\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Bristleback Belts in the ravine for {q757}; pull the outer guards singly.\nC\t\t757\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Ritual Salve from the level 3-4 Bristleback Shamans in the ravine for {q1519}.\nC\t\t1519\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear to Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle and take his head for {q3376}.\nC\t\t3376\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to your initial Camp Narache binding if ready; otherwise leave Brambleblade Ravine by the cleared path and return across the mesa.\nH\t\tHearth to Camp Narache\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t757\t\nT\t\t781\t\nA\t\t763\t\nA\t\t96659\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nT\t\t1519\t\nA\t\t1520\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3376\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t780\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Kodo Rock on the mesa. Drink the Earth Sapta beside the rock, then turn in {q1520} to the Minor Manifestation of Earth.\nU\t\t6635\t\nT\t\t1520\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t1521\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Seer Ravenfeather, then turn in {q1521}. Receive your Earth Totem and learn Stoneskin Totem I; keep the totem in your bags.\nT\t\t1521\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1656\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern pass down from the mesa to Bloodhoof Village.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96659\t\nA\t\t96605\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tType /sit beside Kaga Wildhoof's campfire and wait until Boosted Rest appears for {q96605}.\nC\t\t96605\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96605\t\nA\t\t96661\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t763\t\nA\t\t745\t\nA\t\t767\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t748\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t761\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t767\t\nA\t\t771\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1656\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t46.63\t61.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Kauth; sell junk. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Bloodhoof Village\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 before the village profession training and Poison Water; finish on isolated level-5 Prairie Wolves southwest of Bloodhoof if needed.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t96130\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t44.16\t63.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Fishing from Uthan Stillwater.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96661\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t44.92\t61.67\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from Pyall Silentstride.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t45.29\t61.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Moorat Longstride; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t45.29\t61.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Moorat Longstride for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t45.56\t61.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Wunna Darkmane; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t46.08\t63.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Vira Younghoof.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t743\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Prairie Wolf Paws from the wolves southwest of Bloodhoof for {q748}.\nC\t\t748\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Plainstrider Talons from isolated level-6 Adult Plainstriders on the open plains for {q748}.\nC\t\t748\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t748\t\nA\t\t754\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Winterhoof Cleansing Totem at the southern water well for {q754}.\nU\t\t5411\t\nC\t\t754\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t754\t\nA\t\t756\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 on level 5-6 wolves and plainstriders before the Palemane camps.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t48.35\t63.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Krang Stonehoof, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t47.4\t62.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Narm Skychaser, learn Earthbind Totem and Healing Wave II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t46.93\t59.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Yaw Sharpmane, learn Arcane Shot I and Hunter's Mark I. Restock ammunition at Kennah Hawkseye (44.98,61.97).\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t47.48\t62.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gennia Runetotem, learn Wrath II and Thorns I, plus available healing ranks.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Palemane Tanners at the southern camp for {q745}.\nC\t\t745\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Palemane Skinners for {q745}, pulling the outer guards into cleared ground.\nC\t\t745\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Trophy Swoop Quills from the southern Wiry Swoops for {q761}.\nC\t\t761\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind and defeat Chakuyak west of Bloodhoof and loot her pelt for {q96130}.\nC\t\t96130\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t761\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96130\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 on level 6-7 wildlife before the western and northern circuits.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill five Palemane Poachers at Palemane Rock for {q745}. Pull into the cleared approach.\nC\t\t745\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t745\t\nA\t\t746\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t749\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Sealed Supply Crate at the caravan, then turn in {q749}.\nT\t\t749\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t751\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t751\t\nA\t\t764\t\nA\t\t765\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Stalker Claws from Prairie Stalkers east of Bloodhoof for {q756}.\nC\t\t756\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Cougar Claws from Flatland Cougars on the northern grassland for {q756}.\nC\t\t756\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Well Stones around the water wells for {q771}.\nC\t\t771\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Ambercorn beneath the trees for {q771}.\nC\t\t771\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t756\t\nA\t\t758\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 before training and the harpy and excavation camps.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t48.35\t63.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Krang Stonehoof, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t47.4\t62.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Narm Skychaser, learn Earth Shock II, Lightning Bolt II, Lightning Shield I, Rockbiter Weapon II and Stoneclaw Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t46.93\t59.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Yaw Sharpmane, learn Concussive Shot, Parry and Raptor Strike II before leaving Bloodhoof.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t47.48\t62.95\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gennia Runetotem, learn Entangling Roots I and Healing Touch II before leaving Bloodhoof.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t771\t\nA\t\t772\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t46.88\t61.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tDrink the Water of the Seers beside the village fire and follow the vision by the western road.\nU\t\t4823\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t772\t\nA\t\t773\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Windfury Talons from the harpies at the western camp for {q743}.\nC\t\t743\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Prospector's Picks at Bael'dun Digsite, then use its forge to break them into five Broken Tools for {q746}.\nC\t\t746\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the central water well for {q758}.\nU\t\t5415\t\nC\t\t758\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t746\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t99079\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t743\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t758\t\nA\t\t759\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99079\t\nA\t\t99081\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99081\t\nA\t\t99101\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99101\t\nA\t\t99080\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 on level 8-9 wildlife before the eastern camps.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Galak Centaurs and four Outrunners, then clear Herak the Pillager's guards and take his head for {q99080}.\nC\t\t99080\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fourteen Venture Co. Workers and six Supervisors around the mine's outer works for {q764}; pull to cleared ground.\nC\t\t764\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the mine passages to Fizsprocket, take his clipboard and return through the cleared entrance for {q765}.\nC\t\t765\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Prairie Alpha Teeth from Prairie Wolf Alphas on the northern plains for {q759}.\nC\t\t759\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t764\t\nT\t\t765\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Bloodhoof Village if ready; otherwise follow the road west.\nH\t\tHearth to Bloodhoof Village\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99080\t\nA\t\t99082\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t759\t\nA\t\t760\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 on level 9-10 wolves before the class unlocks and northern rites.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nA\t\t5928\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t861\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nA\t\t6061\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Adult Plainstrider for {q6061}, then return to Yaw Sharpmane.\nC\t\t6061\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6061\t\nA\t\t6087\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Prairie Stalker for {q6087}, then return to Yaw Sharpmane.\nC\t\t6087\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6087\t\nA\t\t6088\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Taming Rod on an isolated Swoop for {q6088}, then return to Yaw Sharpmane.\nC\t\t6088\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t6088\t\nA\t\t6089\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the main road north to Thunder Bluff and use the lift to the city.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t47.0\t49.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before the city sweep.\nP\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t57.24\t87.37\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Torm Ragetotem, learn Bloodrage and Rend II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1505}; keep it for Far Watch Post.\nA\t\t1505\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t40.93\t62.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ansekhwa, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Maces, Staves or Guns.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t40.93\t62.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ansekhwa, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves or Guns.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t40.93\t62.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ansekhwa, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: two-handed Maces.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t40.93\t62.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ansekhwa, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Maces.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t40.41\t51.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Auctioneer Stampi, buy a useful leveling weapon you can equip; keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready. Reserve money for class training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tKeep a usable ranged weapon and its ammunition, or a thrown weapon, for pulling enemies into cleared ground.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6089} and learn Beast Training, Call Pet, Dismiss Pet, Feed Pet and Revive Pet from Holt Thunderhorn.\nT\t\t6089\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t57.3\t89.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Holt, learn Aspect of the Hawk, Serpent Sting II and Track Humanoids. At Hesuwa Thunderhorn (54.09,83.99), learn Growl II, Great Stamina I and Natural Armor I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99082\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t21.99\t18.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Beram Skychaser, learn Flame Shock I, Flametongue Weapon I and Strength of Earth Totem I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1523}; keep it for the northern Barrens.\nA\t\t1523\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5928\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t76.48\t27.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Turak Runetotem, learn Mark of the Wild II, Moonfire II, Rejuvenation II and Nature's Grasp I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5922} and learn Teleport: Moonglade.\nA\t\t5922\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5922\t\nA\t\t5930\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with the Great Bear Spirit for {q5930}.\nC\t\t5930\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5930\t\nA\t\t5932\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t5932\t\nA\t\t6002\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the lift down and follow the road through Bloodhoof into the Barrens, then turn north toward Camp Taurajo.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t42.0\t60.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Moonkin Stone.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Cenarion Lunardust at the stone, defeat Lunaclaw and speak to his spirit for {q6002}.\nU\t\t15710\t\nC\t\t6002\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road through Bloodhoof and take the Thunder Bluff lift.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6002} and learn Bear Form.\nT\t\t6002\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t76.48\t27.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Turak Runetotem, learn Demoralizing Roar I for Bear Form.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain your chosen primary professions and restock before returning to the plains.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the lift down to the northern plains.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t57.94\t36.33\t\t\t\nI\t\tTame a Prairie Wolf Alpha as your permanent pet. Feed it meat and use Bite II in combat until learned for Beast Training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tOpen Beast Training and teach your pet Growl II and the available stamina and armor ranks. Enable Bite and Growl for solo work.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t833\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Bristleback Interlopers at Red Rocks for {q833}.\nC\t\t833\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path up Red Rocks to the Ancestral Spirit. Turn in {q773}, then accept {q775}.\nT\t\t773\t\nA\t\t775\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t833\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the northern water well for {q760}.\nU\t\t5416\t\nC\t\t760\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Flatland Prowler Claws on the northern plains for {q861}.\nC\t\t861\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the main road and lift to Thunder Bluff.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t775\t\nA\t\t776\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t861\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the lift down to the northern plains.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Arra'chea and take his horn for {q776}.\nC\t\t776\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the lift to Thunder Bluff.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t776\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before the mainland journey.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Bloodhoof Village if ready; otherwise take the lift down and follow the road south.\nH\t\tHearth to Bloodhoof Village\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t760\t\nA\t\t98435\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Mulgore by the eastern pass into the Barrens.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q854} from Kirge Sternhorn along the road.\nA\t\t854\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road north to the Crossroads.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t51.5\t30.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tThe Crossroads\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t854\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue north by the road, then east across the bridge into Durotar. At Razor Hill, take the northern road into Orgrimmar.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.12\t63.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before the city stops.\nP\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5726} from Thrall.\nA\t\t5726\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t54.1\t68.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Gryshka; restock and train useful available class abilities.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Orgrimmar\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Bows, Daggers, Thrown or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Axes, Daggers or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.7\t19.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sayoc, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers or Fist Weapons.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior/Hunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t81.53\t19.63\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hanashi, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Staves.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the northern Durotar road and reach Skull Rock's entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Burning Blade cultists and collect a Lieutenant's Insignia for {q5726}, then leave through the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t5726\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise return by the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5726\t\nA\t\t5727\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tQuestion Neeru Fireblade about the Burning Blade for {q5727}.\nC\t\t5727\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5727}, then accept {q5728}; keep it for Ragefire Chasm.\nT\t\t5727\t\nA\t\t5728\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 before the Barrens journey. If short, hunt isolated northern Durotar creatures, then return to Orgrimmar by the main road.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Orgrimmar at 11 or above." },
  { name = "1-11 Tirisfal Glades (Horde)", title = "1-11 Tirisfal Glades", group = "Bethink's Guide 1-20", faction = "Horde", lo = 1, hi = 11, next = "11-19 The Barrens (Horde)", defaultFor = "Undead", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Deathknell, Brill, Agamand Mills and the Scarlet camps; Bandarion Keep and Shadowvale. Ends in Orgrimmar at 11 for the Barrens.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nA\t\t363\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t363\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t364\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Mindless Zombies and eight Wretched Zombies in the northern clearing for {q364}.\nC\t\t364\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t364\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 2 on nearby zombies before the next pickups.\nX\t\t\t2\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3901\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nA\t\t3098\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t3099\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nA\t\t98601\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nA\t\t3096\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nA\t\t3095\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nA\t\t3097\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t376\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t3095\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t32.69\t65.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dannal Stern, learn Battle Shout I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t3096\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t32.53\t65.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt David Trias, learn Stealth I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nT\t\t3097\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t31.11\t66.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dark Cleric Duesten, learn Power Word: Fortitude I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nT\t\t3098\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t30.93\t66.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Arcane Intellect I from Isabella.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t3099\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t30.91\t66.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Immolate from Maximillion.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1470\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t98601\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t31.04\t66.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Devotion Aura from Aramis Hammerhand.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nA\t\t90902\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t31.54\t66.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Holy Light to heal five Injured Deathguard around Deathknell for {q90902}.\nC\t\t90902\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t90902\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twelve Rattlecage Skeletons around the ruined houses for {q3901}.\nC\t\t3901\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Rattlecage Skulls from the skeletons for {q1470}.\nC\t\t1470\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Scavenger Paws and six Duskbat Wings from the nearby scavengers and bats for {q376}.\nC\t\t376\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1470} to learn Summon Imp, then summon it.\nT\t\t1470\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t30.81\t66.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Blood Pact I from Kayla Smithe. Use the grimoire with your Imp summoned and enable Blood Pact.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3901\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t376\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 3 on Rattlecage Skeletons before the next pickups.\nX\t\t\t3\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6395\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3902\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t380\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Scavenged Goods from Equipment Boxes around the ruined houses for {q3902}.\nC\t\t3902\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3902\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 4 on skeletons and Mangy Duskbats before the spider cave.\nX\t\t\t4\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t98389\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nA\t\t91208\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t30.93\t66.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Isabella, learn Frostbolt I and Conjure Water I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t30.91\t66.34\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Maximillion, learn Corruption and Curse of Weakness.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t31.04\t66.45\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aramis Hammerhand, learn Judgement and Blessing of Might I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t31.11\t66.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dark Cleric Duesten, learn Lesser Heal II and Shadow Word: Pain I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t32.53\t65.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt David Trias, learn Pick Pocket and Backstab I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t32.69\t65.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dannal Stern, learn Charge I and Rend I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t27.58\t64.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the Frightened Paladin west of the church and speak with him for {q91208}.\nC\t\t91208\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Young Night Web Spiders outside the hollow for {q380}.\nC\t\t380\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t26.23\t60.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Night Web's Hollow by its mouth, kill eight Night Web Spiders and free six Webbed Victims for {q380} and {q98389}. Pull into cleared passages, then leave through the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t380\t2\t\nC\t\t98389\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to your initial Deathknell binding if ready; otherwise leave Night Web's Hollow by the cleared entrance and follow the path back.\nH\t\tHearth to Deathknell\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t380\t\nA\t\t381\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t98389\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t91208\t\nA\t\t91209\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Samuel Fipps in the northeastern clearing and take his remains.\nK\t\t16333\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBury Samuel's remains at Marla's Grave for {q6395}.\nC\t\t6395\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q6395}. Choose a free Herbalism, Mining or Skinning book; use it when eligible to learn your chosen profession.\nT\t\t6395\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Scarlet Armbands from Converts and Initiates in the southeastern camp for {q381}.\nC\t\t381\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t381\t\nA\t\t382\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Meven Korgal's guards, defeat him and take the Scarlet Crusade Documents for {q382}.\nC\t\t382\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t382\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 5 before the road to Brill; finish on Scarlet Initiates if needed.\nX\t\t\t5\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t383\t\nA\t\t96656\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nA\t\t5651\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Deathknell's eastern road toward Brill.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t365\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Gordo along the road, then accept {q5481}.\nA\t\t5481\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Gloom Weed beside the road to Brill for {q5481}.\nC\t\t5481\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96656\t\nA\t\t96607\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tType /sit beside Eleanor Shackleton's campfire and wait until Boosted Rest appears for {q96607}.\nC\t\t96607\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96607\t\nA\t\t96658\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t91209\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t383\t\nA\t\t427\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t358\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96658\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.77\t51.5\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice Cooking from William Pickman.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Innkeeper Renee; sell junk. Restock food and drinks as needed for faster health and mana recovery.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Brill\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.82\t52.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Apprentice First Aid from Nurse Neela inside the inn.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.16\t52.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Flint and Tinder from Mrs. Winters; keep it for crafting campfire kits.\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.16\t52.59\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Simple Wood from Mrs. Winters for your first campfire kit.\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t86784\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t404\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5481\t\nA\t\t5482\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGather six Dry Branches along the southwestern fields for {q86784}.\nC\t\t86784\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t86784\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven Putrid Claws from Rotting Dead and Ravaged Corpses west of Brill for {q404}.\nC\t\t404\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t404\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 6 on nearby level 5-6 undead and darkhounds before training and the western camps.\nX\t\t\t6\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t426\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t367\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTake The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer from the shelf beside Apothecary Johaan. Keep it for Owen Thadd.\nK\t\t208185\t1\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.85\t52.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Austil de Mon, learn Parry and Thunder Clap I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.97\t52.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Cain Firesong, learn Fireball II, Fire Blast I, Conjure Food I and Comprehend Scroll. Use Comprehend Scroll on untranslated scrolls you find.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.62\t52.68\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ageron Kargal, learn Life Tap and Shadow Bolt II. Buy and use Imp Blood Pact I from Gina Lang nearby if still unlearned.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.25\t52.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shari Stilwell, learn Holy Strike I, Holy Light II, Divine Protection I and Seal of the Crusader I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.75\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Marion Call, learn Gouge I and Sinister Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nT\t\t5651\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.57\t52.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dark Cleric Beryl upstairs in the inn, learn Power Word: Shield I and Smite II. Use your shield for solo pulls; once you have a wand, finish weakened enemies with it.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Vials of Darkhound Blood from isolated Decrepit Darkhounds on the western fields for {q367}.\nC\t\t367\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Tirisfal Pumpkins in the farm fields for {q365}. Clear nearby farmers before gathering.\nC\t\t365\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Scarlet Warriors and clear the camp around Bareth for {q427}.\nC\t\t427\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the escape route before speaking to Bareth Dawnstone and accepting {q99144}.\nA\t\t99144\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Bareth out of Crusader's Outpost and protect him from the attackers for {q99144}.\nC\t\t99144\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t365\t\nT\t\t367\t\nA\t\t407\t\nA\t\t368\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99144\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t427\t\nA\t\t370\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t374\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q407} to the Captured Scarlet Zealot in the inn's cellar.\nT\t\t407\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 7 on level 6-7 darkhounds or undead before the northern gnolls.\nX\t\t\t7\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t354\t\nA\t\t362\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t375\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.03\t52.37\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Coarse Thread from Abigail Shiel for The Chill of Death.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q95314}; keep it for the western journey.\nA\t\t95314\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Doom Weed around the graveyard and northern gnoll fields for {q5482}.\nC\t\t5482\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the requested Rot Hide Graverobbers and Mongrels and collect eight Embalming Ichors for {q358}. Pull out of their camps.\nC\t\t358\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Duskbat Pelts from Greater Duskbats on the western fields for {q375}.\nC\t\t375\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t590\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Calvin Montague and speak to him when he yields for {q590}.\nC\t\t590\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t590\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Captain Perrine, three Scarlet Zealots and three Scarlet Missionaries collecting ten Scarlet Insignia Rings from the camp's Crusaders for {q370} and {q374}.\nC\t\t370\t\t\nC\t\t374\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Brill if ready; otherwise return by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t375\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 8 before training and the Agamand circuit.\nX\t\t\t8\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.85\t52.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Austil de Mon, learn Hamstring I and Heroic Strike II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.97\t52.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Cain Firesong, learn Polymorph I, Frostbolt II and Arcane Missiles I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.62\t52.68\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ageron Kargal, learn Fear and Bane of Agony. Buy Imp Firebolt II from Gina Lang nearby and use it with your Imp summoned.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.25\t52.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shari Stilwell, learn Hammer of Justice I, Purify and Parry.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.75\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Marion Call, learn Evasion and Eviscerate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.57\t52.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dark Cleric Beryl upstairs in the inn, learn Renew I and Fade I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q91282}; keep it for Bandarion Keep.\nA\t\t91282\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t374\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t370\t\nA\t\t371\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t358\t\nA\t\t359\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5482\t\nA\t\t99142\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Undercity by the southern road and main lifts if you need training, equipment or a class delivery; otherwise skip the Undercity service steps and continue to Agamand Mills. Train your chosen primary professions: all nine are available. Brill teaches Alchemy, Enchanting and Herbalism; use Undercity for Blacksmithing, Engineering, Leatherworking, Tailoring, Mining or Skinning. Alternatively, learn Leatherworking from Shelene Rhobart at the road junction southeast of Brill, or Tailoring from Bowen Brisboise at Cold Hearth Manor southwest of Brill. Train any chosen Mining, Herbalism or Skinning not already learned from your starter quest book or a trainer.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t63.25\t48.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Michael Garrett's flight point if not already known.\nP\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t57.31\t32.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Archibald, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords, Daggers or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t57.31\t32.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Archibald, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one- and two-handed Swords.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t57.31\t32.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Archibald, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Crossbows.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t57.31\t32.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Archibald, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords or Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t57.31\t32.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Archibald, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: Daggers.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t57.31\t32.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Archibald, learn missing skills for weapons you plan to use: one-handed Swords.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a useful leveling weapon you can equip; keep a usable one-handed weapon and shield ready. Keep a ranged weapon and ammunition, or a thrown weapon, for pulling. Reserve money for class training.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage/Warlock/Priest\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable early wand at the Auction House, such as a Lesser Magic Wand. Equip it; stand still for 0.5 seconds before shooting.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t73.19\t33.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBring The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer to Owen Thadd in the inner ring of the Magic Quarter, then accept {q79095}.\nA\t\t79095\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t73.19\t33.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q79095} with the book and learn Study.\nT\t\t79095\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tUndercity\t73.19\t33.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Study in the library with a Light Feather. Open the Bundle of Scrolls and use Comprehend Scroll on eligible untranslated scrolls.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAfter the Undercity services, hearth to Brill if ready; otherwise leave by the main lifts and follow the road north.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Notched Ribs and three Blackened Skulls from the soldiers and bonecasters around Agamand Mills for {q426}.\nC\t\t426\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Devlin Agamand and take his remains for {q362}.\nC\t\t362\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 9 on level 8-9 soldiers and bonecasters before the other Agamands.\nX\t\t\t9\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Nissa Agamand and take her remains for {q354}.\nC\t\t354\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Gregor Agamand and take his remains for {q354}.\nC\t\t354\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Thurman Agamand and take his remains for {q354}.\nC\t\t354\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Vile Fin Scales from the murlocs along the western shore for {q368}.\nC\t\t368\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRead a personally found Letter to Yvette from the mill undead, then accept {q361}.\nU\t\t2839\t\nA\t\t361\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Brill if ready; otherwise follow the road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t354\t\nT\t\t362\t\nA\t\t355\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.58\t52.6\t\t\t\nT\t\t361\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q368}, then accept {q369}. Accept {q445}; keep it for the Sepulcher.\nT\t\t368\t\nA\t\t369\t\nA\t\t445\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t426\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t355\t\nA\t\t408\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t67.17\t50.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east from Brill to Brightwater Lake and learn Apprentice Fishing from Clyde Kellen before continuing south to the road junction.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t65.86\t59.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a Fishing Pole from Martine Tramblay; equip it when fishing.\nK\t\t6256\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t359\t\nA\t\t360\t\nA\t\t356\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t360\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 10 on level 9-10 undead and wildlife before the crypt and eastern camps.\nX\t\t\t10\t\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.85\t52.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Austil de Mon, learn Bloodrage and Rend II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nA\t\t1818\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nT\t\t1818\t\nA\t\t1819\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tActivate the skull-shaped stone on the ground beside the Brill mausoleum's doorway. Defeat level-11 Ulag the Cleaver when he emerges for {q1819}.\nC\t\t1819\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Deathguard Dillinger, then turn in {q1819}. Learn Defensive Stance, Taunt and Sunder Armor I.\nT\t\t1819\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.75\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Marion Call, learn Dual Wield, Sap I, Slice and Dice I and Sprint I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern road to Undercity and enter by the main lifts.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy a usable weapon upgrade and an off-hand dagger at the Auction House; equip both weapons after learning Dual Wield.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Brill if ready; otherwise leave by the main lifts and follow the road north.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t61.97\t52.47\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Cain Firesong, learn Frost Nova I, Conjure Water II and Frost Armor II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.25\t52.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shari Stilwell, learn Lay on Hands, Blessing of Protection I, Devotion Aura II, Seal of Righteousness II, Seal of Fury I and Righteous Fury.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southern road to Undercity and enter by its main lifts.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Resurrection I, Mind Blast I, Lesser Heal III and Shadow Word: Pain II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5658}, then turn in {q5658} and learn Touch of Weakness from Aelthalyste.\nA\t\t5658\t\nT\t\t5658\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Brill if ready; otherwise leave by the main lifts and follow the road north.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1478\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south to Undercity and enter by its lifts.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1478\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t1473\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, Demon Skin II and Immolate II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the main lifts and follow the western road to Perrine's camp. Clear its guards and take Egalin's Grimoire from Perrine's Chest for {q1473}.\nC\t\t1473\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Carendin Halgar in Undercity by the main road and lifts.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t1473\t\nA\t\t1471\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAt Carendin's summoning circle, use the Runes of Summoning and subdue the Voidwalker for {q1471}.\nC\t\t1471\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1471} and learn Summon Voidwalker. Summon it and enable Torment for solo work.\nT\t\t1471\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Brill if ready; otherwise leave by the main lifts and take the road north.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t52.0\t27.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Agamand Crypt through its doorway.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the crypt's passages, kill eight Wailing Ancestors and eight Rotting Ancestors, then defeat Captain Dargol and take his skull for {q408}. Leave by the cleared entrance.\nC\t\t408\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t408\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Tomb Weed around the eastern farm fields for {q99142}.\nC\t\t99142\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Bleeding Horrors and eight Wandering Spirits around Balnir Farmstead for {q356}.\nC\t\t356\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Captain Vachon's guards, defeat him and kill five Scarlet Friars for {q371}.\nC\t\t371\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four samples of venom from Vicious Night Web Spiders on the eastern slopes for {q369}.\nC\t\t369\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t356\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t369\t\nA\t\t492\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t371\t\nA\t\t372\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q492} to the Captured Mountaineer in the inn's cellar with Johaan's drink.\nT\t\t492\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99142\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Captain Melrache and both Scarlet Bodyguards for {q372}.\nC\t\t372\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Brill if ready; otherwise take the northern road west and return south to town.\nH\t\tHearth to Brill\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t372\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t96895\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96895\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 11 before the cultist camps; finish on level 9-10 undead or wildlife if needed.\nX\t\t\t11\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t96897\t\nA\t\t96898\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Dark Neophytes and eight Dark Enforcers at the cultist camp, gathering twelve Necrotic Crystal Fragments from the cultists and scattered fragments for {q96897} and {q96898}. Pull into cleared ground.\nC\t\t96897\t\t\nC\t\t96898\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96897\t\nT\t\t96898\t\nA\t\t96899\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by Brill and follow the western road to Bandarion Keep.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t91282\t\nA\t\t91285\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western path toward Shadowvale. Kill eight Vile Fin Attackers and eight Vile Fin Seers on the approach for {q91285}, pulling away from their camps.\nC\t\t91285\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t91285\t\nA\t\t91294\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t21.95\t46.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Hilda the Breaker outside the keep.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t21.88\t50.05\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Ander Solliden along the southern road.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t22.66\t44.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak with Jorin Croge inside the keep to finish meeting its residents for {q91294}.\nC\t\t91294\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q91294} to Danitha Morr upstairs, then accept {q91317}.\nT\t\t91294\t\nA\t\t91317\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96899\t\nA\t\t96896\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHear the conversation between Leonid Barthalomew and Danitha Morr for {q96896}.\nC\t\t96896\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96896\t\nA\t\t98545\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn downstairs to Jorin Croge and accept {q91316}.\nA\t\t91316\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t99152\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t10.73\t62.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western path into Shadowvale.\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Tarnished Drudges and six Tarnished Zealots in the surface ruins. Clear the two-story house, defeat Commander Rudolph Gelhardt upstairs and take his head for {q91317}.\nC\t\t91317\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t12.9\t65.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the roofless ruined house on the village's southern edge. Descend its staircase into the underground cellar.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Bottles of Whispering Elixir in the cellar's rooms and passages, and six Faintly Glowing Bones from its Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics for {q95314} and {q99152}.\nC\t\t95314\t\t\nC\t\t99152\t\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve pieces of Sturdy Lumber from Lumber Piles in the cellar for {q91316}.\nC\t\t91316\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse a personally found Whispering Horror Residue, then accept {q95328}; keep it for Undercity.\nU\t\t268812\t\nA\t\t95328\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t12.9\t65.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared passages and climb the same staircase back to the village.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t99152\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t91316\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nT\t\t91317\t\nA\t\t95803\t\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 12 for Redemption. Complete remaining Tirisfal Glades quests, such as Wanted: Maggot Eye from Brill's wanted notice or Hides for the Forsaken from Shelene Rhobart southeast of Brill, or hunt level 9-10 undead and wildlife.\n