    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Undercity at 37 with An Unholy Alliance, the Scarlet Key, monastery bosses still outstanding, Frostmaw, Vorrel's Revenge and the carried Call to Arms quest.\nX\t\t\t37\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_TEST_OF_LORE_RETURN\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If still in the scheduled Library clear, collect The Beginnings of the Undead Threat for {q1160}. If that clear is already behind you, skip the unfinished quest instead of repeating the dungeon.\nC\t\t1160\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q1160} to Parqual in Undercity, then accept {q6628}. Answer Ner'zhul for {q6628}, turn in {q6628} and accept {q1394}.\nT\t\t1160\t\nA\t\t6628\t\nC\t\t6628\t\t\nT\t\t6628\t\nA\t\t1394\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_TEST_OF_LORE_RETURN\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Tarren Mill.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t63.75\t20.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Tailoring from Daryl Stack in the church (level 35, 200 Tailoring); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t533\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Syndicate Missive from the southern Alterac camp for {q533}.\nC\t\t533\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t533\t\nA\t\t503\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the prison camp obtain the Rusted Iron Key and free Gol'dir for {q503}.\nC\t\t503\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t503\t\nA\t\t506\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t506\t\nA\t\t507\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern road to Dandred's Fold, form a party at the house approach for Aliden, clear Aliden's house and defeat him. Speak to Elysa after the fight for {q507}.\nC\t\t507\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t507\t\nA\t\t508\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Nancy Vishas at her house and take Vorrel's Wedding Ring for {q1051}.\nC\t\t1051\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Frostmaw's cave in southern Alterac, obtain fresh meat from the nearby lions and use it at the Flame of Uzel. Defeat Frostmaw and loot his mane for {q1136}.\nC\t\t1136\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south by road to Tarren Mill.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t508\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1051\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t62.31\t19.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Theodore Mont Claire, keeping a free slot for the training tame.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t19.92\t54.65\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east through Thoradin's Wall to the western grassland. Tame a Plains Creeper; use Bite V in combat until the learning message appears.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t62.31\t19.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Theodore Mont Claire, release the training tame and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite V when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Hammerfall.\nF\t\tHammerfall\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t73.84\t32.46\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Adegwa for the Stromgarde and cove returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Hammerfall\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t655\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t639\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t655\t\nA\t\t672\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t673\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q642} at the Shards of Myzrael; keep it for Drywhisker Gorge.\nA\t\t642\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Highland Raptor Eyes from Highland Thrashers on the central grassland for {q672}.\nC\t\t672\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Hammerfall and turn in {q672}, then accept {q674}.\nT\t\t672\t\nA\t\t674\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q674} to Gor'mul, then accept {q675}.\nT\t\t674\t\nA\t\t675\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q675} to Tor'gan, then accept {q701}.\nT\t\t675\t\nA\t\t701\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_ITEMS_OF_POWER\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: If missing Tabetha's quest, visit your Mage trainer in Undercity and accept {q1947}.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Reach Tabetha through Booty Bay and Ratchet, then turn in {q1947} and accept {q1948}. Return through Ratchet, Booty Bay and Undercity and Hammerfall to Arathi before collecting the totem sticks.\nT\t\t1947\t\nA\t\t1948\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_ITEMS_OF_POWER\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Witherbark Totem Sticks from Witherbark trolls for Items of Power.\nK\t\t7273\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Raptor Hearts from Highland Fleshstalkers on the southern grassland for {q701}.\nC\t\t701\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t54.71\t80.42\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Boulderfist Hall's valley entrance, form a party for the Boulderfist ogres.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Boulderfist Hall by its valley approach with the party; kill ten Brutes and four Magi for {q678}. Leave by the cleared tunnel.\nC\t\t678\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Hammerfall.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t701\t\nA\t\t702\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t678\t\nA\t\t679\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t680\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q702} to Gor'mul, then accept {q847}.\nT\t\t702\t\nA\t\t847\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q847} to Tor'gan.\nT\t\t847\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t25.39\t63.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Stromgarde's gate, form a party for the sigil, Marez and ogre objectives.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Stromgarde by its main gate with the party and recover the Sigil of Strom from the Syndicate quarter. Clear to Marez Cowl, defeat her and take her Bloodstone Orb for {q639} and {q673}.\nC\t\t639\t\t\nC\t\t673\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the ogre quarter with the party; kill seven Boulderfist Shaman and three Lords, then defeat Or'Kalar and loot his head for {q679} and {q680}.\nC\t\t679\t\t\nC\t\t680\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t30.0\t67.0\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t21.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Stromgarde and follow its outside eastern wall south and west along the southern slope. Use the tunnel to Faldir's Cove; do not jump from the cliffs.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t663\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t663\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t662\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t664\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t665\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Professor Phizzlethorpe to the cave and back. Protect him from the water-elemental ambush for {q665}.\nC\t\t665\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t665\t\nA\t\t666\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t23.05\t84.51\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Maiden's Folly through its hull openings and collect its Charts.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t23.39\t85.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Maiden's Folly Log inside the wreck.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t20.46\t85.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Spirit of Silverpine and collect its Charts.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Spirit of Silverpine Log for {q662}.\nC\t\t662\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Daggerspine Raiders and three Sorceresses for {q664}.\nC\t\t664\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWear the Goggles of Gem Hunting and collect ten Calcified Elven Gems from the seabed for {q666}.\nC\t\t666\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Faldir's Cove, then turn in {q662}.\nT\t\t662\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t664\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t666\t\nA\t\t668\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q668}, then accept {q669}; keep the sample gem for Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay.\nT\t\t668\t\nA\t\t669\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Hammerfall if ready; otherwise leave by the cove tunnel and follow the road northeast.\nH\t\tHearth to Hammerfall\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t680\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t639\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t679\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t673\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 38 before the binding stones.\nX\t\t\t38\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Motes of Myzrael from the kobolds in Drywhisker Gorge for {q642}.\nC\t\t642\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q642} at the Iridescent Shards inside the gorge, then accept {q651}.\nT\t\t642\t\nA\t\t651\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the guardians around the Stone of East Binding and take the Cresting Key for {q651}.\nC\t\t651\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead southwest to the Circle of Outer Binding. Clear the guardians and take the Thundering Key for {q651}.\nC\t\t651\t3\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Thundering Exiles around the central stone at the Circle of Outer Binding. Use the ten Witherbark Totem Sticks at the stone, then loot the Bolt Charged Bramble for {q1948}.\nC\t\t1948\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road west to the Circle of West Binding. Clear the guardians and take the Burning Key for {q651}.\nC\t\t651\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q651} at the Stone of Inner Binding.\nT\t\t651\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Hammerfall if ready; otherwise return by the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Hammerfall\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 38 before training. If short, hunt isolated level 37-38 southern raptors on open ground.\nX\t\t\t38\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Bane of Agony IV, Drain Life IV, Drain Soul III and Detect Invisibility II; learn Siphon Life when talented. Learn Imp Firebolt V and Blood Pact IV. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Martha Strain nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.4\t17.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Baltus Fowler, learn Pummel I, Slam III and Thunder Clap IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Garrote IV and Sinister Strike VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Deadly Poison II and Mind-numbing Poison II (170 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Flash Heal IV, Renew VI and Smite VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.08\t15.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Garen Largo, learn Seal of Wisdom I, Holy Light VI, Blessing of Protection III and Turn Undead II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t85.14\t10.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anastasia Hartwell, learn Frostbolt VII, Fire Blast V and Conjure Mana Jade.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Orgrimmar zeppelin outside Undercity.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Disease Cleansing Totem, Flametongue Totem II, Frost Resistance Totem II, Frostbrand Weapon III, Lightning Bolt VII, Stoneclaw Totem IV and Strength of Earth Totem III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Hawk IV and Wing Clip II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1049\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1136\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Nature's Grasp IV, Entangling Roots IV, Healing Touch VII, Hibernate II, Shred III, Soothe Animal II and Wrath VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Freewind Post.\nF\t\tFreewind Post\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the lifts and the mountain path to visit Dorn Plainstalker.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1394\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the path and lifts to Freewind Post.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Thunder Bluff.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy three Soothing Spices for Jarl at the city cooking supplies shop. Keep An Unholy Alliance, the Scarlet Key, monastery quest and Booty Bay gem." },
  { name = "38-39 Dustwallow Marsh (Horde)", title = "38-39 Dustwallow Marsh", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Horde", lo = 38, hi = 39, next = "39-42 Stranglethorn Vale (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Brackenwall and Shady Rest, northern marsh quests and Swamplight Manor. Ends in Grom’gol.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Thunder Bluff at 38 with three Soothing Spices and the Booty Bay gem. Keep An Unholy Alliance, the Scarlet Key and monastery quest for the later clears.\nX\t\t\t38\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t45.81\t64.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Pala for the marsh return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Thunder Bluff\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Camp Taurajo. Follow the southern Barrens road, then take the eastern road into Dustwallow Marsh.\nF\t\tCamp Taurajo\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east to the burned Shady Rest Inn; stay clear of the dragonspawn farther south.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1251\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1269\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1268\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1177\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t35.56\t31.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Shardi's flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tBrackenwall Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1251\t\nT\t\t1268\t\nT\t\t1269\t\nA\t\t1321\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1321\t\nA\t\t1322\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t36.49\t30.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Expert First Aid - Under Wraps from Balai Lok'Wein (125 First Aid); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t36.49\t30.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Manual: Heavy Silk Bandage and Manual: Mageweave Bandage from Balai Lok'Wein; use them at 180 and 210 First Aid respectively. Skip manuals already learned.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1201\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill nine hidden Theramore Infiltrators on the northern marsh paths for {q1201}.\nC\t\t1201\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t43.93\t34.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Acidic Venom Sacs from the Darkfang spiders around the northern marsh for {q1322}, avoiding the high-level cave widow.\nC\t\t1322\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t40.96\t36.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Ogron and clear the route before starting his questioning event.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1273\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccompany Ogron to Reethe and protect the group through the confrontation. Remain until the conversation completes for {q1273}.\nC\t\t1273\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the northern paths to Swamplight Manor, avoiding the spider cave.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1218\t\nT\t\t1218\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1206\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1238\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Mirefin Heads on the northern shore for {q1177}.\nC\t\t1177\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead west to Stinky. Clear the nearby raptors and spiders before speaking to him and accepting {q1270}.\nA\t\t1270\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tProtect Stinky while he gathers his plant, then remain with him until the escort completes for {q1270}.\nC\t\t1270\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t32.46\t23.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern marsh paths west and collect forty Unpopped Darkmist Eyes from the lower-level spiders outside Darkmist Cavern for {q1206}; avoid the Widow and cave interior.\nC\t\t1206\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Brackenwall.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1322\t\nA\t\t1323\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1323\t\nT\t\t1273\t\nA\t\t1276\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1201\t\nT\t\t1238\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_NORTHERN_MARSH\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect forty Unpopped Darkmist Eyes from the spiders outside Darkmist Cavern for {q1206}; avoid the Widow and cave interior.\nC\t\t1206\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Clear nearby raptors and spiders, then speak to Stinky and accept {q1270}.\nA\t\t1270\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Protect Stinky through his plant search and the return for {q1270}.\nC\t\t1270\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect twelve Mirefin Heads on the northern shore for {q1177}.\nC\t\t1177\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_NORTHERN_MARSH\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn east to Swamplight Manor.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Loose Dirt again for the next clue, then accept {q1239}.\nA\t\t1239\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1206\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the marsh paths southwest to Mudcrush Durtfeet and turn in {q1177}, then return north to Brackenwall.\nT\t\t1177\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1239\t\nA\t\t1240\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t58.61\t60.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf ready at 225 Fishing, follow the southeastern marsh paths to Nat Pagle and accept {q6607}. Stay outside Theramore and its guards; skip the detour otherwise.\nA\t\t6607\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t19.5\t20.9\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t74.4\t3.7\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t62.1\t51.4\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t22.8\t76.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the four-fish checklist at the scheduled shores for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t35.56\t31.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Thunder Bluff if ready; otherwise return by the northern marsh paths to Brackenwall and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Thunder Bluff\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1276\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1270\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t669\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1180\t\nA\t\t1181\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1181\t\nA\t\t1182\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q95789} and {q95791} from Krazek upstairs in the inn.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Grom'gol.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1240\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 39 before the northern Stranglethorn circuit. If short, hunt isolated level 37-38 Shadowmaw Panthers south of Grom'gol, then return to the outpost.\nX\t\t\t39\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep An Unholy Alliance, the northern jungle quests, Hemet's crate, Encrusted Tail Fins, Kravel's Parts, Goblin Sponsorship, Into the Scarlet Monastery and The Scarlet Key." },
  { name = "39-42 Stranglethorn Vale (Horde)", title = "39-42 Stranglethorn Vale", group = "Bethink's Guide 20-40", faction = "Horde", lo = 39, hi = 42, next = "42-44 Badlands (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Grom’gol and the northern jungle, Drowned City at 39, Scarlet Monastery’s Armory and Cathedral, Razorfen Downs at 40 and the southern jungle quests. Ends in Booty Bay.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Grom'gol at 39 with An Unholy Alliance, the jungle quests, Hemet's crate, the flats deliveries, Into the Scarlet Monastery and The Scarlet Key.\nX\t\t\t39\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V108_KRAZEK_PICKUPS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Drowned City clear, fly to Booty Bay and accept {q95789} and {q95791} from Krazek upstairs in the inn, then fly back to Grom'gol. If that clear is already behind you, skip these quests instead of repeating it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V108_KRAZEK_PICKUPS\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t568\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t570\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t31.49\t29.75\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Thulbek for the northern circuits.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Grom'gol\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t581\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t596\t\nA\t\t629\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Lashtail Raptors east of the northern road for {q568}.\nC\t\t568\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Snapjaw Crocolisk Skins from the northern river for {q577}; ordinary River Crocolisks do not count.\nC\t\t577\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Foreman Cozzle's tower loot his key and open Cozzle's Footlocker in the nearby house and take the Fuel Regulator Blueprints for {q1182}.\nC\t\t1182\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Shadowmaw Panthers and collect eight Shadowmaw Claws. Hunt Stranglethorn Tigresses in the same central jungle area and collect a Pristine Tigress Fang for {q192} and {q570}.\nC\t\t192\t\t\nC\t\t570\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5762\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t192\t\nA\t\t193\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t47.2\t28.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Bhag'thera's hunting grounds, form a party for Bhag'thera.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Bhag'thera with the party, clear nearby panthers and loot her fang for {q193}.\nC\t\t193\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect nine Bloodscalp Tusks and twenty-five Bloody Bone Necklaces from the outer Bal'lal camps for {q581} and {q596}.\nC\t\t581\t\t\nC\t\t596\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t23.2\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Saltscale coast, form a party for the Tail Fins and nearby coastal tablet.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Encrusted Tail Fins from the Saltscale murlocs with the party for {q1107}.\nC\t\t1107\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the coastal tablet site with the party and recover its Tablet Shard for {q629}.\nC\t\t629\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the coast and main road to Grom'gol.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t581\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t596\t\nT\t\t629\t\nA\t\t598\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the hide and charcoal to make a rubbing of the Third Troll Legend in the southwestern ruins of Zul'Kunda for {q95748}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Grom'gol and turn in {q95748}, then accept {q95770}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q95773} from Commander Aggro'gosh.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Brinescale Tridents from Brinescale Skirmishers near the underwater cavern for {q95773}. Drops can be poor; surface for air between pulls.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t21.87\t25.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tExplore the cavern entrance west of the Vile Reef for {q95770}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Grom'gol and turn in {q95770}, then accept {q95775}. Keep the hide and charcoal.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the coast to the western Vile Reef cavern approach.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_DROWNED_CITY_IDOL\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Drowned City clear, visit Mazu'kon on Mulgore's Skywatcher Plateau and accept {q96774}. Return through Thunder Bluff and Orgrimmar to Grom'gol. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest.\nA\t\t96774\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_DROWNED_CITY_IDOL\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t21.87\t25.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the western Vile Reef cavern approach.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Drowned City party with a tank and healer.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t21.87\t25.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western edge of the Vile Reef together. Clear the Brinescale naga at the cavern, follow it into Sunken Hollow and meet at the instance portal.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Deathless Marrow during the clear and loot an Ancient Gurubashi Idol for {q96774}.\nC\t\t96774\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Voodoo-Infused Artifacts from Saltseer pirates for {q95789}. The party may not find enough for everyone in one clear; skip this quest and its turn-in if short.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill three Saltseer Coroners and Captain Dreadrise for {q95791}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse the hide and charcoal on all four I'lalai tablets for {q95775}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Var'Taka for {q95776}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Drowned City and complete one clear through Min'loth the Serpent. Continue through the submerged passages and dry platforms, then leave by the cleared cavern.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Singing Blue Crystals from Strip Miners and Tinkerers in the Venture Co. mine for {q600}.\nC\t\t600\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the main road to Grom'gol.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t570\t\nA\t\t572\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q568} and {q95776} to Commander Aggro'gosh, then accept {q569}.\nT\t\t568\t\nA\t\t569\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95775} to Kin'weelay.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.55\t30.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Mosh'Ogg Brutes and five Witch Doctors in the nearby outer mound for {q569}.\nC\t\t569\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Grom'gol if ready; otherwise return by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Grom'gol\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t569\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95791} to Krazek.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q95789} to Krazek if you collected all ten artifacts; otherwise skip this turn-in.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t209\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t600\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1182\t\nA\t\t1183\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t28.99\t75.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Blacksmithing from Brikk Keencraft in the house behind the shops near Booty Bay's land exit (level 35, 200 Blacksmithing); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t577\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to the zeppelin base.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the zeppelin to Tirisfal and enter Undercity by the main lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3341\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northeastern Tirisfal road past Brill to Scarlet Monastery's entrance. Join a five-player party with a tank and healer for the Armory; bring the Scarlet Key and keep the quest with Loksey already credited.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t84.8\t32.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tUnlock the Armory and complete one clear through Herod. Avoid his whirlwind and gather the incoming trainees before attacking them.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tReturn to the vestibule after defeating Herod for {q1048}.\nC\t\t1048\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Cathedral portal, join a five-player party with a tank and healer, unlock the wing and clear through Mograine and Whitemane. Clear the side rooms and full cathedral before the final pull.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish Into the Scarlet Monastery for {q1048}, then leave by the cleared vestibule.\nC\t\t1048\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by road and the main Undercity lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1048\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 40 before the class unlock and Razorfen Downs. If short, fly to Tarren Mill and hunt isolated level 39-40 Syndicate on the outer Alterac slopes, then fly back.\nX\t\t\t40\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Demon Armor III, Immolate V, Curse of the Elements III, Create Soulstone III and Howl of Terror; learn Shadowburn when talented. Learn Voidwalker Torment IV and Sacrifice IV. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Martha Strain nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.4\t17.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Baltus Fowler, learn Cleave III, Execute III, Heroic Strike VI, Plate Mail and Rend V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Safe Fall, Stealth III, Feint III and Eviscerate VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Wound Poison II (180 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t75.2\t51.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Ezekiel Graves.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Divine Spirit II, Fade IV, Greater Heal I, Inner Fire IV, Mana Burn III, Mind Blast VI, Prayer of Healing II, Shackle Undead II and Shadow Word: Death II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tUndead Priest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Touch of Weakness IV and Dark Sacrifice III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Hex of Weakness IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.08\t15.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Garen Largo, learn Plate Mail, Consecration III, Hammer of Justice III, Devotion Aura V, Shadow Resistance Aura II and Seal of Light II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t21.95\t46.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by its main lifts and follow the western road to Bandarion Keep. Speak with Hilda the Breaker about your class mount.\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tComplete A Trusty Steed for Summon Warhorse, following your class quest's objectives and turn-ins.\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road and main lifts to Undercity before continuing.\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.19\t15.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Lexington Mortaim, learn Portal: Undercity.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t85.14\t10.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anastasia Hartwell, learn Frostfire Bolt I, Conjure Water V, Ice Armor II, Frost Nova III and Polymorph III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t82.78\t15.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Runes of Portals and replenish Runes of Teleportation from Hannah Akeley.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t4489\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t67.74\t37.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Norman for the Razorfen Downs return; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Undercity\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Artisan Cooking, buy twelve Giant Eggs, ten Zesty Clam Meat and twenty Alterac Swiss at the Auction House if ready for 225 Cooking; skip otherwise.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Orgrimmar zeppelin outside Undercity.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Mail, Chain Heal I, Chain Lightning II, Call of the Spirits, Flame Shock IV, Healing Stream Totem III, Healing Wave VII, Lightning Shield V, Searing Totem IV and Windfury Weapon II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Beast II, Aspect of the Pack, Distracting Shot IV, Freezing Trap II, Hunter's Mark III, Mail, Raptor Strike VI, Track Giants and Volley I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.32\t14.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xao'tsu, learn Growl V. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Cower II, Dire Bear Form, Feline Grace, Ferocious Bite III, Hurricane I, Innervate, Mark of the Wild V, Moonfire VII, Prowl II, Rebirth III, Rejuvenation VII and Tranquility II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.99\t45.68\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Ashwood Seeds from Hagrus for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t4489\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q4490}, then turn in {q4490} to Strahad to learn Summon Felsteed.\nA\t\t4490\t\nT\t\t4490\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.34\t27.72\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Engineering from Buzzek Bracketswing outside the inn (level 35, 200 Engineering); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.63\t28.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf ready at 225 Cooking, complete Clamlette Surprise with Dirge Quikcleave using the purchased ingredients to learn Artisan Cooking; skip otherwise.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1107\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1112\t\nA\t\t1114\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1114\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1115\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1183\t\nA\t\t1186\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1186}, then accept {q1187}; keep it for the later Dustwallow visit.\nT\t\t1186\t\nA\t\t1187\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Camp Taurajo and follow the Gold Road south.\nF\t\tCamp Taurajo\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the eastern thorn path at the Great Lift to Razorfen Downs's entrance, remaining above the elevator.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6626\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V108_COLDBRINGER_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Razorfen Downs clear, visit Sutara Plainstalker on Mulgore's Skywatcher Plateau and accept {q97196}. Return through Thunder Bluff and Camp Taurajo to the entrance. If that clear is already behind you, skip this quest instead of repeating it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V108_COLDBRINGER_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Razorfen Downs party with a tank and healer for the outer thorn quest and dungeon clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWith the party, clear eight Battleguards, eight Thornweavers and eight Death's Head Cultists from the outer thorn passages before entering for {q6626}.\nC\t\t6626\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSearch the outer thorn camps with the party, including the huts south of Myriam Moonsinger, for Ambassador Malcin. He can occupy different huts; defeat him and loot his head for {q6521}.\nC\t\t6521\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6626\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Razorfen Downs together and complete one clear. Ring the gong for one wave at a time, clear each wave, then defeat Tuten'kash.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWith the party, accept {q3523} from Belnistrasz; leave the escort unaccepted until everyone has turned this in and confirmed they're ready.\nA\t\t3523\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLet everyone turn in {q3523}, then confirm that the party is ready before starting the escort.\nT\t\t3523\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce everyone has turned in and confirmed they're ready, accept {q3525}.\nA\t\t3525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the escort route, accompany Belnistrasz to the idol and protect his ritual for {q3525}.\nC\t\t3525\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q3525} at Belnistrasz's Brazier after the ritual to claim the reward.\nT\t\t3525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Mordresh and Glutton, defeat Amnennar and loot the Skull of the Coldbringer for {q3341}.\nC\t\t3341\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot the blue orb beside Amnennar for {q97196}. Have everyone collect it promptly before leaving.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared entrance.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t44.45\t59.15\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Undercity if ready; otherwise return to Camp Taurajo and fly to Orgrimmar.\nH\t\tHearth to Undercity\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Orgrimmar, take the Tirisfal zeppelin and enter Undercity by its main lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3341\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Jade at the Auction House for Items of Power.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Gold Road south to the Dustwallow road, then visit Tabetha by the marsh paths.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_WAND_CATCHUP\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Library clear, visit your Mage trainer in Undercity and accept {q1947}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-ups.\nA\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Travel through Booty Bay and Ratchet to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh, then turn in {q1947}.\nT\t\t1947\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: At Tabetha, accept {q1948} and {q1949}.\nA\t\t1948\t\nA\t\t1949\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Magus Tirth on the Shimmering Flats and turn in {q1949}, then accept {q1950}.\nT\t\t1949\t\nA\t\t1950\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Target Plucky Johnson, use /beckon and speak to him in human form for {q1950}.\nC\t\t1950\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Magus Tirth, turn in {q1950} and accept {q1951}. Return through Ratchet and Booty Bay to Undercity before the Monastery journey.\nT\t\t1950\t\nA\t\t1951\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Witherbark Totem Sticks in Arathi, clear the Thundering Exiles at the Circle of Outer Binding and use the sticks at its central stone. Loot the Bolt Charged Bramble for {q1948}.\nC\t\t1948\t2\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect Rituals of Power during the scheduled Library clear for {q1951}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this wand quest and its follow-ups instead of repeating it.\nC\t\t1951\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Buy one Jade, return through Booty Bay and Ratchet to Tabetha and turn in {q1948} and {q1951}.\nT\t\t1948\t\nT\t\t1951\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_WAND_CATCHUP\nS\tMage\t\t\nT\t\t1948\t\nT\t\t1951\t\nA\t\t1952\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Tabetha after her ritual and turn in {q1952}. Accept {q1954}.\nT\t\t1952\t\nA\t\t1954\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ratchet by the marsh road and Gold Road.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Desolace.\nF\t\tShadowprey Village\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect an Infernal Orb from Burning Blade Summoners in Mannoroc Coven for {q1954}.\nC\t\t1954\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the flight point.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet and return by the marsh paths to Tabetha.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1954}. Clear the nearby wildlife and form a party for the level-40 elite Demon of the Orb before accepting {q1955}.\nT\t\t1954\t\nA\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the summoned demon for {q1955} and turn in {q1955} immediately, before the timer expires.\nC\t\t1955\t\t\nT\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1956}; keep it for Uldaman.\nA\t\t1956\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ratchet by the marsh road and Gold Road.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6521\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Green Hills pages 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26 and 27 at the Undercity Auction House. Keep the fifteen pages together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Grom'gol zeppelin outside Undercity. Continue the southern jungle journey from Grom'gol.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twenty-five Split Bone Necklaces and eighteen Skullsplitter Tusks from level 39-40 Skullsplitter Warriors and Mystics for {q598} and {q209}; avoid the higher-level trolls and patrols.\nC\t\t598\t\t\nC\t\t209\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Jungle Stalkers in the western hunting grounds collecting ten Jungle Stalker Feathers for {q572} and {q196}.\nC\t\t572\t\t\nC\t\t196\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Grom'gol.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t572\t\nA\t\t571\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t598\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay for the southern quests.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t209\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1115}, then accept {q1116}. Accept {q2864}; keep Tran'rek's introduction for Gadgetzan.\nT\t\t1115\t\nA\t\t1116\t\nA\t\t2864\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.04\t77.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Skindle for the final jungle circuit.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q580}; keep the grog errand for the Hinterlands coast.\nA\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t621\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t617\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q606}. Accept {q2872}; keep Stoley's delivery for Steamwheedle Port.\nA\t\t606\t\nA\t\t2872\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t628\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t595\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Bloodsail Correspondence in the cove north of Booty Bay, then turn in {q595}.\nT\t\t595\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t597\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Mistvale Giblets and an Aged Gorilla Sinew from Elder Mistvale Gorillas for {q606} and {q571}; keep ten Gorilla Fangs for Unbagwa.\nC\t\t606\t\t\nC\t\t571\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t606\t\nA\t\t607\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t597\t\nA\t\t599\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t576\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t607\t\nA\t\t609\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t599\t\nA\t\t604\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t587\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 41 before the southern quests. If short, kill isolated level 40-41 Jungle Stalkers, then return to Booty Bay.\nX\t\t\t41\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the southern Bloodsail camps, kill ten Swashbucklers, collect the Charts and Orders, fifteen Snuff and Dizzy's Eye for {q604}, {q587}, and {q576}.\nC\t\t604\t\t\nC\t\t587\t\t\nC\t\t576\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.05\t60.88\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Unbagwa's cave and finish collecting ten Gorilla Fangs from nearby gorillas. Form a party with area damage or crowd control for Mokk's waves, then give the fangs to Unbagwa to begin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tProtect Unbagwa through the waves and loot Mokk's heart for {q348}.\nC\t\t348\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t40.0\t58.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou may want to group up for Voodoo Dues if you find the tightly packed camps challenging. Kill Chucky Ten Thumbs at the Zanzil ruins and take his ring.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t34.92\t51.84\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Jon-Jon the Crow and take his spyglass.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Maury and take his clubbed foot for {q609}.\nC\t\t609\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Zanzil's Mixture from the nearby Zanzil trolls and undead for {q621}.\nC\t\t621\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return south by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t587\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t621\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t604\t\nA\t\t608\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t609\t\nA\t\t613\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t576\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill an Elder Saltwater Crocolisk and loot its skin for {q628}.\nC\t\t628\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t571\t\nA\t\t573\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t19.5\t20.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's fishing quest, fish from the Savage Coast for the Savage Coast Blue Sailfin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Bundles of Akiris Reed from the Brinescale naga in the Vile Reef for {q617}.\nC\t\t617\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t193\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t338\t\nA\t\t339\t\nT\t\t339\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t340\t\nT\t\t340\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t341\t\nT\t\t341\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t342\t\nT\t\t342\t\nT\t\t338\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t196\t\nA\t\t197\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t28.74\t44.85\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Tethis's hunting grounds, form a party for Tethis.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWith the party, hunt Tethis west of the road and take his talon for {q197}.\nC\t\t197\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Naga Explorers near the southern Holy Spring and collect Holy Spring Water for {q573}. Approach by the cleared shore.\nC\t\t573\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Grom'gol.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t573\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t197\t\nA\t\t208\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t38.21\t35.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt King Bangalash's hill approach, form a party for his head.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach King Bangalash's hill by its slope with the party, clear his surroundings and take his head for {q208}.\nC\t\t208\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t208\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t51.5\t28.54\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Mosh'Ogg mound's cave entrance, form a party for Maury's Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWith the party, collect Maury's Key from the Mosh'Ogg ogres for {q613} before leaving the mound.\nC\t\t613\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return south by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t613\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t617\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t628\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8551\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 42 before the next journey. If short, hunt isolated level 41-42 Jungle Stalkers on open ground then return to Booty Bay.\nX\t\t\t42\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep Dream Dust in the Swamp, Martek's letter, Stoley's introduction, Tran'rek's introduction, the grog errand and Razzeric's Tweaking." },
  { name = "42-44 Badlands (Horde)", title = "42-44 Badlands", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 42, hi = 44, next = "44-45 Tanaris (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Stonard and the Swamp of Sorrows, Badlands fieldwork, then Uldaman's outer tunnels and dungeon in one visit at 44. Ends in Kargath.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Booty Bay at 42 with Dream Dust in the Swamp, Martek's letter and the later Tanaris and grog deliveries.\nX\t\t\t42\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Grom'gol, then take the road north. Bypass the Rebel Camp and Duskwood towns.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Duskwood road east, skirt Darkshire on its southern outside approach and take the Deadwind Pass road east to the Swamp of Sorrows. Stay on the road through the pass.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1389} from Magtoor at the Harborage.\nA\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Specks of Dream Dust from the green whelps in the western swamp for {q1116}. Pull away from the dragon patrols.\nC\t\t1116\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t46.07\t54.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point.\nP\t\tStonard\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q698} from Dar.\nA\t\t698\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t48.53\t55.85\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Alchemy from Rogvar on the first landing inside Stonard's largest building (level 35, 200 Alchemy); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1418\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1424\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SWAMP_ENTRY\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Magtoor at the Harborage and accept {q1389} before Fallow Sanctuary.\nA\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Specks of Dream Dust from the western swamp's green whelps for {q1116}; avoid dragon patrols.\nC\t\t1116\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SWAMP_ENTRY\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Draenethyst Crystals at Fallow Sanctuary for {q1389}.\nC\t\t1389\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t74.4\t3.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's quest, fish the northern Misty Reed Strand for the Misty Reed Mahi Mahi.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Galen's immediate camp before speaking to him and accepting {q1393} to start his escort.\nA\t\t1393\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Galen to safety through the ambushes for {q1393}.\nC\t\t1393\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1393\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MISTY_REED_FISH\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying Nat's quest, catch the Misty Reed Mahi Mahi along the northern Misty Reed Strand for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MISTY_REED_FISH\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Unprepared Sawtooth Flanks from Sawtooth Crocolisks in the central swamp for {q698}.\nC\t\t698\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGather ten Atal'ai Artifacts around the Pool of Tears for {q1424}.\nC\t\t1424\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the southeastern marsh paths to Tok'Kar at Misty Reed Post, then turn in {q698} and accept {q699}.\nT\t\t698\t\nA\t\t699\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Sawtooth Snapper Claws from Sawtooth Snappers along the southern coast for {q699}. Stay outside Stagalbog Cave.\nC\t\t699\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tok'Kar and turn in {q699}, then accept {q1422}.\nT\t\t699\t\nA\t\t1422\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1422} to Katar nearby.\nT\t\t1422\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 43 before the coastal murlocs. If short, kill isolated level 41-42 Sawtooth Snappers along the shore, then return to the post.\nX\t\t\t43\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1426\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t88.0\t78.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Marsh Murlocs, ten Marsh Inkspewers and ten Marsh Flesheaters along the southern Misty Reed Strand for {q1426}. Stay outside the cave and avoid the stronger northern camps and Somnus's patrol.\nC\t\t1426\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Katar and turn in {q1426}, then accept {q1427}.\nT\t\t1426\t\nA\t\t1427\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1427} to Tok'Kar.\nT\t\t1427\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west to Stonard.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1424\t\nA\t\t1429\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1389} to Magtoor at the Harborage.\nT\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t46.07\t54.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay if ready; otherwise return to Stonard and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1116\t\nA\t\t1117\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Grom'gol.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin and enter Undercity by the main lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2342\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Death Coil, Curse of Weakness V, Curse of Recklessness III, Shadow Ward II and Searing Pain IV; learn Voidwalker Consume Shadows IV. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Martha Strain nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.4\t17.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Baltus Fowler, learn Battle Shout V and Intercept II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.9\t58.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by its main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Shaman training.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Fire Nova IV, Fire Resistance Totem II, Grace of Air Totem I and Windfury Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t50.8\t13.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin back and enter Undercity by its main lifts before continuing.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Vanish II, Kick III, Slice and Dice II and Ambush IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Holy Fire V, Power Word: Shield VII, Psychic Scream III, Shadow Protection II and Shadow Word: Pain VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.08\t15.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Garen Largo, learn Cleanse, Flash of Light IV, Blessing of Might V, Seal of Fury V, Seal of Righteousness VI and Seal of the Crusader V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t85.14\t10.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anastasia Hartwell, learn Arcane Intellect IV, Conjure Food V, Fireball VIII and Cone of Cold III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by the main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Hunter training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Serpent Sting VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.32\t14.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xao'tsu, learn Great Stamina VII, Natural Armor VII. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin back and return through the Undercity lifts before continuing.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Demoralizing Roar IV, Faerie Fire III, Maul V, Ravage II, Regrowth VI and Starfire IV. Learn Lacerate III when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar, then return through the main lifts to Undercity.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Frost Oil, one Gyrochronatom, one Healing Potion, one Lesser Invisibility Potion and one Patterned Bronze Bracers for Lotwil and Lucien. Repair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Hammerfall.\nF\t\tHammerfall\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t73.41\t36.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Doctor Gregory Victor, complete Triage when eligible (level 35, 225 First Aid) to learn Artisan First Aid. Save fifteen patients before six die: critically injured first, then badly injured. Skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel south across the Thandol Span into Wetlands. Follow the road south through Dun Algaz to Loch Modan, bypass Thelsamar and take the southeastern pass into Badlands. Stay clear of Alliance guards and camps.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western Badlands road to Kargath.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t3.99\t44.78\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Gorrik's flight point before entering the camp.\nP\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t782\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t2.82\t45.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Shul'kar for Badlands returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Kargath\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2258\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1418\t\nA\t\t1419\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t710\t\nA\t\t713\t\nT\t\t713\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t714\t\nT\t\t714\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t715\t\nT\t\t715\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Small Stone Shards and five Rock Elemental Shards from Lesser Rock Elementals on the western slopes for {q710} and {q2258}.\nC\t\t710\t\t\nC\t\t2258\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t710\t\nA\t\t711\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1106\t\nA\t\t1108\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2418\t\nA\t\t703\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect thirty Coyote Jawbones and ten Crag Coyote Fangs from the central Badlands coyotes for {q1419} and {q2258}.\nC\t\t1419\t\t\nC\t\t2258\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Buzzard Wings and five Buzzard Gizzards from the eastern Badlands buzzards for {q703} and {q2258}.\nC\t\t703\t\t\nC\t\t2258\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Indurium Flakes from Stonevault Bonesnappers at Agmond's End for {q1108}.\nC\t\t1108\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t709\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect three Large Stone Slabs from ordinary Rock Elementals on the southern ridge for {q711}.\nC\t\t711\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t711\t\nA\t\t712\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Bracers of Rock Binding from Greater Rock Elementals for {q712}.\nC\t\t712\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the western Dustbelcher camps, form a party for Boss Tho'grun and Lotwil's guardian.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Boss Tho'grun's patrol with the party, defeat him and his guards, then loot the Sign of the Earth for {q782}.\nC\t\t782\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn with the party to Lotwil's camp. Turn in {q712}, then accept {q734}.\nT\t\t712\t\nA\t\t734\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t734\t\nA\t\t716\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t716\t\nA\t\t777\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t777\t\nA\t\t778\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Lotwil again, then defeat the summoned Fam'retor Guardian with the party and take the shackles for {q778}.\nC\t\t778\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t778\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kargath if ready; otherwise return by the western road.\nH\t\tHearth to Kargath\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2258\t\nA\t\t2202\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t782\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1419\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 44 before Uldaman. If short, hunt isolated level 43-44 central Badlands wildlife, then return to Kargath.\nX\t\t\t44\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before leaving Kargath for Uldaman.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_PREPARATION\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Uldaman clear, visit Tabetha and accept {q1954}. If that clear is already behind you, skip this staff chain.\nA\t\t1954\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Mannoroc Coven in Desolace and collect an Infernal Orb from Burning Blade Summoners for {q1954}.\nC\t\t1954\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Tabetha and turn in {q1954}. Clear nearby wildlife and form a party for the level-40 elite Demon of the Orb before accepting {q1955}.\nT\t\t1954\t\nA\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Defeat the summoned demon for {q1955} and turn in {q1955} before its timer expires.\nC\t\t1955\t\t\nT\t\t1955\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q1956} from Tabetha, then return through Ratchet, Booty Bay and Grom’gol, Undercity and Hammerfall to Uldaman before joining the clear.\nA\t\t1956\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t43.8\t10.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel to Uldaman's northern excavation entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Uldaman party with a tank and healer ready for Archaedas. Complete the outer-tunnel quests together, then continue through the full dungeon.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twelve Magenta Fungus Caps from the outer tunnels and dungeon for {q2202}; retain the full stack for Jarkal.\nC\t\t2202\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Dentrium and eight An'Alleum Power Stones from outer-tunnel Shadowforge dwarves for {q2418}.\nC\t\t2418\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Garrett's Family Treasure from the family chest in the South Common Hall of the outer tunnels for {q2342}.\nC\t\t2342\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tablet of Ryun'eh from the Ancient Chest in the outer tunnels for {q709}.\nC\t\t709\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through the outer tunnels together and enter the main instance portal.\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat the Obsidian Sentinel and loot the Obsidian Power Source for {q1956}.\nC\t\t1956\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Baelog before continuing. Read his journal and take Gni'kiv's Medallion from his chest; defeat Revelosh for the Shaft of Tsol. Combine the Staff of Prehistoria and use it in the Map Chamber to reach Ironaya.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Ironaya with the party.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear the scorpion room between the Map Chamber and Temple Hall, then learn Artisan Enchanting from Annora (level 35, 200 Enchanting); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear through the trogg and earthen halls to Archaedas. Let the tank gather the awakened guardians before attacking. Complete the clear and enter the final chamber.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Discs of Norgannon, speak to the Lore Keeper and hear his full explanation, then accept {q2278}.\nA\t\t2278\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tActivate the Discs of Norgannon again to turn in {q2278}.\nT\t\t2278\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccess the Discs again to accept {q2280}, the miniature-disc follow-up for Thunder Bluff.\nA\t\t2280\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared outer tunnels and return to the Badlands camps.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1108\t\nA\t\t1137\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t703\t\nT\t\t2418\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t709\t\nA\t\t728\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kargath if ready; otherwise return by the western road.\nH\t\tHearth to Kargath\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2202\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the miniature discs, Patrick Garrett's treasure, Yagyin's Digest delivery and the carried flats, Tanaris and grog errands." },
  { name = "44-45 Tanaris (Horde)", title = "44-45 Tanaris", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 44, hi = 45, next = "45-47 Feralas (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "The southern jungle finales, Tanaris coast quests and one Krol'dok Stronghold clear. Ends at Camp Mojache.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Kargath at 44 after Uldaman. Keep the miniature discs, city rewards.\nX\t\t\t44\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Tarren Mill.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the eastern Hillsbrad road to Durnholde and the northern pass into the Hinterlands.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead a Venom Bottle at the Witherbark camp to accept {q2933}.\nA\t\t2933\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the pass and road to Tarren Mill. Turn in {q2933} to Apothecary Lydon, then accept {q2934}.\nT\t\t2933\t\nA\t\t2934\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the pass to the southern Hinterlands and collect an Undamaged Venom Sac from a Witherbark Broodguard for {q2934}.\nC\t\t2934\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the pass and road to Tarren Mill. Turn in {q2934}, then accept {q2935}.\nT\t\t2934\t\nA\t\t2935\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2342\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t728\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Corruption V, Shadow Bolt VII, Drain Mana III, Health Funnel V and Subjugate Demon II; learn Imp Fire Shield IV. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Martha Strain nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.4\t17.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Baltus Fowler, learn Demoralizing Shout IV, Overpower III and Revenge IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.9\t58.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by its main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Shaman training.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Lesser Healing Wave IV, Lightning Bolt VIII, Nature Resistance Totem II, Rockbiter Weapon VI and Stoneskin Totem V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Backstab VI, Rupture IV and Shank II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Instant Poison IV (200 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Devouring Plague IV, Flash Heal V, Mind Control II, Mind Vision II and Renew VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Shadowguard IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.08\t15.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Garen Largo, learn Holy Strike VI, Exorcism IV, Blessing of Wisdom IV, Frost Resistance Aura II and Hammer of Wrath I.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t85.14\t10.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anastasia Hartwell, learn Frostbolt VIII, Blizzard IV and Mana Shield IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by the main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Hunter training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aimed Shot IV, Arcane Shot VI, Explosive Trap II, Mend Pet V and Mongoose Bite III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Barkskin, Healing Touch VIII, Rake III, Rip IV, Swipe IV and Thorns V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tShaman/Hunter/Druid\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t50.8\t13.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Grom'gol zeppelin outside Orgrimmar.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf not already in Grom'gol, fly there.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t36.95\t69.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gorlash's shore, form a party for Smotts's Chest.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the shoreline around Gorlash with the party, then kill him and loot Smotts' Chest for {q8551}.\nC\t\t8551\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBoard each Bloodsail ship from its gangplank and clear its decks before entering the cabins.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t32.87\t88.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Captain Stillwater aboard the eastern ship.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t29.32\t88.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Captain Keelhaul aboard the western ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Fleet Master Firallon aboard the southern ship for {q608}, then return to shore.\nC\t\t608\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Booty Bay by the cleared shore and main road.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t608\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8551\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Grom'gol.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2280\t\nA\t\t2440\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2440\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Brackenwall Village, then travel southeast through the marsh to Tabetha. Keep clear of Theramore and dragonspawn camps.\nF\t\tBrackenwall Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q2846}; keep it for Zul'Farrak.\nA\t\t2846\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_LOOT\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If still in the scheduled Uldaman clear, loot the Obsidian Power Source from the Obsidian Sentinel for {q1956}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-ups instead of repeating the dungeon.\nC\t\t1956\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MAGE_ULDAMAN_LOOT\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1956} to Tabetha. Clear the nearby wildlife, then accept {q1957}.\nT\t\t1956\t\nA\t\t1957\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat twelve Mana Surges within the time limit for {q1957}, then turn in {q1957}.\nC\t\t1957\t\t\nT\t\t1957\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1958}, then turn in {q1958} to claim the staff.\nA\t\t1958\t\nT\t\t1958\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Seaforium Booster from the wreck cargo beside Tabetha for {q1187} before returning north.\nC\t\t1187\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Brackenwall by the northern paths.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t992\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2864\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead the Gadgetzan wanted poster, then accept {q2781}.\nA\t\t2781\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2875\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.51\t27.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Fizzgrimble in the inn. Repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1707\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t1690\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Wastewander Bandits and ten Thieves east of Gadgetzan, collecting five Wastewander Water Pouches for {q1690} and {q1707}.\nC\t\t1690\t\t\nC\t\t1707\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1707\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1690\t\nA\t\t1691\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Wastewander Shadow Mages, eight Rogues and six Assassins for {q1691}.\nC\t\t1691\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Caliph's guards and defeat him for {q2781}.\nC\t\t2781\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the Sandsorrow water hole and defeat the disturbed insects for {q992}.\nC\t\t992\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q992}, then accept {q82}; keep the insect-parts quest for the later southern Tanaris circuit.\nT\t\t992\t\nA\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1691\t\nT\t\t2781\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide east to Steamwheedle Port.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8365\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3520\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8366\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2872\t\nA\t\t2873\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t71.58\t43.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the coast south through the Lost Rigger Cove tunnel to the pirate compound.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Southsea Pirates, ten Freebooters, ten Dock Workers and ten Swashbucklers, collecting twenty Southsea Pirate Hats for {q8366} and {q8365}.\nC\t\t8366\t\t\nC\t\t8365\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Stoley's Shipment from the building in the compound for {q2873}.\nC\t\t2873\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Andre Firebeard and loot his head for {q2875}.\nC\t\t2875\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tOpen Pirate's Footlockers looted during the pirate clear. If you find a Ship Schedule, use it to accept {q2876}; keep its delivery for the port return.\nU\t\t9250\t\nA\t\t2876\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the tunnel to Steamwheedle Port.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2875\t\nT\t\t8366\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t67.06\t23.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2876} if you obtained the Ship Schedule.\nT\t\t2876\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8365\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2873\t\nA\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before boarding the Powderfuse Port ship.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Powderfuse Port ship from Steamwheedle Port to the Riverglades.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t76.62\t53.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tFrom Powderfuse Port, take the inland roads northwest toward Krol'dok Stronghold.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tRiverglades\t48.4\t25.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the northern fortress approach. Join a five-player Krol'dok Stronghold party with a tank and healer, then clear the guarded approach together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Krol'dok Stronghold together at 44+.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Krol'dok Stronghold through its final boss, Overlord Mugg, then leave by the cleared approach.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan if ready; otherwise return to Powderfuse Port, take the Steamwheedle ship and ride west to Gadgetzan.\nH\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1117}, then accept {q1118}; keep Kravel's scheme for the later Booty Bay visit.\nT\t\t1117\t\nA\t\t1118\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1137\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2770\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1187\t\nA\t\t1188\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south through the pass to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1188\t\nA\t\t1189\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1189\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 45 before Feralas. If short, return through the pass to hunt isolated level 44-45 Rocs or Glasshide Basilisks in northern Tanaris, then return to the flats.\nX\t\t\t45\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the canyon road west past Freewind Post and continue into Feralas. Stay on the main road to Camp Mojache.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t75.45\t44.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the flight point on arrival.\nP\t\tCamp Mojache\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep Screecher Spirits, Tiara of the Deep, Gahz'rilla, Martek's completed news, Stoley's bottle and the later Booty Bay and Sunken Temple preparations." },
  { name = "45-47 Feralas (Horde)", title = "45-47 Feralas", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 45, hi = 47, next = "47-48 Tanaris (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Camp Mojache’s Woodpaw, Gordunni and Zukk’ash circuits, the coastal work and northern caves. Ends in Gadgetzan.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Camp Mojache at 45 with Screecher Spirits and the carried Zul'Farrak preparations.\nX\t\t\t45\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.8\t45.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Greul for the eastern circuits; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Camp Mojache\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.49\t43.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Shyrka Wolfrunner, keeping a free slot for the training tame.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t88.95\t39.24\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east toward Thalanaar. Tame a Longtooth Runner; use Bite VI in combat until the learning message appears.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.49\t43.27\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Shyrka Wolfrunner, release the training tame and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite VI when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.36\t43.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tLearn Artisan Leatherworking from Hahrana Ironhide in the building opposite the inn (level 35, 200 Leatherworking); skip if not ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2822\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2862\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2973\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2975\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2987\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Woodpaw Gnoll Manes from the camps south of Mojache for {q2862}.\nC\t\t2862\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2862\t\nA\t\t2863\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill five Woodpaw Alphas immediately and return within the one-hour limit for {q2863}. Avoid starting another circuit before the delivery.\nC\t\t2863\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2863\t\nA\t\t2902\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSearch the Woodpaw Battle Plans in the southern camp after clearing its guards, then turn in {q2902}.\nT\t\t2902\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2903\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Iridescent Sprite Darter Wings east of the central road for {q2973}.\nC\t\t2973\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2903\t\nA\t\t7730\t\nA\t\t7731\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2973\t\nA\t\t2974\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t75.13\t29.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tPick up the Gordunni Scroll from the ground beside the northern outpost's fires, crates or cave mouths; use it to accept {q2978}.\nU\t\t9370\t\nA\t\t2978\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Gordunni Ogres, ten Ogre-Magi and five Brutes in the northern ogre camp, using Orwin's Shovel at blue-glowing dig sites to collect twelve Gordunni Cobalt for {q2975} and {q2987}.\nC\t\t2975\t\t\nC\t\t2987\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Camp Mojache.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2975\t\nT\t\t2978\t\nA\t\t2979\t\nA\t\t2980\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2987\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t67.09\t38.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twenty Grimtotem Horns in the camp west of Mojache for {q2974}. Use the hillside paths between ledges.\nC\t\t2974\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t62.1\t51.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's quest, catch the Feralas Ahi in the Verdantis River for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Thick Yeti Hides from Feral Scar Yetis on the southern slopes for {q2822}; avoid Bloodroar the Stalker.\nC\t\t2822\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t60.71\t72.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the southern High Wilderness trail. Kill ten Gordunni Shaman, ten Warlocks and five Maulers for {q2980}.\nC\t\t2980\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Gordunni Orb from the Gordunni Mage-Lords in the southern ogre camps for {q2979}.\nC\t\t2979\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: FERALAS_AHI\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t62.1\t51.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying Nat's quest, catch the Feralas Ahi in the Verdantis River for {q6607}.\nC\t\t6607\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: FERALAS_AHI\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Writhing Deep by its southern cave mouth; collect twenty Zukk'ash Carapaces for {q7730}.\nC\t\t7730\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t75.58\t60.85\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the cave tunnels to Stinglasher and loot its glands for {q7731}; do not navigate across the ground above the cave.\nC\t\t7731\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Mojache if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared tunnels and main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Camp Mojache\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2822\t\nA\t\t7734\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7730\t\nT\t\t7731\t\nA\t\t7732\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2974\t\nA\t\t2976\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2980\t\nT\t\t2979\t\nA\t\t3002\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar for the three ready deliveries.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q3002}, then accept {q7068}; keep it for Maraudon.\nT\t\t3002\t\nA\t\t7068\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7732\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2976\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 46 before class training. If short, fly to Camp Mojache and hunt isolated level 45-46 Feral Scar Yetis on the open slopes, then return to Orgrimmar.\nX\t\t\t46\t\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t48.47\t45.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zevrost, learn Life Tap V, Drain Life V, Create Healthstone IV, Create Firestone III and Rain of Fire III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t80.39\t32.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sorek, learn Charge III, Mocking Blow IV, Slam IV and Sunder Armor IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Chain Heal II, Flametongue Weapon V, Frost Shock III, Magma Totem III, Mana Spring Totem III and Windwall Totem II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Gouge IV, Garrote V, Expose Armor IV and Sinister Strike VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Deadly Poison III (210 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Greater Heal II, Mind Blast VII, Resurrection IV and Smite VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Fire Blast VI, Mage Armor II and Arcane Explosion V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.68\t85.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Thuul, learn Portal: Orgrimmar.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.43\t56.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Runes of Portals and replenish Runes of Teleportation from Horthus.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Wild I, Immolation Trap IV, Scare Beast III and Viper Sting II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Orgrimmar by its main gate and follow the road south to Sen'jin Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SPIDER_GOD_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Zul'Farrak clear, read a Venom Bottle at the Hinterlands Witherbark camp and accept {q2933}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this chain.\nA\t\t2933\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill, turn in {q2933} and accept {q2934}.\nT\t\t2933\t\nA\t\t2934\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Durnholde's Hinterlands pass and collect an Undamaged Venom Sac from a Witherbark Broodguard for {q2934}.\nC\t\t2934\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Lydon, turn in {q2934} and accept {q2935}. Travel through Undercity and Orgrimmar to Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village.\nT\t\t2934\t\nA\t\t2935\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SPIDER_GOD_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2935} to Master Gadrin, then accept {q2936}.\nT\t\t2935\t\nA\t\t2936\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to Orgrimmar.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly for Uldum preparation.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2965\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.62\t19.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alodan the Hopeful, learn Holy Light VII, Blessing of Sacrifice I and Retribution Aura IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2965\t\nA\t\t2966\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Thunder Bluff by its lifts and follow the northwest Mulgore paths to Mazu'kon.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t96774\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q97196} to Sutara Plainstalker on the plateau.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the paths and lifts to Thunder Bluff.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Bash III, Dash II, Moonfire VIII, Pounce II, Rejuvenation VIII, Shred IV and Wrath VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Camp Mojache.\nF\t\tCamp Mojache\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3062\t\nA\t\t3063\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3380\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Rage Scar Yeti cave by its entrance and collect ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides for {q7734}.\nC\t\t7734\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you receive a Perfect Yeti Hide, use it to accept {q7738}.\nA\t\t7738\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7003\t\nA\t\t7721\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill three Vale Screechers, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on each corpse and speak to each released spirit for {q3520}.\nC\t\t3520\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t40.93\t25.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker on the coastal giants before killing them; collect fifteen Miniaturization Residues for {q7003}.\nC\t\t7003\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the northern ruins, kill four each of Northspring Harpies, Roguefeathers, Windcallers and Slayers for {q3063}.\nC\t\t3063\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Horn of Hatetalon in the ruins. Form a party at the summoning stones for Edana Hatetalon, then use the horn and defeat Edana Hatetalon with the party and loot her Dark Heart for {q3062}.\nC\t\t3062\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t44.4\t39.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Water Elemental Cores from Sea Sprays and Sea Elementals for {q7721}.\nC\t\t7721\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7003\t\nT\t\t7721\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Mojache if ready; otherwise return east by the main road.\nH\t\tHearth to Camp Mojache\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7734\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.43\t42.91\t\t\t\nT\t\t7738\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3062\t\nT\t\t3063\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 47 before Zul'Farrak. If short, hunt isolated level 46-47 yetis on the cleared northern cave approaches.\nX\t\t\t47\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan. Keep the miniature discs, Sunken Temple introduction and Zul'Farrak preparations.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t" },
  { name = "47-48 Tanaris (Horde)", title = "47-48 Tanaris", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 47, hi = 48, next = "48-49 Searing Gorge (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Southern Tanaris, Zul’Farrak at 47, Revantusk and Jintha’Alor. Ends in Undercity for Searing Gorge.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Gadgetzan at 47 with Screecher Spirits, Gahz'rilla, Tiara of the Deep, Seeing What Happens and The Sunken Temple.\nX\t\t\t47\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.51\t27.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Fizzgrimble. Repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2865\t\nA\t\t3362\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2768\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2605\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3042\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Centipaar Insect Parts in the Noxious Lair for {q82}.\nC\t\t82\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten Dunemaul Brutes, ten Enforcers and Gor'marok the Ravager in the Dunemaul Compound's cave for {q5863}.\nC\t\t5863\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Laden Dew Gland from the Thistleshrub Dew Collectors while killing eight Gnarled Thistleshrubs and eight Rootshapers for {q2605} and {q3362}.\nC\t\t2605\t\t\nC\t\t3362\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the miniature discs to the Uldum Pedestal, then turn in {q2966}.\nT\t\t2966\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2954\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to the Stone Watcher of Norgannon and hear his full explanation for {q2954}.\nC\t\t2954\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the pedestal again, then turn in {q2954}.\nT\t\t2954\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2967\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Tooga after completing the nearby work, then speak to him and accept {q1560} to start his escort.\nA\t\t1560\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLead Tooga east across cleared desert to Torta on the beach south of Steamwheedle Port for {q1560}. Keep Tooga close and let their reunion finish.\nC\t\t1560\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1560\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3520\t\nA\t\t3527\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2605\t\nA\t\t2606\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3362\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2606\t\nA\t\t2641\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t10\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3380\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3444\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t55.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to the Gaping Chasm's spiral descent. Take the north-facing tunnel partway down the spiral to Scrimshank's gear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnels into the large rectangular chamber and take Scrimshank's Surveying Gear from its western corner for {q10}.\nC\t\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan if ready; otherwise leave through the cleared tunnels and ride north.\nH\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t10\t\nA\t\t110\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t110\t\nA\t\t113\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t113\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t32\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SPIDER_GOD_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Zul'Farrak clear, read a Venom Bottle in the Hinterlands Witherbark camp and accept {q2933}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this chain.\nA\t\t2933\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Lydon in Tarren Mill, turn in {q2933} and accept {q2934}.\nT\t\t2933\t\nA\t\t2934\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through the Durnholde pass and collect an Undamaged Venom Sac from a Witherbark Broodguard for {q2934}.\nC\t\t2934\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Lydon, turn in {q2934} and accept {q2935}.\nT\t\t2934\t\nA\t\t2935\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Master Gadrin in Sen'jin, turn in {q2935} and accept {q2936}. Return through Orgrimmar and Gadgetzan before joining the Zul'Farrak party.\nT\t\t2935\t\nA\t\t2936\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SPIDER_GOD_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tTanaris\t39.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide northwest to Zul'Farrak's entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Zul'Farrak party with a tank and healer. Arrange for one member to bring the Mallet of Zul'Farrak for Gahz'rilla.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Zul'Farrak together at 47+. Keep the temple stairs, scarabs and named bosses in this single clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect twenty Vials of Troll Temper during the clear.\nK\t\t9523\t20\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect five Uncracked Scarab Shells from the scarabs for {q2865}.\nC\t\t2865\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear through Antu'sul, Theka the Martyr and Witch Doctor Zum'rah; loot Theka's First Mosh'aru Tablet. Do not open several graves at once.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRead the Tablet of Theka near Theka the Martyr for {q2936}.\nC\t\t2936\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the pyramid, defeat the Executioner and use his key to release the prisoners. Keep together through the stair defense.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLet the prisoners recover and speak to Weegli to open the final gate. Speak to Sergeant Bly after the defense and defeat his group and loot the Divino-matic Rod for {q2768}.\nC\t\t2768\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Hydromancer Velratha and loot her tiara and Second Mosh'aru Tablet for {q2846}.\nC\t\t2846\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect both Mosh'aru Tablets for {q3527}.\nC\t\t3527\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHave the mallet carrier ring Gahz'rilla's gong. Defeat Gahz'rilla and take the Electrified Scale for {q2770}.\nC\t\t2770\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Chief Ukorz Sandscalp and Ruuzlu with the party to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared entrance and ride southeast.\nH\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2768\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3042\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2865\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3527\t\nA\t\t4787\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2770\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south through the pass to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Brackenwall, then take the northern marsh paths to Tabetha.\nF\t\tBrackenwall Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2846\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Brackenwall by the cleared paths.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t32\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar and enter Undercity by the main lifts, then fly to Tarren Mill.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Tarren Mill.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern Hillsbrad road to Durnholde, then take the pass behind the keep north into the Hinterlands. Avoid Aerie Peak; follow the main road east, then the full coastal path down to Revantusk Village.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t81.7\t81.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Gorkas's flight point.\nP\t\tRevantusk Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7815\t\nA\t\t7816\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t78.14\t81.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Lard for the Jintha’Alor return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Revantusk Village\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve bottles of Pupellyverbos Port along the eastern beach while killing fifteen Saltwater Snapjaws for {q580} and {q7815}.\nC\t\t580\t\t\nC\t\t7815\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party at the beach for Gammerita, then defeat her and take her head for {q7816}.\nC\t\t7816\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7815\t\nT\t\t7816\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7845\t\nA\t\t7850\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7830\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7861\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn up the coastal road to the eastern hills.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Skylord Plume from Razorbeak Skylords on the eastern slopes for {q7830}.\nC\t\t7830\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Violet Tragan from the lake beside the Altar of Zul for {q2641}.\nC\t\t2641\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1429\t\nA\t\t1444\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1446}; keep it for the Sunken Temple clear.\nA\t\t1446\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t50.58\t65.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Jintha'Alor's stair approach, form a party with a healer and crowd control for the Vilebranch elites and the Ancient Egg's guards.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t53.38\t67.11\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Jintha'Alor by its full stair route with the party.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Vessels of Tainted Blood from Vilebranch trolls while clearing the terraces with the party for {q7850}.\nC\t\t7850\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t59.47\t78.26\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the upper terraces, defeat Vile Priestess Hexx and finish twenty Aman'zasi Guards with the party for {q7861}.\nC\t\t7861\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Elder Torntusk on the upper terrace. Turn in {q7845}, then accept {q7846}.\nT\t\t7845\t\nA\t\t7846\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t57.32\t86.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue into the cave with the party and defeat Hitah'ya the Keeper and loot the Shackle Key for {q7846}.\nC\t\t7846\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ancient Egg in the cave behind the upper terraces with the party for {q4787}.\nC\t\t4787\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7846\t\nA\t\t7847\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Revantusk Village if ready; otherwise return by the cleared stairs and eastern coastal path.\nH\t\tHearth to Revantusk Village\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7847\t\nT\t\t7861\t\nT\t\t7850\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7830\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 48 before Searing Gorge. If short, hunt isolated level 47-48 eastern Hinterlands wildlife, then return by the coastal road.\nX\t\t\t48\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity for training.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Bane of Agony V, Banish II, Create Spellstone II and Soul Fire; learn eligible talented ranks. Learn Imp Firebolt VI and Voidwalker Sacrifice V / Suffering III. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Martha Strain nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.4\t17.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Baltus Fowler, learn Execute IV, Heroic Strike VII and Thunder Clap V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.9\t58.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by its main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Shaman training.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Ancestral Spirit IV, Chain Lightning III, Earth Shock VI, Flametongue Totem III, Frostbrand Weapon IV, Healing Wave VIII, Lightning Shield VI and Stoneclaw Totem V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t50.8\t13.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin back and enter Undercity by its main lifts before continuing.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Sap III and Eviscerate VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Wound Poison III (220 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Holy Fire VI, Mana Burn IV, Power Word: Fortitude V, Power Word: Shield VIII and Shadow Word: Death III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Codex: Prayer of Fortitude at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t82.78\t15.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Holy Candles from Hannah Akeley for Prayer of Fortitude.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.08\t15.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Garen Largo, learn Redemption IV, Fire Resistance Aura II and Seal of Wisdom II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t85.14\t10.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anastasia Hartwell, learn Conjure Mana Citrine, Fireball IX, Flamestrike V and Arcane Missiles VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by the main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Hunter training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Hawk V, Disengage III and Raptor Strike VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.32\t14.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xao'tsu, learn Great Stamina VIII, Natural Armor VIII. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin back and return through the Undercity lifts before continuing.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Nature's Grasp V, Entangling Roots V, Ferocious Bite IV, Regrowth VII and Revive IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t44.28\t45.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar, then return through the main lifts to Undercity.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy fifteen Silk Cloth for the Grimesilt Outhouse. Repair, restock and keep The Stone Circle, Ancient Egg, Violet Tragan, Temple preparations, Maraudon fragments errand, Stoley's bottle and grog.\nV\t\tvendor\t" },
  { name = "48-49 Searing Gorge (Horde)", title = "48-49 Searing Gorge", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 48, hi = 49, next = "49-50 Desolace (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Thorium Point, the Cauldron and the Torch of Retribution. Ends in Kargath.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Undercity at 48 with fifteen Silk Cloth and the carried Temple, Maraudon and coastal deliveries.\nX\t\t\t48\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Hammerfall for the First Aid training opportunity.\nF\t\tHammerfall\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t73.41\t36.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Doctor Gregory Victor, learn Heavy Mageweave Bandage (240 First Aid), Runecloth Bandage (260) and Heavy Runecloth Bandage (290) when eligible after Triage. Skip ranks already learned or not yet usable.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Kargath.\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the western Badlands pass into Searing Gorge and follow the northern ridge road to Thorium Point.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t34.84\t30.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Grisha's flight point.\nP\t\tThorium Point\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7701\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7728\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7723\t\nA\t\t7724\t\nA\t\t7727\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3441\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tListen to Kalaran's complete story for {q3441}.\nC\t\t3441\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3441\t\nA\t\t3442\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4449\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFor the outhouse, kill eight Dark Iron Geologists and keep the fifteen purchased Silk Cloth for {q4449}.\nC\t\t4449\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4449\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Hearts of Flame from Blazing Elementals in the southeastern basin for {q3442}.\nC\t\t3442\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3442\t\nA\t\t3443\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and clear bags before descending to the Cauldron.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twenty Heavy War Golems around the Cauldron for {q7723}.\nC\t\t7723\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twenty Greater Lava Spiders on the western plateaus for {q7724}.\nC\t\t7724\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Lookout's Spyglass from Dark Iron Lookouts at the western tower for {q7728}.\nC\t\t7728\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Smithing Tuyere from Dark Iron Steamsmiths near the Cauldron's western rim for {q7728}.\nC\t\t7728\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t39.76\t21.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Cauldron's northern ramps to enter the Slag Pit. Follow its passages to the raised work platforms; do not jump into the lava.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Dark Iron Taskmasters and fifteen Slavers inside and around the Slag Pit, collecting eight Thorium Plated Daggers from the dwarves for {q7729} and {q3443}.\nC\t\t7729\t\t\nC\t\t3443\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party at the upper platform for Overseer Maltorius, clear his guards and defeat him with the party; take the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux beside him for {q7701} and {q7722}.\nC\t\t7701\t\t\nC\t\t7722\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnels down to the Incendosaur lava cavern and kill twenty for {q7727}. Return by the tunnel ramps.\nC\t\t7727\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the northern ramps and return to Kalaran.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3443\t\nA\t\t3452\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Twilight camp approach, form a party and clear the Twilight camps northwest of the Cauldron and collect a Symbol of Ragnaros for {q3452}.\nC\t\t3452\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3452\t\nA\t\t3453\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWait for Kalaran to finish forging the torch for {q3453}.\nC\t\t3453\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3453\t\nA\t\t3454\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3454\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3462\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3462\t\nA\t\t3463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the sentry-tower approach, form a party for the four braziers. Equip the Torch of Retribution before using each brazier; restore your weapon afterward.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the western tower and use its brazier for {q3463}.\nC\t\t3463\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLight the southern tower for {q3463}.\nC\t\t3463\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLight the eastern tower for {q3463}.\nC\t\t3463\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLight the northern tower for {q3463}, then return to Maltrake.\nC\t\t3463\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStay for Kalaran's departure, then open the Hoard of the Black Dragonflight and accept {q3481}.\nA\t\t3481\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3481\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Thorium Point for the ready rewards.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7723\t\nT\t\t7724\t\nT\t\t7727\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7728\t\nT\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7701\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 49 before Maraudon. If short, hunt isolated level 48-49 Dark Iron dwarves around the cleared camp edges then return by the ramps.\nX\t\t\t49\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Kargath. Keep Return to Fel'Zerul, Ancient Egg, Violet Tragan and the coastal deliveries.\nF\t\tKargath\t" },
  { name = "49-50 Desolace (Horde)", title = "49-50 Desolace", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 49, hi = 50, next = "50-52 Un'Goro Crater (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "One Maraudon clear, Alcaz Prison at 50 and the northern delivery circuit. Keep the prepared Sunken Temple quests for level 52.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Kargath at 49 with The Stone Circle, Return to Fel'Zerul, Ancient Egg and the Temple preparations.\nX\t\t\t49\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stonard.\nF\t\tStonard\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1444\t\nA\t\t1445\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay.\nF\t\tBooty Bay\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1118\t\nA\t\t1119\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Ratchet ship.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Stone Circle from Marvon's Chest in his Ratchet workshop for {q3444}.\nC\t\t3444\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Shadowprey Village.\nF\t\tShadowprey Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7029\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t24.09\t68.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Sikewa; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Shadowprey Village\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7064\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDesolace\t22.8\t76.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Nat's quest, fish from Sar'theris Strand for the Sar'theris Striker.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace and read his instructions, then accept {q7067}.\nA\t\t7067\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Willow at Scrabblescrew's Camp and accept {q7028} before returning west to the Valley of Spears.\nA\t\t7028\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Valley of Spears caverns and speak to Cavindra near the orange approach, then accept {q7044}.\nA\t\t7044\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t33.22\t65.67\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill Vark's Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool before entering either instance branch.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Maraudon party with a tank and healer for the outer khans, both entrance branches and Princess Theradras.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Shadowshard Fragments from the outer cavern's Rumblers and Smashers for {q7068}; these passages are outside the instance.\nC\t\t7068\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse the Amulet of Spirits on the five khans as directed by the Pariah's Instructions, defeat them and collect all five gems. The first three are in the outer caverns; the other two are in the orange and purple dungeon branches. Combine the gems with the amulet into the Amulet of Union for {q7067}.\nC\t\t7067\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t28.15\t62.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat The Nameless Prophet in the outer caverns and loot the Amulet of Spirits.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t29.66\t60.48\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the amulet on the Spirit of Kolk, defeat him and take the First Khan's gem.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t29.43\t56.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the purple outer approach to Gelk; use the amulet, defeat him and loot the Second Khan's gem.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDesolace\t35.79\t60.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the orange outer approach to Magra; use the amulet, defeat him and loot the Third Khan's gem. Keep the filled vial and Legends of Maraudon ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Maraudon's orange branch together at 49+. Complete both entrance branches and Earth Song Falls in this same instance; keep the party and instance together throughout.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Theradric Crystal Carvings during the clear.\nK\t\t17684\t15\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the orange branch through Noxxion and Razorlash. Loot Noxxion's Celebrian Rod and the orange-branch khan's gem.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBacktrack through the cleared orange route to the outer caverns and enter the purple branch without resetting the instance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Filled Cerulean Vial on Vylestem Vines, then kill the emerging Noxxious Scion to heal eight plants for {q7029}.\nC\t\t7029\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the purple branch through Lord Vyletongue. Loot his Celebrian Diamond and the purple-branch khan's gem; combine the Amulet of Union when all five gems are collected.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue to Celebras and defeat him. Speak to Celebras the Redeemed with both scepter pieces, then turn in {q7044}. Accept {q7046}.\nT\t\t7044\t\nA\t\t7046\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAssist Celebras through the ritual and read the Incantation of Celebras when prompted for {q7046}.\nC\t\t7046\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7046\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Earth Song Falls with the five-player party, clearing Landslide, Tinkerer Gizlock and Rotgrip.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Princess Theradras with the party for {q7064}; fight with solid ground behind you.\nC\t\t7064\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Zaetar's Spirit after the Princess and accept {q7066}.\nA\t\t7066\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared passages to the Valley of Spears, then ride south to the Centaur Pariah.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7067\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Willow on the return north, then turn in {q7028}.\nT\t\t7028\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Shadowprey if ready; otherwise take the western road back to the village.\nH\t\tHearth to Shadowprey Village\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7029\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7064\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar for the fragments delivery.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7068\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Brackenwall Village.\nF\t\tBrackenwall Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_ALCAZ_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q95284} before the scheduled Alcaz Prison clear. If that clear is already behind you, skip the Alcaz quest steps, including the Folkar chain, A Little Payback and Blood Red Bandanas, instead of repeating the dungeon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_ALCAZ_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t35.21\t30.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q95284} from Nazeer Bloodpike.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel southeast toward Tabetha and the coast, keeping clear of Theramore.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t58.61\t60.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying all four fish, turn in {q6607} to Nat Pagle to learn Artisan Fishing; skip if the quest was not taken.\nT\t\t6607\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 50 before Alcaz Prison. If short, hunt isolated level 48-49 southern marsh wildlife, then return to the coast.\nX\t\t\t50\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock, then follow the marsh paths north and the eastern coast toward Alcaz, staying outside Theramore.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t75.0\t14.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern coastline north to the mainland crossing toward Alcaz Island.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Alcaz Prison party with a tank and healer on the mainland coast. Swim to the western pier together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLand at Alcaz Island's western pier, then follow the island path north to the prison building with the party; keep clear of Doctor Weavil's hilltop compound.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t70.2\t18.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95284} to Sergeant Ulka, then accept {q95285}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Sergeant Ulka about the island for {q95285}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Alcaz Prison together at 50+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill fifteen Strashaz Soldiers and eight Strashaz Enchantresses and take Tidemistress Ca'zass's head for {q96332}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect eight Blood Red Bandanas from the human guards during this clear for {q96334}. Drops can be poor; skip the quest if you finish the clear short.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Commander Folkar in the cells and turn in {q95309}, then accept {q95454}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Alcaz Prison through its final boss, Blazeroar.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSearch the hidden room beyond Blazeroar and read the Perfumed Note on the floor for {q95454}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95454} at the note, then accept {q96369}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared passages to Commander Folkar. Turn in {q96369}, then accept {q95483}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave together by the cleared entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t70.2\t18.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96332} to Sergeant Ulka.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the mainland by the same crossing and follow the northern marsh paths west to Brackenwall.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2641\t\nA\t\t2661\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2661\t\nA\t\t2662\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRemain with Marin until he finishes the elixir for {q2662}.\nC\t\t2662\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2662\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide south to Marvon before visiting Steamwheedle Port.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3444\t\nA\t\t3446\t\nA\t\t3447\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4787\t\nA\t\t3528\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide north through the pass to the Shimmering Flats.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1119\t\nA\t\t1121\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q1121} to the Goblin Pit Boss with the Fool's Stout.\nT\t\t1121\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q1122} and take Kravel's report for Booty Bay.\nA\t\t1122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gadgetzan and fly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Booty Bay ship.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to the zeppelin base.\nF\t\tGrom'gol\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t31.73\t37.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95483} to Thrall.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t34.28\t39.35\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q96334} to Eitrigg if you collected all eight; skip if short.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t48.47\t45.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zevrost, learn Demon Armor IV, Immolate VI, Death Coil II, Curse of the Elements IV, Curse of Tongues II, Detect Invisibility III, Create Soulstone IV and Searing Pain V; learn eligible talented ranks. Learn Imp Blood Pact V and Voidwalker Torment V / Consume Shadows V. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Kurgul nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t80.39\t32.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sorek, learn Cleave IV, Recklessness and Rend VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8417} from Sorek; keep it for the Sunken Temple journey.\nA\t\t8417\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Healing Stream Totem IV, Lightning Bolt IX, Searing Totem V and Windfury Weapon III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nA\t\t8410\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Elemental Air, one Elemental Fire, one Elemental Earth and one Elemental Water at the Auction House for {q8410}.\nC\t\t8410\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.9\t58.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin, enter Undercity by the main lifts and continue to its flight master.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the river north from eastern Hillsbrad to Bath'rah the Windwatcher's ruins. Turn in {q8410}, then accept {q8412}.\nT\t\t8410\t\nA\t\t8412\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tarren Mill and fly to Undercity, then follow the road east through the Bulwark into the Western Plaguelands.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Bloodshot Spider Eyes from level 50-51 Venom Mist Lurkers and eight Thick Black Claws from nearby Diseased Black Bears or Carrion Vultures for {q8412}.\nC\t\t8412\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west through the Bulwark, enter Undercity by the main lifts and fly to Tarren Mill.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the river north to Bath'rah. Turn in {q8412}, then accept {q8413}; keep it for the Sunken Temple clear at 52.\nT\t\t8412\t\nA\t\t8413\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tarren Mill and fly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Kidney Shot II and Ambush V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Crippling Poison II (230 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t42.09\t49.48\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Rekkul.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Divine Spirit III, Fade V, Flash Heal VI, Inner Fire V, Prayer of Healing III, Renew VIII and Shadow Word: Pain VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tUndead Priest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Touch of Weakness V and Dark Sacrifice IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Hex of Weakness V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Frostfire Bolt II, Conjure Water VI, Ice Armor III, Frostbolt IX and Cone of Cold IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Beast III, Distracting Shot V, Serpent Sting VII, Track Dragonkin and Volley II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.32\t14.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xao'tsu, learn Growl VI. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t8419\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Felcloth at the Auction House for Impsy.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Orgrimmar by its main gate and follow the road south to Sen'jin Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SPIDER_GOD_TABLET\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Read Theka's tablet during the scheduled Zul'Farrak clear for {q2936}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest instead of repeating the dungeon.\nC\t\t2936\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SPIDER_GOD_TABLET\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q2936} to Master Gadrin.\nT\t\t2936\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to Orgrimmar.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t54.1\t68.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Gryshka for the northern journey and Temple return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish repairs and supplies before the Felwood journey.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Splintertree. Follow the Ashenvale road west, then take the main road north into Felwood.\nF\t\tSplintertree Post\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter southern Felwood by the main road.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8460} from Grazle near the Emerald Sanctuary.\nA\t\t8460\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Deadwood Warriors, six Pathfinders and six Gardeners in the southern Deadwood camp for {q8460}.\nC\t\t8460\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8460\t\nA\t\t8462\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Unfriendly reputation with Timbermaw Hold; keep hunting southern Deadwood furbolgs if needed.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road north, then take the western trail to Bloodvenom Post. Avoid dropping from the cliffs.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t34.44\t53.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Brakkar's flight point before continuing north.\nP\t\tBloodvenom Post\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road to Impsy beside Bloodvenom Falls.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t8419\t\nA\t\t8421\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t42.64\t47.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Bloodvenom Essence from Tainted Oozes.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t48.7\t20.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road north and collect ten Rotting Wood from Irontree Wanderers and Stompers for {q8421}; avoid the Withered Protector.\nC\t\t8421\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t8421\t\nA\t\t8422\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8462} to Nafien outside Timbermaw Hold.\nT\t\t8462\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Timbermaw Hold's tunnel to Moonglade; avoid fighting the Timbermaw furbolgs.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7066\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Healing Touch IX, Hurricane II, Mark of the Wild VI, Maul VI, Ravage III, Rebirth IV, Starfire V and Tranquility III. Learn Lacerate IV when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q9063} from the trainer; keep the introduction for Torwa Pathfinder.\nA\t\t9063\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t32.09\t66.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Faustron's Horde flight point southwest of the lake.\nP\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2967\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3761\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.62\t19.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alodan the Hopeful, learn Holy Wrath I, Consecration IV, Flash of Light V, Divine Shield II, Lay on Hands III, Seal of Righteousness VII, Seal of Fury VI, Seal of Light III and Devotion Aura VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4494\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.99\t45.68\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Hornbeam Seeds from Hagrus for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Orgrimmar at 50 with March of the Silithid and Un'Goro Soil ready. Keep the Temple preparations and feather quest for the level-52 journey." },
  { name = "50-52 Un'Goro Crater (Horde)", title = "50-52 Un'Goro Crater", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 50, hi = 52, next = "52-54 Felwood (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Torwa’s quests, the Gorishi hive, crystal pylons and Marshal’s Refuge rescues. Ends in Orgrimmar after the Horde soil and silithid reports.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Orgrimmar at 50 with March of the Silithid and Un'Goro Soil.\nX\t\t\t50\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy one Mithril Casing for A-Me 01. Repair and restock; keep room for crystals, soil and gorilla pelts.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4494\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4496\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4504\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide southwest through Tanaris to the crater's eastern descent. Follow the descending path; avoid jumping from the rim.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4289\t\nA\t\t4290\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q9063} to Torwa Pathfinder, then accept {q9052}.\nT\t\t9063\t\nA\t\t9052\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect eight Bloodcap from Bloodpetal creatures and eight Gorishi Stings from the hive insects for {q9052} during the crater circuit.\nC\t\t9052\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFor Ghede, collect twenty Un'Goro Soil for {q3761}, keeping another five for Pestlezugg.\nC\t\t3761\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake a Piece of Threshadon Carcass from the Fresh Threshadon Carcass for {q4290}.\nC\t\t4290\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4290\t\nA\t\t4291\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStep near the ravasaur nests to draw out Lar'korwi Mates; collect two Pheromone Glands for {q4291}.\nC\t\t4291\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4291\t\nA\t\t4292\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead north through the eastern side of the crater, watching for Devilsaur patrols. Continue west along the northern wall to Marshal's Refuge.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t45.23\t5.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point before entering the camp.\nP\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock at the camp.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4284\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3882\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3883\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3881\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4145\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect Bloodpetal Sprouts from the small sprout plants during the crater circuit; keep them for the Temple return.\nK\t\t11315\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4243\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4503\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4492\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4501\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect seven of each Power Crystal color from deposits on the northern flats: red, blue, yellow and green for {q4284}.\nC\t\t4284\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4284\t\nA\t\t4285\t\nA\t\t4287\t\nA\t\t4288\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tInspect the Northern Crystal Pylon for {q4285}.\nC\t\t4285\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t69.05\t17.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Fungal Rock through its cave mouth; have the Mithril Casing ready for A-Me 01.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect two Gorilla, two Stomper and two Thunderer pelts at Fungal Rock for {q4289}.\nC\t\t4289\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4243\t\nA\t\t4244\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4244} with the Mithril Casing.\nT\t\t4244\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4245\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort A-Me 01 out of Fungal Rock and back to Karna for {q4245}.\nC\t\t4245\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4245\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t47.08\t34.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twelve Super Sticky Tar from Tar Beasts and Tar Creepers on the northern flats for {q4504}.\nC\t\t4504\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill five Bloodpetal Lashers and five Bloodpetal Threshers on the northeastern flats for {q4145} and {q4145}.\nC\t\t4145\t1\t\nC\t\t4145\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t58.06\t33.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Dinosaur Bones and eight Webbed Diemetradon Scales from Young Diemetradons in the northeastern flats for {q3882} and {q4503}.\nC\t\t3882\t\t\nC\t\t4503\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Crate of Foodstuffs from the eastern expedition camp for {q3881}; keep the Research Equipment objective open.\nC\t\t3881\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t80.53\t39.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Webbed Pterrordax Scales from Fledgling Pterrordax along the eastern rim for {q4503}.\nC\t\t4503\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the eastern pylon platform and inspect it for {q4287}.\nC\t\t4287\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t79.65\t49.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tLar'korwi is a level 56 non-elite. Get help if needed. Use the Preserved Threshadon Meat and Pheromone Mixture at Lar'korwi's summoning site. Defeat Lar'korwi and take his head for {q4292}.\nC\t\t4292\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: LARKORWI_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q4291}, then accept {q4292}.\nT\t\t4291\t\nA\t\t4292\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: LARKORWI_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4292\t\nT\t\t4289\t\nA\t\t4301\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a Gorishi Scent Gland from the southern hive's insects and five Un'Goro Soil from dirt piles for {q4496}. Keep another twenty soil for Ghede.\nC\t\t4496\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the hive and use the Scraping Vial in a chamber with hanging larvae for {q3883}. Leave by the cleared tunnels.\nC\t\t3883\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ten ordinary Pterrordax along the southern rim for {q4501}.\nC\t\t4501\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Research Equipment from the southwestern camp for {q3881}.\nC\t\t3881\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Frenzied Pterrordax along the western rim for {q4501}.\nC\t\t4501\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t30.93\t50.44\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 51 before Krakle's work. If needed, hunt Young Diemetradons in the northeastern flats.\nX\t\t\t51\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t974\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb the western pylon platform and inspect it for {q4288}.\nC\t\t4288\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Fungal Rock's entrance for U'cha.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear to U'cha in the upper cave and take his pelt for {q4301}.\nC\t\t4301\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west to Marshal's Refuge for the ready rewards.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4503\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4501\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3882\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3883\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3881\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4285\t\nT\t\t4287\t\nT\t\t4288\t\nA\t\t4321\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4321\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4504\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4496\t\nA\t\t4507\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 52 before the hive queen. If short, hunt the northern tar pits' Tar Beasts and Tar Creepers.\nX\t\t\t52\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide back down the eastern crater path and return to the Gorishi hive.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t43.85\t81.39\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Gorishi hive entrance, form a party for the Hive Queen; have the lure ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the queen's chamber through the hive tunnels. Use the Gorishi Queen Lure and defeat the guards and Hive Queen; loot her brain for {q4507}.\nC\t\t4507\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: LARKORWI\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t79.65\t49.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Use the Preserved Threshadon Meat and Pheromone Mixture at Lar'korwi's summoning site. Defeat Lar'korwi and take his head for {q4292}.\nC\t\t4292\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q4292}.\nT\t\t4292\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: LARKORWI\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Torwa and turn in {q4301}.\nT\t\t4301\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t9052\t\nA\t\t9051\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party for approaching a level 54-55 elite Devilsaur. Hibernate it and use the Devilsaur Barb for {q9051}; keep it controlled while withdrawing. The quest requires the test, not a kill.\nC\t\t9051\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Torwa and turn in {q9051}, then accept {q9053}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t9051\t\nA\t\t9053\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill five Bloodpetal Flayers on the central flats for {q4145}, then five Bloodpetal Trappers on the western flats for {q4145}.\nC\t\t4145\t3\t\nC\t\t4145\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t49.69\t45.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Fire Plume Ridge by its path for the volcano objectives and Ringo's rescue.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClimb Fire Plume Ridge by its path; use Krakle's Thermometer at the hottest spot for {q974}.\nC\t\t974\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect nine Un'Goro Ash from the fire elementals around the ridge for {q4502}.\nC\t\t4502\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Ringo after finishing the volcano objectives and turn in {q4492}.\nT\t\t4492\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4491\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLead Ringo down the path and north to Spraggle for {q4491}. Use Spraggle's Canteen whenever he faints.\nC\t\t4491\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4491\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4145\t\nA\t\t4147\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t974\t\nA\t\t980\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the refuge and fly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4507\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4509\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4147} to Liv Rizzlefix, then accept {q4146}; keep the Unloaded Zapper for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t4147\t\nA\t\t4146\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff for the soil delivery.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3761\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.5\t16.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Birgitte Cranston, learn Portal: Thunder Bluff.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.62\t19.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alodan the Hopeful, learn Greater Blessing of Might I, Blessing of Might VI, Exorcism V, Hammer of Wrath II, Holy Strike VII, Shadow Resistance Aura III, Turn Undead III and Seal of the Crusader VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t36.38\t54.85\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Symbols of Kings from Chepi for Greater Blessings.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Cower III, Demoralizing Roar V, Moonfire IX, Rejuvenation IX and Rip V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4509\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t48.47\t45.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zevrost, learn Shadow Bolt VIII, Drain Soul IV, Health Funnel VI, Curse of Weakness VI and Shadow Ward III; learn eligible talented ranks.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t80.39\t32.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sorek, learn Battle Shout VI, Intercept III and Shield Bash III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Fire Nova V, Flame Shock V, Lesser Healing Wave V, Strength of Earth Totem IV and Windfury Totem III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Backstab VII, Feint IV and Rupture V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Instant Poison V and Mind-numbing Poison III (240 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Devouring Plague V, Greater Heal III, Mind Blast VIII and Mind Soothe III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Shadowguard V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Conjure Food VI and Blizzard V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aimed Shot V, Arcane Shot VII and Mend Pet VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t54.1\t68.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Gryshka. Keep The New Springs for Donova Snowden.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Orgrimmar\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8151} from Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar.\nA\t\t8151\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8254} from Ur'kyo; buy one Ichor of Undeath at the Auction House for Ogtinc.\nA\t\t8254\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8250} from Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar.\nA\t\t8250\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8233} from Shenthul.\nA\t\t8233\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin and enter Undercity by its main lifts.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Tarren Mill.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern road and Ravenholdt's hillside path to the manor. Turn in {q8233}, then accept {q8234}.\nT\t\t8233\t\nA\t\t8234\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the hillside path and road to Tarren Mill.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the main lifts.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Orgrimmar zeppelin and enter Orgrimmar.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Splintertree Post.\nF\t\tSplintertree Post\t\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the Ashenvale road east into Azshara and take the northern hillside path to Valormok; avoid Talrendis Point.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t21.96\t49.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point.\nP\t\tValormok\t\nS\tHunter/Priest\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Ogtinc northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nT\t\t8151\t\nA\t\t8153\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nT\t\t8254\t\nA\t\t8255\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tCollect a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8153}.\nC\t\t8153\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Healthy Courser Glands from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8255}.\nC\t\t8255\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ogtinc and turn in {q8153}, then accept {q8231}.\nT\t\t8153\t\nA\t\t8231\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ogtinc and turn in {q8255}, then accept {q8256}.\nT\t\t8255\t\nA\t\t8256\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8256} with the purchased Ichor of Undeath, then accept {q8257}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8256\t\nA\t\t8257\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Wavethrasher Scales from Wavethrashers on the eastern coast for {q8231}.\nC\t\t8231\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Ogtinc and turn in {q8231}, then accept {q8232}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8231\t\nA\t\t8232\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Sealed Azure Bag from Timbermaw Shamans for {q8234}.\nC\t\t8234\t\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the hillside path to Sanath Lim-yo below Archmage Xylem's tower.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8250} to Sanath.\nT\t\t8250\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Archmage Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q8251} from Xylem.\nA\t\t8251\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nT\t\t8234\t\nA\t\t8235\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Nyrill for transport back down.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Glittering Dust from the Blood Elves for {q8251}.\nC\t\t8251\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Encoded Fragments from Forest Oozes for {q8235}.\nC\t\t8235\t\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sanath.\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nT\t\t8251\t\nA\t\t8252\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8235}, then accept {q8236}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8235\t\nA\t\t8236\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Nyrill for transport down, then collect six Enchanted Coral from Spitelash Sirens for {q8252}.\nC\t\t8252\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Sanath.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8252}, then accept {q8253}; keep it for the Sunken Temple.\nT\t\t8252\t\nA\t\t8253\t\nS\tMage/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Nyrill for transport back down.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the paths to Valormok.\nS\tHunter/Mage/Priest/Rogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar before the Temple journey.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t" },
  { name = "52-54 Felwood (Horde)", title = "52-54 Felwood", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 52, hi = 54, next = "54-55 Burning Steppes (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "One Sunken Temple clear at 52, then the Emerald Sanctuary, Jaedenar and northern Felwood circuits. Ends in Orgrimmar with Winterspring preparation.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Orgrimmar at 52 with The New Springs and Orgrimmar bound.\nX\t\t\t52\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Grom'gol zeppelin outside Orgrimmar, then fly to Stonard.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_TEMPLE_SHARED_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Larion at Marshal's Refuge and accept {q4145} before the Temple clear; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t4145\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill five Bloodpetal Lashers, five Threshers, five Flayers and five Trappers for {q4145}.\nC\t\t4145\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Larion, turn in {q4145} and accept {q4147}.\nT\t\t4145\t\nA\t\t4147\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Liv Rizzlefix in Ratchet, turn in {q4147} and accept {q4146}. Collect one Bloodpetal Sprout in Un'Goro for the return, then return to Orgrimmar.\nT\t\t4147\t\nA\t\t4146\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_TEMPLE_SHARED_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_TEMPLE_CLASS_PREPARATION\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Loganaar in Moonglade and accept {q9063}. If the clear is already behind you, skip this chain.\nA\t\t9063\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Torwa Pathfinder in eastern Un'Goro, turn in {q9063} and accept {q9052}.\nT\t\t9063\t\nA\t\t9052\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect eight Bloodcap from Bloodpetals and eight Gorishi Stings from the hive insects for {q9052}.\nC\t\t9052\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Torwa, turn in {q9052} and accept {q9051}.\nT\t\t9052\t\nA\t\t9051\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Form a party to approach a level 54-55 elite Devilsaur. Hibernate it and use the Devilsaur Barb for {q9051}; withdraw while it is controlled.\nC\t\t9051\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Torwa, turn in {q9051} and accept {q9053}. Return through Gadgetzan to Orgrimmar before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t9051\t\nA\t\t9053\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar and accept {q8151}; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8151\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Ogtinc in Azshara, turn in {q8151} and accept {q8153}.\nT\t\t8151\t\nA\t\t8153\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8153}.\nC\t\t8153\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Ogtinc, turn in {q8153} and accept {q8231}.\nT\t\t8153\t\nA\t\t8231\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect six Wavethrasher Scales on Azshara's eastern coast for {q8231}.\nC\t\t8231\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Ogtinc, turn in {q8231} and accept {q8232}. Return through Valormok to Orgrimmar before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8231\t\nA\t\t8232\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar and accept {q8254}. Buy one Ichor of Undeath; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8254\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Ogtinc in Azshara, turn in {q8254} and accept {q8255}.\nT\t\t8254\t\nA\t\t8255\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect four Healthy Courser Glands from Mosshoof Coursers for {q8255}.\nC\t\t8255\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Ogtinc, turn in {q8255} and accept {q8256}.\nT\t\t8255\t\nA\t\t8256\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q8256} with the Ichor of Undeath and accept {q8257}. Return through Valormok to Orgrimmar before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8256\t\nA\t\t8257\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Shenthul in Orgrimmar and accept {q8233}; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8233\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Lord Jorach Ravenholdt in Hillsbrad, turn in {q8233} and accept {q8234}.\nT\t\t8233\t\nA\t\t8234\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Azshara and collect the Sealed Azure Bag from Timbermaw Shamans for {q8234}.\nC\t\t8234\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Take Sanath Lim-yo's transport to Xylem, turn in {q8234} and accept {q8235}. Use Nyrill's transport down.\nT\t\t8234\t\nA\t\t8235\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Encoded Fragments from Forest Oozes for {q8235}.\nC\t\t8235\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Sanath to Xylem, turn in {q8235} and accept {q8236}. Use Nyrill's transport down and return through Valormok to Orgrimmar before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8235\t\nA\t\t8236\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Temple clear, visit Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar and accept {q8250}; skip this chain if that clear is already behind you.\nA\t\t8250\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Visit Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara and turn in {q8250}. Take his transport to Xylem and accept {q8251}, then use Nyrill's transport down.\nT\t\t8250\t\nA\t\t8251\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect ten Glittering Dust from the Blood Elves for {q8251}.\nC\t\t8251\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Sanath to Xylem, turn in {q8251} and accept {q8252}. Use Nyrill's transport down.\nT\t\t8251\t\nA\t\t8252\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect six Enchanted Coral from Spitelash Sirens for {q8252}.\nC\t\t8252\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Sanath to Xylem, turn in {q8252} and accept {q8253}. Use Nyrill's transport down and return through Valormok to Orgrimmar before the Temple journey.\nT\t\t8252\t\nA\t\t8253\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_TEMPLE_CLASS_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stonard.\nF\t\tStonard\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road around Stonard to the Blasted Lands border and speak to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. Turn in {q8417}, then accept {q8423}.\nT\t\t8417\t\nA\t\t8423\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south into the Blasted Lands and kill seven level 52-53 Helboar on the northern plains for {q8423}.\nC\t\t8423\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north to the Fallen Hero. Turn in {q8423}, then accept {q8424}.\nT\t\t8423\t\nA\t\t8424\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tClear the northern and eastern camps: twenty Shadowsworn Adepts, ten Cultists and twenty Thugs for {q8424}.\nC\t\t8424\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to the Fallen Hero. Turn in {q8424}, then accept {q8425}; keep it for the Sunken Temple clear.\nT\t\t8424\t\nA\t\t8425\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t70.2\t45.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Pool of Tears and the temple's south-facing entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Sunken Temple party with a tank and healer. Keep the Egg of Hakkar, both Marvon quests, Fetishes of Hakkar and Jammal'an the Prophet.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSwim across and climb the stairs, then follow the interior passages down to the instance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Sunken Temple together at 52+. Complete the lower statue circuit and the upper temple in this one clear.\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot two Amber, two Blue and two Green Voodoo Feathers from the six balcony defenders: Gasher, Zul'Lor, Hukku, Mijan, Zolo and Loro for {q8422}.\nC\t\t8422\t\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect two Amber, two Blue and two Green Voodoo Feathers from Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor and Loro during the balcony clear for {q8425}.\nC\t\t8425\t\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect two Amber, two Blue and two Green Voodoo Feathers from Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor and Loro during the balcony clear for {q8413}.\nC\t\t8413\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect five Atal'ai Haze from Deep Lurkers, Murk Worms and Saturated Oozes during the lower-ring clear for {q4146}.\nC\t\t4146\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the lower ring and activate its six statues in this order: south, north, southwest, southeast, northwest, northeast. Descend to the Pit of Refuse.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Atal'alarion, then inspect the Altar of Hakkar and the Idol of Hakkar.\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot the Putrid Vine from Atal'alarion for {q9053}.\nC\t\t9053\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3446\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3447\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish collecting five Atal'ai Haze from the lower passages for {q4146}, then continue to the upper ring and defeat all six balcony defenders to remove Jammal'an's barrier.\nC\t\t4146\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the dragonkin and defeat Jammal'an and Ogom with the party; loot Jammal'an's head for {q1446}. Finish the named dragon encounters before approaching Eranikus.\nC\t\t1446\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Tooth of Morphaz for {q8232}.\nC\t\t8232\t\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Azure Key for {q8236}.\nC\t\t8236\t\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Arcane Shard for {q8253}.\nC\t\t8253\t\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Morphaz and loot the Blood of Morphaz for {q8257}.\nC\t\t8257\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Hakkar's chamber, use the Egg of Hakkar to begin the ritual. Defeat the waves, use Hakkari Blood to extinguish the braziers, then defeat the Avatar of Hakkar. Loot the Essence of Hakkar and use it from your bags to fill the egg for {q3528}.\nC\t\t3528\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the Shade of Eranikus with the party to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you loot the Essence of Eranikus, use it to accept {q3373}.\nA\t\t3373\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you obtained the Essence, place it in the Essence Font in Eranikus's chamber and turn in {q3373}.\nT\t\t3373\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect twenty Fetishes of Hakkar from Atal'ai trolls in the outer passages and instance for {q1445}.\nC\t\t1445\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared temple passages and return west to Stonard.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1445\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road to the Fallen Hero at the Blasted Lands border, then turn in {q8425}. Choose and equip Diamond Flask; use it before demanding fights.\nT\t\t8425\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t46.07\t54.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the road to Stonard before continuing.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Revantusk, then follow the full coastal road up and the southern road west to the Atal'ai Exile.\nF\t\tRevantusk Village\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t1446\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the southern road and full coastal path to Revantusk Village.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Tarren Mill.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern road and hillside path to Ravenholdt.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8236} to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt.\nT\t\t8236\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the path and road to Tarren Mill.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise leave by the main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by road to Revantusk Village.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFly from Revantusk Village to Tarren Mill for Bath'rah's reward.\nF\t\tTarren Mill\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the river north to Bath'rah, then turn in {q8413}. Choose and equip Enamored Water Spirit; use its mana-support totem for long fights.\nT\t\t8413\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t60.14\t18.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise return to Tarren Mill and fly to Undercity.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Undercity, take the Orgrimmar zeppelin outside the city.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t81.7\t81.76\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf not already in Orgrimmar, hearth there if ready; otherwise return to Revantusk Village and fly to Undercity.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Undercity, take the Orgrimmar zeppelin outside the city.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3528\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5065} from Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port; keep the tablet search for the level-58 Plaguelands journey.\nA\t\t5065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Marshal's Refuge.\nF\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4146\t\nA\t\t4148\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4148} with the reserved Bloodpetal Sprouts.\nT\t\t4148\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the eastern crater paths to Torwa.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nT\t\t9053\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the eastern path to Marshal's Refuge.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\tHunter/Mage\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Azshara for the class rewards.\nF\t\tValormok\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8232} to Ogtinc.\nT\t\t8232\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t28.11\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Sanath.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Sanath for transport to Xylem.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8253} to Archmage Xylem.\nT\t\t8253\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAsk Nyrill for transport down.\nS\tHunter/Mage\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the paths to Valormok.\nS\tHunter/Mage\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Bloodvenom Post.\nF\t\tBloodvenom Post\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4505\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6162\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q4521}; keep it for the Winterspring journey.\nA\t\t4521\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road south to Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8257} to Greta Mosshoof at the Emerald Sanctuary.\nT\t\t8257\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4102\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5156\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5155\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Overlord Ror in the southern Deadwood camp and take his claw for {q6162}.\nC\t\t6162\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the outer Jaedenar camps: four Hounds, four Guardians, six Adepts and six Cultists for {q5155}.\nC\t\t5155\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5155\t\nA\t\t5157\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the Empty Canteen at the Jaedenar Moonwell for {q5157}.\nC\t\t5157\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the southern Jadefire camp, use the Hardened Flasket at the corrupted moonwell for {q4505}.\nC\t\t4505\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5157\t\nA\t\t5158\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6162\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4505\t\nA\t\t4506\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t32.32\t66.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Winna's kitten to the corrupted moonwell and release it there.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLead the changed cat back by the cleared route; at Winna, speak to the cat to release it for {q4506}.\nC\t\t4506\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4506\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Ratchet for the purified-water delivery.\nF\t\tRatchet\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5158\t\nA\t\t5159\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Bloodvenom Post, then follow the main road south to Emerald Sanctuary.\nF\t\tBloodvenom Post\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5159\t\nA\t\t5165\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8422}. Choose the Abyss Shard for its lasting Voidwalker summon utility; keep the trinket.\nT\t\t8422\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Niby and Impsy beside Bloodvenom Falls, then accept {q7601}.\nA\t\t7601\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7601\t\nA\t\t7602\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFelwood\t36.23\t45.87\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t65.96\t16.48\t20\t0\t\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t57.73\t50.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep one checklist of the three Flawless Fel Essences; collect them during the Shadow Hold, Blasted Lands and Azshara circuits.\nK\t\t18624\t1\t\t\nK\t\t18622\t1\t\t\nK\t\t18623\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill two Entropic Beasts and two Entropic Horrors in Shatter Scar Vale; explore the corrupted pools for {q5156}.\nC\t\t5156\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Blood Amber from Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders at Irontree Woods for {q4102}; avoid Dessecus.\nC\t\t4102\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8461\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill six Deadwood Den Watchers, six Avengers and six Shamans for {q8461}; return to Nafien.\nC\t\t8461\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q8461}, then accept {q8465}; keep Salfa's introduction for the Winterspring passage.\nT\t\t8461\t\nA\t\t8465\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nI\t\tReach Unfriendly reputation with Timbermaw Hold again if needed after the Azshara quest; continue killing Deadwood furbolgs here until ready for the tunnel.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the main road south to Emerald Sanctuary; visit Maybess Riverbreeze south of the camp for Cleansing Felwood.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5156\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4102\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 54 before Shadow Hold.\nX\t\t\t54\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFelwood\t35.45\t59.06\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the western Jaedenar trail to Shadow Hold's entrance. Form a five-player party with a tank and healer for the deep chambers and Shadow Lord Fel'dan.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the tunnel ramps and use the Purified Moon Well Water to extinguish all four braziers for {q5165}.\nC\t\t5165\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Felwood Flawless Fel Essence from Jaedenar Legionnaires during this Shadow Hold outing; keep it for Impsy.\nK\t\t18624\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared approach and return together to Greta at Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5165\t\nA\t\t5242\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Shadow Hold with the party. Defeat Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan in the chamber beyond Rakaiah, and loot Fel'dan's head for {q5242}. Stop there; avoid the deeper demon rooms.\nC\t\t5242\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared tunnels and return to Emerald Sanctuary.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5242\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFelwood\t34.44\t53.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise return by the main road and western trail to Bloodvenom Post and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t48.47\t45.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zevrost, learn Corruption VI, Drain Life VI, Drain Mana IV, Hellfire III and Howl of Terror II; learn Imp Fire Shield V. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Kurgul nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t80.39\t32.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sorek, learn Demoralizing Shout V, Hamstring III, Revenge V and Slam V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Chain Heal III, Frost Resistance Totem III, Rockbiter Weapon VII and Stoneskin Totem VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Garrote VI and Sinister Strike VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Deadly Poison IV (250 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Holy Fire VII, Power Word: Shield IX and Smite VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff for Paladin training.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.62\t19.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alodan the Hopeful, learn Greater Blessing of Wisdom I, Blessing of Wisdom V, Hammer of Justice IV, Holy Light VIII and Blessing of Sacrifice II.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Orgrimmar before continuing.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Fireball X, Fire Blast VII and Frost Nova IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Explosive Trap III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.32\t14.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xao'tsu, learn Great Stamina IX, Natural Armor IX. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Faerie Fire IV, Rake IV, Regrowth VIII, Shred V, Soothe Animal III, Swipe V, Thorns VI and Wrath VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep The New Springs, Speak to Salfa, Wild Guardians and the three-region Infernal checklist for the northern journey." },
  { name = "54-55 Burning Steppes (Horde)", title = "54-55 Burning Steppes", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 54, hi = 55, next = "55-56 Western Plaguelands (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Blasted Lands preparation, Kargath and Flame Crest, and Blackrock Depths preparation. Ends in Undercity.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Orgrimmar at 54 after training. Keep the Infernal essence checklist and Winterspring deliveries.\nX\t\t\t54\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy twelve Relic Coffer Keys at the Auction House for the Depths vault. Repair and restock.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Grom'gol zeppelin outside Orgrimmar, then fly to Stonard.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stonard. Follow the southern road into the Blasted Lands; stay clear of Nethergarde Keep.\nF\t\tStonard\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2581\t\nA\t\t2583\t\nA\t\t2585\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t2601\t\nA\t\t2603\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Snickerfang Jowls from the northern hyenas.\nK\t\t8391\t5\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fourteen Vulture Gizzards from Black Slayers.\nK\t\t8396\t14\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Scorpok Pincers from Scorpok Stingers.\nK\t\t8393\t6\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect six Blasted Boar Lungs from Ashmane Boars.\nK\t\t8392\t6\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eleven Basilisk Brains from Redstone Basilisks.\nK\t\t8394\t11\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t57.73\t50.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Blasted Lands Flawless Fel Essence from Felguard Sentries; keep clear of the Dark Portal and stronger demons.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2581\t\nT\t\t2583\t\nT\t\t2585\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t2601\t\nT\t\t2603\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north by road to Stonard.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Kargath.\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t2.82\t45.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Shul'kar for the Blackrock returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Kargath\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4081\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q3821} from Thal'trak Proudtusk.\nA\t\t3821\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3906\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4061\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4134\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the western Badlands pass into Searing Gorge and enter Blackrock Mountain. Descend the central chains to the rock tomb, take the lower chain into the quarry and follow the passages toward Blackrock Depths.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the exterior quarry approach, form a party for Overmaster Pyron.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Overmaster Pyron in the exterior quarry with the party before entering the instance for {q3906}.\nC\t\t3906\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the cleared quarry passages and chains to the upper ring, then use the southeastern exit into Burning Steppes.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.69\t24.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Vahgruk's flight point at Flame Crest.\nP\t\tFlame Crest\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4136\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4296\t\nA\t\t4123\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4726\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Fractured Elemental Shards from War Reavers on the plains south of Flame Crest for {q4061}.\nC\t\t4061\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake a Tablet Transcript from the Tablet of the Seven in the Ruins of Thaurissan for {q4296}.\nC\t\t4296\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on Black Broodlings before killing them; collect eight Broodling Essence from the crystals they leave for {q4726}.\nC\t\t4726\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t78.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Dreadmaul Rock's northern ramp to the Remains of Sha'ni and summon her spirit.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3821\t\nA\t\t3822\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t78.2\t41.5\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the ramps down to the southwestern cave. Search for Krom'Grul and loot Sha'ni's Nose-Ring for {q3822}; if absent, check the eastern cave reached by the upper ramp.\nC\t\t3822\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road east to Cyrus's cave, keeping the Black Dragonflight Molt from the Searing Gorge chest ready.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4022\t\nT\t\t4022\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4024\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4726\t\nA\t\t4808\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4296\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_OVERMASTER_PYRON\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Blackrock Mountain's chains to the exterior quarry. Form a party and defeat Overmaster Pyron for {q3906}, then leave by the cleared quarry and upper ring.\nC\t\t3906\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_OVERMASTER_PYRON\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.69\t24.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Kargath if ready; otherwise fly from Flame Crest.\nH\t\tHearth to Kargath\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3822\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3906\t\nA\t\t3907\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7201\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4061\t\nA\t\t4062\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3981\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4062} to Lotwil at his eastern camp, then accept {q4063}.\nT\t\t4062\t\nA\t\t4063\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 55 before the Plaguelands journey. If short, hunt isolated level 54-55 Burning Steppes elementals then return to Kargath.\nX\t\t\t55\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity. Keep the Blackrock Depths quests for the level-56 clear.\nF\t\tUndercity\t" },
  { name = "55-56 Western Plaguelands (Horde)", title = "55-56 Western Plaguelands", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 55, hi = 56, next = "56-57 Winterspring (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "The four Scourge cauldrons, Andorhal and the Felstone family, then one complete Blackrock Depths clear at 56. Ends at Bloodvenom Post for Winterspring.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Undercity at 55 with the prepared Blackrock Depths quests and Winterspring deliveries.\nX\t\t\t55\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t67.74\t37.89\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Norman for the Plaguelands returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Undercity\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the main lifts and follow the eastern Tirisfal road to the Bulwark on the Western Plaguelands border.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5405\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5405}. Equip the Argent Dawn Commission while fighting Scourge.\nT\t\t5405\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5096\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5341\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Flame in a Bottle from the crate beside Derrington before leaving; keep his Scourge Banner.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Scarlet base camp. Use Flame in a Bottle to burn the command tent, then plant Derrington's Scourge Banner for {q5096}.\nC\t\t5096\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west by road to the Bulwark.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5096\t\nA\t\t5098\t\nA\t\t5228\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5228\t\nA\t\t5229\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Cauldron Lord Bilemaw, loot his key and take a sample at the Felstone Field Cauldron for {q5229}.\nC\t\t5229\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5229\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5230\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Janice in the farmhouse, then accept {q5021}.\nA\t\t5021\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5021} at the package in the barn.\nT\t\t5021\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5023\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Andorhal's southern approach, clear each tower doorway before using the Beacon Torch.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5098}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5098\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5098}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5098\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5098}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5098\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tStand in this Andorhal tower doorway and use the Beacon Torch for {q5098}; follow the streets to the next tower.\nC\t\t5098\t4\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Chromie in the ruined inn at Andorhal, then accept {q4971}.\nA\t\t4971\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Temporal Displacer beside the silos and kill ten revealed Temporal Parasites for {q4971}.\nC\t\t4971\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4971\t\nA\t\t4972\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect five Andorhal Watches from the lockboxes in the city rubble for {q4972}.\nC\t\t4972\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4972\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Undercity if ready; otherwise return west through the Bulwark and enter by the main lifts.\nH\t\tHearth to Undercity\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5023\t\nA\t\t5049\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5049\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5050\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the main lifts and return east to the Bulwark.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5098\t\nA\t\t105\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5230\t\nA\t\t5231\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5050\t\nA\t\t5051\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the Jabbering Ghoul and loot the other half of the charm, combine both halves and return the Good Luck Charm to Janice for {q5051}.\nC\t\t5051\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5051\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Cauldron Lord Malvinious, take his key and sample Dalson's Tears Cauldron for {q5231}.\nC\t\t5231\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5231\t\nA\t\t5232\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRead Mrs. Dalson's Diary in the barn. Accept {q5058}, then turn in {q5058}.\nA\t\t5058\t\nT\t\t5058\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the Wandering Skeleton around the farm and loot the Dalson Outhouse Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the outhouse behind the farmhouse, accept {q5059}, then turn in {q5059} to unlock the door.\nA\t\t5059\t\nT\t\t5059\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat the released Farmer Dalson and loot the Dalson Cabinet Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOpen the Locked Cabinet upstairs in the farmhouse. Accept {q5060}, then turn in {q5060}.\nA\t\t5060\t\nT\t\t5060\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5232\t\nA\t\t5233\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern farm trails to Kirsta Deepshadow, south of Hearthglen. Accept {q6004}.\nA\t\t6004\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill two Scarlet Medics, two Hunters, two Magi and two Knights in the Scarlet camps south and southeast of Kirsta for {q6004}; keep clear of Hearthglen's elite guards.\nC\t\t6004\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Kirsta. Turn in {q6004}, then accept {q6023}.\nT\t\t6004\t\nA\t\t6023\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party for the guarded Scarlet positions. Defeat Huntsman Radley near the road and Cavalier Durgen at the northern tower for {q6023}; avoid Hearthglen's gate.\nC\t\t6023\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Kirsta. Turn in {q6023}, then accept {q6025}; keep the tower reconnaissance for the later Scarlet Illusion visit.\nT\t\t6023\t\nA\t\t6025\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Cauldron Lord Razarch, take his key and sample the Writhing Haunt Cauldron for {q5233}.\nC\t\t5233\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5233\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5234\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5234\t\nA\t\t5235\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Gahrron's Withering. Defeat Cauldron Lord Soulwrath, take his key and sample the cauldron for {q5235}.\nC\t\t5235\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5235\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5236\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5236\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5238\t\nT\t\t5238\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 56 before training. If short, hunt isolated level 55-56 Diseased Wolves on the western farms then return west to Undercity.\nX\t\t\t56\t\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Undercity if ready; otherwise return through the Bulwark and enter by the main lifts.\nH\t\tHearth to Undercity\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t86.21\t15.93\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Kaal Soulreaper, learn Fear III, Life Tap VI, Curse of Recklessness IV and Soul Fire II; learn Voidwalker Sacrifice VI. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Martha Strain nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.4\t17.29\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Baltus Fowler, learn Execute V, Heroic Strike VIII and Mocking Blow V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.9\t58.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by its main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Shaman training.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Chain Lightning IV, Flametongue Weapon VI, Grace of Air Totem II, Healing Wave IX, Lightning Bolt X, Lightning Shield VII, Magma Totem IV, Mana Spring Totem IV and Windwall Totem III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tDurotar\t50.8\t13.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin back and enter Undercity by its main lifts before continuing.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Expose Armor V and Eviscerate VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t84.88\t73.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Gregory Charles, learn Wound Poison IV (260 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t49.26\t17.12\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Aelthalyste, learn Flash Heal VII, Mana Burn V, Psychic Scream IV, Renew IX, Shadow Protection III and Shadow Word: Death IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t47.08\t15.9\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Garen Largo, learn Retribution Aura V and Frost Resistance Aura III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t64.42\t52.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tome of Arcane Brilliance at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t85.14\t10.03\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Anastasia Hartwell, learn Arcane Intellect V, Frostbolt X, Arcane Missiles VII and Flamestrike VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tUndercity\t82.78\t15.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Arcane Powder from Hannah Akeley for Arcane Brilliance once learned. Replenish your teleport and portal runes.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by the main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin for Hunter training.\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Wild II, Immolation Trap V, Raptor Strike VIII and Viper Sting III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin back and return through the Undercity lifts before continuing.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Ferocious Bite V, Healing Touch X and Pounce III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar, then return through the main lifts to Undercity.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Kargath for Blackrock Depths.\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t2.82\t45.86\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Shul’kar for the dungeon return.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Kargath\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and clear bags before leaving Kargath.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the Searing Gorge pass, mountain chains and quarry to the instance portal.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Blackrock Depths portal, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for the full clear; arrange a member with the Shadowforge Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Blackrock Depths together and complete one clear through Emperor Dagran Thaurissan. Clear the prison and lower city before the upper halls.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Anvilrage Guardsmen, ten Wardens and five Footmen during the lower-city clear for {q4081}.\nC\t\t4081\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat High Interrogator Gerstahn for the prison key and unlock Commander Gor'shak's cell. Let everyone who needs the defense turn in {q3981}, then confirm that the party is ready before anyone starts the attack.\nT\t\t3981\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce everyone has turned in and confirmed they're ready, accept {q3982} to start Gor'shak's defense.\nA\t\t3982\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefend him through the attack for {q3982}.\nC\t\t3982\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q3982}, then accept {q4001} and take the report for Thrall.\nT\t\t3982\t\nA\t\t4001\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Kharan Mighthammer in the nearby cell and hear his account for {q4001} before leaving the prison.\nC\t\t4001\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Bael'Gar and use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on his remains to collect the Fiery Essence for {q4024}.\nC\t\t4024\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Ring of Law and city, defeat Lord Incendius and loot the Tablet of Kurniya for {q3907}.\nC\t\t3907\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tOpen the twelve Relic Coffers with your keys, defeat the vault defenders and Watchman Doomgrip, then click the separate Heart of the Mountain beside the Secret Safe for {q4123}.\nC\t\t4123\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tHave the key carrier open the Shadowforge route. Clear through General Angerforge toward Golem Lord Argelmach.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Argelmach and take his head and collect ten Intact Elemental Cores from the Ragereaver Golems and Warbringer Constructs for {q4063}.\nC\t\t4063\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Essence of the Elements from the dungeon elementals and golems for {q7201}.\nC\t\t7201\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Grim Guzzler. Before fighting in the bar, buy six Dark Iron Ale Mugs from Plugger. Give Private Rocknot pairs of mugs until he opens the rear door; stay clear of the exploding kegs and defeat Phalanx when hostile.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tSpeak to Ribbly and defeat his group and take his head for {q4136}.\nC\t\t4136\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tBreak the Thunderbrew Lager Kegs in the side room, defeat Hurley Blackbreath and loot the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe for {q4134}.\nC\t\t4134\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Ambassador Flamelash and the Summoners' Tomb. Clear the Lyceum together, take torches from Flamekeepers and light both braziers. Defeat Magmus and Emperor Dagran Thaurissan. Spare Princess Moira and control her healing while the tank holds the Emperor.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared quarry, then take the upper Blackrock ring's southern exit to Burning Steppes and continue to Flame Crest.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4136\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4123\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4024\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Flame Crest and fly to Kargath.\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7201\t\nT\t\t4134\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3907\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4081\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4063\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Kargath if ready; otherwise follow the western Badlands road.\nH\t\tHearth to Kargath\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep Thrall's report for the next Orgrimmar return, Felnok Steelspring, The New Springs, Speak to Salfa and Wild Guardians.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Orgrimmar zeppelin outside Undercity.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4001\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Bloodvenom Post. Keep Felnok Steelspring, The New Springs, Speak to Salfa, Wild Guardians, Unfinished Business and Barov Family Fortune.\nF\t\tBloodvenom Post\t" },
  { name = "56-57 Winterspring (Horde)", title = "56-57 Winterspring", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 56, hi = 57, next = "57-58 Feralas (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Donova and Everlook, Umi’s yeti work, Wild Guardians and one Blackmaw Hold clear. Ends in Camp Mojache.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at Bloodvenom Post at 56 with The New Springs, Speak to Salfa, Felnok Steelspring and Wild Guardians.\nX\t\t\t56\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Felwood's main road into Timbermaw Hold and take its Moonglade branch; avoid fighting Timbermaw furbolgs.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5527} from Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven.\nA\t\t5527\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through Timbermaw Hold and take its Winterspring branch.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8465\t\nA\t\t8464\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t980\t\nA\t\t5082\t\nA\t\t4842\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Ragged Owlbeasts on the central slopes along the road east for {q4521}. Crazed Owlbeasts do not count.\nC\t\t4521\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue east by the road to Everlook.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t60.47\t36.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Yugrek's Horde flight point before the town sweep.\nP\t\tEverlook\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t3783\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t61.36\t38.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Vizzie; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6029\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6030\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4808\t\nA\t\t4809\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t969\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t64.05\t39.83\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect ten Thick Yeti Furs from the Ice Thistle Yetis on the outer slopes for {q3783}.\nC\t\t3783\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t3783\t\nA\t\t977\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Ice Thistle cave; collect two Pristine Yeti Horns from Matriarchs and Patriarchs for {q977}.\nC\t\t977\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill eight Winterfall Shamans, eight Den Watchers and eight Ursa around Winterfall Village for {q8464}.\nC\t\t8464\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Uncracked Chillwind Horns from the Chillwind chimaeras for {q4809}.\nC\t\t4809\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Raging Owlbeasts on the northern snowy slopes for {q4521}. Crazed Owlbeasts do not count.\nC\t\t4521\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Everlook if ready; otherwise return by the road.\nH\t\tHearth to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t977\t\nA\t\t5163\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Legacki in Everlook for {q5163}; keep the toy for Sprinkle and Quixxil.\nC\t\t5163\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4809\t\nA\t\t4810\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_WILD_GUARDIANS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill fifteen Ragged Owlbeasts on the central slopes and fifteen Raging Owlbeasts on the northern slopes for {q4521}; Crazed Owlbeasts do not count.\nC\t\t4521\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_WILD_GUARDIANS\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t64.26\t68.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the Frostmaul approach, form a party for the Frostmaul Shards among the elite giants.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect four Frostmaul Shards among the giants with the party for {q969}; clear each cluster before gathering.\nC\t\t969\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t59.82\t74.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tExplore the southern source of the hot springs at the Darkwhisper Gorge boundary for {q4842}. Stay clear of the Hederine camps.\nC\t\t4842\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western road and kill the remaining Winterfall furbolgs for {q5082}.\nC\t\t5082\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5082\t\nT\t\t4842\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8464\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Everlook if ready; otherwise follow the road east.\nH\t\tHearth to Everlook\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t969\t\nA\t\t975\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t975\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Bloodvenom Post for the Wild Guardians delivery.\nF\t\tBloodvenom Post\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4521\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Splintertree. Follow the Ashenvale road east into Azshara, then use the northern hillside path to Valormok; keep clear of Talrendis Point.\nF\t\tSplintertree Post\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_BLACKMAW_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q92346} before the scheduled Blackmaw Hold clear. If that clear is already behind you, skip this introduction, Get to the Roots of It and Blackmaw Pouches instead of repeating the dungeon.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_BLACKMAW_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t22.5\t51.4\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q92346} from Jediga at Valormok.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t21.96\t49.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake Kroum's flight point.\nP\t\tValormok\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t75.65\t31.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q92346} to Nara Wildmane on Elder Rise, then accept {q92343}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Valormok before continuing toward Blackmaw Hold.\nF\t\tValormok\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the high ground north of the Ruins of Eldarath and accept {q92069} from Ogtinc.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t42.0\t38.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q97327} from Ekkal at the Ruins of Eldarath.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the Azshara Flawless Fel Essence from Legashi Satyrs for {q7602}.\nC\t\t7602\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t38.6\t33.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 57 before Blackmaw Hold. If needed, hunt Legashi Satyrs then reach the northern gate.\nX\t\t\t57\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Blackmaw Hold party with a tank and healer. Follow the northern gate's tunnel into the mountain together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Blackmaw Hold together at 57+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Nordrassil Root Caps during the clear for {q92343}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect five Blackmaw Pouches during the clear for {q97327}.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot Withermaw's Claws of the Great Bear and Bonesnout the Unbroken's Tusks of the Unbroken for {q92069}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Blackmaw Hold through Varrox Bleakhoof, then leave by the cleared approach.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t42.0\t38.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q97327} to Ekkal on the return south.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t42.4\t42.62\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the high ground to Ogtinc and turn in {q92069}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn together by the roads to Valormok.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Bloodvenom Post and follow Felwood's main road north to Impsy.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7602\t\nA\t\t7603\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReach Kroshius's remains and form a party for Kroshius.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Fel Fire at Kroshius's remains, defeat the awakened infernal with the party and take its core for {q7603}.\nC\t\t7603\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tComplete Niby's demonstration, then turn in {q7603} to learn Inferno.\nT\t\t7603\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the main road and western trail to Bloodvenom Post.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff from Valormok or Bloodvenom Post.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t75.65\t31.61\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q92343} to Nara Wildmane on Elder Rise.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Thunder Bluff by its lifts and follow the northwest Mulgore paths to Mayena Earthseeker.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t34.8\t22.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q95928} from Mayena; keep it for Shaper's Terrace.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the same paths and lifts to Thunder Bluff.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Camp Mojache. Keep Felnok's package, both Everlook reports, Umi's toy and Barov Family Fortune.\nF\t\tCamp Mojache\t" },
  { name = "57-58 Feralas (Horde)", title = "57-58 Feralas", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 57, hi = 58, next = "58-59 Eastern Plaguelands (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "The Cenarion Hold circuit and Dire Maul preparation, one Dire Maul East clear, then level-58 training. Ends in Orgrimmar.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Camp Mojache at 57 after Blackmaw Hold.\nX\t\t\t57\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock before the Silithus preparation.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7489\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.49\t42.73\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sheendra Tallgrass, buy and use Recipe: Lobster Stew, Recipe: Baked Salmon and Recipe: Mightfish Steak when eligible at 275 Cooking; skip recipes already learned or not usable.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_RELIQUARY_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Dire Maul East clear, visit Rabine Saturna in Moonglade and accept {q5527}. Return to Feralas before the Silithus journey. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-up.\nA\t\t5527\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_RELIQUARY_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Sprinkle for {q5163}; keep it for Quixxil.\nC\t\t5163\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Marshal's Refuge.\nF\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide through Un'Goro's western pass into Silithus. Follow the road toward Cenarion Hold, then take the southern branch to Southwind Village.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Reliquary of Purity from the Dusty Reliquary in Southwind Village's northern lodge for {q5527}; the spirits can release insects when defeated.\nC\t\t5527\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn north by the road to Cenarion Hold.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSilithus\t48.68\t36.67\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect Runk's Horde flight point.\nP\t\tCenarion Hold\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8284\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8280\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t8277\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tSilithus\t51.89\t39.16\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Calandrath; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Cenarion Hold\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Stonelash Scorpid Stingers on the northern desert flats for {q8277}.\nC\t\t8277\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Sand Skitterer Fangs on the northern desert flats for {q8277}.\nC\t\t8277\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill fifteen Dredge Strikers on the northern flats for {q8280}.\nC\t\t8280\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect eight Twilight Tablet Fragments from the Twilight Tablet piles in the Crystal Vale for {q8284}.\nC\t\t8284\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8277\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8280\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t8284\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Moonglade.\nF\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5527} to Rabine Saturna, then accept {q5526}.\nT\t\t5527\t\nA\t\t5526\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Feralas.\nF\t\tCamp Mojache\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t74.8\t45.18\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Greul; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Camp Mojache\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the northern path to Azj'Tordin at Lariss Pavilion, then accept {q7441}.\nA\t\t7441\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path into Dire Maul's central courtyard. At the eastern entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Dire Maul East.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul East together at 57+. Speak to Pusillin and follow him through the wing; clear each passage before advancing to his next position.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Pusillin at his final platform. Loot Azj'Tordin's book and the Crescent Key for {q7441}.\nC\t\t7441\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tClear Lethtendris and Pimgib; loot Lethtendris's Web for {q7489}.\nC\t\t7489\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Hydrospawn and Zevrim Thornhoof. Speak to Old Ironbark after Zevrim's defeat and follow him to the final courtyard.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Alzzin the Wildshaper and his reinforcements.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect a Felvine Shard and seal it in the Reliquary of Purity for {q5526} before leaving.\nC\t\t5526\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Emerald Dream during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7506}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18364\t\nA\t\t7506\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Greatest Race of Hunters during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7503} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18361\t\nA\t\t7503\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Light and How to Swing It during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7501} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18359\t\nA\t\t7501\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7504} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18362\t\nA\t\t7504\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7498} and keep the book for the library.\nU\t\t18356\t\nA\t\t7498\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Codex of Defense during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7499}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18357\t\nA\t\t7499\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find The Arcanist's Cookbook during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7500}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18358\t\nA\t\t7500\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Frost Shock and You during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7505}; keep it for the library.\nU\t\t18363\t\nA\t\t7505\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf you find Harnessing Shadows during a Dire Maul clear, use it to accept {q7502}; keep it for the library visit.\nA\t\t7502\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared entrance to Lariss Pavilion.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7441\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Mojache if ready; otherwise follow the eastern road.\nH\t\tHearth to Camp Mojache\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7489\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SILITHUS_AND_SPRINKLE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return through Gadgetzan and use Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Sprinkle for {q5163}.\nC\t\t5163\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Reach Cenarion Hold through Marshal's Refuge and accept {q8284}, {q8280} and {q8277}.\nA\t\t8284\t\nA\t\t8280\t\nA\t\t8277\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect eight Stonelash Scorpid Stingers and eight Sand Skitterer Fangs on the northern flats for {q8277}.\nC\t\t8277\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill fifteen Dredge Strikers on the northern flats for {q8280}.\nC\t\t8280\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Collect eight Twilight Tablet Fragments in the Crystal Vale for {q8284}.\nC\t\t8284\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Cenarion Hold and turn in {q8277}, {q8280} and {q8284}.\nT\t\t8277\t\nT\t\t8280\t\nT\t\t8284\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SILITHUS_AND_SPRINKLE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Moonglade.\nF\t\tMoonglade\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5526} to Rabine Saturna.\nT\t\t5526\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 58 before training and the Plaguelands journey.\nX\t\t\t58\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar for training.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t48.47\t45.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zevrost, learn Bane of Agony VI, Death Coil III, Rain of Fire IV and Searing Pain VI; learn Imp Firebolt VII and Voidwalker Consume Shadows VI. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Kurgul nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t80.39\t32.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sorek, learn Pummel II, Sunder Armor V and Thunder Clap VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Fire Resistance Totem III, Flametongue Totem IV, Frost Shock IV, Frostbrand Weapon V and Stoneclaw Totem VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Sprint III, Kick IV and Ambush VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Greater Heal IV, Mind Blast IX, Mind Control III, Resurrection V and Shadow Word: Pain VIII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff for Paladin training.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.62\t19.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alodan the Hopeful, learn Flash of Light VI, Seal of Fury VII, Seal of Righteousness VIII and Seal of Wisdom III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Orgrimmar before continuing.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Conjure Mana Ruby, Mage Armor III and Cone of Cold V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Hawk VI, Hunter's Mark IV, Mongoose Bite IV, Serpent Sting VIII and Volley III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Nature's Grasp VI, Entangling Roots VI, Hibernate III, Maul VII, Moonfire X, Ravage IV, Rejuvenation X and Starfire VI. Learn Lacerate V when talented.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy two Thorium Bars, one Golden Rod, eight Hi-Explosive Bombs and eight Unstable Triggers at the Auction House for Smokey. Repair, restock and keep Felnok's package, both Everlook reports, Umi's toy and the four-deed quest.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t54.1\t68.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Gryshka for later city returns.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Crescent Key for Dire Maul North and West at 60." },
  { name = "58-59 Eastern Plaguelands (Horde)", title = "58-59 Eastern Plaguelands", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 58, hi = 59, next = "59-60 Un'Goro Crater (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Lower Blackrock Spire, Tirion's story and Stratholme at 59. Ends at Marshal's Refuge.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart in Orgrimmar at 58 with both Everlook reports, Felnok's package, Umi's toy and Barov Family Fortune. Keep Smokey's purchased materials.\nX\t\t\t58\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_MOSHARU_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Lower Blackrock Spire clear, visit Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port and accept {q5065}. Return through Ratchet and Booty Bay to Orgrimmar before the Plaguelands journey. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest and its follow-up.\nA\t\t5065\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_MOSHARU_PREPARATION\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin, then follow the road east through the Bulwark into the Eastern Plaguelands.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the roads to Zul'Mashar's approach and form a party for the guarded tablet search.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the approach and stairs, then recover the Third Mosh'aru Tablet at the top of the ziggurat and the Fourth at its base for {q5065}. Avoid walking over the graves.\nC\t\t5065\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn by the cleared approach and Plaguelands roads to Undercity; enter by its main lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Undercity by its main lifts and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide east to Steamwheedle Port. Turn in {q5065} to Prospector Ironboot, then accept {q4788}.\nT\t\t5065\t\nA\t\t4788\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t70.36\t15.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable your companion with Xon'cha for the Bloodaxe Worg tame; keep a free stable slot and suitable pet food. Include the tame when arranging the Lower Blackrock Spire clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar and enter Undercity by the main lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Kargath.\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBadlands\t5.81\t47.52\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Warlord Goretooth, receive Goretooth's Command and use it if needed to accept {q4903}.\nA\t\t4903\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4981\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q4724} from Galamav and {q4768} from Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave before leaving Kargath.\nA\t\t4724\t\nA\t\t4768\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Flame Crest for the Spire preparations.\nF\t\tFlame Crest\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4810\t\nA\t\t4734\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t4729\t\nA\t\t4862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west into Blackrock Mountain; take the ramp and chain to the Spire balcony and reach the portal. Join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Lower Blackrock Spire and the outer Quartermaster.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Lower Blackrock Spire together at 58+. Take the descending route to the lower wing.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Warosh near the entrance and read his scroll, then accept {q4867}.\nA\t\t4867\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Highlord Omokk and loot Omokk's Head. Collect the Roughshod Pike at the ogre area for Urok's challenge.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Bijou and turn in {q4981}.\nT\t\t4981\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Bijou and accept {q4982} before continuing the search for her belongings.\nA\t\t4982\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Spire Spider Eggs in the spider passages for {q4862}.\nC\t\t4862\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Mother Smolderweb, then clear the path to Urok's platform. Place the Roughshod Pike and Omokk's Head at Urok's Tribute Pile; defeat the waves and Urok Doomhowl and collect Warosh's Mojo for {q4867}.\nC\t\t4867\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tFind Bijou's Belongings in the lower chambers for {q4982}, then return them to her before leaving the wing.\nC\t\t4982\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4982}, then accept {q4983}; keep Bijou's information for Lexlort in Kargath.\nT\t\t4982\t\nA\t\t4983\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tContinue through War Master Voone and the worg chambers. Capture a Bloodaxe Worg Pup with Kibler's cage for {q4729}.\nC\t\t4729\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets in the troll chambers for {q4788}.\nC\t\t4788\t\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nI\t\tTame an adult Bloodaxe Worg in the cleared worg chambers. Feed it, teach the available Growl and passive ranks through Beast Training, and use Bite VIII until learned. Keep this pet through the clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Halycon and Gizrul the Slavener.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Halycon for {q4724}.\nC\t\t4724\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRecover the Darkstone Tablet in the troll chambers for {q4768}.\nC\t\t4768\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDuring the clear, look for Inconspicuous Documents on the ground in the boss areas and loot the Important Blackrock Documents. Defeat Omokk, Voone and Wyrmthalak, completing the final orc halls for {q4903}.\nC\t\t4903\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the cleared lower wing and give Warosh his mojo, then turn in {q4867}.\nT\t\t4867\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave the Spire with the party. Find Scarshield Quartermaster on the outer balcony and defeat him.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf he drops Blackhand's Command, use it to accept {q7761} and keep the attunement quest for Upper Blackrock Spire.\nA\t\t7761\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn together through Blackrock Mountain to Flame Crest.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4729\t\nT\t\t4862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Kargath.\nF\t\tKargath\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4903\t\nA\t\t4941\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4983\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4724} to Galamav and {q4768} to Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave.\nT\t\t4724\t\nT\t\t4768\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tBadlands\t3.99\t44.78\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise fly from Kargath to Undercity.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Undercity, take the Orgrimmar zeppelin outside the city.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Eitrigg in Thrall's chamber and hear his counsel for {q4941}.\nC\t\t4941\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4941}, then accept {q4974}; keep it for the Upper Blackrock Spire clear at 60.\nT\t\t4941\t\nA\t\t4974\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t70.36\t15.01\t\t\t\nI\t\tStable the worg with Xon'cha and retrieve your companion. Open Beast Training and teach Bite VIII when its level and training points allow.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar. From the landing, follow the eastern road to the Bulwark.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6029\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5901\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Andorhal's approach, form a party for Araj.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to central Andorhal with the party. Clear Araj's nearby defenders before the pull.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Araj the Summoner and take the Phylactery Shard from the object left at his position for {q105}.\nC\t\t105\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road northeast into Eastern Plaguelands and visit Tirion by the western river.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5542\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5543\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5544\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Nathanos Blightcaller at Marris Stead and accept {q6022}, {q6042} and {q6133}.\nA\t\t6022\t\nA\t\t6042\t\nA\t\t6133\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill twenty Noxious Plaguebats and ten Monstrous Plaguebats for {q6042} during the southern circuit.\nC\t\t6042\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill thirty Plaguebats in the southern Plaguelands for {q5543}.\nC\t\t5543\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill twenty Plaguehound Runts for {q5542}.\nC\t\t5542\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect fifteen Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat from Carrion Grubs for {q5544}.\nC\t\t5544\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill five Plaguehounds for {q5542}.\nC\t\t5542\t2\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill five Frenzied Plaguehounds for {q5542}.\nC\t\t5542\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Corin's Crossing, collect seven Living Rot within ten minutes and use the Mortar and Pestle to make Coagulated Rot for {q6022}.\nC\t\t6022\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quel'Lithien Lodge, form a party for the lodge's guards. Kill eight Rangers, eight Pathstriders and eight Woodsmen, then recover the Quel'Thalas Registry for {q6133}.\nC\t\t6133\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Nathanos at Marris Stead and turn in {q6022}, {q6042} and {q6133}, then accept {q6135} and {q6136}.\nT\t\t6022\t\nT\t\t6042\t\nT\t\t6133\t\nA\t\t6135\t\nA\t\t6136\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tForm a party with a tank and healer for Duskwing and Borelgore before setting out.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Duskwing and loot a Patch of Duskwing's Fur for {q6135}.\nC\t\t6135\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Borelgore in the northern Plaguelands for {q6136}.\nC\t\t6136\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_RAMSTEIN_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: After Nathanos's outdoor quests, accept {q6163} if the scheduled Stratholme Undead clear is still ahead. If that clear is already behind you, skip Ramstein instead of repeating the dungeon.\nA\t\t6163\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_RAMSTEIN_CLEAR_NOTICE\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Nathanos and turn in {q6135} and {q6136}, then accept {q6163}; keep it for Stratholme Undead.\nT\t\t6135\t\nT\t\t6136\t\nA\t\t6163\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit the Light's Hope Chapel before starting the northern ruins.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.81\t49.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect the flight point.\nP\t\tLight's Hope Chapel\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6030\t\nA\t\t5251\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.79\t50.25\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock, buy and use Formula: Powerful Anti-Venom if Honored with the Argent Dawn and at 300 First Aid; skip if not ready or already learned.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5212\t\nA\t\t5529\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5243\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5214\t\nA\t\t6026\t\nT\t\t6026\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6041\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5281\t\nA\t\t6021\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tCollect one hundred Plagueland Termites from Termite Mounds for {q5901}.\nC\t\t5901\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Smokey's Special Compound at eight marked Scourge structures in Plaguewood for {q6041}. Leave each building after placing the compound.\nC\t\t6041\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6164\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover Augustus's Receipt Book from the inn at Terrordale for {q6164}.\nC\t\t6164\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6164\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5281\t\nA\t\t5282\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Tirion by the river.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5542\t\nT\t\t5543\t\nT\t\t5544\t\nA\t\t5742\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSit beside Tirion and hear his story for {q5742}.\nC\t\t5742\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5742\t\nA\t\t5781\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Zaeldarr the Outcast in the Undercroft and take his head for {q6021}.\nC\t\t6021\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Undercroft graveyard examine the Loose Dirt Mound and defeat the summoned attackers and recover Taelan's Hammer for {q5781}.\nC\t\t5781\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5781\t\nA\t\t5845\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRecover the Symbol of Lost Honor from Northdale's lake for {q5845}.\nC\t\t5845\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5845\t\nA\t\t5846\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west by the Plaguelands road to the Bulwark.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t105\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5901\t\nA\t\t5902\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t48.34\t31.99\t\t\t\nI\t\tPlace the termite barrel at the Northridge Lumber Mill and inspect the crate that appears.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5902\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t6390\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6390\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5846\t\nA\t\t5848\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn through the Plaguelands roads to Light's Hope.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6021\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t6041\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 59 before Stratholme. If short, hunt the eastern Plaguelands' Plaguebats and Carrion Grubs then return to Light's Hope.\nX\t\t\t59\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t26.84\t19.23\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the main road northwest to Stratholme's main gate.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Stratholme's main gate, join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Stratholme Living.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter through the main gate at 59+ and clear the streets toward the Scarlet Bastion.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect ten Plagued Flesh Samples during the clear.\nK\t\t13174\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRecover five Stratholme Holy Water from supply crates for {q5243}; clear the rats or insects when a trapped crate opens.\nC\t\t5243\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tUse Egan's Blaster on Spectral and Ghostly Citizens, then on the released Restless Souls; free fifteen for {q5282}.\nC\t\t5282\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Aurius in the chapel and accept {q5122}.\nA\t\t5122\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tSearch Ezra Grimm's smoke shop, defeat Ezra and take the tobacco for {q5214}.\nC\t\t5214\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the Scarlet Bastion and defeat Archivist Galford for {q5251}; leave the archive unburned until the painting pickups are finished.\nC\t\t5251\t1\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTake Of Love and Family from behind the twin-moons painting on the wall before anyone burns the archive for {q5848}; burning disables the pickup.\nC\t\t5848\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tBurn the Scarlet Archive after everyone who needs the painting has looted it for {q5251}.\nC\t\t5251\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Medallion of Faith from its Scarlet chest for {q5122}.\nC\t\t5122\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Balnazzar to finish the Scarlet Bastion. If his head drops, keep it for Duke Nicholas.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Light's Hope for the ready reports.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5251\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf carrying Balnazzar's head, use it after reporting the archive to accept {q5262}.\nA\t\t5262\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5262} if you obtained the head.\nT\t\t5262\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5263} if the head delivery was completed.\nA\t\t5263\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5212\t\nA\t\t5213\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5214\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach Stratholme's service entrance and join a five-player party with a tank and healer for Stratholme Undead; arrange a member with the Key to the City to open it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter through the service entrance and turn in {q5122} to Aurius in the chapel.\nT\t\t5122\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear the undead district's three ziggurats through Baroness Anastari, Nerub'enkan and Maleki the Pallid; clear each interior's acolytes.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tRecover the Scourge Data from the ziggurat chest for {q5213}.\nC\t\t5213\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Magistrate Barthilas and loot the Key to the City, then enter Slaughter Square.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tLoot Ramstein the Gorger's head during the clear for {q6163}.\nC\t\t6163\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tDefeat Ramstein and the ensuing waves, then Baron Rivendare to finish the clear. Loot Rivendare's head for {q5263} if the quest is active.\nC\t\t5263\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Aurius in Rivendare's room after the fight and accept {q5125} to claim his reckoning reward.\nA\t\t5125\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5125\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Nathanos at Marris Stead and turn in {q6163}.\nT\t\t6163\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Egan and Light's Hope.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5282\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5243\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5213\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5263} with the Baron's head if the quest was active.\nT\t\t5263\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5264} if Above and Beyond was completed.\nA\t\t5264\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.9\t48.41\t\t\t\nT\t\t5264\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.9\t48.41\t\t\t\nA\t\t5265\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.96\t48.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5265} to claim the Argent Hold reward if offered.\nT\t\t5265\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5848\t\nA\t\t5861\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel west to Uther's Tomb.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5861\t\nA\t\t5862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_UNFINISHED_BUSINESS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before taking Myranda's Scarlet Illusion, visit Kirsta Deepshadow south of Hearthglen and accept {q6004}.\nA\t\t6004\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Kill two Scarlet Medics, two Hunters, two Magi and two Knights south and southeast of Kirsta for {q6004}; avoid Hearthglen's elite guards.\nC\t\t6004\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Kirsta, turn in {q6004} and accept {q6023}.\nT\t\t6004\t\nA\t\t6023\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Form a party for Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen. Defeat them at the guarded road and tower positions for {q6023}.\nC\t\t6023\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Kirsta, turn in {q6023} and accept {q6025}. Return to Myranda for a fresh Scarlet Illusion before entering Hearthglen; dismiss pets.\nT\t\t6023\t\nA\t\t6025\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_UNFINISHED_BUSINESS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tSpeak to Myranda for the Scarlet Illusion, dismiss pets and travel into Hearthglen while disguised. Reach Taelan before arranging his escort party.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tWhile still disguised, climb Hearthglen's watchtower to overlook the town for {q6025}, then continue to Taelan.\nC\t\t6025\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5862} to Taelan with Tirion's Gift.\nT\t\t5862\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Taelan, form a party for his escort. Check that everyone who needs it has finished their turn-in, and that everyone is ready.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q5944} once the party confirms they're ready.\nA\t\t5944\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort Taelan through Hearthglen. Protect him through the scripted encounters and remain through Tirion's arrival and the final conversation for {q5944}.\nC\t\t5944\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5944\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_STRATHOLME_REPORTS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Return to Light's Hope Chapel and turn in {q5243} and {q5213}.\nT\t\t5243\t\nT\t\t5213\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tEastern Plaguelands\t71.63\t50.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q5263} if carrying the Baron's head.\nT\t\t5263\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q5264} if Above and Beyond was completed.\nA\t\t5264\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q5264} at Light's Hope Chapel.\nT\t\t5264\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: Accept {q5265} if offered.\nA\t\t5265\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Turn in {q5265} to claim the Argent Hold reward.\nT\t\t5265\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_STRATHOLME_REPORTS\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn south to Kirsta and turn in {q6025}.\nT\t\t6025\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t60.9\t58.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise follow the roads west through the Bulwark to the zeppelin tower outside Undercity.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf still in Tirisfal, take the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan for the tablet delivery.\nF\t\tGadgetzan\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port and turn in {q4788}, then return to Gadgetzan.\nT\t\t4788\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Marshal's Refuge; keep your Orgrimmar Hearthstone binding.\nF\t\tMarshal's Refuge\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock. Keep Umi's Mechanical Yeti, Barov Family Fortune, Plagued Hatchlings, Egg Freezing, For The Horde and any Blackhand's Command attunement." },
  { name = "59-60 Un'Goro Crater (Horde)", title = "59-60 Un'Goro Crater", group = "Bethink's Guide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 59, hi = 60, next = "", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", bethink = true,
    about = "Shaper’s Terrace at 59, final training, Upper Blackrock Spire, Scholomance and Dire Maul North and West at 60. Ends in Orgrimmar.",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart at Marshal's Refuge at 59 after Stratholme, with your Hearthstone bound to Orgrimmar. Keep Crystalline Elements, the four-deed quest, Plagued Hatchlings, Egg Freezing, For The Horde, Umi's toy and any Upper Spire attunement.\nX\t\t\t59\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Quixxil for {q5163}; keep it for Umi in Everlook.\nC\t\t5163\t3\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair and restock at Marshal's Refuge before the ascent.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t18.1\t61.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the approach north from Marshal's Refuge onto the crater's raised northern terrace. Use the rising path to the titan complex entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_SHAPERS_TERRACE_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t34.8\t22.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tGuide migration: Before the scheduled Shaper's Terrace clear, visit Mayena Earthseeker in northwestern Mulgore and accept {q95928}. Return through Thunder Bluff and Gadgetzan to Marshal's Refuge. If the clear is already behind you, skip this quest.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_SHAPERS_TERRACE_PICKUP\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shaper's Terrace entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Shaper's Terrace together at 59+.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect one Moist Crystal, Charged Crystal, Noxious Crystal and Fiery Crystal during the clear for {q95928}.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Shaper's Terrace through Nanaya, completing the other encounters along the route, then leave by the cleared approach.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach level 60 before final training and the last dungeon circuit. If short, return to Cenarion Hold and hunt southern Dredge Crushers or Twilight camps, then use the Cenarion Hold flight point.\nX\t\t\t60\t\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff from Marshal's Refuge or Cenarion Hold.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the lifts and follow the northwest Mulgore paths to Mayena Earthseeker.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tMulgore\t34.8\t22.2\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q95928} to Mayena.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise return by the same paths and lifts to Thunder Bluff and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t54.1\t68.41\t\t\t\nI\t\tBind with Gryshka; repair and restock.\nB\t\tSet your hearthstone to Orgrimmar\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t48.47\t45.43\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Zevrost, learn Demon Armor V, Immolate VII, Bane of Doom, Create Healthstone V, Create Soulstone V and Create Spellstone III; learn eligible talented ranks. Learn Imp Blood Pact VI and Voidwalker Torment VI / Suffering IV. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Kurgul nearby.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t80.39\t32.38\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sorek, learn Cleave V, Overpower IV and Rend VII.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you have Manual of Heroic Strike IX or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Heroic Strike IX.\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you have Manual of Battle Shout VII or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Battle Shout VII.\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you have Manual of Revenge VI or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Revenge VI.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.66\t35.92\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Sagorne Creststrider, learn Ancestral Spirit V, Earth Shock VII, Healing Stream Totem V, Lesser Healing Wave VI, Lightning Shield VIII, Nature Resistance Totem III, Searing Totem VI and Windfury Weapon IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tablet of Healing Wave X at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tablet of Strength of Earth Totem V at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.\nS\tShaman\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Tablet of Grace of Air Totem III at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Stealth IV, Gouge V, Backstab VIII and Rupture VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t43.05\t53.74\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Shenthul, learn Instant Poison VI (280 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t42.09\t49.48\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Rekkul.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tRestock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Devouring Plague VI, Divine Spirit IV, Fade VI, Holy Fire VIII, Inner Fire VI, Power Word: Fortitude VI, Power Word: Shield X, Prayer of Healing IV, Prayer of Spirit and Shackle Undead III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tUndead Priest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Touch of Weakness VI and Dark Sacrifice V.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Hex of Weakness VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tTroll Priest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t35.59\t87.82\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ur'kyo, learn Shadowguard VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Codex: Prayer of Fortitude II at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t55.9\t62.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy and use Codex: Prayer of Shadow Protection at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.\nS\tPriest\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.43\t56.55\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Sacred Candles from Horthus for your group prayers.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff for Paladin training.\nF\t\tThunder Bluff\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t22.62\t19.91\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Alodan the Hopeful, learn Greater Blessing of Kings, Greater Blessing of Might II, Greater Blessing of Wisdom II, Holy Strike VIII, Redemption V, Exorcism VI, Consecration V, Holy Wrath II, Hammer of Wrath III, Seal of Light IV, Devotion Aura VII and Fire Resistance Aura III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tPaladin\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Orgrimmar before continuing.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t38.35\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Pephredo, learn Fireball XI, Frostfire Bolt III, Polymorph IV and Blizzard VI.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.05\t18.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Beast IV, Aimed Shot VI, Arcane Shot VIII, Distracting Shot VI, Freezing Trap III, Mend Pet VII and Wing Clip III.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t66.32\t14.81\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Xao'tsu, learn Growl VII, Great Stamina X, Natural Armor X. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tCast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tMoonglade\t52.53\t40.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Loganaar, learn Hurricane III, Mark of the Wild VII, Prowl III, Rebirth V, Regrowth IX, Revive V, Rip VI and Tranquility IV.\nV\t\ttrainer\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar.\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tDruid\t\t\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t45.99\t45.68\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Ironwood Seeds from Hagrus for your new Rebirth rank.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRepair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7562\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy ten Elixirs of Shadow Power, six Large Brilliant Shards, twenty-five Dark Iron Ore, thirty-five Black Dragonscales and three Arcanite Bars at the Auction House. Keep gold for Shadowy Potions, Xorothian Stardust and Gorzeeki's three ritual items.\nV\t\tvendor\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar and enter Undercity by its main lifts.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Flame Crest.\nF\t\tFlame Crest\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t12.69\t31.64\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide west to Mor'zul and Gorzeeki at the Altar of Storms.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7562\t\nA\t\t7563\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7623\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki Wildeyes for the Jaedenar visit. Keep the purchased mount materials in your bags.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Flame Crest, fly to Undercity and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Everlook for Umi's delivery.\nF\t\tEverlook\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tWinterspring\t60.47\t36.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tArrive at Everlook's Horde flight point after the flight.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5163\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tCollect thirty Raging Beast's Blood from the Crazed Owlbeasts for {q7563}; stay clear of the southern demon camps.\nC\t\t7563\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Everlook and fly to Bloodvenom Post.\nF\t\tBloodvenom Post\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFollow Felwood's main road south to Jaedenar. Drink a Shadowy Potion before entering Shadow Hold, keep it active and keep pets passive among the now-friendly demons.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7623\t\nA\t\t7624\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tConfront Ulathek, defeat him and take The Traitor's Heart for {q7624}. Keep the Shadowy Potion effect active for the return to Banehollow.\nC\t\t7624\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7624\t\nA\t\t7625\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan beside Banehollow. Leave through the same passages while the potion remains active.\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFelwood\t34.44\t53.96\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared passages and main road, return to Bloodvenom Post and fly.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTake the Tirisfal zeppelin, fly from Undercity to Flame Crest and return west to Mor'zul and Gorzeeki at the Altar of Storms.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7563\t\nA\t\t7564\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7564\t\nT\t\t7625\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7626\t\nA\t\t7627\t\nA\t\t7628\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7626\t\nT\t\t7627\t\nT\t\t7628\t\nA\t\t7630\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7630\t\nA\t\t7629\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tKeep the Imp in a Jar for Scholomance.\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.69\t24.22\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel to Flame Crest and repair. From Everlook, fly to Orgrimmar, take the Tirisfal zeppelin and fly from Undercity; from the Altar of Storms, follow the road east.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTravel into Blackrock Mountain and up to the Spire portal. Reach the upper wing's door.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the upper Spire door, join a group with tanks and healers; arrange a member with the Seal of Ascension to open it.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Upper Blackrock Spire together at 60. Clear the rune rooms and free Pyroguard Emberseer, then defeat him.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tAfter clearing the Rookery safely, use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg to test Egg Freezing for {q4734}.\nC\t\t4734\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFor Thrall, defeat Solakar Flamewreath, then clear Rend's arena waves and defeat Rend; loot his head for {q4974}.\nC\t\t4974\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat General Drakkisath and his guards with the group to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf carrying Blackhand's Command, touch Drakkisath's Brand behind the General to turn in {q7761} for the attunement.\nT\t\t7761\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn together to Flame Crest.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t4734\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Undercity, then follow the eastern road through the Bulwark into Western Plaguelands. Continue along the farm roads to Caer Darrow.\nF\t\tUndercity\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tVisit Eva Sarkhoff on Caer Darrow before entering Scholomance.\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t5382\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tInclude Imp Delivery when arranging the Scholomance quest clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tJoin a five-player Scholomance party with a tank and healer; arrange a member with the Skeleton Key. Arrange the full quest clear, including Eva's follow-ups, Jandice and Kirtonos.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Scholomance together at 60. Leave Jandice's basement and Kirtonos's balcony for their quest steps while clearing the main halls first.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tCollect the four deeds: Southshore on a table in the first large room; Tarren Mill on a table before the hatchlings; Brill in Ras Frostwhisper's room; Caer Darrow in Lord Alexei Barov's room for {q5341}.\nC\t\t5341\t\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tKill twenty Plagued Hatchlings before clearing Rattlegore's room for {q5529}.\nC\t\t5529\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Rattlegore and the path to Ras Frostwhisper, then defeat Ras.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tUse the Imp in a Jar at the laboratory and stay until J'eevee finishes the parchment for {q7629}.\nC\t\t7629\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through the classroom bosses. Defeat Doctor Theolen Krastinov and burn both Sarkhoff remains in his room for {q5382}.\nC\t\t5382\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDefeat Darkmaster Gandling after the six lower-room bosses. Return through the cleared halls to Eva without resetting the instance.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5382\t\nA\t\t5515\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tRe-enter the same instance with the party. Clear Jandice Barov's basement, defeat her and take Krastinov's Bag of Horrors for {q5515}.\nC\t\t5515\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to Eva by the cleared halls.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5515\t\nA\t\t5384\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the same instance's balcony with the party. Place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier and defeat Kirtonos the Herald to finish the clear for {q5384}.\nC\t\t5384\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared entrance.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5384}. Keep the Spectral Essence reward for speaking to Caer Darrow's spirits.\nT\t\t5384\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn west along the Plaguelands road to the Bulwark.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5341\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue west to Undercity and use its main lifts.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Light's Hope.\nF\t\tLight's Hope Chapel\t\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t5529\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Flame Crest and return west to Gorzeeki and Mor'zul at the Altar of Storms.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nT\t\t7629\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nA\t\t7631\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tBuy J'eevee's Jar, Black Lodestone and Xorothian Glyphs from Gorzeeki. Read Mor'zul's Instructions.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t55.6\t54.14\t\t\t\nI\t\tUse Drain Soul on Blackrock Soldiers until you carry at least twenty Soul Shards for Dire Maul's ritual.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise fly from Light's Hope to Undercity and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin. From the Altar of Storms, return to Flame Crest for the Undercity flight instead.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q4974} to Thrall with Rend's head and hear his proclamation.\nT\t\t4974\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Camp Mojache.\nF\t\tCamp Mojache\t\nS\t\t\t\nA\t\t7481\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path to Dire Maul's central courtyard. At the northern entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer and unlock the wing with the Crescent Key.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul North together at 60. Clear the ogre guards and their patrols in order.\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf a Gordok Shackle Key drops, take it to Knot Thimblejack in the courtyard and accept {q5525}.\nA\t\t5525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q5525} to free Knot if you obtained the key.\nT\t\t5525\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue through Guard Fengus, Guard Slip'kik and Captain Kromcrush. Defeat King Gordok and Cho'Rush the Observer to finish the clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared northern entrance and cross the central courtyard to the western entrance.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tHave all three ritual items and at least twenty Soul Shards ready for Dire Maul West.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tInclude the Dreadsteed ritual when arranging the Dire Maul West clear.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt Dire Maul's western entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer. Bring the Crescent Key and unlock the wing together.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul West together at 60. Speak to the Shen'dralar Ancient above the courtyard and accept {q7461} before continuing deeper.\nA\t\t7461\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear Tendris Warpwood and the courtyard pylon's guardians. Continue through the upper walkways, Illyanna Ravenoak and Magister Kalendris, clearing each pylon's guardians.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach the Prison of Immol'thar and clear the guardians of its remaining pylons. Check that all five pylons are deactivated, then defeat Immol'thar.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tClear Immol'thar's prison before the Dreadsteed ritual. Use J'eevee's Jar to place the bell, wheel and candle.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tDefend the ritual with the party, using Black Lodestone and Soul Shards to reactivate extinguished ritual objects. Keep the tank free to gather incoming demons.\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tWhen the nine summoning runes are active and the ritual is complete, use the Xorothian Glyphs. Defeat the Xorothian Dreadsteed and Lord Hel'nurath with the party for {q7631}.\nC\t\t7631\t\t\nS\tWarlock\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7631} to the Dreadsteed Spirit to bind the mount and learn Summon Dreadsteed.\nT\t\t7631\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue to the Athenaeum and defeat Prince Tortheldrin to finish Dire Maul West for {q7461}.\nC\t\t7461\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Shen'dralar Ancient through the cleared halls. Turn in {q7461}, then accept {q7877}.\nT\t\t7461\t\nA\t\t7877\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn to the Athenaeum and turn in {q7877} to claim the Treasure of the Shen'dralar.\nT\t\t7877\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind Telmius Dreamseeker's remains in the library and examine them for {q7481}.\nC\t\t7481\t\t\nS\tDruid\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIn the Dire Maul library, turn in {q7506} to Lorekeeper Javon if carrying The Emerald Dream.\nT\t\t7506\t\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7503} to Lorekeeper Mykos in the library if carrying it.\nT\t\t7503\t\nS\tPaladin\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7501} to Lorekeeper Mykos and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas if carrying the book.\nT\t\t7501\t\nS\tPriest\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7504} to Lorekeeper Javon and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas if carrying it.\nT\t\t7504\t\nS\tRogue\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7498} to Lorekeeper Kildrath and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas if carrying it.\nT\t\t7498\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION BEGIN: V106_DIRE_MAUL_BOOKS\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying Codex of Defense, use it to accept {q7499}.\nU\t\t18357\t\nA\t\t7499\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying The Arcanist's Cookbook, use it to accept {q7500}.\nU\t\t18358\t\nA\t\t7500\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tGuide migration: If carrying Frost Shock and You, use it to accept {q7505}.\nU\t\t18363\t\nA\t\t7505\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\t-- MIGRATION END: V106_DIRE_MAUL_BOOKS\nS\tWarrior\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7499} to Lorekeeper Kildrath if carrying Codex of Defense.\nT\t\t7499\t\nS\tMage\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7500} to Lorekeeper Kildrath if carrying The Arcanist's Cookbook.\nT\t\t7500\t\nS\tShaman\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tTurn in {q7505} to Lorekeeper Javon if carrying Frost Shock and You.\nT\t\t7505\t\nS\tWarlock\t\tcompletewith=next\nI\t\tIf carrying Harnessing Shadows, turn in {q7502} to Lorekeeper Mykos and take the Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas.\nT\t\t7502\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tAccept {q7463} from Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum before leaving.\nA\t\t7463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave through the cleared western entrance.\nS\tMage\t\t\nG\t\tFeralas\t64.8\t30.3\t\t\t\nI\t\tCross the central courtyard to Dire Maul East's main entrance and find a five-player party with a tank and healer for Hydrospawn.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tEnter Dire Maul East and clear the corridors and pool approach to Hydrospawn. Defeat him and take the Hydrospawn Essence for {q7463}.\nC\t\t7463\t\t\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tLeave by the cleared eastern entrance. Return to the Athenaeum through its outer access door, using the Crescent Key.\nS\tMage\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in {q7463} to Lorekeeper Lydros and learn Conjure Water VII.\nT\t\t7463\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn east by the main road to Camp Mojache.\nS\t\t\t\nT\t\t7481\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tFeralas\t75.45\t44.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise fly from Camp Mojache.\nH\t\tHearth to Orgrimmar\nF\t\tOrgrimmar\t\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Orgrimmar by the main gate and take the Tirisfal zeppelin for your epic class mount.\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nG\t\tTirisfal Glades\t21.95\t46.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the western road to Bandarion Keep and speak with Hilda the Breaker about the Charger quest.\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tComplete Justice and Retribution, following your class quest's objectives, preparation and turn-ins. Learn Summon Forsaken Charger.\nS\tUndead Paladin\t\t\nI\t\tReturn along the road to the Tirisfal zeppelin and take it back to Orgrimmar.\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tFinish in Orgrimmar at level 60 with the full dungeon journey complete." },
}) do table.insert(pfQuest_xpGuide_Guides, g) end
